{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 2360566,
  "courseSlug": "sveltejs-the-complete-guide",
  "courseTitle": "Svelte.js - The Complete Guide",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "errors": [],
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "14689430",
      "title": "Introduction",
      "lectureOrder": 1,
      "videoOrder": 1,
      "sourceHash": "0a32e8dcb20b79588be0103eb770cbfdfa5ffc50387668b183722b33afed1841",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.41,
          "end": 2.09,
          "en": "Welcome to this course.",
          "zh": "歡迎來到這門課。"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.09,
          "end": 7.52,
          "en": "I'm really excited that you're joining me on this journey through Svelte JS.",
          "zh": "很高興你和我一起踏上這趟 Svelte.js 的旅程。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.67,
          "end": 15.14,
          "en": "Svelte JS is an amazing piece of technology that allows you to build highly reactive interfaces, user",
          "zh": "Svelte.js 是一項非常出色的技術，讓你能建立高度反應式的介面，也就是"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 15.14,
          "end": 18.1,
          "en": "interfaces for the web, for the browser.",
          "zh": "給網頁、給瀏覽器使用的使用者介面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 18.11,
          "end": 24.32,
          "en": "You'll use JavaScript for this and you'll learn all about the special svelte syntax, how it works,",
          "zh": "你會用 JavaScript 來做這件事，也會完整學到 Svelte 的特殊語法、它如何運作、"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 24.32,
          "end": 31.01,
          "en": "which code it generates, and how you can utilize all the many features it gives you to build exactly",
          "zh": "它會產生哪些程式碼，以及如何運用它提供的眾多功能，來建立"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 31.01,
          "end": 32.84,
          "en": "the web application you need.",
          "zh": "你真正需要的網頁應用程式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 32.87,
          "end": 38.42,
          "en": "We'll start at all the basics, of course, but we'll work our way up all the way up to server side",
          "zh": "我們當然會從所有基礎開始，但會一路往上，直到伺服器端"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 38.42,
          "end": 38.87,
          "en": "rendering.",
          "zh": "渲染。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 38.87,
          "end": 44.6,
          "en": "But along that way you'll learn how to output data, how to dynamically recalculate data, how to listen",
          "zh": "沿途你會學到如何輸出資料、如何動態重新計算資料、如何聆聽"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 44.6,
          "end": 51.5,
          "en": "to events, how to validate forms, how to bind to inputs, how to send Http requests, how to manage",
          "zh": "事件、如何驗證表單、如何綁定輸入、如何送出 HTTP 請求、如何管理"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 51.5,
          "end": 56.99,
          "en": "your store, your state on the front end application, and so much more.",
          "zh": "你的 store、前端應用程式上的 state，以及更多內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 57.08,
          "end": 62.4,
          "en": "I'll walk you through all these features step by step, and I strongly believe that you'll learn the",
          "zh": "我會一步一步帶你走過這些功能，而且我深信，你學得"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 62.4,
          "end": 68.88,
          "en": "most if you're not just seeing things in theory, but also in the scope of a real project.",
          "zh": "最多的方式，不只是在理論上看見這些東西，而是放在一個真實專案的範圍裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 68.88,
          "end": 70.91,
          "en": "And that's why in this course we'll have both.",
          "zh": "所以這門課兩者都會有。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 70.92,
          "end": 77.78999999999999,
          "en": "We'll have the theory chapters where we have smaller mini demos which are not really polished and instead",
          "zh": "我們會有理論章節，裡面是較小的迷你示範，那些示範沒有打磨得很精緻，而是"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 77.78999999999999,
          "end": 80.01,
          "en": "focus on the new concepts I'm explaining.",
          "zh": "聚焦在我正在說明的新概念。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 80.01,
          "end": 86.82,
          "en": "But thereafter we'll take that knowledge and apply it in our course project, our meetup planner, where",
          "zh": "之後我們會把那些知識用到課程專案裡，也就是我們的 meetup 規劃器，在那裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 86.82,
          "end": 91.92,
          "en": "we can create and manage our meetups and contact the creators of meetups and so on.",
          "zh": "我們可以建立並管理 meetup，也可以聯絡 meetup 的建立者，諸如此類。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 91.92,
          "end": 97.05,
          "en": "And we'll apply all the knowledge in this project so that you see both how it works, but then also",
          "zh": "我們會把所有知識套用到這個專案，讓你既看到它如何運作，也看到"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 97.05,
          "end": 100.22999999999999,
          "en": "how it works in a real or in a bigger application.",
          "zh": "它在真實、或較大型的應用程式裡如何運作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 100.22999999999999,
          "end": 105.75,
          "en": "And in the end of the course I'll of course also show you how to deploy this application actually even",
          "zh": "課程最後，我當然也會示範如何實際部署這個應用程式，甚至"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 105.75,
          "end": 107.43,
          "en": "in a couple of different ways.",
          "zh": "用幾種不同的方式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 107.61,
          "end": 109.32,
          "en": "So that's what's in the course.",
          "zh": "這就是這門課的內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 109.32,
          "end": 110.00999999999999,
          "en": "Who am I?",
          "zh": "我是誰？"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 110.03999999999999,
          "end": 111.99000000000001,
          "en": "My name is Maximilian Schwartzmiller.",
          "zh": "我叫 Maximilian Schwarzmüller。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 111.99000000000001,
          "end": 116.31,
          "en": "I'm a freelance web developer and five star rated instructor here on Udemy.",
          "zh": "我是自由接案的網頁開發者，也是 Udemy 上五星評價的講師。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 116.31,
          "end": 121.05,
          "en": "I got many courses, including courses on React, Angular and View, and by the end of the course,",
          "zh": "我有很多課程，包括 React、Angular 和 Vue 的課程，而在課程結束時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 121.05,
          "end": 127.26,
          "en": "I'll also tell you of course, why you should learn svelte or why you might want to also check out the",
          "zh": "我當然也會告訴你，為什麼你該學 Svelte，或為什麼你可能也想看看"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 127.26,
          "end": 128.25,
          "en": "other options.",
          "zh": "其他選擇。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 128.67,
          "end": 134.58,
          "en": "But besides having all these courses, I do have a lot of courses on JavaScript in general and I was",
          "zh": "除了這些課程，我在 JavaScript 方面也有很多課程，而當我"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 134.58,
          "end": 140.07,
          "en": "really excited when I found out about Svelte when I had a first look at it when I started working with",
          "zh": "第一次認識 Svelte、第一次看到它、開始使用它時，我真的很興奮，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 140.07,
          "end": 143.49,
          "en": "it, because I like it syntax, I like it, simplicity.",
          "zh": "因為我喜歡它的語法，喜歡它的簡潔。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 143.49,
          "end": 149.64,
          "en": "I like that it gives us very fast, high performance applications and I truly believe that it is a skill",
          "zh": "我喜歡它給我們非常快、高效能的應用程式，而且我真心相信，它是一項技能"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 149.64,
          "end": 150.81,
          "en": "or a technology.",
          "zh": "或一項技術。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 150.84,
          "end": 157.17000000000002,
          "en": "Every modern front end web developer should at least have had a look at and therefore, let's not waste",
          "zh": "每一位現代前端網頁開發者至少都該看過一次，因此，我們不要浪費"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 157.17000000000002,
          "end": 157.74,
          "en": "any time.",
          "zh": "任何時間。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 157.74,
          "end": 159.39,
          "en": "Let's dive into it together.",
          "zh": "讓我們一起深入吧。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "14689516",
      "title": "Why Svelte?",
      "lectureOrder": 2,
      "videoOrder": 2,
      "sourceHash": "b3e5ee6b90e959ead783c3cda0d3dabac6be8b85770527506eefe5d9c5cafbc4",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.17,
          "end": 4.99,
          "en": "Before we dive into what Svelte is.",
          "zh": "在我們深入 Svelte 是什麼之前，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.02,
          "end": 8.11,
          "en": "Let's understand which problem it solves.",
          "zh": "先了解它解決了什麼問題。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.23,
          "end": 12.46,
          "en": "For this, we have to understand how we build modern web applications.",
          "zh": "為此，我們必須了解如何建立現代網頁應用程式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12.7,
          "end": 18.07,
          "en": "Let's first of all take a step back and have a look at how we build applications or websites.",
          "zh": "首先退一步，看看我們如何建立應用程式或網站。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 18.07,
          "end": 19.18,
          "en": "Ten years ago.",
          "zh": "十年前。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 19.36,
          "end": 25.27,
          "en": "There you would typically use a language like PHP, which allows you to write some code which then is",
          "zh": "那時你通常會使用 PHP 這類語言，它讓你寫一些程式碼，然後"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 25.27,
          "end": 30.82,
          "en": "interpreted on the server, and there you're reaching out to a database, you're doing all kinds of",
          "zh": "在伺服器上被解譯，你會在那裡連到資料庫，做各種"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 30.82,
          "end": 39.04,
          "en": "stuff and eventually you will render some HTML code dynamically on the server and ship that to the user",
          "zh": "事情，最後在伺服器上動態渲染一些 HTML 程式碼，再送到使用者那裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 39.04,
          "end": 41.63,
          "en": "and there it is basically displayed in the browser.",
          "zh": "基本上就顯示在瀏覽器裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 41.65,
          "end": 47.11,
          "en": "Now you can still build applications in that way and there also are scenarios where this is the best",
          "zh": "你現在仍然可以用那種方式建立應用程式，而且也有一些情境，那是"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 47.11,
          "end": 49.75,
          "en": "possible way of building web apps.",
          "zh": "建立網頁應用程式最好的方式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 49.75,
          "end": 56.26,
          "en": "And by the way, attached to this lecture here, you'll find a link to a video and an article which",
          "zh": "順帶一提，這堂課附有一個連結，通往一支影片和一篇文章，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 56.26,
          "end": 61.45,
          "en": "I created where I dive into the different kinds of web applications, including this approach I'm just",
          "zh": "是我做的，我在裡面深入不同種類的網頁應用程式，包括我正在"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 61.45,
          "end": 62.27,
          "en": "describing.",
          "zh": "描述的這種做法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 62.77,
          "end": 67.43,
          "en": "Now, ten years ago, that was about the only way of building web applications.",
          "zh": "十年前，那幾乎是建立網頁應用程式的唯一方式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 67.45,
          "end": 74.56,
          "en": "Now we have a more modern way, or we can build more modern web applications that are better suited",
          "zh": "現在我們有更現代的方式，也可以建立更現代的網頁應用程式，更適合"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 74.56,
          "end": 75.76,
          "en": "for problems we solve.",
          "zh": "我們要解決的問題。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 75.76,
          "end": 78.85,
          "en": "Nowadays in such applications, we still have back end.",
          "zh": "如今在這類應用程式裡，我們仍然有後端。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 78.85,
          "end": 81.25,
          "en": "So that would be the code that runs on the server.",
          "zh": "那就是在伺服器上執行的程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 81.25,
          "end": 86.32,
          "en": "And I'll come back to why we have that code and what happens there in a second.",
          "zh": "我等一下會回來談，為什麼我們有那段程式碼，以及那裡發生什麼事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 86.41,
          "end": 90.85,
          "en": "But we also have the front end part of our web application.",
          "zh": "但我們也有網頁應用程式的前端部分。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 90.85,
          "end": 93.72999999999999,
          "en": "So that is essentially the part the user sees.",
          "zh": "那本質上就是使用者看到的部分。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 93.72999999999999,
          "end": 100.06,
          "en": "It's all about the user interface and therefore this is basically everything that happens in the browser.",
          "zh": "重點都在使用者介面，因此這基本上就是瀏覽器裡發生的一切。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 100.21000000000001,
          "end": 104.1,
          "en": "Now the front end at the back end, of course, have to communicate.",
          "zh": "前端和後端當然必須溝通。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 104.11,
          "end": 110.32,
          "en": "If you're building a user interface which is displayed in the browser with the help of HTML, CSS and",
          "zh": "如果你用 HTML、CSS 和"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 110.32,
          "end": 116.53,
          "en": "JavaScript, then this user interface might need to fetch some data that should be displayed inside",
          "zh": "JavaScript 的協助，在瀏覽器裡顯示使用者介面，這個使用者介面可能需要取得一些應該顯示在"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 116.53,
          "end": 116.86,
          "en": "of it.",
          "zh": "其中的資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 116.86,
          "end": 123.56,
          "en": "And for that you would still reach out to a backend because you still have certain tasks that can only",
          "zh": "為此你仍然會連到後端，因為你仍然有某些工作只能"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 123.59,
          "end": 127.01,
          "en": "happen on the backend on a server to be precise.",
          "zh": "在後端發生，更精確地說，是在伺服器上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 127.04,
          "end": 133.07,
          "en": "For example, reaching out to a database, you don't really want to do that in your browser because",
          "zh": "例如連到資料庫，你其實不想在瀏覽器裡做這件事，因為"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 133.07,
          "end": 140.78,
          "en": "if you use the JavaScript code that runs in your browser to connect to a database, then you might run",
          "zh": "如果你用瀏覽器裡執行的 JavaScript 程式碼去連資料庫，你可能會遇到"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 140.78,
          "end": 142.04,
          "en": "into some technical problems.",
          "zh": "一些技術問題。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 142.04,
          "end": 148.1,
          "en": "But most importantly, you will run into some security problems because everything that happens in the",
          "zh": "但最重要的是，你會遇到安全性問題，因為瀏覽器裡發生的一切、"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 148.1,
          "end": 153.98,
          "en": "browser, all the JavaScript code, all the CSS code can be viewed by your users.",
          "zh": "所有 JavaScript 程式碼、所有 CSS 程式碼，使用者都能看到。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 153.98,
          "end": 159.62,
          "en": "And for connecting to a database, you would have to use some credentials which then would be exposed",
          "zh": "而要連到資料庫，你必須使用某些憑證，那些憑證就會暴露"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 159.62,
          "end": 160.52,
          "en": "in your browser.",
          "zh": "在瀏覽器裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 160.52,
          "end": 162.5,
          "en": "So that would be highly insecure.",
          "zh": "那會非常不安全。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 162.59,
          "end": 170.18,
          "en": "Therefore, tasks like this, or any tasks that involve sensitive code always have to happen on a server",
          "zh": "因此，這類工作，或任何涉及敏感程式碼的工作，永遠必須在伺服器上發生，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 170.18,
          "end": 171.62,
          "en": "and therefore on the back end.",
          "zh": "也就是在後端。"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 172.31,
          "end": 178.57999999999998,
          "en": "Therefore, unsurprisingly, tasks like user authentication or verification also happens there and also",
          "zh": "所以毫不意外，像使用者身分驗證這類工作也發生在那裡，另外"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 178.57999999999998,
          "end": 184.22,
          "en": "maybe some heavy lifting which you just don't want to do on your users devices because especially,",
          "zh": "也許還有一些繁重運算，你就是不想在使用者的裝置上做，因為尤其"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 184.22,
          "end": 190.43,
          "en": "let's say on slower mobile devices, running certain pieces of code, certain calculations can really",
          "zh": "在較慢的行動裝置上，執行某些程式碼、某些計算，真的可能"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 190.43,
          "end": 194.03,
          "en": "slow down your web application and the devices of your users.",
          "zh": "拖慢你的網頁應用程式和使用者的裝置。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 194.18,
          "end": 197.93,
          "en": "What you do want to do on the devices of your users.",
          "zh": "你確實想在使用者裝置上做的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 197.93,
          "end": 203.54,
          "en": "So in the browser, however, is everything that is related to the user interface because you want to",
          "zh": "也就是在瀏覽器裡做的，則是一切和使用者介面有關的事，因為你想"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 203.54,
          "end": 205.67000000000002,
          "en": "build a reactive user interface.",
          "zh": "建立反應式的使用者介面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 205.7,
          "end": 211.34,
          "en": "Now reactive is a fancy term for everything should happen instantly.",
          "zh": "反應式是一個花俏的詞，意思是一切都應該立刻發生。"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 211.34,
          "end": 213.95,
          "en": "It should really feel like a mobile app.",
          "zh": "它應該真的感覺像一個行動應用程式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 213.95,
          "end": 220.13,
          "en": "If you consider mobile apps which you're downloading from the app stores there, if you tap around,",
          "zh": "如果你想想從應用程式商店下載的那些行動應用程式，當你點來點去時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 220.16,
          "end": 224.66,
          "en": "if you think about it, you never have to wait for a new page to load.",
          "zh": "仔細想想，你從來不用等待新頁面載入。"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 224.66,
          "end": 231.05,
          "en": "You have these nice smooth transitions from page A to be sure, there might be some data on a certain",
          "zh": "你會有從 A 頁到 B 頁的順暢轉場。當然，某個"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 231.05,
          "end": 235.05,
          "en": "page for which you might have to wait, and then you see a loading spinner.",
          "zh": "頁面上可能有一些資料你必須等待，然後你會看到載入中的旋轉圖示。"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 235.05,
          "end": 242.13,
          "en": "But that still feels better than seeing a white page in between transitions where a new page has to",
          "zh": "但那仍然比轉場之間看到一片白頁好，那是新頁面必須"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 242.13,
          "end": 245.52,
          "en": "be generated on the server and shipped back to the client.",
          "zh": "在伺服器上產生、再送回用戶端的時候。"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 245.52,
          "end": 246.96,
          "en": "And that is exactly what I mean.",
          "zh": "這正是我的意思。"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 246.96,
          "end": 248.97,
          "en": "It's this reactive experience.",
          "zh": "就是這種反應式體驗。"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 248.97,
          "end": 254.73,
          "en": "You tap a button and something happens instantly, even if it's just a window that shows a loading spinner,",
          "zh": "你點一個按鈕，某件事立刻發生，就算只是一個顯示載入旋轉圖示的視窗，"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 254.73,
          "end": 257.31,
          "en": "but at least it's not a blank white page.",
          "zh": "至少不是一片空白的白頁。"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 257.43,
          "end": 260.52,
          "en": "And that is the behavior we want to bring to our users.",
          "zh": "這就是我們想帶給使用者的行為。"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 260.52,
          "end": 266.58,
          "en": "And the only way of doing that is to use JavaScript, because JavaScript is the only language, the",
          "zh": "而唯一的做法是使用 JavaScript，因為 JavaScript 是唯一的語言、"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 266.58,
          "end": 270.96,
          "en": "only programming language that allows us to execute logic in the browser.",
          "zh": "唯一能讓我們在瀏覽器裡執行邏輯的程式語言。"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 270.96,
          "end": 273.63,
          "en": "So that is where our users are after all.",
          "zh": "畢竟那就是我們的使用者所在的地方。"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 273.63,
          "end": 279.27,
          "en": "And therefore we can use JavaScript to, for example, listen to a click on a button and then already",
          "zh": "因此我們可以用 JavaScript，例如聆聽按鈕的點擊，然後立刻"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 279.27,
          "end": 280.47,
          "en": "change the Dom.",
          "zh": "改變 DOM。"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 280.47,
          "end": 286.02,
          "en": "So the HTML code in the browser at runtime to show an overlay, for example.",
          "zh": "也就是在執行時改變瀏覽器裡的 HTML 程式碼，例如顯示一個覆蓋層。"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 286.02,
          "end": 292.11,
          "en": "So to add some HTML code dynamically which wasn't there before without having to load a new page from",
          "zh": "也就是動態加入一些先前不存在的 HTML 程式碼，而不必從"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 292.11,
          "end": 298.01,
          "en": "the backend and therefore we have no page reloads, which is awesome, which really gives our users",
          "zh": "後端載入新頁面，因此沒有頁面重新載入，這很棒，真的給使用者"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 298.04,
          "end": 299.65999999999997,
          "en": "a great user experience.",
          "zh": "很好的使用體驗。"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 299.78,
          "end": 304.07,
          "en": "We call such types of apps single page applications.",
          "zh": "我們把這類應用程式稱為單頁應用程式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 304.07,
          "end": 304.82,
          "en": "Why?",
          "zh": "為什麼？"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 304.85,
          "end": 312.98,
          "en": "Because there is only one single page, one HTML file that is downloaded from the server and thereafter",
          "zh": "因為只有單一一個頁面，從伺服器下載的一個 HTML 檔，之後"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 312.98,
          "end": 318.71,
          "en": "everything that changes visually is changed through JavaScript that runs in the client.",
          "zh": "視覺上的一切變化，都是透過在用戶端執行的 JavaScript 改變的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 318.71,
          "end": 321.71,
          "en": "So we never download a second HTML file.",
          "zh": "所以我們永遠不會下載第二個 HTML 檔。"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 321.71,
          "end": 327.53,
          "en": "We might be downloading some data which we then use in our application and we might change everything",
          "zh": "我們可能會下載一些資料，再在應用程式裡使用，也可能透過 JavaScript 改變"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 327.53,
          "end": 332.96,
          "en": "on that page through JavaScript so that technically to the user it looks like there are different pages",
          "zh": "那個頁面上的一切，所以對使用者來說，技術上看起來像有不同的頁面"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 332.96,
          "end": 340.01,
          "en": "involved, but it is technically only one HTML page and our backend on the server therefore typically",
          "zh": "參與其中，但技術上只有一個 HTML 頁面，而伺服器上的後端因此通常"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 340.01,
          "end": 347.45,
          "en": "is an API, which basically means it's a server which exposes a couple of URLs, a couple of endpoints",
          "zh": "是一個 API，基本上意思是它是一台伺服器，暴露出幾個 URL、幾個端點，"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 347.45,
          "end": 353.72,
          "en": "to which we can send Http requests from inside our JavaScript driven application.",
          "zh": "我們可以從 JavaScript 驅動的應用程式內部，向那些端點送出 HTTP 請求。"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 353.72,
          "end": 361.25,
          "en": "But these endpoints, these URLs don't return HTML code, but they typically return Json code.",
          "zh": "但這些端點、這些 URL 不會回傳 HTML 程式碼，通常回傳的是 JSON。"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 361.25,
          "end": 369.35,
          "en": "That's a machine readable data format which contains no markup, no styling, but is only raw data which",
          "zh": "那是機器可讀的資料格式，沒有標記、沒有樣式，只有原始資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 369.35,
          "end": 373.61,
          "en": "then can be used by our front end, by the JavaScript application.",
          "zh": "然後可以被我們的前端、也就是 JavaScript 應用程式使用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 373.61,
          "end": 376.01,
          "en": "And that's how these two ends communicate.",
          "zh": "這就是這兩端如何溝通。"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 376.04,
          "end": 379.55,
          "en": "Now that is how a lot of modern web applications are built.",
          "zh": "很多現代網頁應用程式就是這樣建立的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 379.64,
          "end": 385.43,
          "en": "And a good example would be my home page academy.com where I have many free and paid tutorials you can",
          "zh": "一個好例子是我的首頁 academind.com，那裡有很多免費和付費教學，你可以"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 385.43,
          "end": 387.05,
          "en": "look into now there.",
          "zh": "現在進去看看。"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 387.05,
          "end": 394.34000000000003,
          "en": "If you navigate around, watch this reload icon here in the top left, you see this never spins no matter",
          "zh": "如果你在裡面導覽，看左上角這個重新整理圖示，你會看到它從不轉動，不管"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 394.34000000000003,
          "end": 395.57,
          "en": "where I click.",
          "zh": "我點哪裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 396.21,
          "end": 398.37,
          "en": "It's always happening on the same page.",
          "zh": "一切都發生在同一個頁面上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 398.37,
          "end": 405.24,
          "en": "It looks like I load a new page, but behind the scenes it's JavaScript code that changes everything",
          "zh": "看起來像我載入了新頁面，但背後是 JavaScript 程式碼在動態改變"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 405.24,
          "end": 406.83,
          "en": "on that page dynamically.",
          "zh": "那個頁面上的一切。"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 406.83,
          "end": 414.81,
          "en": "When I click around, that therefore leads to a very immersive and reactive user experience where new",
          "zh": "當我點來點去時，因此會帶來非常沉浸、反應式的使用體驗，新的"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 414.81,
          "end": 418.8,
          "en": "data might be downloaded from the server, but it happens behind the scenes.",
          "zh": "資料可能從伺服器下載，但發生在背後。"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 418.8,
          "end": 422.49,
          "en": "You don't see it and therefore to you it feels really instant.",
          "zh": "你看不到，所以對你來說感覺真的很即時。"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 422.49,
          "end": 424.29,
          "en": "And there are many other examples.",
          "zh": "還有很多其他例子。"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 424.29,
          "end": 431.07,
          "en": "Parts of YouTube are built in that way, parts of Udemy and of many popular web services you can use",
          "zh": "YouTube 的部分功能是這樣建立的，Udemy 的一部分，以及你現在能使用的許多熱門網路服務，"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 431.07,
          "end": 431.82,
          "en": "these days.",
          "zh": "也都是這樣。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "14689518",
      "title": "What is Svelte?",
      "lectureOrder": 3,
      "videoOrder": 3,
      "sourceHash": "87fa4aa5915d1b2627a036e81129a9c0daefff9e403e36eab45e48a96fa5d364",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.12,
          "end": 8.21,
          "en": "So now that we know how we build modern web applications, the question is how can Svelte help us with",
          "zh": "現在我們知道如何建立現代網頁應用程式了，問題是 Svelte 如何幫助我們"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 8.21,
          "end": 8.54,
          "en": "that?",
          "zh": "做到這件事？"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.54,
          "end": 10.7,
          "en": "What is svelte or svelte?",
          "zh": "Svelte，或是 Svelte"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.7,
          "end": 11.54,
          "en": "JS.",
          "zh": "JS，到底是什麼？"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.69,
          "end": 16.88,
          "en": "Well, first of all, the word svelte might be new to you, especially if you're not a native English",
          "zh": "首先，svelte 這個字對你可能很陌生，尤其如果你和我一樣，不是以英語為"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.88,
          "end": 18.11,
          "en": "speaker as I am.",
          "zh": "母語。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.26,
          "end": 25.1,
          "en": "And if we have a look at its definition, we see that svelte basically means gracefully slender in theatre.",
          "zh": "如果我們看它的定義，svelte 基本上是指劇場裡優雅而纖細。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 25.1,
          "end": 27.89,
          "en": "So essentially it means thin lightweight.",
          "zh": "所以本質上它的意思是薄、輕量。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 27.89,
          "end": 29.9,
          "en": "You could say that could be synonyms.",
          "zh": "你也可以說，那可以當成同義詞。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 29.9,
          "end": 38.45,
          "en": "So it's all about creating a lightweight, slim application because when we control everything through",
          "zh": "所以重點是建立輕量、精簡的應用程式，因為當我們透過"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 38.45,
          "end": 45.26,
          "en": "JavaScript in the browser, that means that this JavaScript code has to be downloaded by the users of",
          "zh": "瀏覽器裡的 JavaScript 控制一切時，代表使用者必須先下載這段 JavaScript 程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 45.26,
          "end": 48.68,
          "en": "our web page before anything happens on the page.",
          "zh": "頁面上才會發生任何事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 48.68,
          "end": 56.18,
          "en": "And the more complex our code is, the more code has to be downloaded and the slower our page therefore",
          "zh": "我們的程式碼越複雜，必須下載的程式碼就越多，頁面因此也就越"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 56.21,
          "end": 56.54,
          "en": "is.",
          "zh": "慢。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 56.57,
          "end": 63.6,
          "en": "And svelte is a tool that allows us to build lightweight modern web applications that use JavaScript,",
          "zh": "而 Svelte 是一個工具，讓我們能建立輕量的現代網頁應用程式，它們使用 JavaScript，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 63.6,
          "end": 70.08,
          "en": "but highly optimized JavaScript where you ship as little code as required and then also have code that",
          "zh": "但是高度最佳化的 JavaScript，你只送出必要的那麼少程式碼，而且那些程式碼"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 70.08,
          "end": 75.75,
          "en": "is not just small in size, but also very efficient when it's executed in the browser.",
          "zh": "不只體積小，在瀏覽器裡執行時也非常有效率。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 75.75,
          "end": 80.91,
          "en": "Therefore giving you a very fast application both to load it and to run it.",
          "zh": "因此你得到一個非常快的應用程式，載入快，執行也快。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 80.94,
          "end": 82.65,
          "en": "Now, how is this achieved?",
          "zh": "這是怎麼做到的？"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 82.8,
          "end": 86.13,
          "en": "Svelte is a compiler, not a framework.",
          "zh": "Svelte 是編譯器，不是框架。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 86.13,
          "end": 91.83,
          "en": "Now, if you're new to this modern web application world, this might not tell you much, but maybe",
          "zh": "如果你剛接觸這個現代網頁應用程式的世界，這句話也許說明不了太多，但也許"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 91.83,
          "end": 95.34,
          "en": "you heard about React or Angular or Vue.",
          "zh": "你聽過 React、Angular 或 Vue。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 95.37,
          "end": 100.86,
          "en": "These are JavaScript frameworks which by the way, are amazing and not necessarily worse than svelte,",
          "zh": "這些是 JavaScript 框架，順帶一提，它們非常出色，也不必然比 Svelte 差，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 100.89,
          "end": 102.93,
          "en": "but svelte uses a different approach.",
          "zh": "但 Svelte 用的是不同的做法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 102.93,
          "end": 110.91,
          "en": "The idea behind frameworks like React and Angular and View is that you also write some modern JavaScript",
          "zh": "React、Angular 和 Vue 這類框架背後的想法是，你也會寫一些現代 JavaScript"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 110.91,
          "end": 114.42,
          "en": "code within the rules of the framework you're using.",
          "zh": "程式碼，並遵守你所用框架的規則。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 114.42,
          "end": 120.09,
          "en": "So let's say within the the rules and the concepts of Angular using a certain syntax which is then given",
          "zh": "比方說，遵守 Angular 的規則和概念，使用某種提供給你的語法，然後"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 120.09,
          "end": 124.32,
          "en": "to you and you ship that code along with the framework.",
          "zh": "把那段程式碼和框架一起送出。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 124.32,
          "end": 130.59,
          "en": "So along with Angular or along with a library like React to your users.",
          "zh": "也就是和 Angular 一起，或和 React 這類函式庫一起，送給你的使用者。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 130.59,
          "end": 138.15,
          "en": "And then it's the conjunction of the framework Angular or Vue or React and your code that makes the",
          "zh": "然後是框架 Angular、Vue 或 React，與你的程式碼共同作用，才讓"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 138.15,
          "end": 139.5,
          "en": "magic happen in the browser.",
          "zh": "魔法在瀏覽器裡發生。"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 139.5,
          "end": 144.75,
          "en": "So you have certain instructions in your code, which is then kind of understood by the framework like",
          "zh": "所以你的程式碼裡有某些指令，可以說是被框架理解，例如"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 144.75,
          "end": 149.3,
          "en": "Angular, you could say, and then both together build nice user interfaces.",
          "zh": "Angular，然後兩者一起建立漂亮的使用者介面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 149.31,
          "end": 155.64,
          "en": "The huge advantage of that is that you typically have a lot of great concepts to use, a lot of built",
          "zh": "這樣做的巨大優勢是，你通常有很多很好的概念可用、很多內建"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 155.64,
          "end": 161.46,
          "en": "in features, and therefore you have a good time building such applications and modern frameworks also",
          "zh": "功能，因此建立這類應用程式會很順手，而且現代框架"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 161.46,
          "end": 167.43,
          "en": "are pretty small, but by definition you could say they're not as small as svelte.",
          "zh": "也相當小，但你可以說，依照定義，它們不會像 Svelte 那麼小。"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 167.46,
          "end": 172.82999999999998,
          "en": "Now, of course, being small is not everything that matters, but it definitely is One thing to consider.",
          "zh": "當然，小並不是唯一重要的事，但它絕對是要考慮的一點。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 173.13,
          "end": 178.53,
          "en": "The idea behind Svelte is not that you ship your code in a framework and then both work together, but",
          "zh": "Svelte 背後的想法，不是把你的程式碼和框架一起送出、再讓兩者合作，而是"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 178.53,
          "end": 184.68,
          "en": "you write code using a certain syntax which you'll learn in this course and then svelte is a tool that",
          "zh": "你用某種語法寫程式碼，那種語法你會在這門課學到，然後 Svelte 是一個工具，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 184.68,
          "end": 191.58,
          "en": "runs over your code and generates pure vanilla JavaScript code, which is highly optimized, which contains",
          "zh": "它跑過你的程式碼，產生純粹的原生 JavaScript 程式碼，高度最佳化，裡面包含"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 191.58,
          "end": 196.92000000000002,
          "en": "a bunch of instructions which will basically make the things happen in the browser that you want to",
          "zh": "一堆指令，基本上會在瀏覽器裡讓你想發生的事情發生，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 196.92000000000002,
          "end": 198.36,
          "en": "happen based on your code.",
          "zh": "依據的是你的程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 198.36,
          "end": 203.4,
          "en": "But what you ship to your users is only that code, so you don't ship an extra framework.",
          "zh": "但你送給使用者的只有那段程式碼，所以你不會額外送出一個框架。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 203.4,
          "end": 206.88,
          "en": "It's really just your compiled code.",
          "zh": "真的只是你編譯後的程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 206.88,
          "end": 213.32999999999998,
          "en": "Still JavaScript code, but not the code you wrote, but the code that is generated by Svelte based",
          "zh": "仍然是 JavaScript 程式碼，但不是你寫下的那段，而是 Svelte 根據"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 213.32999999999998,
          "end": 217.38,
          "en": "on the instructions you wrote using the svelte syntax.",
          "zh": "你用 Svelte 語法寫下的指令所產生的程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 217.38,
          "end": 220.89,
          "en": "And that of course makes way more sense once we dive into svelte.",
          "zh": "當然，等我們深入 Svelte 之後，這會合理得多。"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 221.07,
          "end": 228.93,
          "en": "So you ship such compiled code and then these translated instructions are the code or make up the code",
          "zh": "所以你送出的是這樣編譯過的程式碼，然後這些轉譯後的指令就是程式碼，或構成"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 228.93,
          "end": 230.46,
          "en": "that runs in the browser.",
          "zh": "在瀏覽器裡執行的程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 230.46,
          "end": 236.04,
          "en": "And the advantage is simply that you ship less code than with a framework like Angular or a library",
          "zh": "優勢很單純：你送出的程式碼比 Angular 這類框架或"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 236.04,
          "end": 237.24,
          "en": "like React.",
          "zh": "React 這類函式庫更少。"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 237.24,
          "end": 241.89,
          "en": "And I will leave out the detailed comparison of these different solutions here.",
          "zh": "這裡我先不深入比較這些不同方案的細節。"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 241.89,
          "end": 243.03,
          "en": "At this moment.",
          "zh": "在這個時刻。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 243.06,
          "end": 247.59,
          "en": "We first of all, can learn svelte and then we can dive into that comparison later.",
          "zh": "我們可以先學 Svelte，之後再深入那個比較。"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 247.65,
          "end": 252.93,
          "en": "There are advantages to the different solutions, and it's not that svelte is better than everything,",
          "zh": "不同方案各有優勢，並不是 Svelte 比一切都好，"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 252.93,
          "end": 255.33,
          "en": "but it is a highly interesting approach.",
          "zh": "但它是一種非常有趣的做法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 255.33,
          "end": 259.11,
          "en": "And shipping small code definitely is an advantage.",
          "zh": "而送出體積小的程式碼，絕對是一項優勢。"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 259.38,
          "end": 261.75,
          "en": "So how does Svelte work then?",
          "zh": "那麼 Svelte 是怎麼運作的？"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 261.78,
          "end": 263.7,
          "en": "How do we write such svelte code?",
          "zh": "我們要怎麼寫這樣的 Svelte 程式碼？"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 263.7,
          "end": 267.72,
          "en": "How do we compile it and how does it look like when it then runs in the browser?",
          "zh": "我們要怎麼編譯它，而它在瀏覽器裡執行時又長什麼樣子？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "14689520",
      "title": "Setting Up a First App & The Course Project",
      "lectureOrder": 5,
      "videoOrder": 4,
      "sourceHash": "521986b2817f3ec9a0abac5b60b5fa6eb7fe7a4e9e0f7e9398c72c23743d678d",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.11,
          "end": 7.15,
          "en": "As you already learned, Svelte is all about building reactive user interfaces for the web or in the",
          "zh": "正如你已經學到的，Svelte 的重點就是為網頁建立反應式使用者介面，或是在"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 7.15,
          "end": 7.69,
          "en": "web.",
          "zh": "網頁裡建立。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.69,
          "end": 14.56,
          "en": "And it basically works such that you write code, which is basically normal JavaScript code, not just",
          "zh": "它的運作方式基本上是你寫程式碼，那些基本上是一般的 JavaScript 程式碼，不只是"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 14.56,
          "end": 21.22,
          "en": "basically it is normal JavaScript code, but you follow a certain syntax which is understood by svelte,",
          "zh": "基本上，它就是一般的 JavaScript 程式碼，但你遵循某種語法，可以說是 Svelte 能理解的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 21.22,
          "end": 27.67,
          "en": "you could say, and by using that syntax, when you run the svelte compiler over your code, it compiles",
          "zh": "使用那種語法時，當你讓 Svelte 編譯器跑過你的程式碼，它會編譯"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 27.67,
          "end": 32.41,
          "en": "the code to optimize the runtime instructions and you only ship the code your app really needs.",
          "zh": "程式碼，以最佳化執行時指令，而你只送出應用程式真正需要的程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 32.41,
          "end": 38.83,
          "en": "And therefore in the browser that compile code executes and then renders the user interface and rerenders",
          "zh": "因此在瀏覽器裡，那段編譯後的程式碼會執行，然後渲染使用者介面，並重新渲染"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 38.83,
          "end": 41.89,
          "en": "it up on certain conditions which you defined in your code.",
          "zh": "它，依據你在程式碼裡定義的某些條件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 41.98,
          "end": 45.28,
          "en": "Now let's have a look at this in a concrete example.",
          "zh": "現在讓我們用一個具體例子看看這件事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 45.86,
          "end": 48.47,
          "en": "Attached to this video, you find a zip file.",
          "zh": "這支影片附有一個 zip 檔。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 48.47,
          "end": 54.59,
          "en": "If you download and unzip this, you will find this folder structure without that vs code thing.",
          "zh": "如果你下載並解壓縮，會看到這個資料夾結構，沒有那個 VS Code 相關的東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 54.59,
          "end": 57.89,
          "en": "So the public, the source folder and these four files in it.",
          "zh": "也就是 public、source 資料夾，以及裡面的這四個檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 58.25,
          "end": 64.91,
          "en": "Now this is a starting project or a starting setup we can use to write svelte apps and I will walk you",
          "zh": "這是一個起始專案，或一套起始設定，我們可以用來寫 Svelte 應用程式，我會帶你"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 64.94,
          "end": 67.91,
          "en": "through the setup and why we need it in this video now.",
          "zh": "看過這套設定，以及為什麼我們在這支影片裡需要它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 68.06,
          "end": 74.57,
          "en": "Now, first of all, you will also need an IDE or a code editor to write some code.",
          "zh": "首先，你也需要一個 IDE 或程式碼編輯器來寫程式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 74.6,
          "end": 76.76,
          "en": "Now maybe you already have one.",
          "zh": "也許你已經有了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 76.76,
          "end": 82.46000000000001,
          "en": "If you don't, I strongly recommend using Visual Studio code, which is the editor I'll be using in",
          "zh": "如果沒有，我強烈建議使用 Visual Studio Code，也就是我在"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 82.46000000000001,
          "end": 83.03,
          "en": "this course.",
          "zh": "這門課裡會使用的編輯器。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 83.03,
          "end": 83.84,
          "en": "It's free to use.",
          "zh": "它可以免費使用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 83.84,
          "end": 86.06,
          "en": "It's great for JavaScript web development.",
          "zh": "它很適合 JavaScript 網頁開發。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 86.06,
          "end": 92.12,
          "en": "You can download it from code.visualstudio.com and there you find versions for Mac Windows and Linux.",
          "zh": "你可以從 code.visualstudio.com 下載，那裡有 Mac、Windows 和 Linux 的版本。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 92.33,
          "end": 94.37,
          "en": "So once you installed that.",
          "zh": "所以一旦你安裝好了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 94.97,
          "end": 101.47999999999999,
          "en": "You get the look I have here by hitting command shift P or control shift P on windows and then choosing",
          "zh": "按 Command+Shift+P，或在 Windows 上按 Control+Shift+P，然後選擇"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 101.47999999999999,
          "end": 103.13,
          "en": "preferences color theme.",
          "zh": "Preferences: Color Theme，就能得到我這裡的外觀。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 103.13,
          "end": 106.55,
          "en": "And there I'm using the dark plus default dark theme.",
          "zh": "我使用的是 Dark+，也就是預設的深色主題。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 106.58,
          "end": 109.37,
          "en": "Of course, don't have to use it, but that's the look I have here.",
          "zh": "當然你不必用它，但那是我這裡的外觀。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 109.49000000000001,
          "end": 115.61,
          "en": "You also can install a couple of extensions which you can reach under view extensions or by using the",
          "zh": "你也可以安裝幾個擴充功能，可以在 View、Extensions 找到，或使用"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 115.61,
          "end": 120.2,
          "en": "shortcut which is shown there and there I'm using the material icons.",
          "zh": "那裡顯示的快捷鍵，我使用的是 Material Icon Theme。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 120.41,
          "end": 125.21,
          "en": "That is a package which is totally optional, but you can install that material icon theme to have the",
          "zh": "那是一個完全選擇性的套件，但你可以安裝 Material Icon Theme，讓"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 125.21,
          "end": 127.04,
          "en": "same file icons as I have.",
          "zh": "檔案圖示和我的一樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 127.04,
          "end": 130.91,
          "en": "And I also recommend installing the svelte extension.",
          "zh": "我也建議安裝 Svelte 擴充功能。"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 130.91,
          "end": 134.39,
          "en": "Simply search for svelte and then install this svelte extension.",
          "zh": "只要搜尋 svelte，然後安裝這個 Svelte 擴充功能。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 134.39,
          "end": 134.75,
          "en": "Here.",
          "zh": "在這裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 134.75,
          "end": 136.31,
          "en": "I already have it installed.",
          "zh": "我已經安裝好了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 136.31,
          "end": 138.98,
          "en": "I strongly recommend that you do so too.",
          "zh": "我強烈建議你也這樣做。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 139.31,
          "end": 142.64,
          "en": "Now that is the only thing you need for this course.",
          "zh": "這就是這門課你唯一需要額外準備的東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 142.64,
          "end": 147.23,
          "en": "And of course you can simply configure this editor to your likings.",
          "zh": "當然你也可以依自己的喜好設定這個編輯器。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 147.23,
          "end": 148.55,
          "en": "So what did I give you here?",
          "zh": "那麼我在這裡給你的是什麼？"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 148.55,
          "end": 150.53,
          "en": "What are these files and folders all about?",
          "zh": "這些檔案和資料夾是做什麼的？"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 150.53,
          "end": 151.52,
          "en": "Why do we need them?",
          "zh": "為什麼我們需要它們？"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 151.64,
          "end": 157.65,
          "en": "Well, since Svelte is a compiler, we need to download that compilation tool essentially.",
          "zh": "因為 Svelte 是編譯器，我們本質上需要下載那個編譯工具。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 157.65,
          "end": 158.19,
          "en": "Right.",
          "zh": "對吧。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 158.46,
          "end": 160.17000000000002,
          "en": "And therefore.",
          "zh": "因此。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 160.84,
          "end": 165.17000000000002,
          "en": "I gave you this project because there is already included as a dependency.",
          "zh": "我給你這個專案，是因為它已經被包含為相依套件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 165.19,
          "end": 171.85,
          "en": "Now, if you've never worked with a modern frontend project before, this might be totally new to you.",
          "zh": "如果你從未做過現代前端專案，這對你可能完全陌生。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 171.85,
          "end": 178.75,
          "en": "But you will see this package.json file here, which essentially is a file that lists all the dependencies",
          "zh": "但你會看到這個 package.json 檔案，它本質上是一個檔案，列出所有相依套件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 178.75,
          "end": 184.18,
          "en": "we need to run this project to compile our code, you could say.",
          "zh": "可以說是我們執行這個專案、編譯程式碼所需要的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 184.33,
          "end": 186.88,
          "en": "And there you see a bunch of dependencies in there.",
          "zh": "你會在裡面看到一堆相依套件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 186.88,
          "end": 188.68,
          "en": "Most importantly, svelte.",
          "zh": "最重要的是 Svelte。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 188.83,
          "end": 191.83,
          "en": "Svelte is the tool which will compiles your code.",
          "zh": "Svelte 就是會編譯你程式碼的那個工具。"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 191.92,
          "end": 194.29,
          "en": "Now to have a nice development experience.",
          "zh": "為了有好的開發體驗。"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 194.29,
          "end": 199.84,
          "en": "We don't just want to write code, compile it, and then double click the file and view it in the browser.",
          "zh": "我們不想只是寫程式、編譯，然後連點兩下檔案、在瀏覽器裡查看。"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 199.84,
          "end": 204.76,
          "en": "Instead, we want to have a experience which is close to what our users would see.",
          "zh": "我們想要的體驗要接近使用者會看到的樣子。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 204.79,
          "end": 209.74,
          "en": "Therefore, we need a demo web server so that we can really see how our application behaves when it",
          "zh": "因此我們需要一台示範用的網頁伺服器，才能真正看到應用程式在"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 209.74,
          "end": 214.87,
          "en": "is served by a server, because that is different to when we double click on an HTML file, because",
          "zh": "由伺服器提供時如何表現，因為那和連點兩下 HTML 檔不同，因為"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 214.87,
          "end": 217.72,
          "en": "when using a web server we use the Http protocol.",
          "zh": "使用網頁伺服器時，我們用的是 HTTP 協定。"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 217.72,
          "end": 220.73,
          "en": "When double clicking a file, we use the file protocol.",
          "zh": "連點兩下檔案時，我們用的是 file 協定。"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 220.73,
          "end": 226.7,
          "en": "And in addition, it would be nice that if we change something and we save that file, it automatically",
          "zh": "此外，如果我們改了東西並存檔，它能自動"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 226.7,
          "end": 229.52,
          "en": "recompiles that file and reloads the web page.",
          "zh": "重新編譯那個檔案並重新載入網頁，那就很好。"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 229.52,
          "end": 232.34,
          "en": "And this is a project setup that gives you all of that.",
          "zh": "而這套專案設定把這些都給你。"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 232.34,
          "end": 237.23,
          "en": "It gives you a development web server, and whenever you change something, the page will automatically",
          "zh": "它給你一台開發用網頁伺服器，而且每當你改了東西，頁面會自動"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 237.23,
          "end": 240.29,
          "en": "reload because the code will automatically be rebuilt.",
          "zh": "重新載入，因為程式碼會自動重新建置。"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 240.29,
          "end": 246.47,
          "en": "And that all is also orchestrated by a tool named rollup, which essentially watches your JavaScript",
          "zh": "這一切也由一個名叫 Rollup 的工具編排，它本質上會監看你的 JavaScript"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 246.47,
          "end": 246.92,
          "en": "code.",
          "zh": "程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 246.92,
          "end": 252.5,
          "en": "And whenever you change something, it uses svelte to compile it and it also does a couple of other",
          "zh": "每當你改了東西，它就用 Svelte 編譯，也會做一些其他"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 252.5,
          "end": 253.64,
          "en": "optimizations.",
          "zh": "最佳化。"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 253.79,
          "end": 259.46,
          "en": "The rollup config file is the file that controls all about that and you can ignore that.",
          "zh": "rollup 設定檔控制這一切，你可以忽略它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 259.46,
          "end": 262.37,
          "en": "You don't need to change anything there, you can just leave it as it be.",
          "zh": "你不需要改那裡的任何東西，維持原樣即可。"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 262.4,
          "end": 266.03,
          "en": "The source folder is where we will write our code instead.",
          "zh": "我們改成在 source 資料夾裡寫程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 266.82,
          "end": 271.89,
          "en": "In there we have the Main.js file, which is the first JavaScript code that will be executed in the",
          "zh": "裡面有 main.js，那是會被執行的第一段 JavaScript 程式碼，在"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 271.89,
          "end": 272.42,
          "en": "end.",
          "zh": "最後。"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 272.43,
          "end": 275.94,
          "en": "And there you see we're importing app from app svelte.",
          "zh": "你會看到我們從 App.svelte 匯入 App。"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 276.15,
          "end": 282.72,
          "en": "Now this is a normal modern JavaScript import syntax and dot svelte of course is an extension you might",
          "zh": "這是一般的現代 JavaScript import 語法，而 .svelte 當然是你可能"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 282.72,
          "end": 283.47,
          "en": "not know.",
          "zh": "不認識的副檔名。"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 283.56,
          "end": 291.45,
          "en": "This is simply an extension understood by rollup here, and this contains a svelte file which is a combination",
          "zh": "這只是這裡的 Rollup 能理解的副檔名，它包含一個 Svelte 檔，結合了"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 291.45,
          "end": 298.74,
          "en": "of JavaScript between the script tags, CSS, between the style tags and normal HTML markup.",
          "zh": "script 標籤之間的 JavaScript、style 標籤之間的 CSS，以及一般的 HTML 標記。"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 298.74,
          "end": 304.59,
          "en": "And if you work with Vue.js before, which is of course not a requirement, but if you did, then this",
          "zh": "如果你以前用過 Vue.js，這當然不是必要條件，但如果你用過，那麼這"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 304.59,
          "end": 310.26,
          "en": "will look very familiar to you because in Vue.js you have highly comparable files where you also have",
          "zh": "對你會非常眼熟，因為在 Vue.js 裡你有高度相似的檔案，同樣"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 310.26,
          "end": 312.12,
          "en": "these three parts in one file.",
          "zh": "在一個檔案裡有這三個部分。"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 312.15,
          "end": 317.79,
          "en": "The idea here is that every svelte file makes up one building block of your user interface.",
          "zh": "這裡的想法是，每個 Svelte 檔構成使用者介面的一個建構區塊。"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 317.79,
          "end": 322.89,
          "en": "One component you could say where you have some logic between the script tags, some styling between",
          "zh": "可以說是一個元件，script 標籤之間有一些邏輯，樣式則在"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 322.89,
          "end": 326.19,
          "en": "the style tags and the markup that makes up this component.",
          "zh": "style 標籤之間，以及構成這個元件的標記。"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 326.19,
          "end": 332.11,
          "en": "And here we already have a glimpse at some special syntax which seems to be understood by svelte, this",
          "zh": "這裡我們已經瞥見一些似乎被 Svelte 理解的特殊語法，就是"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 332.11,
          "end": 333.64,
          "en": "curly brace thing here.",
          "zh": "這個大括號。"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 333.97,
          "end": 336.1,
          "en": "So what happens here is we import this.",
          "zh": "所以這裡發生的是，我們匯入這個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 336.1,
          "end": 339.79,
          "en": "This is understood by svelte and roll up working together.",
          "zh": "這是由一起合作的 Svelte 和 Rollup 所理解的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 339.79,
          "end": 347.05,
          "en": "And then this essentially just here tells Svelte which understands all this code that we want to instantiate",
          "zh": "然後這裡本質上告訴理解這全部程式碼的 Svelte，我們想要實例化"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 347.05,
          "end": 353.26,
          "en": "this component and we want to render it in our document body of the single page reloading.",
          "zh": "這個元件，並把它渲染到 document 的 body，也就是我們正在載入的那個單頁。"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 353.26,
          "end": 355.84000000000003,
          "en": "Because remember, we're building a single page application.",
          "zh": "因為記得，我們在建立單頁應用程式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 355.84000000000003,
          "end": 361.39,
          "en": "I mentioned this early on the slide and the single page I'm talking about can be find can be found in",
          "zh": "我稍早在投影片上提過，我說的那個單頁可以在"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 361.39,
          "end": 362.35,
          "en": "the public folder.",
          "zh": "public 資料夾裡找到。"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 362.35,
          "end": 364.24,
          "en": "It's the index.html file there.",
          "zh": "就是那裡的 index.html。"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 364.27,
          "end": 366.82,
          "en": "It's a normal HTML skeleton.",
          "zh": "它是一個一般的 HTML 骨架。"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 366.87,
          "end": 374.29,
          "en": "We have some imports for for CSS and for JavaScript and we have nothing else because well it will be",
          "zh": "我們有一些 CSS 和 JavaScript 的引入，其他什麼都沒有，因為"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 374.29,
          "end": 377.56,
          "en": "populated with content dynamically by JavaScript.",
          "zh": "它會由 JavaScript 動態填入內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 377.89,
          "end": 382.63,
          "en": "Global CSS, by the way, is a file where you can write some global CSS code.",
          "zh": "順帶一提，global.css 是你可以寫一些全域 CSS 的檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 382.84,
          "end": 387.85,
          "en": "So this is the starting setup we will use now to see what happens there.",
          "zh": "所以這就是我們現在要用的起始設定，來看看那裡會發生什麼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 387.85,
          "end": 391.99,
          "en": "We need to install one additional tool and that is Node JS.",
          "zh": "我們需要再安裝一個工具，那就是 Node.js。"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 392.2,
          "end": 395.14,
          "en": "For this you should visit nodejs.org.",
          "zh": "為此你應該造訪 nodejs.org。"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 395.14,
          "end": 402.28,
          "en": "NodeJS is a JavaScript runtime that allows you to write server side JavaScript code and of course we'll",
          "zh": "Node.js 是 JavaScript 執行環境，讓你能寫伺服器端 JavaScript，當然我們"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 402.28,
          "end": 405.19,
          "en": "not write any server side JavaScript code here.",
          "zh": "這裡不會寫任何伺服器端 JavaScript。"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 405.19,
          "end": 411.37,
          "en": "But besides being a JavaScript runtime that allows you to write server side JavaScript code, it also",
          "zh": "但除了作為能寫伺服器端 JavaScript 的執行環境，它也"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 411.37,
          "end": 417.67,
          "en": "allows you to execute JavaScript code outside of the browser in general, and that is one of the features",
          "zh": "讓你能在瀏覽器之外執行 JavaScript，而那是我們需要的功能之一，"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 417.67,
          "end": 422.44,
          "en": "we need because rollup and svelte need node JS to run.",
          "zh": "因為 Rollup 和 Svelte 需要 Node.js 才能執行。"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 422.44,
          "end": 427.57,
          "en": "So they basically are written in JavaScript too, but you don't execute these files in the browser but",
          "zh": "所以它們基本上也是用 JavaScript 寫的，但你不是在瀏覽器裡執行這些檔案，而是"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 427.57,
          "end": 430.27,
          "en": "here on your computer to compile the code.",
          "zh": "在你的電腦上編譯程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 430.27,
          "end": 435.13,
          "en": "And that requires node JS to be installed on your computer to well do the job.",
          "zh": "那就需要電腦上安裝 Node.js，才能完成這項工作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 435.16,
          "end": 442.57,
          "en": "In addition, Node JS also installs a tool called NPM, which stands for Node Package Manager, which",
          "zh": "此外，Node.js 也會安裝一個叫 npm 的工具，代表 Node Package Manager，"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 442.6,
          "end": 448,
          "en": "allows you to download and install all the dependencies which are listed here in the Package.json file.",
          "zh": "讓你下載並安裝這裡 package.json 裡列出的所有相依套件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 448,
          "end": 451.69,
          "en": "Because this file just specifies which dependencies we need.",
          "zh": "因為這個檔案只是指定我們需要哪些相依套件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 451.72,
          "end": 458.11,
          "en": "You need to run a command using NPM to download and install them here in your project folder.",
          "zh": "你需要用 npm 執行一個指令，在專案資料夾裡下載並安裝它們。"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 458.29,
          "end": 464.62,
          "en": "Therefore, you should download the latest version the current version here from nodejs.org download",
          "zh": "因此，你應該從 nodejs.org 下載目前的最新版本，"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 464.62,
          "end": 465.4,
          "en": "and install it.",
          "zh": "下載並安裝它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 465.4,
          "end": 468.25,
          "en": "It's a normal installer for which you can walk.",
          "zh": "它是一般的安裝程式，你可以照著步驟走。"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 468.25,
          "end": 469.84000000000003,
          "en": "Nothing fancy about that.",
          "zh": "沒有什麼特別的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 469.84000000000003,
          "end": 476.68,
          "en": "And once you did that, which I did off screen here, you can open the terminal and here I'm using the",
          "zh": "一旦你做完，我在畫面外已經做過了，你就可以打開終端機，我這裡用的是"
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 476.68,
          "end": 481.42,
          "en": "one built into Visual Studio code which you find under terminal New Terminal.",
          "zh": "內建在 Visual Studio Code 裡的那個，可以在 Terminal、New Terminal 找到。"
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 481.93,
          "end": 486.31,
          "en": "The advantage here is that it's automatically navigated into my folder here.",
          "zh": "這裡的好處是，它會自動進入我這裡的資料夾。"
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 486.34,
          "end": 492.28,
          "en": "You can of course also use your normal terminal or command prompt on your machine, but then you should",
          "zh": "你當然也可以用電腦上一般的終端機或命令提示字元，但那樣你應該"
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 492.28,
          "end": 495.61,
          "en": "use this CD command to navigate into your project folder.",
          "zh": "用這個 cd 指令進入專案資料夾。"
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 495.73,
          "end": 497.41,
          "en": "And in that project folder.",
          "zh": "在那個專案資料夾裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 497.41,
          "end": 501.04,
          "en": "Now the first thing you have to run is NPM install.",
          "zh": "現在你必須先執行的是 npm install。"
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 501.49,
          "end": 508.24,
          "en": "This uses this NPM tool to download and install all these dependencies in this project folder so that",
          "zh": "這會用 npm 這個工具，在這個專案資料夾裡下載並安裝所有相依套件，好讓"
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 508.24,
          "end": 509.86,
          "en": "we can use them in the project.",
          "zh": "我們能在專案裡使用它們。"
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 509.86,
          "end": 516.64,
          "en": "It stores all these downloaded dependencies in the node modules folder, which is quite big, but whenever",
          "zh": "它把下載的相依套件存在 node_modules 資料夾，那個資料夾相當大，但每當"
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 516.64,
          "end": 520.72,
          "en": "you want to get rid of it you can just delete it and recreate it with NPM install.",
          "zh": "你想清掉它，可以直接刪除，再用 npm install 重建。"
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 521.11,
          "end": 523.87,
          "en": "You can ignore any warnings you might be getting here.",
          "zh": "你可能在這裡看到的任何警告都可以忽略。"
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 524.14,
          "end": 524.56,
          "en": "Now.",
          "zh": "現在。"
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 524.56,
          "end": 532.09,
          "en": "Once you did that, you can run one of these scripts which are built into this Package.json file scripts",
          "zh": "做完之後，你可以執行內建在這個 package.json 裡的其中一個指令稿，指令稿"
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 532.09,
          "end": 534.28,
          "en": "can also be triggered through NPM.",
          "zh": "也可以透過 npm 觸發。"
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 534.28,
          "end": 537.79,
          "en": "You simply run NPM run and then the name of the script.",
          "zh": "你只要執行 npm run，再加上指令稿的名稱。"
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 537.79,
          "end": 544.45,
          "en": "And we need the dev script, which stands for Development to get that development server, that file",
          "zh": "我們需要 dev 指令稿，代表 development，以取得那個開發伺服器、檔案"
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 544.45,
          "end": 547.9,
          "en": "watching and that auto compilation later.",
          "zh": "監看，以及稍後的自動編譯。"
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 547.9,
          "end": 553.09,
          "en": "For example, we'll also use the build script to build our application for production.",
          "zh": "例如，我們也會用 build 指令稿，為正式環境建置應用程式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 553.72,
          "end": 559.57,
          "en": "Now with that up and running, with that dev script up and running, what you can do is you can go back",
          "zh": "現在這些都跑起來了，dev 指令稿跑起來之後，你可以做的是回到"
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 559.57,
          "end": 566.47,
          "en": "to your browser and now visit localhost 5000 on this page you.",
          "zh": "瀏覽器，現在造訪 localhost:5000，在這個頁面上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 566.48,
          "end": 573.65,
          "en": "You should then see Hello World, because this is the starting code or the starting content that is",
          "zh": "你應該會看到 Hello World，因為這是起始程式碼，或是起始內容，"
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 573.65,
          "end": 575.95,
          "en": "well coded into our project right now.",
          "zh": "目前就寫在我們的專案裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 139,
          "start": 575.96,
          "end": 582.17,
          "en": "You'll also see that now in the public folder there are a bunch of files for new files.",
          "zh": "你也會看到，現在 public 資料夾裡多了一堆新檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 140,
          "start": 582.17,
          "end": 583.91,
          "en": "Now what's in these files?",
          "zh": "這些檔案裡有什麼？"
        },
        {
          "id": 141,
          "start": 584.06,
          "end": 586.91,
          "en": "Let's start with Bundle.js, which is the interesting one.",
          "zh": "先從 bundle.js 開始，這是有趣的那個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 142,
          "start": 586.91,
          "end": 592.16,
          "en": "This is essentially the compiled code svelte spit out for you.",
          "zh": "這本質上就是 Svelte 為你產生的編譯後程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 143,
          "start": 592.25,
          "end": 595.34,
          "en": "It's quite a lot of code, certainly more than we wrote.",
          "zh": "程式碼相當多，肯定比我們寫的多。"
        },
        {
          "id": 144,
          "start": 595.34,
          "end": 601.07,
          "en": "And still it's highly optimized because of course, this is not just the code well that you wrote here.",
          "zh": "但它仍然高度最佳化，因為這當然不只是你在這裡寫的那段程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 145,
          "start": 601.07,
          "end": 607.04,
          "en": "It is the code that makes sure that this gets all attached to the Dom here so that you have something",
          "zh": "它是確保這一切都掛到這裡的 DOM 上的程式碼，好讓你的畫面上"
        },
        {
          "id": 146,
          "start": 607.04,
          "end": 611.6,
          "en": "on the screen and it might still be overkill for a single Hello world.",
          "zh": "有東西，而對單一一個 Hello World 來說，它也許仍然過頭了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 147,
          "start": 611.6,
          "end": 615.5,
          "en": "But the more dynamic content we add, the more sense this makes.",
          "zh": "但我們加入越多動態內容，這就越有道理。"
        },
        {
          "id": 148,
          "start": 615.5,
          "end": 621.77,
          "en": "Because this code includes everything you need to attach new code or new content dynamically to the",
          "zh": "因為這段程式碼包含你需要的一切，用來把新程式碼或新內容動態掛到"
        },
        {
          "id": 149,
          "start": 621.77,
          "end": 625.73,
          "en": "page to react to clicks and much more.",
          "zh": "頁面上、對點擊做出反應，以及更多。"
        },
        {
          "id": 150,
          "start": 626.18,
          "end": 632.28,
          "en": "This is the optimized compiled code you have, and this is all the code that needs to be shipped.",
          "zh": "這就是你擁有的最佳化編譯程式碼，也是所有需要送出的程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 151,
          "start": 632.28,
          "end": 639.51,
          "en": "And if you ever work with Angular or React or Vue, you know that these frameworks ship far more code",
          "zh": "如果你曾經用過 Angular、React 或 Vue，你知道這些框架會送出多得多的程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 152,
          "start": 639.51,
          "end": 645.63,
          "en": "for a simple Hello World app because there you would have the whole framework included and not just",
          "zh": "就算只是一個簡單的 Hello World 應用程式，因為那裡會包含整個框架，而不只是"
        },
        {
          "id": 153,
          "start": 645.63,
          "end": 649.38,
          "en": "an extended set of instructions for your code.",
          "zh": "針對你的程式碼擴充出來的一組指令。"
        },
        {
          "id": 154,
          "start": 649.62,
          "end": 655.8,
          "en": "Now the other files here are simply just the CSS stylings we have and then source maps which help with",
          "zh": "這裡的其他檔案只是我們擁有的 CSS 樣式，然後是 source map，有助於"
        },
        {
          "id": 155,
          "start": 655.8,
          "end": 656.61,
          "en": "debugging.",
          "zh": "除錯。"
        },
        {
          "id": 156,
          "start": 656.94,
          "end": 659.19,
          "en": "That is our starting project.",
          "zh": "這就是我們的起始專案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 157,
          "start": 659.19,
          "end": 661.38,
          "en": "That's our starting code we'll work with.",
          "zh": "這就是我們要使用的起始程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 158,
          "start": 661.38,
          "end": 667.23,
          "en": "Let's now dive into our first little change here to see how we can write some code.",
          "zh": "現在讓我們在這裡做第一個小改動，看看我們如何寫一些程式碼。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "14689522",
      "title": "Writing Some Svelte Code",
      "lectureOrder": 6,
      "videoOrder": 5,
      "sourceHash": "412f9aec6df3edfe1a0f364f60541bc317e7d5be2812a9572327755561b19d75",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 1.99,
          "end": 2.92,
          "en": "To write some code.",
          "zh": "要寫一些程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.92,
          "end": 5.35,
          "en": "Let's go into that app, svelte file.",
          "zh": "我們進到那個 App.svelte 檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.35,
          "end": 11.11,
          "en": "And there we see we have that JavaScript code where we export a variable name.",
          "zh": "在那裡我們看到一段 JavaScript，用 export 匯出一個變數 name。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.11,
          "end": 11.83,
          "en": "Okay?",
          "zh": "好。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.86,
          "end": 16.84,
          "en": "Then we have that markup where we seem to use that variable with the curly braces.",
          "zh": "然後有一段標記，我們似乎用大括號使用那個變數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.84,
          "end": 21.22,
          "en": "And please note that this is of course not normal HTML code.",
          "zh": "請注意，這當然不是一般的 HTML 程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 21.25,
          "end": 23.14,
          "en": "Normally in HTML we should see.",
          "zh": "在一般的 HTML 裡，我們應該會看到"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.17,
          "end": 29.62,
          "en": "Hello Curly brace name curly brace here and not hello world because well, it's not world here.",
          "zh": "Hello {name}，而不是 Hello World，因為這裡並不是 world。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 29.62,
          "end": 33.4,
          "en": "So there kind of seems to be a connection between this and this variable.",
          "zh": "所以這兩者之間，和這個變數之間，似乎有某種連結。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 33.43,
          "end": 40.78,
          "en": "But even if there were whereas world coming from that's coming from Main.js where we set up this props",
          "zh": "但就算有，world 又是從哪來的？它來自 main.js，我們在那裡設定了這個 props"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 40.78,
          "end": 45.16,
          "en": "thing where I assign world as a value to name.",
          "zh": "的東西，我把 world 這個值指定給 name。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 45.28,
          "end": 51.46,
          "en": "Now I'll dive into the details of this later in the course because we'll work our way through this svelte",
          "zh": "這些細節我稍後在課程裡會再深入，因為我們會一步一步走過這些 Svelte"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 51.46,
          "end": 52.9,
          "en": "syntax step by step.",
          "zh": "語法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 52.9,
          "end": 60.13,
          "en": "But essentially what happens here is this Here is a certain command understood by Svelte, and it's",
          "zh": "但本質上，這裡發生的是：這是 Svelte 能理解的某個指令，而且它"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 60.13,
          "end": 67.28,
          "en": "both regular JavaScript and a special instruction understood by svelte at the same time where this command",
          "zh": "同時既是一般的 JavaScript，也是 Svelte 能理解的特殊指令，這個指令"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 67.31,
          "end": 74.3,
          "en": "tells svelte we have a variable name in this svelte component which we can use in the markup.",
          "zh": "告訴 Svelte，這個 Svelte 元件裡有一個變數 name，我們可以在標記裡使用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 74.3,
          "end": 80.69,
          "en": "And by adding exports, well, it knows this variable can actually be set from outside of this component",
          "zh": "加上 export 之後，它就知道這個變數其實可以從元件外部設定，"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 80.69,
          "end": 82.4,
          "en": "because I'm not setting it inside, right?",
          "zh": "因為我沒有在裡面設定它，對吧？"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 82.4,
          "end": 83.78,
          "en": "I'm not assigning a value here.",
          "zh": "我沒有在這裡指定值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 83.78,
          "end": 85.07,
          "en": "There is no equal sign.",
          "zh": "沒有等號。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 85.07,
          "end": 86.84,
          "en": "We could add one, but there isn't.",
          "zh": "我們可以加一個，但現在沒有。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 86.87,
          "end": 92.3,
          "en": "And therefore, Svelte actually looks at the place where this component gets used, which is here.",
          "zh": "因此，Svelte 實際上會去看這個元件被使用的地方，也就是這裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 92.3,
          "end": 95.6,
          "en": "We import it here and we instantiate it here and there.",
          "zh": "我們在這裡匯入它，也在這裡實例化它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 95.6,
          "end": 102.65,
          "en": "We then have props, which is a special keyword understood by Svelte, which tells svelte whatever key",
          "zh": "然後我們有 props，這是 Svelte 能理解的特殊關鍵字，它告訴 Svelte，我們這裡的任何鍵"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 102.65,
          "end": 107.93,
          "en": "value pairs we have here populate variables with the names on the left side of the colon.",
          "zh": "值組，都要用冒號左邊的名稱去填入變數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 107.93,
          "end": 111.74000000000001,
          "en": "So with name, in this case with the values on the right side.",
          "zh": "所以在這個例子是 name，值則是右邊的那些。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 111.74000000000001,
          "end": 121.19,
          "en": "So we could also add a second prop here H maybe 30 and then in app svelte we could also export let H",
          "zh": "我們也可以在這裡再加第二個 prop，例如 age 是 30，然後在 App.svelte 裡也可以 export let age"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 121.19,
          "end": 125.72,
          "en": "here and this has to be H because it's H here and now.",
          "zh": "在這裡，而且必須是 age，因為這裡就是 age。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 127.06,
          "end": 133.75,
          "en": "We could also add my age is and then curly brace age because again this is another instruction understood",
          "zh": "我們也可以加上 my age is，然後加大括號 age，因為這又是 Svelte 能理解的另一個指令，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 133.78,
          "end": 141.25,
          "en": "by svelte where it knows that there is a connection between this segment here or this statement and",
          "zh": "它知道這一段、或這個陳述式，和"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 141.25,
          "end": 142.51,
          "en": "this variable.",
          "zh": "這個變數之間有連結。"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 142.51,
          "end": 147.1,
          "en": "If you now save all files, this is the automatic recompilation and reloading.",
          "zh": "如果你現在把所有檔案存檔，這就是我說的自動重新編譯和重新載入。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 147.1,
          "end": 149.44,
          "en": "I meant because now we see Hello world.",
          "zh": "因為現在我們看到 Hello World。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 149.44,
          "end": 155.32,
          "en": "My age is 30 and this gets even more interesting if we make this dynamic.",
          "zh": "My age is 30，如果我們把它變成動態的，就更有趣了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 155.35,
          "end": 158.59,
          "en": "Let's say we're not getting these values from outside.",
          "zh": "假設我們不是從外部取得這些值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 158.62,
          "end": 161.23,
          "en": "We could get them from outside and still make it dynamic.",
          "zh": "我們可以從外部取得，同時仍然讓它是動態的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 161.23,
          "end": 164.59,
          "en": "But let's handle everything inside of this component.",
          "zh": "但讓我們把一切都放在這個元件裡面處理。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 164.59,
          "end": 169.18,
          "en": "And therefore, my name now is Max and my age is 30.",
          "zh": "因此，我的名字現在是 Max，我的年齡是 30。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 169.18,
          "end": 174.22,
          "en": "And in Main.js, we can now get rid of that props thing here because we're not passing in the data from",
          "zh": "在 main.js 裡，我們現在可以拿掉這裡的 props，因為我們不再從"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 174.22,
          "end": 175.87,
          "en": "outside into the component.",
          "zh": "外部把資料傳進元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 175.9,
          "end": 178.63,
          "en": "Instead, I define it here and now.",
          "zh": "而是我在這裡定義它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 178.63,
          "end": 180.55,
          "en": "Well, we still have the output here.",
          "zh": "我們這裡仍然有輸出。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 180.55,
          "end": 181.18,
          "en": "Hello, Max.",
          "zh": "Hello, Max。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 181.18,
          "end": 184.15,
          "en": "My age of 30, but of course that's not dynamic.",
          "zh": "My age is 30，但那當然還不是動態的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 184.15,
          "end": 188.39,
          "en": "But now we can also do things in svelte, like add a button.",
          "zh": "但現在我們也可以在 Svelte 裡做一些事，例如加一個按鈕。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 189.28,
          "end": 196.12,
          "en": "When we say change H And when I click this button, I want to change the H to, let's say the H plus",
          "zh": "我們寫上 change age，當我點這個按鈕時，我想把 age 改成，比方說 age 加"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 196.12,
          "end": 196.72,
          "en": "one.",
          "zh": "一。"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 197.44,
          "end": 198.31,
          "en": "For this.",
          "zh": "為此。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 198.34,
          "end": 202.72,
          "en": "In the script tags we can add a JavaScript function increment.",
          "zh": "在 script 標籤裡，我們可以加一個 JavaScript 函式 incrementAge。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 202.99,
          "end": 207.85,
          "en": "For example, you can name the function whatever you want and this is a normal JavaScript function should",
          "zh": "例如，函式名稱你可以隨便取，這是一般的 JavaScript 函式"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 207.85,
          "end": 213.57999999999998,
          "en": "be syntax, you know, And in there I take my age and I add plus one to it.",
          "zh": "語法，你知道的，在裡面我取出 age，並加上一。"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 213.57999999999998,
          "end": 217.54,
          "en": "And of course we can also use the shorthand notation of plus equals one.",
          "zh": "當然我們也可以用加等於一的簡寫。"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 217.84,
          "end": 220,
          "en": "So this increments the age by one.",
          "zh": "所以這會把 age 加一。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 220.39,
          "end": 228.4,
          "en": "Now in normal JavaScript, if we were not using svelte, we could select the button with Queryselector.",
          "zh": "在一般的 JavaScript 裡，如果我們不用 Svelte，可以用 querySelector 選到按鈕。"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 228.4,
          "end": 234.06,
          "en": "For example, add an event listener and fire this function whenever the button is clicked.",
          "zh": "例如加上事件監聽器，每當按鈕被點擊就呼叫這個函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 234.07,
          "end": 239.82999999999998,
          "en": "The problem would be that the age would change here in JavaScript, but that change wouldn't automatically",
          "zh": "問題是，age 會在 JavaScript 裡改變，但那個改變不會自動"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 239.82999999999998,
          "end": 243.55,
          "en": "be reflected back into the Dom, into what the user sees, right?",
          "zh": "反映回 DOM，也就是使用者看到的畫面，對吧？"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 243.76,
          "end": 247.9,
          "en": "Because in normal JavaScript you have no syntax like this.",
          "zh": "因為在一般的 JavaScript 裡，沒有像這樣的語法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 247.9,
          "end": 254.65,
          "en": "You can't use curly braces in HTML to tell JavaScript, Hey, when this value here changes, please",
          "zh": "你不能在 HTML 裡用大括號告訴 JavaScript：嘿，當這裡的值改變時，請"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 254.65,
          "end": 256.15,
          "en": "output the new value here.",
          "zh": "把新的值輸出到這裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 256.15,
          "end": 263,
          "en": "Instead, you manually have to write code where you say okay and now create a new HTML element, append",
          "zh": "你必須自己寫程式碼，說好，現在建立一個新的 HTML 元素，附加"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 263,
          "end": 268.01,
          "en": "it to the Dom or change the text content of of an existing element and so on.",
          "zh": "到 DOM，或改變既有元素的文字內容，諸如此類。"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 268.37,
          "end": 270.23,
          "en": "With svelte that's a bit easier.",
          "zh": "用 Svelte 就容易一些。"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 270.23,
          "end": 278.51,
          "en": "This is understood by svelte and sets up a live connection between well, our age variable here and",
          "zh": "這被 Svelte 理解，並建立一個即時連結，連結我們這裡的 age 變數和"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 278.51,
          "end": 280.19,
          "en": "this place in the Dom.",
          "zh": "DOM 裡的這個位置。"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 280.19,
          "end": 284.81,
          "en": "And now we can also tell Svelte that it should react to button click by adding on colon.",
          "zh": "現在我們也可以告訴 Svelte，它應該對按鈕點擊做出反應，方法是加上 on 冒號"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 284.81,
          "end": 285.56,
          "en": "Click here.",
          "zh": "click，寫在這裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 285.59000000000003,
          "end": 289.90999999999997,
          "en": "This is not normal JavaScript or HTML code.",
          "zh": "這不是一般的 JavaScript 或 HTML 程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 289.94,
          "end": 295.13,
          "en": "Normally this would not be understood by the browser, but it doesn't have to be understood by the browser",
          "zh": "瀏覽器通常不會理解這個，但它不必被瀏覽器理解，"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 295.13,
          "end": 301.22,
          "en": "because svelte is a tool that runs all over our code before it ships it to the browser.",
          "zh": "因為 Svelte 是一個工具，在把程式碼送到瀏覽器之前，會先跑過我們全部的程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 301.22,
          "end": 307.85,
          "en": "And Svelte understands this instruction because it's official svelte syntax and svelte now knows okay,",
          "zh": "Svelte 理解這個指令，因為這是官方的 Svelte 語法，Svelte 現在知道，好，"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 307.85,
          "end": 310.34,
          "en": "when the button gets clicked, something should happen.",
          "zh": "當按鈕被點擊時，應該發生某件事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 310.49,
          "end": 314.72,
          "en": "And that's something is defined by adding a equals sign.",
          "zh": "而那件事是用加上等號來定義的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 314.81,
          "end": 316.01,
          "en": "And then you can.",
          "zh": "然後你可以。"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 316.01,
          "end": 318.34,
          "en": "But you don't have to add quotation marks.",
          "zh": "但你不必加上引號。"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 318.34,
          "end": 320.44,
          "en": "And then in there, curly braces.",
          "zh": "然後在裡面加大括號。"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 320.47,
          "end": 324.64,
          "en": "Now the curly braces are required, the quotation marks are not.",
          "zh": "大括號是必要的，引號則不是。"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 326.21,
          "end": 331.28,
          "en": "But I like wrapping that in between the quotation marks because it can help with.",
          "zh": "但我喜歡用引號包起來，因為這有助於"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 332.29,
          "end": 339.7,
          "en": "Syntax highlighting here in the ID and now between these curly braces, you again give svelte a hint",
          "zh": "這裡 IDE 的語法突顯，而現在在這些大括號之間，你再次給 Svelte 一個提示，"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 339.73,
          "end": 341.74,
          "en": "to what you want to connect this code.",
          "zh": "關於你想把這段程式碼連到什麼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 341.74,
          "end": 345.77,
          "en": "And here I want to connect it to increment age like this.",
          "zh": "這裡我想把它連到 incrementAge，像這樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 345.79,
          "end": 351.64,
          "en": "Now don't add curly braces here because you don't want to execute increment age when this code is parsed.",
          "zh": "這裡不要加大括號，因為你不想在這段程式碼被解析時就執行 incrementAge。"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 351.67,
          "end": 354.77,
          "en": "Instead, you want to tell svelte this is a pointer.",
          "zh": "你想告訴 Svelte，這是一個指標。"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 354.79,
          "end": 360.67,
          "en": "This is the name of the function which should execute when this button is clicked and then svelte will",
          "zh": "這是按鈕被點擊時應該執行的函式名稱，然後 Svelte 會"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 360.67,
          "end": 363.76,
          "en": "execute this function when the button is clicked.",
          "zh": "在按鈕被點擊時執行這個函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 363.76,
          "end": 368.56,
          "en": "And in that function we change the age because we have set up this live connection here.",
          "zh": "在那個函式裡我們改變 age，因為我們已經在這裡建立了這個即時連結。"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 368.56,
          "end": 372.34,
          "en": "We should see that change automatically in the Dom.",
          "zh": "我們應該會看到那個改變自動出現在 DOM 裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 372.34,
          "end": 377.71,
          "en": "So on our screen, if you now save everything and you go back, you have the button here.",
          "zh": "所以在畫面上，如果你現在把一切存檔並回到畫面，這裡就有按鈕。"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 377.74,
          "end": 380.11,
          "en": "If you click change age, you see.",
          "zh": "如果你點 change age，你會看到。"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 381.51,
          "end": 382.78,
          "en": "The age changes.",
          "zh": "年齡改變了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 382.8,
          "end": 384.08,
          "en": "It's like magic.",
          "zh": "就像魔法一樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 384.09,
          "end": 388.2,
          "en": "And it happens only with that bit of code you wrote.",
          "zh": "而這只靠你寫的那一點程式碼就發生了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 388.45,
          "end": 394.71,
          "en": "Now, again, if you have a look at the public file folder here, you see way more code and in there",
          "zh": "再看一次這裡的 public 資料夾，你會看到多得多的程式碼，在裡面"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 394.71,
          "end": 399.27,
          "en": "you see all the code that in the end is responsible for making this happen.",
          "zh": "你會看到最終負責讓這件事發生的所有程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 399.27,
          "end": 405.36,
          "en": "And that should also make it clearer why this is a bit more code, because this code includes all the",
          "zh": "這也應該讓你更清楚，為什麼程式碼會多一些，因為這段程式碼包含所有"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 405.36,
          "end": 410,
          "en": "instructions that reaches out to the real Dom and changes it.",
          "zh": "會連到真正的 DOM 並改變它的指令。"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 410.01,
          "end": 412.53,
          "en": "Here, for example, you see how the content is rendered.",
          "zh": "例如在這裡，你會看到內容如何被渲染。"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 412.53,
          "end": 418.2,
          "en": "The button, the my H is text and so on and you see the dynamic segments here, text, name, text,",
          "zh": "按鈕、My age is 那段文字等等，你也會看到這裡的動態片段，文字、name、文字、"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 418.2,
          "end": 423.21,
          "en": "context, age, and you see the button, the button has some text.",
          "zh": "然後是 age，你也會看到按鈕，按鈕有一些文字。"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 423.21,
          "end": 430.5,
          "en": "And then somewhere we also have a listener set up for the button which changes this h value in the end",
          "zh": "然後某個地方我們也為按鈕設定了監聽器，最後會改變這個 age 的值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 430.5,
          "end": 432.36,
          "en": "and which updates the Dom.",
          "zh": "並更新 DOM。"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 432.66,
          "end": 435,
          "en": "This is how svelte works.",
          "zh": "這就是 Svelte 的運作方式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 435,
          "end": 438.03,
          "en": "And if this was a tiny bit too fast, no worries.",
          "zh": "如果剛才稍微快了一點，別擔心。"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 438.03,
          "end": 444.31,
          "en": "From the next section on, we'll walk through the course syntax and all its core features step by step.",
          "zh": "從下一個章節開始，我們會一步一步走過這門課的語法，以及所有核心功能。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "14696224",
      "title": "Course Outline",
      "lectureOrder": 7,
      "videoOrder": 6,
      "sourceHash": "a186e0a82bf031cfe87294fa7fce97ccd8695010e4e07858e6770bc9265419c4",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.09,
          "end": 8.27,
          "en": "So now that we got our hands dirty on our first svelte code, I would imagine that you hopefully are",
          "zh": "所以現在我們已經親手寫了第一段 Svelte 程式碼，我想你希望"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 8.27,
          "end": 14.35,
          "en": "excited to dive deeper into svelte and learn all about it and its syntax and we're almost there.",
          "zh": "會很興奮，想更深入 Svelte，完整了解它和它的語法，而我們就快到了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 14.36,
          "end": 19.88,
          "en": "Let me just walk you through what you can expect from this course and what you will find at which point",
          "zh": "讓我帶你看看這門課你能期待什麼，以及你會在哪個時間點找到什麼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 19.88,
          "end": 23.09,
          "en": "in this course we're almost done getting started.",
          "zh": "在這門課裡，我們的入門幾乎要結束了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 23.09,
          "end": 29.81,
          "en": "The next step in the next course section is that we will dive into the base syntax and all the core",
          "zh": "下一個課程章節的下一步，是我們會深入基礎語法，以及所有構成 Svelte 的核心"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 29.81,
          "end": 36.47,
          "en": "features that make up svelte, so all the core tools you need to build a basic application, send data",
          "zh": "功能，也就是你建立基本應用程式、把資料送到"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 36.47,
          "end": 42.98,
          "en": "to other components, use components, understand what components are that they are really important",
          "zh": "其他元件、使用元件、理解元件是什麼所需要的全部核心工具，它們在"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 42.98,
          "end": 44.72,
          "en": "in svelte and all that fun stuff.",
          "zh": "Svelte 裡真的很重要，以及所有那些有趣的東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 44.72,
          "end": 51.59,
          "en": "So this is a really crucial module thereafter and kind of connected to that, we'll dive into conditionals",
          "zh": "所以這之後是一個非常關鍵的單元，和它相關的是，我們會深入條件式"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 51.59,
          "end": 58.37,
          "en": "and loops that will help you understand how you can output different content on the page depending on",
          "zh": "和迴圈，那會幫助你理解如何依不同條件，在頁面上輸出不同內容，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 58.37,
          "end": 64.74,
          "en": "different conditions and also how you can output lists of data without writing the same code over and",
          "zh": "以及如何輸出資料清單，而不必一再寫"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 64.74,
          "end": 65.79,
          "en": "over again.",
          "zh": "同樣的程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 66.27,
          "end": 72.3,
          "en": "We'll thereafter have a closer look at reactivity, which is a core concept of svelte and where we will",
          "zh": "之後我們會更仔細看反應性，這是 Svelte 的核心概念，那裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 72.3,
          "end": 76.92,
          "en": "have a couple of features which haven't been covered in the previous two modules.",
          "zh": "會有一些前兩個單元還沒涵蓋的功能。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 76.92,
          "end": 81.42,
          "en": "Well, we'll have a look at them in this module then and thereafter.",
          "zh": "我們會在那個單元裡看它們，然後在那之後。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 81.42,
          "end": 85.56,
          "en": "It's time for starting our bigger course project.",
          "zh": "就該開始我們較大的課程專案了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 85.56,
          "end": 92.94,
          "en": "In this course there will be a project to which we come back after every major section to add the things",
          "zh": "這門課會有一個專案，每個主要章節之後我們都會回到它，把"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 92.94,
          "end": 97.65,
          "en": "we learned in theory in the section in the scope of that course project.",
          "zh": "我們在該章節理論上學到的東西，套進那個課程專案的範圍裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 97.65,
          "end": 103.35,
          "en": "Because in all these sections like the base syntax section, I'll also have small demos, but you'll",
          "zh": "因為在基礎語法這類章節裡，我也會有小型示範，但你"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 103.35,
          "end": 110.4,
          "en": "then see all the things come together at the example of a real project in these course projects sections.",
          "zh": "接著會在這些課程專案章節裡，看到所有東西在一個真實專案的例子中湊在一起。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 110.4,
          "end": 112.22999999999999,
          "en": "So definitely don't skip them.",
          "zh": "所以千萬不要跳過它們。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 112.22999999999999,
          "end": 117.75,
          "en": "They contain very useful information and you will see the big picture and how things work together and",
          "zh": "它們包含非常有用的資訊，你會看到全貌、事情如何一起運作，以及"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 117.75,
          "end": 121.89,
          "en": "also how you solve real problems in these course project sections.",
          "zh": "你如何在這些課程專案章節裡解決真實問題。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 122.19,
          "end": 128.34,
          "en": "So after starting with the course project here, now that all the basics are there and the foundation",
          "zh": "所以在這裡開始課程專案之後，既然所有基礎都在了，根基"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 128.34,
          "end": 131.16,
          "en": "should be set, we'll dive deeper into components.",
          "zh": "也應該打好了，我們會更深入元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 131.16,
          "end": 136.11,
          "en": "Components, as you will learn throughout this course, are a core building block of svelte applications.",
          "zh": "元件，正如你會在這門課裡學到的，是 Svelte 應用程式的核心建構區塊。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 136.11,
          "end": 138.63,
          "en": "You work with components only.",
          "zh": "你只和元件一起工作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 138.63,
          "end": 142.07999999999998,
          "en": "You have a bunch of components that are able to interact with each other.",
          "zh": "你會有一堆能夠彼此互動的元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 142.07999999999998,
          "end": 146.88,
          "en": "And in this module, we'll dig deeper into components and see what we can do with them.",
          "zh": "在這個單元裡，我們會更深入元件，看看我們能用它們做什麼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 147.24,
          "end": 152.04,
          "en": "Thereafter, we'll again have a course project, but I'll not show it here on the slide to save some",
          "zh": "之後我們又會有一個課程專案，但為了節省"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 152.04,
          "end": 152.52,
          "en": "time.",
          "zh": "時間，我不會在這張投影片上展示它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 152.52,
          "end": 158.52,
          "en": "Essentially, from now on you'll have a course project section after every theory section, So the next",
          "zh": "本質上，從現在起，每個理論章節之後你都會有一個課程專案章節。所以下一個"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 158.52,
          "end": 162.78,
          "en": "theory section thereafter is on bindings and working with forms.",
          "zh": "理論章節是關於綁定，以及使用表單。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 162.81,
          "end": 165.42000000000002,
          "en": "The bindings is a term which is not clear right now.",
          "zh": "綁定這個詞現在還不清楚。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 165.42000000000002,
          "end": 166.74,
          "en": "It will be clear by then.",
          "zh": "到那時就會清楚。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 166.74,
          "end": 172.47,
          "en": "And working with forms means that you will learn how to get user input, how to validate it and so on.",
          "zh": "使用表單的意思是，你會學到如何取得使用者輸入、如何驗證它，諸如此類。"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 172.5,
          "end": 175.65,
          "en": "Thereafter, we'll again apply that in the course project.",
          "zh": "之後我們會再把那個套用到課程專案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 175.65,
          "end": 180.84,
          "en": "And the next theory section is on managing data with a concept called stores.",
          "zh": "下一個理論章節是用一個叫 stores 的概念來管理資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 180.87,
          "end": 184.5,
          "en": "You'll learn what stores are and how to use them and why they are awesome.",
          "zh": "你會學到 stores 是什麼、如何使用，以及為什麼它們很出色。"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 184.5,
          "end": 189.45,
          "en": "And thereafter, again, we'll apply it on the course project before we then dive into transitions and",
          "zh": "之後我們會再把它套用到課程專案，然後我們會進入轉場和"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 189.45,
          "end": 190.47,
          "en": "animations.",
          "zh": "動畫。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 191.01,
          "end": 197.22,
          "en": "It's important to provide a good user experience and transitions and animations help the users understand",
          "zh": "提供好的使用體驗很重要，轉場和動畫幫助使用者理解"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 197.22,
          "end": 200.16,
          "en": "what's changing on your page or what changed.",
          "zh": "你的頁面上什麼正在改變，或什麼已經改變了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 200.16,
          "end": 207.51,
          "en": "And the good thing is that Svelte has a rich suit of built in transition capabilities that make animating",
          "zh": "好消息是，Svelte 有一套豐富的內建轉場能力，讓動畫"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 207.51,
          "end": 209.82,
          "en": "things really easy and really simple.",
          "zh": "變得很容易、很單純。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 209.82,
          "end": 212.4,
          "en": "And in this module, we'll see how it works.",
          "zh": "在這個單元裡，我們會看它如何運作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 212.43,
          "end": 217.05,
          "en": "Again, it will be applied to the course project and then the next theory module, we'll have a look",
          "zh": "它會再被套用到課程專案，然後下一個理論單元，我們會看"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 217.05,
          "end": 223.35,
          "en": "at Http requests because up to this point we'll have worked only in our client side application and",
          "zh": "HTTP 請求，因為到這個時間點，我們都只在用戶端應用程式裡工作，而"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 223.35,
          "end": 227.88,
          "en": "all the data we worked on will be lost with every refresh of the browser.",
          "zh": "我們處理的所有資料，每次重新整理瀏覽器都會消失。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 227.91,
          "end": 233.85,
          "en": "Therefore, it is at this point that we will finally learn how to communicate with some API, with some",
          "zh": "因此，就是在這個時間點，我們終於會學到如何和某個 API、某個"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 233.85,
          "end": 238.59,
          "en": "back end and send requests to it to store data and fetch data from there.",
          "zh": "後端溝通，並向它送出請求，以儲存資料，以及從那裡取得資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 238.62,
          "end": 241.5,
          "en": "This will of course also be used in the course project.",
          "zh": "這當然也會用在課程專案裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 241.92,
          "end": 249.42,
          "en": "Well, and then we dive into some special elements, svelte offers, and thereafter into a very cool",
          "zh": "然後我們會深入 Svelte 提供的一些特殊元素，之後再進入一個非常酷的"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 249.42,
          "end": 253.03,
          "en": "additional framework, you could say, which is called sapper.",
          "zh": "附加框架，你可以說，它叫做 Sapper。"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 253.03,
          "end": 257.65,
          "en": "It will help us with routing and server side rendering and you will learn how it works and why you might",
          "zh": "它會幫助我們做路由和伺服器端渲染，你會在這個單元學到它如何運作，以及為什麼你可能"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 257.65,
          "end": 259.45,
          "en": "want to use it in this module.",
          "zh": "想使用它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 259.81,
          "end": 264.67,
          "en": "Well, and the best app is worthless if it only exists on your computer.",
          "zh": "再好的應用程式，如果只存在於你的電腦上，也沒有價值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 264.67,
          "end": 269.53,
          "en": "So we'll conclude this module by deploying the apps and you will learn that there are different ways",
          "zh": "所以我們會以部署這些應用程式來結束這個單元，你會學到有不同的方式"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 269.53,
          "end": 270.94,
          "en": "of deploying svelte apps.",
          "zh": "可以部署 Svelte 應用程式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 270.94,
          "end": 276.28,
          "en": "And I'll dive into all of them and show concrete examples of how it works in this course.",
          "zh": "我會深入每一種，並在這門課裡展示它如何運作的具體例子。"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 276.28,
          "end": 281.98,
          "en": "And by the end of the course you'll have learned a lot about Svelte and you should feel really confident",
          "zh": "到課程結束時，你會學到很多關於 Svelte 的事，而且你應該感到很有信心，"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 281.98,
          "end": 285.73,
          "en": "using it in your next projects and build amazing apps with it.",
          "zh": "能在你接下來的專案裡使用它，並用它建立出色的應用程式。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "14696228",
      "title": "How To Get The Most Out Of The Course",
      "lectureOrder": 8,
      "videoOrder": 7,
      "sourceHash": "70eff6260a467ad5c34116d41c4dd32bab37ba2c75be339e4642b51bf9591871",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2,
          "end": 6.62,
          "en": "Now that you know what's in the course, the question is how do you get the most out of it?",
          "zh": "現在你知道這門課裡有什麼了，問題是你要如何從中得到最多？"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 6.83,
          "end": 9.11,
          "en": "And obviously, you should watch the videos.",
          "zh": "顯然，你應該看這些影片。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 9.11,
          "end": 10.64,
          "en": "It's a video on demand course.",
          "zh": "這是一門隨選影片課程。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.64,
          "end": 13.31,
          "en": "So I guess this is kind of, well, obvious.",
          "zh": "所以我想這算是，嗯，很明顯。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.34,
          "end": 15.11,
          "en": "Watch them at your pace, though.",
          "zh": "不過，照你自己的步調看。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.11,
          "end": 17.63,
          "en": "Take advantage of these video controls.",
          "zh": "好好利用這些播放控制項。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.63,
          "end": 20.45,
          "en": "Slow me down if I'm going too fast, speed me up.",
          "zh": "如果我講太快，就把速度放慢；如果我太慢，就把速度加快。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.45,
          "end": 26.27,
          "en": "If I'm going too slow, really adjust it to your pace and don't feel bad if you have to pause or rewind",
          "zh": "如果我講得太慢，就真的調成你的步調，如果必須暫停或倒帶，也不必覺得不好，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.3,
          "end": 27.8,
          "en": "the video, that's normal.",
          "zh": "這很正常。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.8,
          "end": 29.54,
          "en": "It's a video on demand course.",
          "zh": "這是一門隨選影片課程。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.54,
          "end": 35.75,
          "en": "Watch a lecture as often as you need to, especially because I would recommend that you code along.",
          "zh": "一堂課需要看幾次就看幾次，尤其因為我建議你跟著一起寫程式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 35.75,
          "end": 41.36,
          "en": "Now I might be typing too fast because there also are students who are not coding along in this course.",
          "zh": "我打字可能太快，因為這門課裡也有學生沒有跟著寫。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 41.36,
          "end": 42.65,
          "en": "Should be for everyone.",
          "zh": "應該要適合每一個人。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 42.65,
          "end": 45.41,
          "en": "If you do code along, maybe I'm going too fast.",
          "zh": "如果你跟著寫，也許我講得太快。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 45.41,
          "end": 49.52,
          "en": "If slowing me down is not enough, you can pause the video until you catch up.",
          "zh": "如果放慢還不夠，你可以暫停影片，直到你跟上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 49.52,
          "end": 55.94,
          "en": "That is part of the course and no reason to feel bad about coding along is crucial and I would absolutely",
          "zh": "那是課程的一部分，沒有理由覺得不好意思；跟著寫非常關鍵，我絕對"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 55.94,
          "end": 61.97,
          "en": "recommend that you do it because if you code along then you really see if you understood the concepts",
          "zh": "建議你這樣做，因為跟著寫時，你才真的看得出自己是否理解了概念，"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 62.07,
          "end": 64.77,
          "en": "and you'll encounter errors yourself.",
          "zh": "而且你會自己遇到錯誤。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 64.8,
          "end": 71.19,
          "en": "I also provide assignments and from a certain point on also the course project and I would recommend",
          "zh": "我也提供作業，從某個時間點開始還有課程專案，我建議"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 71.19,
          "end": 76.02,
          "en": "that you do these assignments and that you practice them, that you watch my solutions thereafter and",
          "zh": "你做這些作業、練習它們，之後再看我的解答，"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 76.02,
          "end": 82.08,
          "en": "in the course project that you also pause the videos, try certain things I'm about to implement on",
          "zh": "在課程專案裡也暫停影片，先自己試著做我即將實作的某些東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 82.08,
          "end": 89.1,
          "en": "your own first and always compare your solution to mine to find out where maybe you went wrong or maybe",
          "zh": "並且總是把你的解法和我的對照，找出也許你哪裡錯了，或也許"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 89.1,
          "end": 90.53999999999999,
          "en": "you have a better solution.",
          "zh": "你有更好的解法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 91.21000000000001,
          "end": 95.71000000000001,
          "en": "I also recommend that you try to debug and fix errors on your own.",
          "zh": "我也建議你試著自己除錯、自己修正錯誤。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 95.8,
          "end": 100.50999999999999,
          "en": "Google is your friend, and this might sound dumb, but if you're getting an error message, put it",
          "zh": "Google 是你的朋友，這聽起來可能很蠢，但如果你看到錯誤訊息，把它"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 100.50999999999999,
          "end": 103.72,
          "en": "into Google and chances are you'll find a solution for the error.",
          "zh": "貼進 Google，你很有可能會找到那個錯誤的解法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 103.72,
          "end": 106.02000000000001,
          "en": "And of course, don't just Google them first.",
          "zh": "當然，不要一開始就只靠搜尋。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 106.03,
          "end": 111.58,
          "en": "Actually, you should read them first because a lot of error messages are pretty clear and you can use",
          "zh": "其實你應該先讀它們，因為很多錯誤訊息相當清楚，你也可以使用"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 111.58,
          "end": 116.86,
          "en": "the normal chrome debugging tools and all the tools you're used to from web development to narrow down",
          "zh": "一般的 Chrome 除錯工具，以及你在網頁開發裡習慣的所有工具，來縮小"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 116.86,
          "end": 117.4,
          "en": "issues.",
          "zh": "問題範圍。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 117.4,
          "end": 122.77,
          "en": "And especially reading the error messages is, as I just said, really important and helps with a lot",
          "zh": "尤其是閱讀錯誤訊息，正如我剛才說的，真的很重要，能幫上很多"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 122.77,
          "end": 123.7,
          "en": "of problems.",
          "zh": "問題。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 124.61,
          "end": 130.16,
          "en": "Of course also dive into the official docs because whilst I will walk you through all of svelte that",
          "zh": "當然也要深入官方文件，因為雖然我會帶你走過你需要知道的全部 Svelte，"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 130.16,
          "end": 136.31,
          "en": "you need to know and provide a lot of knowledge on it, there are always niche cases that might not",
          "zh": "並提供很多相關知識，總是會有這裡可能沒"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 136.31,
          "end": 141.86,
          "en": "be covered here, or there's a certain concept which I do cover, but which you forgot at some point",
          "zh": "涵蓋的冷門情況，或某個我有講、但你某個時候忘了的概念，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 141.86,
          "end": 147.59,
          "en": "or which you just want to read about again so that you don't just have the video, the spoken form,",
          "zh": "或你只是想再讀一次，這樣你就不只有影片、口說的形式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 147.59,
          "end": 151.55,
          "en": "but also a readable form of a certain explanation.",
          "zh": "也有某個說明的可讀形式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 151.79,
          "end": 157.4,
          "en": "And last but not least, this course, like all Udemy courses, comes with a Q&A section and you can",
          "zh": "最後，這門課和所有 Udemy 課程一樣，都有問答區，你可以"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 157.4,
          "end": 165.2,
          "en": "ask there now please try to solve issues on your own first because asking there of course means that",
          "zh": "在那裡提問。請先試著自己解決問題，因為在那裡提問當然表示"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 165.2,
          "end": 167.36,
          "en": "you are stuck until someone answers.",
          "zh": "你會卡住，直到有人回答。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 167.39,
          "end": 173.03,
          "en": "Now I will actually answer there regularly, but only two questions directly related to the course or",
          "zh": "我會定期在那裡回答，但只回答和課程直接相關的問題，或"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 173.03,
          "end": 174.31,
          "en": "to course problems.",
          "zh": "課程裡的問題。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 174.32,
          "end": 178.22,
          "en": "And again, if you solve problems on your own, you don't have to wait for my answer.",
          "zh": "再說一次，如果你自己解決問題，就不必等我的回答。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 178.22,
          "end": 179.9,
          "en": "In addition, don't just ask.",
          "zh": "此外，不要只提問。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 179.9,
          "end": 186,
          "en": "There also help others because just like coding along, if you help others, you will have to think",
          "zh": "也幫助其他人，因為就像跟著寫程式，如果你幫助別人，你必須思考"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 186,
          "end": 186.81,
          "en": "about problems.",
          "zh": "問題。"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 186.81,
          "end": 189.69,
          "en": "You encounter problems and you have to solve them.",
          "zh": "你會遇到問題，而且你必須解決它們。"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 189.69,
          "end": 194.76,
          "en": "And ultimately it's solving problems, which makes you a better developer.",
          "zh": "最終，是解決問題讓你成為更好的開發者。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 194.76,
          "end": 200.88,
          "en": "So that would be my strong recommendation so that you absolutely get the most out of the course.",
          "zh": "所以這是我強烈的建議，好讓你絕對從這門課得到最多。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 200.91,
          "end": 204.99,
          "en": "With that, let's dive into Svelte and all its core features.",
          "zh": "那麼，讓我們深入 Svelte 和它所有的核心功能。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "14689478",
      "title": "Module Introduction",
      "lectureOrder": 10,
      "videoOrder": 8,
      "sourceHash": "a4c9117d69cea02b065c339ba8437cb516e42846f41df869756ab1279d953301",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.07,
          "end": 7.74,
          "en": "Now that we just got started with Svelte and that you have an idea of what it is and what's inside of",
          "zh": "現在我們才剛開始接觸 Svelte，你也對它是什麼、以及這門課裡面有什麼有了概念。"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 7.74,
          "end": 8.7,
          "en": "this course.",
          "zh": "這門課。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.73,
          "end": 17.49,
          "en": "Let's dive into the core base syntax of Svelte JS and the core features you need to know for any svelte",
          "zh": "讓我們深入 Svelte.js 的核心基礎語法，以及你寫任何 Svelte"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 17.52,
          "end": 20.31,
          "en": "application or code you're going to write.",
          "zh": "應用程式或程式碼都必須知道的核心功能。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 20.79,
          "end": 24.36,
          "en": "Now what is the base syntax all about?",
          "zh": "那麼，基礎語法到底在講什麼？"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 24.51,
          "end": 26.77,
          "en": "Let's think about it the other way.",
          "zh": "讓我們反過來看。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 26.79,
          "end": 31.62,
          "en": "What do we need in modern or in any web application?",
          "zh": "在現代、或任何網頁應用程式裡，我們需要什麼？"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 31.65,
          "end": 34.65,
          "en": "Well, in the end, it's all about data.",
          "zh": "最終，一切都和資料有關。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 35.16,
          "end": 37.43,
          "en": "Data that we want to output.",
          "zh": "我們想輸出的資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 37.44,
          "end": 42.81,
          "en": "For example, we want to output some text like the name of the user or the age of the user.",
          "zh": "例如，我們想輸出一些文字，像使用者的名字或使用者的年齡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 42.84,
          "end": 46.89,
          "en": "We also might want to change some CSS code dynamically.",
          "zh": "我們也可能想動態改變一些 CSS 程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 46.89,
          "end": 51.41,
          "en": "And with that, I don't mean that we hover over a button and it then changes.",
          "zh": "我說的不是滑鼠移到按鈕上、它就改變。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 51.42,
          "end": 53.82,
          "en": "We can do that with CSS only.",
          "zh": "那只用 CSS 就能做到。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 54,
          "end": 61.5,
          "en": "I mean that for example, we deactivate a user in our admin dashboard because we're administrating a",
          "zh": "我的意思是，例如我們在管理後台停用一個使用者，因為我們在管理一個"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 61.5,
          "end": 64.9,
          "en": "social network and we're deactivating a user.",
          "zh": "社群網路，而我們正在停用某個使用者。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 64.93,
          "end": 73.39,
          "en": "Then after we click that button and we confirmed the deactivation, maybe the text for this user, the",
          "zh": "然後在我們點了那個按鈕、並確認停用之後，也許這個使用者的文字、"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 73.39,
          "end": 76.21000000000001,
          "en": "name turns red or gets grayed out.",
          "zh": "名字變成紅色，或變成灰色。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 76.24,
          "end": 84.76,
          "en": "Of course we use CSS to get that style, but to apply that style only after we deactivated the user.",
          "zh": "我們當然用 CSS 得到那個樣式，但要只在停用使用者之後才套用那個樣式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 84.76,
          "end": 91.53999999999999,
          "en": "We can't do this with CSS only because the deactivation process is related to some logic running in",
          "zh": "這不能只用 CSS 做到，因為停用的過程和某些正在執行的邏輯有關，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 91.53999999999999,
          "end": 92.88,
          "en": "our JavaScript code.",
          "zh": "也就是我們的 JavaScript 程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 92.89,
          "end": 98.58,
          "en": "So we need JavaScript to change that CSS code and that would be another example.",
          "zh": "所以我們需要 JavaScript 來改變那段 CSS，那會是另一個例子。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 98.59,
          "end": 105.7,
          "en": "Or we want to set an HTML attribute or property dynamically, let's say the source of an image which",
          "zh": "或者我們想動態設定一個 HTML 屬性或特性，比方說"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 105.7,
          "end": 106.84,
          "en": "we want to display.",
          "zh": "我們想顯示的圖片來源。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 106.87,
          "end": 114.07,
          "en": "This would be some examples of us outputting data and these are all also examples of data that might",
          "zh": "這些都是我們輸出資料的例子，也都是可能"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 114.07,
          "end": 118.3,
          "en": "change in our application or that might be entered by a user.",
          "zh": "在應用程式裡改變、或可能由使用者輸入的資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 118.69,
          "end": 121.96,
          "en": "And that's the other part besides output.",
          "zh": "那是輸出之外的另一部分。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 121.96,
          "end": 128.56,
          "en": "And there are other examples too, of course we have input or we have changes to that data and often",
          "zh": "當然還有其他例子。我們有輸入，或我們對那些資料做了變更，而常常"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 128.56,
          "end": 134.89,
          "en": "that will be triggered by the user, for example, a user entering some text into an input.",
          "zh": "那是由使用者觸發的，例如使用者在輸入框裡打了一些文字。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 134.92,
          "end": 142.54,
          "en": "Maybe we have a signup form and a user may enter his data there and we want to validate whether that",
          "zh": "也許我們有一個註冊表單，使用者可以在那裡輸入他的資料，我們想驗證那"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 142.54,
          "end": 146.2,
          "en": "really is a valid email address which the user is entering.",
          "zh": "是否真的是使用者正在輸入的有效電子郵件地址。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 146.2,
          "end": 153.4,
          "en": "Then with JavaScript we can check this on every keystroke and already give the user some error message",
          "zh": "然後用 JavaScript，我們可以在每一次按鍵時檢查，並在錯誤時就給使用者一些錯誤訊息，"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 153.4,
          "end": 160.51,
          "en": "if it's wrong in the browser without ever hitting our server or the user is simply clicking a button",
          "zh": "就在瀏覽器裡，完全不必打到我們的伺服器。或者使用者只是點了一個按鈕，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 160.51,
          "end": 162.88,
          "en": "as we did it in the first course module.",
          "zh": "就像我們在第一個課程單元裡做的那樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 163.39,
          "end": 169.96,
          "en": "We also might be loading some data from a server and that is only indirectly triggered by a user because",
          "zh": "我們也可能從伺服器載入一些資料，那只是間接"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 169.96,
          "end": 175.81,
          "en": "maybe the user clicked a button, but then a request is sent off to the backend.",
          "zh": "由使用者觸發，因為也許使用者點了一個按鈕，但接著一個請求被送到後端。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 175.84,
          "end": 181.45,
          "en": "You remember that slide from the first section with backend and frontend API and single page application.",
          "zh": "你記得第一個章節那張投影片，有後端、前端、API 和單頁應用程式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 181.45,
          "end": 183.4,
          "en": "That is what I'm talking about here.",
          "zh": "我這裡說的就是那個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 183.4,
          "end": 186.25,
          "en": "So maybe some data is loaded from an API.",
          "zh": "所以也許某些資料是從 API 載入的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 186.28,
          "end": 192.55,
          "en": "Probably because the user did something, but then once the request is on its way, when the response",
          "zh": "大概是因為使用者做了某件事，但接著一旦請求在途中，當回應"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 192.55,
          "end": 196.84,
          "en": "returns, that then also might trigger a change in our data.",
          "zh": "回來時，那也可能觸發我們資料的改變。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 196.84,
          "end": 203.53,
          "en": "And then this immediate change is not directly triggered by the user but by the response coming back.",
          "zh": "然後這個立即的改變不是直接由使用者觸發，而是由回來的回應觸發。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 203.53,
          "end": 207.85,
          "en": "And of course there is an infinite amount of possible events.",
          "zh": "當然，可能的事件有無限多種。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 207.85,
          "end": 216.04,
          "en": "So in the end, our user interface, our application is all about events, user input, changes to our",
          "zh": "所以最終，我們的使用者介面、我們的應用程式，全都和事件、使用者輸入、"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 216.04,
          "end": 219.64,
          "en": "data, and then us outputting that data.",
          "zh": "我們資料的變更有關，然後是我們輸出那些資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 219.64,
          "end": 226.66,
          "en": "So we need tools that help us with these two ends with reacting to different kinds of events and to",
          "zh": "所以我們需要工具，幫助我們處理這兩端：對不同種類的事件做出反應，以及"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 226.66,
          "end": 227.77,
          "en": "outputting data.",
          "zh": "輸出資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 227.77,
          "end": 233.29,
          "en": "And output does not just mean text, but also things like changing a CSS class and so on.",
          "zh": "而輸出不只是文字，也包括改變 CSS class 之類的事情。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "14689480",
      "title": "Using Curly Braces & Understanding the Core Syntax",
      "lectureOrder": 11,
      "videoOrder": 9,
      "sourceHash": "e0f3c2e4c5187125ada122201e680bc7fda657c4b8a699c41e5a2bbc66cd3f56",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.02,
          "end": 5.07,
          "en": "Back in our project, I made one tiny change.",
          "zh": "回到我們的專案，我做了一個很小的改動。"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.08,
          "end": 10.51,
          "en": "Attached to this lecture you find a new global CSS file which you should download and simply replace",
          "zh": "這堂課附有一個新的 global.css，你應該下載，並直接替換"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 10.51,
          "end": 14.17,
          "en": "the content in your existing global CSS file with this content.",
          "zh": "你現有 global.css 裡的內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 14.2,
          "end": 20.95,
          "en": "You can leave the rest as it is, and once you did this, restart this server with NPM run dev.",
          "zh": "其餘可以維持原樣，做完之後，用 npm run dev 重新啟動這個伺服器。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 21.04,
          "end": 24.43,
          "en": "Then on localhost 5000 you should see something like this.",
          "zh": "然後在 localhost:5000，你應該會看到類似這樣的畫面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 24.43,
          "end": 32.56,
          "en": "So some new styles and if you don't see that, open your developer tools in the browser and then right",
          "zh": "也就是一些新樣式。如果你沒看到，打開瀏覽器的開發者工具，然後在"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 32.56,
          "end": 38.35,
          "en": "click on that refresh icon here in Chrome and click empty cache and hard reload or do it in whichever",
          "zh": "Chrome 裡對這個重新整理圖示按右鍵，點「清空快取並強制重新載入」，或在你使用的"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 38.35,
          "end": 43.18,
          "en": "browser you are using to make sure you're fetching the latest version of our code.",
          "zh": "任何瀏覽器裡做同樣的事，以確保你取得的是我們程式碼的最新版本。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 43.63,
          "end": 47.38,
          "en": "So with this you should see this output here.",
          "zh": "這樣你應該會看到這裡的輸出。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 47.38,
          "end": 54.34,
          "en": "And of course that is only well content you saw before just styled a bit differently.",
          "zh": "當然，那只是你之前看過的內容，只是樣式稍微不同。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 54.34,
          "end": 59.97,
          "en": "But now let me dig into that syntax we were using and let me explain what's happening there and which",
          "zh": "但現在讓我深入我們使用的那個語法，說明那裡發生什麼，以及"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 60.01,
          "end": 62.12,
          "en": "other features Svelte has.",
          "zh": "Svelte 還有哪些其他功能。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 62.91,
          "end": 70.38,
          "en": "I already mentioned that these curly brace things here in the svelte files in the markup set up, you",
          "zh": "我已經提過，Svelte 檔案標記裡的這些大括號，建立了，可以說，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 70.38,
          "end": 78,
          "en": "could say live connections between this place in your HTML code, in your Dom and the respective variables",
          "zh": "你 HTML 程式碼裡這個位置、也就是你的 DOM，和對應變數之間的即時連結，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 78,
          "end": 79.5,
          "en": "you have in your script tag.",
          "zh": "那些變數在你的 script 標籤裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 79.5,
          "end": 85.17,
          "en": "So name here between the curly braces in the markup refers to the name variable and the same is true",
          "zh": "所以標記裡大括號中的 name，指的是 name 變數，age 也是一樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 85.17,
          "end": 87.26,
          "en": "for age and increment age.",
          "zh": "以及 incrementAge。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 87.27,
          "end": 88.71000000000001,
          "en": "The function here.",
          "zh": "就是這個函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 88.98,
          "end": 95.03999999999999,
          "en": "And that indeed is probably the core mechanism of svelte.",
          "zh": "而這的確大概就是 Svelte 的核心機制。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 95.07,
          "end": 101.13,
          "en": "It has many other features built in that help you with building modern web applications and with managing",
          "zh": "它內建了許多其他功能，幫助你建立現代網頁應用程式，並有效率地管理"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 101.13,
          "end": 102.81,
          "en": "your data efficiently and so on.",
          "zh": "你的資料，諸如此類。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 102.81,
          "end": 110.82,
          "en": "But when it comes to outputting content, that really is the core curly braces, single curly braces",
          "zh": "但說到輸出內容，核心真的就是大括號。單層大括號"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 110.85,
          "end": 120.75,
          "en": "in your markup are recognized by the svelte compiler and they tell Svelte that it should look for something",
          "zh": "在你的標記裡會被 Svelte 編譯器辨識，它們告訴 Svelte，它應該尋找某個東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 120.75,
          "end": 126.22,
          "en": "named like the content between the curly braces is in your script tags.",
          "zh": "名稱就像大括號之間的內容，而那個東西在你的 script 標籤裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 126.22,
          "end": 130.45,
          "en": "So here it looks for something named name and it finds this variable.",
          "zh": "所以這裡它尋找名叫 name 的東西，並找到這個變數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 130.45,
          "end": 136.45,
          "en": "Here it looks for something named age and it finds this variable and it finds something named increment",
          "zh": "這裡它尋找名叫 age 的東西，找到這個變數，也找到名叫 incrementAge"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 136.45,
          "end": 136.93,
          "en": "age.",
          "zh": "的東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 136.93,
          "end": 141.7,
          "en": "This function and then svelte establishes a connection.",
          "zh": "這個函式，然後 Svelte 建立連結。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 141.7,
          "end": 148.51,
          "en": "And if you just have curly braces like this, which you have here in some text, and I will later also",
          "zh": "如果你只有像這樣的大括號，也就是你在某些文字裡看到的，我稍後也會"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 148.51,
          "end": 151.81,
          "en": "show you how to assign values to attributes and properties.",
          "zh": "示範如何把值指定給屬性和特性。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 151.84,
          "end": 159.1,
          "en": "If you have it here, then Svelte will automatically look for a value it can output here.",
          "zh": "如果它在這裡，Svelte 會自動尋找一個可以輸出到這裡的值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 159.1,
          "end": 167.02,
          "en": "So when you're using it like this name and age, you should always refer to a variable or something",
          "zh": "所以當你像這樣使用 name 和 age 時，你應該總是指向一個變數，或某個"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 167.02,
          "end": 170.38,
          "en": "related that can be output as text here.",
          "zh": "相關的東西，可以在這裡當成文字輸出。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 170.53,
          "end": 174.43,
          "en": "Now it automatically, as you see here, at the example of age.",
          "zh": "它會自動處理，如你在這裡看到的，以 age 為例。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 175.05,
          "end": 179.76,
          "en": "Transforms this number to text so you can directly output numbers here.",
          "zh": "把這個數字轉成文字，所以你可以直接在這裡輸出數字。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 179.76,
          "end": 181.86,
          "en": "You don't need to transform this manually.",
          "zh": "你不需要手動轉換。"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 182.55,
          "end": 187.71,
          "en": "When you're pointing at a function, it doesn't automatically execute that function for you.",
          "zh": "當你指向一個函式時，它不會自動替你執行那個函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 187.71,
          "end": 195.36,
          "en": "That only works here when you click the button because we decorated this with this on colon Click annotation.",
          "zh": "那只在你點按鈕時這裡才會運作，因為我們用這個 on:click 註記裝飾了它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 195.36,
          "end": 198.63,
          "en": "This is not a built in HTML attribute.",
          "zh": "這不是內建的 HTML 屬性。"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 198.63,
          "end": 204.09,
          "en": "Of course, this is instead some syntax which would normally be ignored by the browser because it's",
          "zh": "當然，這反而是某種語法，瀏覽器通常會忽略它，因為"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 204.09,
          "end": 206.52,
          "en": "not understood by the browser out of the box.",
          "zh": "瀏覽器開箱並不理解它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 206.52,
          "end": 213.54,
          "en": "Instead, this is syntax understood by svelte and it tells svelte to add an event listener to the button",
          "zh": "這是 Svelte 能理解的語法，它告訴 Svelte 給按鈕加上事件監聽器，"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 213.54,
          "end": 219.03,
          "en": "which should eventually trigger increment age when well this executes.",
          "zh": "最終應該在這段執行時觸發 incrementAge。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 219.63,
          "end": 226.23,
          "en": "It is worth pointing out that on click and on whatever event you're listening to, of course you're",
          "zh": "值得指出的是，on:click，以及 on: 加上你正在聆聽的任何事件，當然你"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 226.23,
          "end": 227.64,
          "en": "not limited to click.",
          "zh": "不限於 click。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 227.67000000000002,
          "end": 229.95,
          "en": "You can listen to any event.",
          "zh": "你可以聆聽任何事件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 230.04,
          "end": 233.88,
          "en": "An HTML element supports whatever you're listening to.",
          "zh": "一個 HTML 元素支援的，就是你正在聆聽的那些。"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 233.88,
          "end": 239.17000000000002,
          "en": "You always have to pass a pointer and a function here between the curly braces.",
          "zh": "你始終必須在大括號之間傳入一個指標，也就是一個函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 239.29,
          "end": 245.32,
          "en": "When outputting text like here, you always have to reference something or point at something that holds",
          "zh": "輸出文字時，像這裡，你始終必須參考某個東西，或指向某個持有"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 245.32,
          "end": 247.03,
          "en": "a value that can be output.",
          "zh": "可以輸出的值的東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 247.36,
          "end": 254.26,
          "en": "Now you can add any JavaScript expression between these curly braces, any single line expression.",
          "zh": "你可以在這些大括號之間加入任何 JavaScript 運算式，任何單行運算式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 254.41,
          "end": 258.61,
          "en": "So you can also, for example, output H plus one here that would also be valid.",
          "zh": "所以你也可以，例如，在這裡輸出 age 加一，那也是有效的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 258.64,
          "end": 262,
          "en": "You're not restricted to a single variable.",
          "zh": "你不限於單一變數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 262,
          "end": 269.53,
          "en": "You can have any simple JavaScript expression here, no complex for loop or if statement, but a one",
          "zh": "這裡可以是任何簡單的 JavaScript 運算式，不能是複雜的 for 迴圈或 if 陳述式，但像這樣的"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 269.53,
          "end": 271.57,
          "en": "line expression like this will work.",
          "zh": "單行運算式可以運作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 271.57,
          "end": 278.62,
          "en": "And now you see H is 31 here, even though I haven't clicked the button and H is 30 at the start because",
          "zh": "現在你看到這裡是 31，即使我還沒點按鈕，而一開始是 30，因為"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 278.62,
          "end": 280.65999999999997,
          "en": "I'm adding one here now.",
          "zh": "我現在在這裡加了一。"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 280.65999999999997,
          "end": 281.86,
          "en": "This can be very convenient.",
          "zh": "這可以非常方便。"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 281.86,
          "end": 285.79,
          "en": "You can also do things like name to uppercase.",
          "zh": "你也可以做 name.toUpperCase() 這樣的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 285.79,
          "end": 288.61,
          "en": "Make sure you get the casing of that command right.",
          "zh": "要確認那個指令的大小寫寫對。"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 289.18,
          "end": 296.08,
          "en": "To transform Max to uppercase Max because to uppercase is normal JavaScript syntax.",
          "zh": "把 Max 轉成大寫，因為 toUpperCase 是一般的 JavaScript 語法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 296.08,
          "end": 302.74,
          "en": "You can call this method on a string and name is just a string to transform it to uppercase.",
          "zh": "你可以在字串上呼叫這個方法，而 name 只是一個字串，用來把它轉成大寫。"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 302.74,
          "end": 304.21,
          "en": "So that all works.",
          "zh": "所以這些都能運作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 304.21,
          "end": 313.06,
          "en": "But most of the time you should keep your markup code here relatively lean and not do complex calculations",
          "zh": "但大多數時候，你應該讓這裡的標記程式碼保持相對精簡，不要做複雜計算"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 313.06,
          "end": 317.47,
          "en": "in there, but instead try to really only output single values.",
          "zh": "在裡面，而是試著真的只輸出單一值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 317.47,
          "end": 322.51,
          "en": "And if you have values that have to be derived based on other values.",
          "zh": "如果你有必須根據其他值推導出來的值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 322.51,
          "end": 327.91,
          "en": "So if you want to transform this to uppercase, then you should instead do it up here in the script",
          "zh": "所以如果你想把它轉成大寫，你應該改成在上面的 script"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 327.94,
          "end": 334.54,
          "en": "tags and there is a convenient syntax svelte gives you which helps you with that.",
          "zh": "標籤裡做，而 Svelte 給你一種方便的語法，可以幫助你做到這件事。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "14689482",
      "title": "Reactive Variables",
      "lectureOrder": 12,
      "videoOrder": 10,
      "sourceHash": "da804128586998348797383b09744db039d7ae6ad69e5e6da68b468c18f68a49",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.24,
          "end": 9.68,
          "en": "There is a special JavaScript syntax which you maybe never saw before because you really don't use it",
          "zh": "有一種特殊的 JavaScript 語法，你也許從沒看過，因為你在 JavaScript 裡真的不常"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 9.68,
          "end": 11.42,
          "en": "that often in JavaScript.",
          "zh": "使用它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 11.45,
          "end": 14.09,
          "en": "That is dollar sign.",
          "zh": "那就是錢字號。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 14.27,
          "end": 19.58,
          "en": "Colon, to be precise, doesn't have to be a dollar sign can be any word.",
          "zh": "精確地說是冒號。不必是錢字號，可以是任何字。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 19.61,
          "end": 21.89,
          "en": "That's a labeled statement.",
          "zh": "那叫做標籤陳述式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 21.92,
          "end": 29.06,
          "en": "Label statements can be used in vanilla JavaScript in conjunction with loops and the break and continue",
          "zh": "標籤陳述式可以在原生 JavaScript 裡和迴圈，以及 break 和 continue"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 29.09,
          "end": 30.35,
          "en": "keyword and attached.",
          "zh": "關鍵字一起使用。附帶的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 30.35,
          "end": 34.43,
          "en": "You find an article on them, but you don't really need to learn about them.",
          "zh": "你會找到一篇關於它們的文章，但你其實不需要學它們。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 34.43,
          "end": 37.22,
          "en": "You don't really use them in normal JavaScript.",
          "zh": "你在一般的 JavaScript 裡真的不會用到它們。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 37.4,
          "end": 43.19,
          "en": "Svelte takes advantage of this because you rarely use them and you won't miss them if you can't use",
          "zh": "Svelte 利用了這一點，因為你很少使用它們，如果你不能用"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 43.19,
          "end": 43.67,
          "en": "them.",
          "zh": "它們，你也不會想念。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 43.67,
          "end": 48.86,
          "en": "Svelte grabs this dollar sign labeled statement.",
          "zh": "Svelte 抓住這個錢字號標籤陳述式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 48.86,
          "end": 50.87,
          "en": "So here the label simply is dollar sign.",
          "zh": "所以這裡的標籤就只是錢字號。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 50.87,
          "end": 57.41,
          "en": "And now after this colon, you normally would have a loop where you can then use the label to control",
          "zh": "而在這個冒號之後，你通常會有一個迴圈，然後可以用這個標籤，以 break 和 continue 控制"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 57.41,
          "end": 59.15,
          "en": "the flow with break and continue.",
          "zh": "流程。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 59.18,
          "end": 63.9,
          "en": "Now, Svelte simply hijacks this and assigns a different meaning to it.",
          "zh": "現在，Svelte 只是借用了這個，並賦予它不同的意義。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 63.93,
          "end": 67.47,
          "en": "When you have dollar sign colon and now it has to be a dollar sign.",
          "zh": "當你寫下錢字號加冒號，這時它必須是錢字號。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 67.47,
          "end": 69.06,
          "en": "It can't be any other word.",
          "zh": "不能是任何其他字。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 69.09,
          "end": 77.3,
          "en": "Then you can thereafter add a dynamic calculation based on some other value.",
          "zh": "然後你可以在後面加上一個根據某個其他值做的動態計算。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 77.31,
          "end": 84.69,
          "en": "So let's say we want to have our uppercase name and that's basically a new variable, you could say.",
          "zh": "比方說我們想要大寫的名字，那基本上可以說是一個新變數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 85.12,
          "end": 90.76,
          "en": "We can assign a value to that name to uppercase, using that built in JavaScript method.",
          "zh": "我們可以把值指定給 uppercaseName，使用那個內建的 JavaScript 方法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 90.78999999999999,
          "end": 92.89,
          "en": "You don't need to declare that variable.",
          "zh": "你不需要宣告那個變數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 92.89,
          "end": 99.34,
          "en": "Svelte will do this for you, so you don't need to do let uppercase name first though you could, but",
          "zh": "Svelte 會幫你做，所以你不必先寫 let uppercaseName，雖然你可以，但"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 99.34,
          "end": 101.02000000000001,
          "en": "you don't have to.",
          "zh": "你不必。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 102.71000000000001,
          "end": 103.64,
          "en": "Instead svelte.",
          "zh": "而是 Svelte。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 103.64,
          "end": 104.57,
          "en": "We'll create this for you.",
          "zh": "會幫你建立它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 104.57,
          "end": 110.81,
          "en": "And most importantly, it will recalculate this whenever name changes.",
          "zh": "最重要的是，每當 name 改變，它會重新計算這個值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 111.02000000000001,
          "end": 116.3,
          "en": "So for a start, let's output uppercase name down there and let's save everything.",
          "zh": "所以先從這裡開始，我們在下面輸出 uppercaseName，然後把一切存檔。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 116.3,
          "end": 121.76,
          "en": "And now you should again see Max or whatever name you chose with all uppercase characters.",
          "zh": "現在你應該再次看到 Max，或你選的任何名字，全部都是大寫。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 122.45,
          "end": 128.06,
          "en": "Now let me show that this is really dynamic by adding another button here.",
          "zh": "現在讓我證明這真的是動態的，在這裡再加一個按鈕。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 131.87,
          "end": 132.2,
          "en": "Where?",
          "zh": "在哪裡？"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 132.26,
          "end": 132.8,
          "en": "Say?",
          "zh": "寫上？"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 133.63,
          "end": 135.16,
          "en": "Change name.",
          "zh": "Change name。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 135.94,
          "end": 137.98,
          "en": "And adding a new function.",
          "zh": "並加上一個新函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 139.12,
          "end": 140.35,
          "en": "Change name.",
          "zh": "changeName。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 141.39,
          "end": 148.32,
          "en": "Where I simply set name, not uppercase name, but name equal to Maximillian.",
          "zh": "我只是設定 name，不是 uppercaseName，而是 name 等於 Maximilian。"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 148.32,
          "end": 150.15,
          "en": "So for now this is all hardcoded.",
          "zh": "所以目前這全部都是寫死的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 150.15,
          "end": 156.42000000000002,
          "en": "We'll soon give the user a way of entering this manually, so change name should execute.",
          "zh": "我們很快會讓使用者能手動輸入，所以 changeName 應該被執行。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 156.42000000000002,
          "end": 157.59,
          "en": "When we click this button.",
          "zh": "當我們點這個按鈕時。"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 157.59,
          "end": 159.32999999999998,
          "en": "We can do this with onClick.",
          "zh": "我們可以用 on:click 做到。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 159.36,
          "end": 163.41,
          "en": "As you learned, quotes are optional, Curly braces are not.",
          "zh": "如你所學，引號可有可無，大括號則不行。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 163.41,
          "end": 165.45,
          "en": "And then we execute change name.",
          "zh": "然後我們執行 changeName。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 166.62,
          "end": 171.72,
          "en": "Now watch what happens to Max, which is uppercase here if I click change name.",
          "zh": "現在看這裡的 Max，它目前是大寫，如果我點 Change name，會發生什麼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 172.55,
          "end": 175.31,
          "en": "It's converted to Maximilian.",
          "zh": "它會變成 Maximilian。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 176,
          "end": 179.87,
          "en": "Now, that is interesting because here.",
          "zh": "這很有趣，因為在這裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 180.59,
          "end": 185.95,
          "en": "We're outputting uppercase name and I'm not changing uppercase name, I'm changing name.",
          "zh": "我們輸出的是 uppercaseName，而我沒有改 uppercaseName，我改的是 name。"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 185.96,
          "end": 193.64,
          "en": "But dollar sign Colon is an instructor picked up by the Svelte compiler, which adds a couple of code",
          "zh": "但 $: 是一個被 Svelte 編譯器拾起的指令，它會在最終輸出裡加上幾行"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 193.64,
          "end": 195.41,
          "en": "lines in the final output.",
          "zh": "程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 195.41,
          "end": 200.81,
          "en": "So in that bundle.js file in the end, which basically makes sure that whenever we change name.",
          "zh": "所以最終在那個 bundle.js 檔案裡，基本上確保每當我們改變 name。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 201.59,
          "end": 203.8,
          "en": "It changes or it runs this code again.",
          "zh": "它就改變，或再次執行這段程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 203.81,
          "end": 204.35,
          "en": "Why?",
          "zh": "為什麼？"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 204.38,
          "end": 209.69,
          "en": "Because we use name on the right side of that labeled expression.",
          "zh": "因為我們在那個標籤運算式的右邊使用了 name。"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 209.69,
          "end": 215.45,
          "en": "And therefore, whenever name changes, it reruns this expression and it stores the new value in uppercase",
          "zh": "因此，每當 name 改變，它就重新執行這個運算式，並把新的值存進 uppercaseName，"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 215.45,
          "end": 218.66,
          "en": "name, which we then in turn do output down there.",
          "zh": "而我們接著在下面輸出它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 218.66,
          "end": 219.92000000000002,
          "en": "So that's really convenient.",
          "zh": "所以這真的很方便。"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 219.92000000000002,
          "end": 227.63,
          "en": "And this is a great example to understand where the lines between JavaScript and the svelte compiler",
          "zh": "這是一個很好的例子，用來理解 JavaScript 和 Svelte 編譯器之間的界線"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 227.63,
          "end": 228.38,
          "en": "blur.",
          "zh": "在哪裡變模糊。"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 228.41,
          "end": 236.09,
          "en": "This is a normal JavaScript feature, but svelte hijacks it to use it as an instruction to generate",
          "zh": "這是一般的 JavaScript 功能，但 Svelte 借用它，當成指令來產生"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 236.09,
          "end": 237.89,
          "en": "some totally different code.",
          "zh": "一些完全不同的程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 237.89,
          "end": 241.43,
          "en": "So this is not a feature that would normally work in JavaScript.",
          "zh": "所以這不是在 JavaScript 裡通常會運作的功能。"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 241.43,
          "end": 247.85,
          "en": "It's really just working because svelte takes advantage of it and makes sure that different code is",
          "zh": "它能運作，真的只是因為 Svelte 利用了它，並確保產生的是不同的程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 247.85,
          "end": 253.04,
          "en": "generated and the code that is generated makes sure that we recreate uppercase.",
          "zh": "而產生出來的程式碼確保我們重建大寫版本。"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 253.04,
          "end": 258.26,
          "en": "Whenever name changes, we can see that in the bundle we search for uppercase there.",
          "zh": "每當 name 改變。我們可以在 bundle 裡看到，我們在那裡搜尋 uppercase。"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 262.18,
          "end": 265.27,
          "en": "You see, first of all here, it creates the variable for us.",
          "zh": "你會看到，首先它在這裡幫我們建立變數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 266.43,
          "end": 272.88,
          "en": "And then here this code might not be totally clear, but what we can see is that when name is dirty,",
          "zh": "然後這裡的程式碼也許不完全清楚，但我們能看到的是，當 name 是 dirty，"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 272.88,
          "end": 278.28,
          "en": "which basically means when it changed and svelte keeps track of whether that changed or not internally.",
          "zh": "基本上就是當它改變了，而 Svelte 在內部追蹤它有沒有改變。"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 278.28,
          "end": 286.59000000000003,
          "en": "So when name changed, it invalidates uppercase name, which basically is a command used by svelte to",
          "zh": "所以當 name 改變，它會讓 uppercaseName 失效，那基本上是 Svelte 用來"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 286.59000000000003,
          "end": 293.46,
          "en": "rerender this part of the Dom which uses uppercase name and it recalculates uppercase name and uses",
          "zh": "重新渲染 DOM 裡使用 uppercaseName 的這個部分的指令，並重新計算 uppercaseName，使用"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 293.46,
          "end": 295.93,
          "en": "that new value to update it in the Dom.",
          "zh": "那個新值在 DOM 裡更新它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 295.95,
          "end": 300.96,
          "en": "Now you can of course go through that entire bundle.js file if you want to understand all the internals,",
          "zh": "當然，如果你想理解所有內部細節，可以自己把整個 bundle.js 走一遍，"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 300.96,
          "end": 302.56,
          "en": "but this is how it works.",
          "zh": "但這就是它的運作方式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 302.58,
          "end": 305.85,
          "en": "This is one important trick.",
          "zh": "這是一個重要的技巧。"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 305.88,
          "end": 315.05,
          "en": "You could of course simply use name to uppercase down there that would achieve the same result.",
          "zh": "你當然也可以直接在下面使用 name.toUpperCase()，那會得到同樣的結果。"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 315.06,
          "end": 323.04,
          "en": "But using this labeled statement here and this dynamic recalculation offered by svelte is especially",
          "zh": "但使用這裡的標籤陳述式，以及 Svelte 提供的這種動態重新計算，特別"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 323.04,
          "end": 329.11,
          "en": "useful if you have multiple places in your page where you use that dynamic value because you then don't",
          "zh": "有用，如果你的頁面上有多個地方使用那個動態值，因為你就不必"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 329.11,
          "end": 334.3,
          "en": "have to use that in template in markup manipulation everywhere.",
          "zh": "在每個標記操作的地方都寫那一段。"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 334.31,
          "end": 339.46,
          "en": "Instead, you always refer to uppercase name and you have your logic up there and it's generally a good",
          "zh": "你始終參考 uppercaseName，邏輯放在上面，而一般來說，這是好的"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 339.46,
          "end": 345.1,
          "en": "practice to keep as much logic in the script tags and as little logic as possible down there in the",
          "zh": "做法：盡量把邏輯放在 script 標籤裡，下面的"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 345.1,
          "end": 345.82,
          "en": "markup.",
          "zh": "標記裡則盡量少放邏輯。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "14689484",
      "title": "More Reactivity",
      "lectureOrder": 13,
      "videoOrder": 11,
      "sourceHash": "fe42a9ba072e73bdf4eb9f999ce0c786fc42c3e5c5a8714aad09b2833900d8e5",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.03,
          "end": 8.57,
          "en": "Now, it's also worth pointing out that this labeled statement here, which is picked up by svelte to",
          "zh": "另外也值得指出，這裡這個標記陳述式，Svelte 會撿起來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 8.57,
          "end": 14.6,
          "en": "dynamically rerun this code whenever name changes, can also be used not just for variable assignments,",
          "zh": "每當 name 改變就動態重新執行這段程式碼，它不只可以用在變數賦值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 14.6,
          "end": 15.86,
          "en": "but for any other code.",
          "zh": "也可以用在任何其他程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 15.89,
          "end": 19.28,
          "en": "You can also console log name.",
          "zh": "你也可以 console.log name。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 19.28,
          "end": 25.13,
          "en": "And again, because we're using name on the right side of that label statement, this is actually transformed",
          "zh": "同樣地，因為我們在那個標記陳述式的右側使用 name，這實際上會被轉換"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 25.13,
          "end": 30.71,
          "en": "into code which will rerun this code snippet here whenever well name changes.",
          "zh": "成一段程式碼，每當 name 改變就會重新執行這裡這個程式碼片段。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 30.81,
          "end": 35.93,
          "en": "So therefore now if you have your developer tools open and you are in the JavaScript console, if you",
          "zh": "所以現在如果你打開開發者工具，並且在 JavaScript 主控台，如果你"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 35.96,
          "end": 41.24,
          "en": "click change name, you see it being console logged here because of that feature.",
          "zh": "點 Change Name，你會看到它在這裡被 console.log，就是因為那個功能。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 41.39,
          "end": 48.56,
          "en": "You can also use these label statements, these dynamic statements into which svelte turns them, for",
          "zh": "你也可以把這些標記陳述式，這些 Svelte 把它們轉成的動態陳述式，例如"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 48.56,
          "end": 50.84,
          "en": "example, in conjunction with a if statement.",
          "zh": "和 if 陳述式一起使用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 50.9,
          "end": 58.1,
          "en": "If name is equal to Maximilian, you could say then you want to set the age to 31.",
          "zh": "如果 name 等於 Maximilian，你就可以說，那麼你想把 age 設成 31。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 58.96,
          "end": 60.22,
          "en": "If you do that.",
          "zh": "如果你這樣做。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 60.88,
          "end": 67.96,
          "en": "You should see that if I click change name The age also changed to 31 because now again name is on the",
          "zh": "你應該會看到，如果我點 Change Name，age 也變成 31，因為現在 name 又在"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 67.96,
          "end": 72.46000000000001,
          "en": "right side of this label statement and therefore this entire statement Re-executed.",
          "zh": "這個標記陳述式的右側，因此這整個陳述式會重新執行。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 73.4,
          "end": 76.64,
          "en": "Now, you might be wondering, isn't age also on the right side?",
          "zh": "現在你可能會想，age 不也在右側嗎？"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 76.64,
          "end": 78.05,
          "en": "What if I change age?",
          "zh": "如果我改 age 呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 78.17,
          "end": 79.58,
          "en": "If you change age.",
          "zh": "如果你改 age。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 81.52,
          "end": 84.13,
          "en": "This doesn't affect this code here.",
          "zh": "這不會影響這裡這段程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 84.13,
          "end": 86.14,
          "en": "If I add a console log in here.",
          "zh": "如果我在這裡加一個 console.log。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 87.97,
          "end": 89.98,
          "en": "It runs, you will see.",
          "zh": "它會執行，你會看到。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 89.98,
          "end": 91.81,
          "en": "This only runs if I change the name.",
          "zh": "這只在我改 name 時執行。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 91.81,
          "end": 93.07,
          "en": "Now you see it runs.",
          "zh": "現在你看到它執行了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 93.07,
          "end": 99.61,
          "en": "If I click change name change age, you see it runs as not printed again because we're only referring",
          "zh": "如果我點 Change Name、Change Age，你看到它執行後沒有再印出來，因為我們只參照"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 99.64,
          "end": 102.03999999999999,
          "en": "to the dependencies specified in this line.",
          "zh": "這一行指定的相依。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 102.03999999999999,
          "end": 107.25999999999999,
          "en": "So directly here in the if statement to be precise, only these dependencies retrigger this code.",
          "zh": "所以精確地說，是直接在這個 if 陳述式裡，只有這些相依會重新觸發這段程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 107.35,
          "end": 115.24000000000001,
          "en": "So this is a useful syntax feature offered by svelte, which really enhances JavaScript and gives you",
          "zh": "所以這是 Svelte 提供的實用語法功能，它真的加強了 JavaScript，給你"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 115.24000000000001,
          "end": 121.63,
          "en": "a very powerful way of writing code that should run when something else changed and then update the",
          "zh": "一種很有力的寫法，讓程式碼在別的東西改變時執行，然後更新"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 121.63,
          "end": 127.06,
          "en": "Dom if that value is reflected in the Dom, like here in the case of uppercase name.",
          "zh": "DOM，如果那個值反映在 DOM 裡，就像這裡大寫 name 的情況。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "14689486",
      "title": "Binding to Element Properties",
      "lectureOrder": 14,
      "videoOrder": 12,
      "sourceHash": "1cb341b92d470c7416b18a434b222eb04c55b3eb91bcdb0b488dacb80591e08e",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 1.99,
          "end": 7.27,
          "en": "Thus far we're interacting with buttons, which is of course nice because buttons play an important",
          "zh": "到目前為止我們在和按鈕互動，這當然很好，因為按鈕在"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 7.27,
          "end": 9.31,
          "en": "role in web applications.",
          "zh": "網頁應用程式裡扮演重要角色。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 9.43,
          "end": 12.43,
          "en": "But what if we wanted to change the name?",
          "zh": "但如果我們想改變 name 呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 13.51,
          "end": 18.43,
          "en": "Through an input field so that you, as the user of the web application, can change the name instead",
          "zh": "透過輸入欄，讓你身為網頁應用程式的使用者可以改 name，而不是"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 18.43,
          "end": 22.24,
          "en": "of us hard coding it here into this function.",
          "zh": "我們在這裡把它寫死在這個函式裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 22.78,
          "end": 26.68,
          "en": "So instead of having a change name button here, which I'll comment out.",
          "zh": "所以與其在這裡有一個 Change Name 按鈕，我會把它註解掉。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 27.93,
          "end": 35.25,
          "en": "I'll add a input input of type text, and when we type in there, the username should change.",
          "zh": "我會加一個 type 為 text 的 input，當我們在那裡打字時，name 應該改變。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 36.9,
          "end": 39.77,
          "en": "Now, of course, if we save it like this, here's the input.",
          "zh": "當然，如果我們就這樣存檔，這裡有輸入欄。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 39.78,
          "end": 42.75,
          "en": "Styling is not too beautiful, but doesn't matter for now.",
          "zh": "樣式不太好看，但現在沒關係。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 42.75,
          "end": 46.05,
          "en": "But if I type there, of course nothing changes up there.",
          "zh": "但如果我在那裡打字，上面當然什麼都不會變。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 46.05,
          "end": 47.07,
          "en": "Because why would it?",
          "zh": "因為為什麼會變？"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 47.1,
          "end": 49.79,
          "en": "Where is the connection between input and our name?",
          "zh": "input 和我們的 name 之間的連結在哪？"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 49.8,
          "end": 51,
          "en": "There is no connection.",
          "zh": "沒有連結。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 51,
          "end": 51.51,
          "en": "Right?",
          "zh": "對吧？"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 51.51,
          "end": 53.46,
          "en": "So how do we set up a connection?",
          "zh": "所以我們要怎麼建立連結？"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 53.82,
          "end": 61.11,
          "en": "Well, an input has a value attribute and property, and you can bind to this property by adding value,",
          "zh": "input 有 value 屬性，你可以繫結這個屬性，藉由加上 value，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 61.11,
          "end": 63.42,
          "en": "this normal attribute here to input.",
          "zh": "這個一般屬性，加到 input 上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 63.54,
          "end": 67.68,
          "en": "And then how about setting this equal to name?",
          "zh": "然後把這設成等於 name 如何？"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 67.68,
          "end": 69.78,
          "en": "Again, you could omit these quotes here.",
          "zh": "同樣地，你可以省略這些引號。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 69.81,
          "end": 72.33,
          "en": "The curly braces, however, are required.",
          "zh": "不過大括號是必要的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 72.51,
          "end": 78.96000000000001,
          "en": "You'll learn that this should set up a connection between the name and, well, this element.",
          "zh": "你會學到，這應該在 name 和這個元素之間建立連結。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 78.99,
          "end": 82.17,
          "en": "Now, previously we used this connection to output some text.",
          "zh": "先前我們用這個連結來輸出一些文字。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 82.68,
          "end": 88.83,
          "en": "Can we now also set up a connection between the value in the input and this variable?",
          "zh": "現在我們也能在輸入欄的值和這個變數之間建立連結嗎？"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 88.86,
          "end": 91.71000000000001,
          "en": "Let's see if we save that.",
          "zh": "讓我們存檔看看。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 91.83,
          "end": 97.47,
          "en": "Indeed, we see Max here and if I start typing, nothing changes.",
          "zh": "確實，我們看到 Max，如果我開始打字，什麼都沒變。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 97.5,
          "end": 98.49000000000001,
          "en": "Now, why is that?",
          "zh": "為什麼？"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 98.52000000000001,
          "end": 101.22,
          "en": "Because right now it's only a one way connection.",
          "zh": "因為現在這只是單向連結。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 101.22,
          "end": 109.5,
          "en": "By default, the data flow in svelte is unidirectional, which means here we're outputting data.",
          "zh": "預設上，Svelte 的資料流是單向的，這表示我們在這裡輸出資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 109.53,
          "end": 115.32,
          "en": "We're not reacting to changes in this input element to change our name variable.",
          "zh": "我們沒有對這個 input 元素的變化做出反應，來改變 name 變數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 115.5,
          "end": 120.4,
          "en": "If we would want to do this, we would have to add an input listener.",
          "zh": "如果我們想這樣做，必須加一個 input 監聽器。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 120.42,
          "end": 126.93,
          "en": "Input is a normal event which is fired by input elements, which is fired whenever the user basically",
          "zh": "input 是一般事件，由 input 元素觸發，基本上每當使用者"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 126.93,
          "end": 128.31,
          "en": "types into that input.",
          "zh": "在那個輸入欄打字就會觸發。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 128.34,
          "end": 130.35,
          "en": "Now we can add a function here.",
          "zh": "現在我們可以在這裡加一個函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 131.21,
          "end": 133.4,
          "en": "Name input or whatever you want to name it.",
          "zh": "叫 nameInput，或任何你想取的名稱。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 133.4,
          "end": 138.59,
          "en": "And there we should also accept an argument which we get by default by JavaScript.",
          "zh": "那裡我們也應該接受一個引數，JavaScript 預設會給我們。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 138.62,
          "end": 139.76,
          "en": "The event.",
          "zh": "就是 event。"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 140.41,
          "end": 141.32999999999998,
          "en": "Argument here.",
          "zh": "引數在這裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 141.34,
          "end": 147.94,
          "en": "Event simply is an object which again the browser JavaScript the Dom gives us automatically.",
          "zh": "event 只是一個物件，瀏覽器、JavaScript、DOM 會自動給我們。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 147.95,
          "end": 154.27,
          "en": "It's a data container, a JavaScript object with a bunch of useful information about that event, which",
          "zh": "它是一個資料容器，一個 JavaScript 物件，有一堆關於那個事件的有用資訊，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 154.27,
          "end": 155.65,
          "en": "type of event and so on.",
          "zh": "是哪一種事件等等。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 155.65,
          "end": 162.43,
          "en": "And most importantly, this event has a target, which is basically the element that triggered the event,",
          "zh": "最重要的是，這個 event 有 target，基本上就是觸發事件的元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 162.43,
          "end": 163.81,
          "en": "which is this input.",
          "zh": "也就是這個 input。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 163.81,
          "end": 170.92000000000002,
          "en": "And that target, because it is an input element, has a value property because HTML input elements",
          "zh": "而那個 target 因為是 input 元素，有 value 屬性，因為 HTML input 元素"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 170.92000000000002,
          "end": 175.69,
          "en": "have value properties and that allows us to grab the value the user entered.",
          "zh": "有 value 屬性，這讓我們能取得使用者輸入的值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 175.9,
          "end": 183.01,
          "en": "So then we can get the entered value, which I'll temporarily store in this constant here by reaching",
          "zh": "所以我們可以取得輸入的值，我暫時存在這個常數裡，藉由取得"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 183.01,
          "end": 186.28,
          "en": "out to event target value.",
          "zh": "event.target.value。"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 186.58,
          "end": 191.2,
          "en": "And now here we can set name equal to that entered value.",
          "zh": "然後這裡我們可以把 name 設成那個輸入的值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 191.23,
          "end": 193.9,
          "en": "Of course, you could also do it all in one line if you wanted to.",
          "zh": "當然，如果你想，也可以全部寫成一行。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 194.05,
          "end": 197.89,
          "en": "So now with every keystroke, we want to update the name variable.",
          "zh": "所以現在每一次按鍵，我們都想更新 name 變數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 197.89,
          "end": 205.52,
          "en": "So this one here with the entered value for this, we now just have to bind on input here.",
          "zh": "也就是這裡這個，用輸入的值，為此我們現在只要在這裡繫結 on:input。"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 207.02,
          "end": 212.6,
          "en": "To our newly added function, which is this name input function.",
          "zh": "到我們新加的函式，也就是這個 nameInput 函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 214.07999999999998,
          "end": 216.87,
          "en": "For now, save that again, Max.",
          "zh": "現在先再存一次，Max。"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 216.87,
          "end": 217.47,
          "en": "Output there.",
          "zh": "輸出在那裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 217.47,
          "end": 218.7,
          "en": "But now if we type.",
          "zh": "但現在如果我們打字。"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 218.73,
          "end": 221.88,
          "en": "You see the name change up there, too.",
          "zh": "你看到上面的 name 也變了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 222.12,
          "end": 224.07,
          "en": "Now, why does the name change up there?",
          "zh": "為什麼上面的 name 會變？"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 225.52,
          "end": 229.54,
          "en": "Because we're changing it with every keystroke like this.",
          "zh": "因為我們像這樣每一次按鍵都在改它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 230.07999999999998,
          "end": 233.38,
          "en": "Now we still have only unidirectional data flow.",
          "zh": "現在我們仍然只有單向資料流。"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 233.41,
          "end": 237.34,
          "en": "This here is used to let data flow into the input.",
          "zh": "這裡這個用來讓資料流進 input。"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 237.37,
          "end": 241.66,
          "en": "This is used to let it flow out of the input, so to say, to react to the event.",
          "zh": "這個用來讓它從 input 流出，可以說是對事件做出反應。"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 241.66,
          "end": 248.17,
          "en": "But both together, of course, create a two directional data flow which allows us to reflect the input",
          "zh": "但兩者合在一起，當然就建立雙向資料流，讓我們能反映輸入"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 248.17,
          "end": 250.45,
          "en": "in well, the input element.",
          "zh": "在這個 input 元素裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 250.45,
          "end": 253.69,
          "en": "And also up there where we only output the name.",
          "zh": "以及上面我們只輸出 name 的地方。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "14689490",
      "title": "Two-Way Binding Shortcut",
      "lectureOrder": 15,
      "videoOrder": 13,
      "sourceHash": "e80b31fcc52bbab4c3f326689d66feeceda48fdbe9e6f27d318d1e60cd8bd41a",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.03,
          "end": 4.24,
          "en": "If you have a situation like this.",
          "zh": "如果你遇到像這樣的情況。"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.25,
          "end": 6.8,
          "en": "Svelte also has a shortcut for you.",
          "zh": "Svelte 也有一個捷徑給你。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.25,
          "end": 10.22,
          "en": "I'll duplicate this and comment out the first solution.",
          "zh": "我會複製這段，並把第一個解法註解掉。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.64,
          "end": 12.5,
          "en": "A more concise way of writing this.",
          "zh": "更精簡的寫法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.53,
          "end": 18.5,
          "en": "If you need these two directional data flow is that you use the bind keyword.",
          "zh": "如果你需要這種雙向資料流，就是使用 bind 關鍵字。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 18.53,
          "end": 25.91,
          "en": "Now that again just like on is understood by Svelte Bind Colon and then the name of the property you",
          "zh": "這又和 on 一樣，Svelte 看得懂 bind 冒號，然後是你想"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 25.91,
          "end": 28.52,
          "en": "want to bind, in this case the value property.",
          "zh": "繫結的屬性名稱，在這個例子裡是 value 屬性。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 28.97,
          "end": 33.14,
          "en": "And then again you can use quotes, but you don't have to.",
          "zh": "然後你同樣可以用引號，但不必。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 33.32,
          "end": 36.8,
          "en": "And I'm binding to name.",
          "zh": "而我繫結到 name。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 36.89,
          "end": 37.89,
          "en": "What does this do?",
          "zh": "這做了什麼？"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 37.91,
          "end": 39.92,
          "en": "This sets up two way binding.",
          "zh": "這建立雙向繫結。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 39.92,
          "end": 46.46,
          "en": "This means that now the data flow is into the value property, but with every keystroke it will also",
          "zh": "這表示現在資料流進 value 屬性，但每一次按鍵也會"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 46.46,
          "end": 48.41,
          "en": "automatically update name.",
          "zh": "自動更新 name。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 48.56,
          "end": 54.98,
          "en": "So now if I set this and I type in there, you see the same effect as before.",
          "zh": "所以現在如果我設定這個並在那裡打字，你會看到和之前一樣的效果。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 54.98,
          "end": 60.47,
          "en": "But now this essentially is a shortcut for what we achieved here in the longer form before.",
          "zh": "但現在這本質上是捷徑，對應我們之前用較長寫法達成的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 60.5,
          "end": 65.77,
          "en": "It's very convenient, especially for text input and so on, for form inputs in general.",
          "zh": "這非常方便，尤其是文字輸入等等，一般來說是表單輸入。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 65.79,
          "end": 68.1,
          "en": "You can also use it in other places.",
          "zh": "你也可以在其他地方使用它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 68.1,
          "end": 76.89,
          "en": "You can theoretically bind any or most HTML properties, but I would not recommend overusing this because",
          "zh": "理論上你可以繫結任何或大多數 HTML 屬性，但我不建議過度使用，因為"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 76.89,
          "end": 80.97,
          "en": "breaking this unidirectional data flow should only be done with a good reason.",
          "zh": "打破這種單向資料流，只應該在有好理由時才做。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 80.97,
          "end": 82.35,
          "en": "This is a good reason here.",
          "zh": "這裡是一個好理由。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 82.35,
          "end": 88.68,
          "en": "But in most cases you want to be very clear about how your data flows and set up your own event listeners",
          "zh": "但在大多數情況下，你會想非常清楚資料如何流動，並設定你自己的事件監聽器，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 88.68,
          "end": 93.33,
          "en": "and your own data outputs and don't merge them, but especially for form inputs.",
          "zh": "以及你自己的資料輸出，不要把它們混在一起，但尤其是表單輸入。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 93.33,
          "end": 99.12,
          "en": "As I mentioned, this is fine and this is a shortcut for this longer syntax here.",
          "zh": "如前所述，這樣沒問題，而且這是這裡較長語法的捷徑。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "14689492",
      "title": "Using Multiple Components",
      "lectureOrder": 16,
      "videoOrder": 14,
      "sourceHash": "becf9573f7168296ddc5b3f107c5f4fc550a5a6c37a3a3690a102a0e0670c975",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.03,
          "end": 6.02,
          "en": "So these have been some interesting first steps.",
          "zh": "所以這些是一些有趣的第一步。"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 6.32,
          "end": 13.28,
          "en": "Let's now actually work with more than one component, because thus far I only have this app svelte",
          "zh": "現在讓我們實際使用超過一個元件，因為到目前為止我只有這個 App.svelte"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 13.28,
          "end": 17.06,
          "en": "file, this one component here, which is rendered on the entire page.",
          "zh": "檔案，這裡這一個元件，它渲染在整個頁面上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 17.54,
          "end": 23.78,
          "en": "Now, let's say we now want to work with multiple components and we want to create a nice contact card",
          "zh": "現在，假設我們想使用多個元件，而且想建立一張漂亮的聯絡卡片，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 23.78,
          "end": 24.77,
          "en": "for our user.",
          "zh": "給我們的使用者。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 24.8,
          "end": 30.86,
          "en": "Now, of course, this is a very small demo here, but of course you could have some web application",
          "zh": "當然，這裡是一個很小的示範，但你當然可以有某個網頁應用程式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 30.86,
          "end": 37.67,
          "en": "where you want to share some contact details of the administrators of the page of users of your page.",
          "zh": "你想分享頁面管理員、你頁面使用者的一些聯絡資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 37.67,
          "end": 45.29,
          "en": "Maybe you're building your own online education page where you want to show some concise information",
          "zh": "也許你在建立自己的線上教育頁面，想顯示一些精簡資訊，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 45.29,
          "end": 50.9,
          "en": "about the instructor of a course below the course, and therefore you want to have some component which",
          "zh": "關於課程講師的，放在課程下方，因此你想要某個元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 50.9,
          "end": 54.47,
          "en": "sums up the name, let's say the title.",
          "zh": "總結名稱，比方說頭銜。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 54.47,
          "end": 60.74,
          "en": "So the professional title, the job of this person maybe has an image and maybe a short description.",
          "zh": "也就是專業頭銜，這個人的工作，也許有一張圖片，也許有一段短描述。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 61.68,
          "end": 68.22,
          "en": "We can add this all in this one single component, but the more logic that flows into our application,",
          "zh": "我們可以把這一切加在這一個元件裡，但流進應用程式的邏輯越多，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 68.22,
          "end": 69.53999999999999,
          "en": "the bigger this gets.",
          "zh": "它就變得越大。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 69.53999999999999,
          "end": 75.66,
          "en": "So if I now start adding some markup for the contact card here and later we have one for a list of courses",
          "zh": "所以如果我現在開始在這裡為聯絡卡片加一些標記，稍後我們有一個給課程清單，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 75.66,
          "end": 78.69,
          "en": "and later we have one for the signup form.",
          "zh": "稍後我們有一個給註冊表單。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 78.69,
          "end": 81.33,
          "en": "Well then this gets a huge file.",
          "zh": "那麼這會變成一個巨大的檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 81.33,
          "end": 82.95,
          "en": "It gets hard to manage.",
          "zh": "它會很難管理。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 82.95,
          "end": 88.83,
          "en": "We might have name clashes between our variables and it will simply be no fun.",
          "zh": "我們的變數之間可能會有名稱衝突，而且這根本不好玩。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 89.1,
          "end": 96.18,
          "en": "And therefore, let's create a second file and I'll name this contact card dot svelte, the name of",
          "zh": "因此，讓我們建立第二個檔案，我把它命名為 ContactCard.svelte，名稱是"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 96.18,
          "end": 97.95,
          "en": "the extension, the file extension here.",
          "zh": "副檔名，這裡的檔案副檔名。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 98.07,
          "end": 104.1,
          "en": "That should be dot svelte to have that svelte extension for Visual Studio code, we installed work.",
          "zh": "那應該是 .svelte，才能有那個 Svelte 副檔名，讓我們為 Visual Studio Code 安裝的能"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 104.1,
          "end": 104.78999999999999,
          "en": "Fine.",
          "zh": "正常運作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 104.88,
          "end": 112.89,
          "en": "And now in this contact card svelte file, we can create a new svelte component which may have the same",
          "zh": "現在在這個 ContactCard.svelte 檔案裡，我們可以建立一個新的 Svelte 元件，它可以有和 App"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 112.89,
          "end": 113.97,
          "en": "features as the apps.",
          "zh": "一樣的功能。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 113.97,
          "end": 118.44,
          "en": "Well, file a script section, a style section, and some markup.",
          "zh": "檔案、一個 script 區段、一個 style 區段，以及一些標記。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 118.47,
          "end": 121.89,
          "en": "Now, of course, if you have no styles, you need no style section.",
          "zh": "當然，如果你沒有樣式，就不需要 style 區段。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 121.89,
          "end": 125.49,
          "en": "And if you have no script, if you have no logic, you don't need that either.",
          "zh": "如果你沒有 script、沒有邏輯，你也不需要那個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 125.64,
          "end": 128.64,
          "en": "You probably always need some markup though.",
          "zh": "你大概總是需要一些標記。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 128.64,
          "end": 129.78,
          "en": "So let's start with that.",
          "zh": "所以讓我們從那裡開始。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 129.78,
          "end": 135.78,
          "en": "Let's add a div as a wrapper around our card and in there.",
          "zh": "讓我們加一個 div 當作卡片的包裝，在裡面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 136.99,
          "end": 138.97,
          "en": "Let's give this some header.",
          "zh": "讓我們給它一些頁首。"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 139.3,
          "end": 143.65,
          "en": "A card header where we have the name later.",
          "zh": "一個卡片頁首，稍後我們會放名稱。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 143.68,
          "end": 145.35,
          "en": "Maybe an H1 tag.",
          "zh": "也許一個 h1 標籤。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 145.36,
          "end": 149.95,
          "en": "So the user name and this will become a dynamic value later.",
          "zh": "所以是使用者名稱，這稍後會變成動態值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 150.19,
          "end": 154.51,
          "en": "And below that H2 tag we have the job title.",
          "zh": "在那個 h2 標籤下面，我們有職稱。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 155.21,
          "end": 157.94,
          "en": "And then we have some main content in there.",
          "zh": "然後我們在裡面有一些主要內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 157.94,
          "end": 164.39,
          "en": "And in that content we have a paragraph with a short description.",
          "zh": "在那個內容裡我們有一個段落，帶一段短描述。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 164.42000000000002,
          "end": 168.47,
          "en": "I also want to have an image and I want to have that next to the name and job titles.",
          "zh": "我也想要一張圖片，而且我想把它放在名稱和職稱旁邊。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 168.47,
          "end": 176.84,
          "en": "Let's add a div in here maybe, and another div and in that second div we'll have the username and job",
          "zh": "也許在這裡加一個 div，再加另一個 div，在第二個 div 裡我們會有使用者名稱和職稱，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 176.84,
          "end": 180.92,
          "en": "title and in that first div we'll have an image.",
          "zh": "在第一個 div 裡我們會有一張圖片。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 182.33,
          "end": 186.2,
          "en": "Of course, a bunch of data is missing, but this will be the general markup.",
          "zh": "當然少了一堆資料，但這會是一般的標記。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 186.7,
          "end": 189.22,
          "en": "Now, we also will need some styling.",
          "zh": "現在我們也需要一些樣式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 189.22,
          "end": 191.86,
          "en": "So let's add some style tags here and now.",
          "zh": "所以讓我們在這裡加一些 style 標籤，現在。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 191.86,
          "end": 197.34,
          "en": "The cool thing about these styles is that they are scoped to the component.",
          "zh": "這些樣式很酷的地方是，它們的範圍限定在這個元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 197.35,
          "end": 198.55,
          "en": "But does this mean.",
          "zh": "但這是什麼意思。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 199.3,
          "end": 205.54,
          "en": "You see that H1 tag here in the apps world file which colors the H1 text purple?",
          "zh": "你看到 App.svelte 檔案裡這個 h1 標籤，它把 h1 文字著成紫色？"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 206.02,
          "end": 208.96,
          "en": "Well, I have an H1 tag here as well.",
          "zh": "我這裡也有一個 h1 標籤。"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 208.96,
          "end": 209.28,
          "en": "Right.",
          "zh": "對。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 209.29,
          "end": 213.13,
          "en": "It's in the div here of my contact cards.",
          "zh": "它在我的聯絡卡片這個 div 裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 213.13,
          "end": 214.09,
          "en": "Swelled file.",
          "zh": ".svelte 檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 214.97,
          "end": 223.7,
          "en": "So therefore, if I now use my contact card svelte component in that app component, the two styles",
          "zh": "所以如果我現在在那個 App 元件裡使用 ContactCard.svelte 元件，這兩組樣式"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 223.7,
          "end": 224.93,
          "en": "might merge.",
          "zh": "可能會合併。"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 224.93,
          "end": 225.23,
          "en": "Right?",
          "zh": "對吧？"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 225.23,
          "end": 228.45,
          "en": "So maybe the H1 tag in here also is colored purple.",
          "zh": "所以也許這裡的 h1 標籤也被著成紫色。"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 228.47,
          "end": 232.4,
          "en": "Well, it won't because svelte scopes styles.",
          "zh": "它不會，因為 Svelte 會把樣式限定範圍。"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 232.4,
          "end": 236.24,
          "en": "But first of all, let's use the contact card and the app svelte file.",
          "zh": "但首先，讓我們使用 ContactCard 和 App.svelte 檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 236.24,
          "end": 240.5,
          "en": "And for this in the script section of this component you import.",
          "zh": "為此，在這個元件的 script 區段裡，你匯入"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 242.07,
          "end": 242.97,
          "en": "Your.",
          "zh": "你的"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 244.56,
          "end": 246.66,
          "en": "Component by giving it a name.",
          "zh": "元件，並給它一個名稱。"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 246.66,
          "end": 252.09,
          "en": "The name is up to you, but it should be written in this Pascal case notation where you start with a",
          "zh": "名稱由你決定，但應該用這種 PascalCase 寫法，你從"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 252.09,
          "end": 258,
          "en": "capital character, you only have one word, and every new word inside of the word also starts with",
          "zh": "一個大寫字元開始，而且這個詞裡面每一個新詞也以"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 258,
          "end": 259.2,
          "en": "a capital character.",
          "zh": "大寫字元開始。"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 259.2,
          "end": 264.24,
          "en": "And then you add a from keyword and then a relative path to the file where this component is defined",
          "zh": "然後你加 from 關鍵字，然後是相對路徑，指向定義這個元件的檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 264.24,
          "end": 267.93,
          "en": "in in this case, contact contact card dot svelte.",
          "zh": "在這個例子裡是 ContactCard.svelte。"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 268.08,
          "end": 274.29,
          "en": "Now, you could also import it here in Main.js and instantiate it here as a new main component which",
          "zh": "你也可以在 main.js 這裡匯入它，並在這裡把它實例化成一個新的主要元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 274.29,
          "end": 280.92,
          "en": "you add somewhere in your index.html file and it would be possible you could also add some entry points",
          "zh": "你把它加在 index.html 檔案的某處，這是可能的，你也可以在這裡加一些進入點，"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 280.92,
          "end": 288.6,
          "en": "in here, some divs with IDs, for example app or whatever you want, and then use this these IDs to",
          "zh": "一些有 ID 的 div，例如 app 或任何你想要的，然後用這些 ID"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 288.6,
          "end": 293.58,
          "en": "select them here instead of taking the whole document body, you could use document, query selector,",
          "zh": "在這裡選取它們，而不是拿整個 document.body，你可以用 document.querySelector，"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 293.58,
          "end": 298.77,
          "en": "select one of the divs with the IDs and then define where this component should be added.",
          "zh": "選取其中一個有 ID 的 div，然後定義這個元件應該加在哪裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 298.77,
          "end": 303.03,
          "en": "Import another component and add this to another element in the index.html file.",
          "zh": "匯入另一個元件，並把它加到 index.html 檔案的另一個元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 303.03,
          "end": 309.97,
          "en": "That's also possible, but often you will also have one root component like here apps world which holds",
          "zh": "那也是可能的，但你常常也會有一個根元件，像這裡的 App.svelte，它容納"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 309.97,
          "end": 315.28,
          "en": "your entire svelte application and all these sub components like the contact card component.",
          "zh": "你整個 Svelte 應用程式，以及所有這些子元件，像是 ContactCard 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 315.31,
          "end": 320.8,
          "en": "That's why I'm importing the contact card here, because it belongs to this main app I'm building here",
          "zh": "所以我在這裡匯入 ContactCard，因為它屬於我"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 320.8,
          "end": 321.52,
          "en": "with svelte.",
          "zh": "用 Svelte 建立的這個主要應用程式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 321.55,
          "end": 325.87,
          "en": "I don't need multiple root nodes in my index.html file.",
          "zh": "我不需要在 index.html 檔案裡有多個根節點。"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 325.87,
          "end": 332.26,
          "en": "I have one root entry point instead, and in there I build up my application as a tree of components.",
          "zh": "我反而有一個根進入點，在那裡我把應用程式建成一棵元件樹。"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 332.26,
          "end": 337.81,
          "en": "And now that contact card component can be used in app svelte directly in the markup.",
          "zh": "現在那個 ContactCard 元件可以直接在 App.svelte 的標記裡使用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 338.17,
          "end": 343.81,
          "en": "You can simply add it as a normal HTML element like this as a self-closing tag.",
          "zh": "你可以像這樣把它加成像一般 HTML 元素，作為自閉合標籤。"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 343.81,
          "end": 344.47,
          "en": "Even.",
          "zh": "甚至。"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 344.56,
          "end": 346.9,
          "en": "Just make sure you have the casing right.",
          "zh": "只要確認大小寫正確。"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 346.93,
          "end": 355.6,
          "en": "Lowercase elements will be treated as regular built in HTML elements by svelte Pascal case elements",
          "zh": "小寫元素會被 Svelte 當成一般內建 HTML 元素，PascalCase 元素"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 355.6,
          "end": 361.15,
          "en": "will be treated as custom components and that is important for svelte to compile your code correctly.",
          "zh": "會被當成自訂元件，這對 Svelte 正確編譯你的程式碼很重要。"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 361.15,
          "end": 366.55,
          "en": "That's why you should follow this naming convention now with that, if you save that all.",
          "zh": "所以你現在應該遵循這個命名慣例，如果你把那一切存檔。"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 367.29,
          "end": 370.62,
          "en": "This is the card that has no special styles right now.",
          "zh": "這張卡片現在沒有特別的樣式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 370.62,
          "end": 379.35,
          "en": "But one thing it does have is an H1 tag, which is not purple because styles are scoped to a component.",
          "zh": "但它確實有的一件事是 h1 標籤，它不是紫色，因為樣式範圍限定在元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 379.35,
          "end": 387.69,
          "en": "So the H1 tag in the app svelte file only styles h1 tags Here in this app svelte file it styles no other",
          "zh": "所以 App.svelte 檔案裡的 h1 標籤只設定這裡這個 App.svelte 檔案裡的 h1 標籤，它不設定"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 387.69,
          "end": 389.7,
          "en": "H1 tags in the application.",
          "zh": "應用程式裡的其他 h1 標籤。"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 390,
          "end": 391.47,
          "en": "And how is this achieved?",
          "zh": "這是怎麼做到的？"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 391.5,
          "end": 396.69,
          "en": "Well in the developer tools, if you inspect this H1 tag, you see it has a class of svelte and then",
          "zh": "在開發者工具裡，如果你檢查這個 h1 標籤，你會看到它有一個 class，是 svelte 然後"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 396.69,
          "end": 405.96,
          "en": "some random hash and in the end your CSS code for this component got transformed to also use this class",
          "zh": "一些隨機雜湊，最後你這個元件的 CSS 程式碼也被轉換成使用這個 class"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 405.96,
          "end": 406.89,
          "en": "as a selector.",
          "zh": "當作選擇器。"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 406.89,
          "end": 409.2,
          "en": "And this class is only used in this component.",
          "zh": "而這個 class 只用在這個元件裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 409.2,
          "end": 416.52,
          "en": "In the other component, this H1 tag here has no class and therefore it doesn't get that style.",
          "zh": "在另一個元件裡，這裡這個 h1 標籤沒有 class，因此它得不到那個樣式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 416.52,
          "end": 417.96,
          "en": "That is how svelte does this.",
          "zh": "Svelte 就是這樣做的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 417.96,
          "end": 420.24,
          "en": "And that, of course is also a useful feature.",
          "zh": "而那當然也是一個實用功能。"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 420.24,
          "end": 423.3,
          "en": "By the way, Svelte does even more with your CSS code.",
          "zh": "順帶一提，Svelte 對你的 CSS 程式碼做得更多。"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 423.3,
          "end": 429.97,
          "en": "It also removes any unused CSS code, so if you had a rule in here which made no sense, it would even",
          "zh": "它也會移除任何未使用的 CSS 程式碼，所以如果你這裡有一條沒有意義的規則，它甚至會"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 429.97,
          "end": 432.58,
          "en": "remove that before shipping code to the browser.",
          "zh": "在把程式碼送到瀏覽器之前移除它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 432.58,
          "end": 435.73,
          "en": "Again, Svelte is all about being small and quick.",
          "zh": "再次強調，Svelte 的重點就是小而快。"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 435.73,
          "end": 443.41,
          "en": "In the end we added a so-called nested component nested because we use a component in a component,",
          "zh": "最後我們加了一個所謂的巢狀元件，巢狀是因為我們在元件裡使用元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 443.44,
          "end": 448.36,
          "en": "we use the contact card component in the app component and we use it like this.",
          "zh": "我們在 App 元件裡使用 ContactCard 元件，而且我們像這樣使用它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 448.63,
          "end": 455.53,
          "en": "Now, instead of the contact card component, we can write our own styles and we can then also of course",
          "zh": "現在，我們可以為 ContactCard 元件寫自己的樣式，然後我們當然也可以"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 455.53,
          "end": 458.98,
          "en": "use the same svelte features we were using in the app Svelte.",
          "zh": "使用我們在 App.svelte 裡用過的相同 Svelte 功能。"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 459.01,
          "end": 461.98,
          "en": "So work with dynamic data and so on.",
          "zh": "所以使用動態資料等等。"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 462.07,
          "end": 467.74,
          "en": "Now of course, our contact card also needs some styling therefore attached to find a contact card dot",
          "zh": "當然，我們的聯絡卡片也需要一些樣式，因此附件裡可以找到 ContactCard"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 467.74,
          "end": 469.3,
          "en": "svelte file my file.",
          "zh": ".svelte 檔案，我的檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 469.3,
          "end": 475.36,
          "en": "It has no logic in there, just some styling and adjusted markup which after you're using it will give",
          "zh": "裡面沒有邏輯，只有一些樣式和調整過的標記，你使用之後會得到"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 475.36,
          "end": 478.03,
          "en": "you a contact card that looks like this.",
          "zh": "一張看起來像這樣的聯絡卡片。"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 478.03,
          "end": 479.92,
          "en": "Now, again, nothing will happen there.",
          "zh": "同樣地，那裡不會發生什麼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 479.92,
          "end": 481.9,
          "en": "There's no dynamic logic attached to this.",
          "zh": "沒有附上動態邏輯。"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 481.93,
          "end": 486.79,
          "en": "We of course, will add all of that together, but this will be a starting point.",
          "zh": "我們當然會一起把那些都加上，但這會是一個起點。"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 487,
          "end": 494.38,
          "en": "Now let's make sure that we can actually fill this dynamically, because now we're using a nested component,",
          "zh": "現在讓我們確保可以動態填入它，因為現在我們使用巢狀元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 494.41,
          "end": 497.35,
          "en": "the contact card component in the app, svelte component.",
          "zh": "在 App.svelte 元件裡的 ContactCard 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 497.35,
          "end": 504.19,
          "en": "How can these two components now communicate so that, for example, when we enter our name here, we",
          "zh": "這兩個元件現在要怎麼溝通，例如當我們在這裡輸入名稱，"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 504.19,
          "end": 507.76,
          "en": "output this here instead of this generic username text.",
          "zh": "我們在這裡輸出它，而不是這段通用的 username 文字。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "14689496",
      "title": "Components & Communication via Props",
      "lectureOrder": 17,
      "videoOrder": 15,
      "sourceHash": "2672761653c89a576ed011b467cc15caf41b593b39b0790ea3692794d6dc0782",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.36,
          "end": 8.12,
          "en": "We want to connect our app svelte file, namely this input here with this name.",
          "zh": "我們想把 App.svelte 檔案連起來，也就是這裡這個 input 和這個 name。"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 8.12,
          "end": 9.32,
          "en": "That's a good start, right?",
          "zh": "這是好的開始，對吧？"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 9.32,
          "end": 14.42,
          "en": "And actually, we can use a technique or a feature of svelte for that, which we saw in the first course",
          "zh": "其實我們可以用 Svelte 的一項技術或功能來做，我們在第一個課程"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 14.42,
          "end": 15.8,
          "en": "section briefly.",
          "zh": "單元裡短暫看過。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 16.31,
          "end": 22.07,
          "en": "Now we will definitely need to add some script logic and that's why I'm just shrinking this here.",
          "zh": "現在我們一定要加一些 script 邏輯，所以我把這裡縮小。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 22.07,
          "end": 25.31,
          "en": "It's still there just so that we can see the markup next to the script.",
          "zh": "它還在，只是讓我們能在 script 旁邊看到標記。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 25.46,
          "end": 31.4,
          "en": "Let's add a script tag here to contact Card svelte and to add a variable.",
          "zh": "讓我們在 ContactCard.svelte 這裡加一個 script 標籤，並加一個變數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 31.4,
          "end": 37.28,
          "en": "We of course use the let keyword, but to add a variable which can be set from outside, we use export.",
          "zh": "我們當然用 let 關鍵字，但要加一個可以從外面設定的變數，我們用 export"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 37.28,
          "end": 37.82,
          "en": "Let.",
          "zh": "let。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 37.85,
          "end": 43.31,
          "en": "Now again, this is svelte kind of hijacking a built in JavaScript feature.",
          "zh": "這又是 Svelte 有點借用內建 JavaScript 功能。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 43.4,
          "end": 50.78,
          "en": "The export keyword was not invented by svelte that exists in JavaScript, but in JavaScript we kind",
          "zh": "export 關鍵字不是 Svelte 發明的，它存在於 JavaScript，但在 JavaScript 裡我們"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 50.78,
          "end": 52.22,
          "en": "of use it a bit differently.",
          "zh": "用得有點不一樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 52.25,
          "end": 57.98,
          "en": "Svelte here recognizes that we're exporting a variable and that means to svelte that this variable can",
          "zh": "Svelte 在這裡認出我們正在匯出一個變數，對 Svelte 來說這表示這個變數現在可以"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 57.98,
          "end": 66.42,
          "en": "now be set from outside and with from outside, I mean from a component which uses this contact card",
          "zh": "從外面設定，而我說的外面，是指使用這個 ContactCard"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 66.42,
          "end": 68.88,
          "en": "component like the app component does.",
          "zh": "元件的元件，就像 App 元件這樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 69.63,
          "end": 74.82,
          "en": "So we give this variable a name then and that would be the username, for example.",
          "zh": "所以我們給這個變數一個名稱，那會是 username，例如。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 74.82,
          "end": 79.74,
          "en": "And now how can we pass in a value for a username which we can then use down there?",
          "zh": "現在我們要怎麼傳入 username 的值，然後在下面使用？"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 79.86,
          "end": 84.33,
          "en": "Well, first of all, let's use it down there in the contact card svelte file.",
          "zh": "首先，讓我們在 ContactCard.svelte 檔案下面使用它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 84.33,
          "end": 90.99,
          "en": "I use curly braces to output content and the content I want to output is the value of the username variable.",
          "zh": "我用大括號輸出內容，我想輸出的內容是 username 變數的值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 90.99,
          "end": 93.86,
          "en": "But again, how do I now set this from outside?",
          "zh": "但同樣地，我現在要怎麼從外面設定它？"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 93.87,
          "end": 98.91,
          "en": "Well, first of all, we have to go to the place where we are using the contact card component, which",
          "zh": "首先，我們必須到使用 ContactCard 元件的地方，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 98.91,
          "end": 100.8,
          "en": "is here in the app component.",
          "zh": "也就是這裡的 App 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 100.8,
          "end": 108.39,
          "en": "And then we don't set props equal to something because you might remember that in Main.js we previously",
          "zh": "然後我們不會把 props 設成某個東西，因為你可能記得在 main.js 裡，我們先前"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 108.39,
          "end": 114.53,
          "en": "had a props key here and then we set our props here as key value pairs on an object.",
          "zh": "這裡有一個 props 鍵，然後我們在物件上把 props 設成鍵值組。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 114.53999999999999,
          "end": 120.06,
          "en": "Well, that only works if you're creating your components in JavaScript files, like we're doing it",
          "zh": "那只在你於 JavaScript 檔案裡建立元件時有效，就像我們"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 120.06,
          "end": 120.72,
          "en": "here.",
          "zh": "在這裡做的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 120.72,
          "end": 127.92,
          "en": "If you're creating them in markup as we're doing it here, you simply add your prop name and this is",
          "zh": "如果你像這裡這樣在標記裡建立它們，你只要加上 prop 名稱，而這"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 127.92,
          "end": 129.18,
          "en": "called a prop here.",
          "zh": "在這裡叫做 prop。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 129.18,
          "end": 136.17000000000002,
          "en": "So when you export variables, these variables are named props of these component properties, Bindable",
          "zh": "所以當你匯出變數，這些變數就叫做這些元件屬性的 props，這個元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 136.17000000000002,
          "end": 137.79,
          "en": "properties of this component.",
          "zh": "可繫結的屬性。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 137.82,
          "end": 142.53,
          "en": "You use the prop name here directly on your custom HTML tag.",
          "zh": "你直接在自訂 HTML 標籤上使用 prop 名稱。"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 142.53,
          "end": 148.47,
          "en": "So in this case username make sure the casing is correct because this is parsed by svelte, not by the",
          "zh": "所以在這個例子裡是 username，請確認大小寫正確，因為這是由 Svelte 解析，不是由"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 148.47,
          "end": 150.63,
          "en": "browser, hence casing matters.",
          "zh": "瀏覽器解析，因此大小寫有差。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 150.69,
          "end": 153.69,
          "en": "And then you set this equal to the value you want to pass in.",
          "zh": "然後你把它設成你想傳入的值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 153.69,
          "end": 157.74,
          "en": "This could be max for example, hardcoded.",
          "zh": "這可以是 Max，例如，寫死的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 157.95,
          "end": 163.41,
          "en": "If I do that, you see Max here, but of course you can also use a dynamic value.",
          "zh": "如果我這樣做，你會在這裡看到 Max，但你當然也可以用動態值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 163.41,
          "end": 168.27,
          "en": "So instead of Max you can also use curly braces here and refer to name.",
          "zh": "所以與其用 Max，你也可以在這裡用大括號，並參照 name。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 168.27,
          "end": 175.53,
          "en": "And now keep in mind that name is a variable in app component which we are binding to through the bind",
          "zh": "請記得 name 是 App 元件裡的變數，我們透過 bind"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 175.56,
          "end": 178.98,
          "en": "keyword here with two way binding on that input.",
          "zh": "關鍵字，用那個 input 上的雙向繫結，繫結到它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 179.19,
          "end": 184.56,
          "en": "So therefore now if you save this, you also see Max, because that is our starting value for name.",
          "zh": "所以現在如果你存檔，你也會看到 Max，因為那是 name 的起始值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 184.56,
          "end": 187.92,
          "en": "But now as I type there you see it changed down there too.",
          "zh": "但現在我在那裡打字，你看到下面也變了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 187.92,
          "end": 195.66,
          "en": "And this is how you can communicate between two different components with the help of export Led, which",
          "zh": "你就是這樣在兩個不同元件之間溝通，藉助 export let，它"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 195.66,
          "end": 202.05,
          "en": "allows us to create variables which can be set from outside without export.",
          "zh": "讓我們能建立可以從外面設定的變數，如果沒有 export。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 202.05,
          "end": 203.91,
          "en": "If I were to try this.",
          "zh": "如果我試著這樣做。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 204.5,
          "end": 207.76,
          "en": "You will see that I see undefined here.",
          "zh": "你會看到我在這裡看到 undefined。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 207.77,
          "end": 214.91,
          "en": "And as I type, nothing happens because this is now not bindable from outside and we do not define a",
          "zh": "而我打字時什麼都沒發生，因為這現在不能從外面繫結，而且我們沒有在這裡定義"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 214.91,
          "end": 215.9,
          "en": "value in here.",
          "zh": "一個值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 215.9,
          "end": 217.85,
          "en": "Hence we see undefined here.",
          "zh": "因此我們在這裡看到 undefined。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 217.85,
          "end": 223.04,
          "en": "So the export keyword matters to make this settable from outside.",
          "zh": "所以 export 關鍵字很重要，才能讓這可以從外面設定。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "14689498",
      "title": "Diving Deeper into Bindings",
      "lectureOrder": 18,
      "videoOrder": 16,
      "sourceHash": "0cb6d82b8a548f9c1d4a08155479a6fc0e8440d9afcce950161f7f0c85ab0a03",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.06,
          "end": 9.62,
          "en": "Now as a little challenge, make sure that job title and description are also suitable from outside.",
          "zh": "現在作為一個小挑戰，確保 job title 和 description 也能從外面設定。"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 9.62,
          "end": 15.2,
          "en": "In the same way, we're setting the name from inside our app component that we have two new input fields",
          "zh": "用同樣的方式，我們在 App 元件裡設定 name，我們在那裡有兩個新的輸入欄，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 15.2,
          "end": 19.73,
          "en": "there, one for the description, maybe even use a text area there if you're feeling fancy.",
          "zh": "一個給 description，如果你想講究，甚至可以用 textarea。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 19.73,
          "end": 25.22,
          "en": "But the input is fine too, and make sure you bind them to variables which you then pass down to the",
          "zh": "但 input 也可以，並確保你把它們繫結到變數，然後把那些變數傳下去給"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 25.22,
          "end": 26.54,
          "en": "contact card component.",
          "zh": "ContactCard 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 26.57,
          "end": 32.27,
          "en": "If you're feeling really fancy, you can even try binding to that image here.",
          "zh": "如果你真的想講究，甚至可以試著繫結到這裡的圖片。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 32.27,
          "end": 34.85,
          "en": "But we'll do this together thereafter, of course.",
          "zh": "但我們之後當然會一起做。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 34.85,
          "end": 36.05,
          "en": "And not just that.",
          "zh": "而且不只那樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 36.05,
          "end": 41.03,
          "en": "We'll also do the job title and description thing together, but here's your chance to pause the video,",
          "zh": "我們也會一起做 job title 和 description，但這裡是你暫停影片的機會，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 41.03,
          "end": 44.18,
          "en": "try these things on your own, and then we'll do it together.",
          "zh": "自己試試這些，然後我們再一起做。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 46.43,
          "end": 47.84,
          "en": "Were you successful?",
          "zh": "你成功了嗎？"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 47.87,
          "end": 49.82,
          "en": "Well, let's try together.",
          "zh": "我們一起試試。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 49.85,
          "end": 55.06,
          "en": "Let's start with the job title and the description in the contact card component.",
          "zh": "讓我們從 ContactCard 元件裡的 job title 和 description 開始。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 55.07,
          "end": 58.34,
          "en": "I want to use them and I want to set them from outside.",
          "zh": "我想使用它們，而且想從外面設定它們。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 58.37,
          "end": 64.61,
          "en": "Hence we add them as variables, but not as normal variables, but as exported variables so that we",
          "zh": "因此我們把它們加為變數，但不是一般變數，而是匯出的變數，這樣我們"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 64.61,
          "end": 71.45,
          "en": "can set them from outside because Svelte understands this syntax and makes these bindable properties.",
          "zh": "可以從外面設定，因為 Svelte 看得懂這個語法，並讓這些成為可繫結屬性。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 71.53999999999999,
          "end": 77.83,
          "en": "So here I'll have my job title and I'll also export my description.",
          "zh": "所以這裡我會有 jobTitle，我也匯出 description。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 77.84,
          "end": 80.72,
          "en": "The names you choose here are totally up to you.",
          "zh": "你在這裡選擇的名稱完全由你決定。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 82.07,
          "end": 85.69,
          "en": "Now let's use that down there to bind this dynamically.",
          "zh": "現在讓我們在下面使用它，動態繫結。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 85.7,
          "end": 88.13,
          "en": "Here I want to bind to job title.",
          "zh": "這裡我想繫結到 jobTitle。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 88.13,
          "end": 91.28,
          "en": "And here I want to bind to description.",
          "zh": "這裡我想繫結到 description。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 92.50999999999999,
          "end": 94.43,
          "en": "Now the bindings are set up.",
          "zh": "現在繫結設定好了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 94.46000000000001,
          "end": 98.6,
          "en": "Of course, we now have to pass in these values and for that we need more inputs.",
          "zh": "當然，我們現在必須傳入這些值，為此我們需要更多輸入欄。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 98.6,
          "end": 106.34,
          "en": "One more input for the job title and for this here in the apps world file, I'll add my title.",
          "zh": "再一個輸入欄給 job title，為此在 App.svelte 檔案裡，我會加我的 title。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 106.34,
          "end": 107.93,
          "en": "You could name it job title here too.",
          "zh": "你也可以在這裡把它命名為 jobTitle。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 107.93,
          "end": 114.06,
          "en": "I'm just using different names to make it really clear where I'm using which variable.",
          "zh": "我只是用不同名稱，讓我清楚哪裡用哪個變數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 114.08,
          "end": 116.09,
          "en": "So here I have my title.",
          "zh": "所以這裡我有 title。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 116.91,
          "end": 119.13,
          "en": "And this could be an empty string initially.",
          "zh": "這一開始可以是空字串。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 119.31,
          "end": 124.71,
          "en": "And I also have my description, and this can also be an empty string initially.",
          "zh": "我也有 description，這也一開始可以是空字串。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 126.08,
          "end": 130.32,
          "en": "Now with that, let's bind it down there.",
          "zh": "有了這些，讓我們在下面繫結。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 130.34,
          "end": 133.19,
          "en": "The second input should be bound to title.",
          "zh": "第二個 input 應該繫結到 title。"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 133.19,
          "end": 139.76,
          "en": "And then I'll add a text area here where I don't need any of that.",
          "zh": "然後我在這裡加一個 textarea，我不需要那些。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 139.76,
          "end": 141.29,
          "en": "Just give it three rows.",
          "zh": "只要給它三列。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 141.29,
          "end": 143.63,
          "en": "And also you can use bind there.",
          "zh": "你也可以在那裡用 bind。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 143.66,
          "end": 145.82,
          "en": "Bind it to.",
          "zh": "把它繫結到"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 148.24,
          "end": 149.32,
          "en": "The description.",
          "zh": "description。"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 150.61,
          "end": 152.62,
          "en": "So now these values are all bound.",
          "zh": "所以現在這些值都繫結了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 152.65,
          "end": 156.01,
          "en": "Now let's make sure we're passing them into contact card.",
          "zh": "現在讓我們確保把它們傳進 ContactCard。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 156.13,
          "end": 166.18,
          "en": "For that here on contact card, I set job title equal to title and I set description.",
          "zh": "為此，在 ContactCard 上，我設 jobTitle 等於 title，並設 description"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 167.07,
          "end": 169.38,
          "en": "Equal to description.",
          "zh": "等於 description。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 169.38,
          "end": 169.89,
          "en": "And now here.",
          "zh": "現在這裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 169.89,
          "end": 174.72,
          "en": "Description on the right refers to the variable I use here in app Svelte description.",
          "zh": "右邊的 description 指的是我在 App.svelte 這裡使用的變數 description。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 174.72,
          "end": 180.18,
          "en": "On the left has to be the name of the variable I'm exporting in the contact card svelte file.",
          "zh": "左邊必須是我在 ContactCard.svelte 檔案裡匯出的變數名稱。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 181.05,
          "end": 182.52,
          "en": "Let's give this a try.",
          "zh": "讓我們試試。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 182.67,
          "end": 183.84,
          "en": "Super ugly here.",
          "zh": "這裡超醜。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 183.84,
          "end": 188.79,
          "en": "We'll take care about the styling soon, but let's check if that works.",
          "zh": "我們很快會處理樣式，但先看看是否有效。"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 189.82,
          "end": 192.3,
          "en": "I do teach web development.",
          "zh": "我教網頁開發。"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 192.31,
          "end": 194.65,
          "en": "That's looking pretty good to me.",
          "zh": "對我來說看起來相當不錯。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 194.68,
          "end": 199.21,
          "en": "Now, let's finish up this little exercise by making sure we can also use an image.",
          "zh": "現在，讓我們完成這個小練習，確保我們也能使用圖片。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 199.21,
          "end": 205.18,
          "en": "And for that, again, I'll add another input here where I want to bind to image.",
          "zh": "為此，我再在這裡加一個 input，我想繫結到 image。"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 205.18,
          "end": 206.8,
          "en": "So now I'm back in app svelte.",
          "zh": "所以我回到 App.svelte。"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 206.8,
          "end": 212.88,
          "en": "I'm binding to image because here for the moment we'll just enter an image URL.",
          "zh": "我繫結到 image，因為目前我們只會輸入圖片 URL。"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 212.89,
          "end": 216.34,
          "en": "So here I'm having my image variable, which is an empty string.",
          "zh": "所以這裡我有 image 變數，它是空字串。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 216.34,
          "end": 222.25,
          "en": "I'm binding to that in the input so that I can enter a copy and paste in a URL to an image in the web.",
          "zh": "我在 input 裡繫結到它，這樣我可以輸入、貼上一個網路上的圖片 URL。"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 222.25,
          "end": 225.1,
          "en": "And then I want to pass that down to the contact card.",
          "zh": "然後我想把它傳下去給 ContactCard。"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 225.1,
          "end": 232.69,
          "en": "So here I'll add a new variable user image, and that user image can be used here on the source.",
          "zh": "所以這裡我加一個新變數 userImage，而 userImage 可以用在 source 上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 233.41,
          "end": 234.67000000000002,
          "en": "You saw that before.",
          "zh": "你之前看過。"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 234.67000000000002,
          "end": 238.72,
          "en": "You can set values on attributes and properties as well, just like that.",
          "zh": "你也可以像這樣在屬性上設定值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 238.81,
          "end": 241.93,
          "en": "So here I'm using user image.",
          "zh": "所以這裡我使用 userImage。"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 243.96,
          "end": 245.16,
          "en": "Let's remove that for the moment.",
          "zh": "讓我們暫時拿掉那個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 245.16,
          "end": 246.78,
          "en": "We don't need it at the moment.",
          "zh": "我們目前不需要它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 247.39,
          "end": 251.38,
          "en": "And user image here is now set from outside.",
          "zh": "而這裡的 userImage 現在從外面設定。"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 251.5,
          "end": 253.15,
          "en": "We now save this.",
          "zh": "我們現在存檔。"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 254.14,
          "end": 257.53,
          "en": "Uh, we see no image here because we loaded No image yet.",
          "zh": "呃，我們這裡看不到圖片，因為我們還沒載入圖片。"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 258.09,
          "end": 261.45,
          "en": "But let's grab an image and I will quickly Google myself.",
          "zh": "但讓我們抓一張圖片，我會很快用 Google 搜尋我自己。"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 261.48,
          "end": 264.51,
          "en": "Of course, you can search for any person you want.",
          "zh": "當然，你可以搜尋任何你想要的人。"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 265.39,
          "end": 267.62,
          "en": "Let me grab that image from Linked in here.",
          "zh": "讓我從這裡的 LinkedIn 抓那張圖片。"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 267.7,
          "end": 269.17,
          "en": "If I copy that.",
          "zh": "如果我複製它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 270.85,
          "end": 271.99,
          "en": "Into here.",
          "zh": "到這裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 272.90999999999997,
          "end": 273.98,
          "en": "Doesn't work.",
          "zh": "不行。"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 273.99,
          "end": 275.73,
          "en": "I'm outputting user image here.",
          "zh": "我在這裡輸出 userImage。"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 275.73,
          "end": 276.63,
          "en": "User image.",
          "zh": "userImage。"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 276.63,
          "end": 278.37,
          "en": "Well, of course we have to pass it down.",
          "zh": "當然我們必須把它傳下去。"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 278.37,
          "end": 278.7,
          "en": "Right?",
          "zh": "對吧？"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 278.7,
          "end": 285.33,
          "en": "So here on Contact Card, the apps well file, let's refer to the image variable here and pass that",
          "zh": "所以在 ContactCard 上，App.svelte 檔案裡，讓我們參照這裡的 image 變數，並把它傳"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 285.33,
          "end": 285.65999999999997,
          "en": "down.",
          "zh": "下去。"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 285.65999999999997,
          "end": 288.42,
          "en": "By the way, it's getting super long as it is here.",
          "zh": "順帶一提，它在這裡變得超長。"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 288.42,
          "end": 291.81,
          "en": "You can also split that across multiple lines.",
          "zh": "你也可以把它拆成多行。"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 295.36,
          "end": 296.53,
          "en": "Just like that.",
          "zh": "就像這樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 297.84000000000003,
          "end": 298.95,
          "en": "Save this.",
          "zh": "存檔。"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 300.06,
          "end": 301.77,
          "en": "And now let me try this again.",
          "zh": "現在讓我再試一次。"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 301.8,
          "end": 303.69,
          "en": "Here is my image.",
          "zh": "這是我的圖片。"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 303.78,
          "end": 307.62,
          "en": "And of course, I can enter the rest as well.",
          "zh": "當然，我也可以填其餘的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 307.8,
          "end": 315.3,
          "en": "I do teach web development and a little bit of styling enhancement here, of course, totally optional.",
          "zh": "我教網頁開發，這裡有一點樣式加強，當然完全是選擇性的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 315.33,
          "end": 316.92,
          "en": "But here on that.",
          "zh": "但在那個上面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 318.07,
          "end": 319.36,
          "en": "User data.",
          "zh": "使用者資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 319.84,
          "end": 326.14,
          "en": "I'll add a little bit of padding to the left of one REM just to have some distance here.",
          "zh": "我會在左側加一點 padding，1rem，只是為了這裡有些距離。"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 328.29,
          "end": 330.09,
          "en": "Between the image and my text.",
          "zh": "在圖片和我的文字之間。"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 330.21,
          "end": 337.47,
          "en": "So this is now how we can also bind to to an image or to an attribute in general.",
          "zh": "所以現在我們也可以這樣繫結到圖片，或一般來說繫結到屬性。"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 337.68,
          "end": 345.48,
          "en": "However, what you should also do, just as a side note, is of course supply alt text here so that",
          "zh": "不過，你也應該做的，只是附帶一提，當然是在這裡提供 alt 文字，這樣"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 345.48,
          "end": 350.34000000000003,
          "en": "you do also provide some content for people with screen readers and so on.",
          "zh": "你也為使用螢幕閱讀器的人提供一些內容等等。"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 350.34000000000003,
          "end": 353.52,
          "en": "And here I'll just use my user name.",
          "zh": "這裡我就用我的使用者名稱。"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 353.73,
          "end": 356.07,
          "en": "So this is more dynamic binding.",
          "zh": "所以這是更多的動態繫結。"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 356.07,
          "end": 358.65,
          "en": "It's not all we can learn about that though.",
          "zh": "不過我們能學的還不只這些。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "14689502",
      "title": "Using Self-Extending Properties",
      "lectureOrder": 19,
      "videoOrder": 17,
      "sourceHash": "0618188eda1ac1b26c7ea33b00953d5bf2a3d6bcc2b3779109d0246dfc836a09",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.11,
          "end": 3.22,
          "en": "In svelte.",
          "zh": "在 Svelte 裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.25,
          "end": 10.15,
          "en": "If we go back to the app svelte file, if you have property assignments like this where on an element,",
          "zh": "如果我們回到 App.svelte 檔案，如果你有像這樣的屬性賦值，在一個元素上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 10.18,
          "end": 17.05,
          "en": "no matter if it's a custom component like it is here, or if it's a normal HTML element, if you have",
          "zh": "不管它是像這裡這樣的自訂元件，還是一般的 HTML 元素，如果你有"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 17.08,
          "end": 25.75,
          "en": "a property or an attribute which has the same name as the value, then Svelte allows you to use a shortcut",
          "zh": "一個屬性或特性，名稱和值相同，那麼 Svelte 允許你用捷徑，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 25.75,
          "end": 29.77,
          "en": "instead of using description equals description, which you can do.",
          "zh": "而不必寫 description 等於 description，雖然你可以這樣做。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 29.77,
          "end": 35.02,
          "en": "But instead of doing that, you can just use curly brace description like this.",
          "zh": "但與其那樣做，你可以像這樣只寫大括號 description。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 35.14,
          "end": 41.68,
          "en": "And if you know modern JavaScript syntax, especially object destructuring, then this might look familiar",
          "zh": "如果你知道現代 JavaScript 語法，尤其是物件解構，那麼這看起來可能"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 41.68,
          "end": 42.12,
          "en": "to you.",
          "zh": "很熟悉。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 42.13,
          "end": 47.56,
          "en": "It's simply a shortcut understood by svelte, which means yeah, the variable is named description.",
          "zh": "它只是 Svelte 看得懂的捷徑，意思是，這個變數名叫 description。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 47.59,
          "end": 53.32,
          "en": "The property to which I want to assign that variable is conveniently also named description.",
          "zh": "我想把那個變數指派給的屬性，剛好也叫 description。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 53.32,
          "end": 56.57,
          "en": "So this is basically to what this should be extended.",
          "zh": "所以這基本上就是它應該展開成的樣子。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 56.59,
          "end": 59.67,
          "en": "So that's a little shortcut you can but you don't have to use.",
          "zh": "所以這是一個小捷徑，你可以用，但不必用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 59.68,
          "end": 62.33,
          "en": "And of course it's not something I wanted to hide from you.",
          "zh": "當然這不是我想對你隱瞞的東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 62.33,
          "end": 63.68,
          "en": "So definitely be aware of this.",
          "zh": "所以一定要知道這件事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 63.68,
          "end": 66.35,
          "en": "And don't wonder if you see me use this throughout the course.",
          "zh": "如果你在這門課裡看到我使用它，不要覺得奇怪。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 66.35,
          "end": 68.18,
          "en": "Feel free to do so on your own.",
          "zh": "你自己也可以放心這樣做。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "14689504",
      "title": "Outputting HTML Content",
      "lectureOrder": 20,
      "videoOrder": 18,
      "sourceHash": "d7326547b2f7845a5984bf687a3a2b24f4a8738fe8c295e0017bc059b04fb995",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.16,
          "end": 5.58,
          "en": "One other thing you should know about.",
          "zh": "還有一件事你應該知道。"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 6.54,
          "end": 13.65,
          "en": "Bindings is that if you decide that you want to output some HTML content, let's say here in the description",
          "zh": "繫結是，如果你決定想輸出一些 HTML 內容，假設這裡在描述裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 13.92,
          "end": 15.96,
          "en": "you want to say this is.",
          "zh": "你想說 this is。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 17.52,
          "end": 24.48,
          "en": "Important and you use the strong tags for that to use to get some bold text here.",
          "zh": "Important，而你用 strong 標籤來得到這裡一些粗體文字。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 24.51,
          "end": 27.87,
          "en": "You see that instead the HTML tags are output.",
          "zh": "你看到的反而是 HTML 標籤被輸出。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 27.87,
          "end": 35.49,
          "en": "So when you have HTML code and you want to output that dynamically and want to have it treated as HTML",
          "zh": "所以當你有 HTML 程式碼，而你想動態輸出它，並想讓它被當成 HTML"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 35.52,
          "end": 38.34,
          "en": "instead of text, then this doesn't work.",
          "zh": "而不是文字，那麼這樣行不通。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 38.37,
          "end": 42.93,
          "en": "Now, let me emphasize that this is a good default behavior.",
          "zh": "現在，讓我強調這是好的預設行為。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 42.96,
          "end": 43.68,
          "en": "Why?",
          "zh": "為什麼？"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 43.71,
          "end": 48.15,
          "en": "Because it protects you against cross-site scripting attacks.",
          "zh": "因為它保護你免於跨站腳本攻擊。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 48.24,
          "end": 56.25,
          "en": "If Svelte would automatically treat everything as HTML code and output it as such, then you would be",
          "zh": "如果 Svelte 自動把一切都當成 HTML 程式碼並那樣輸出，那麼你會"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 56.25,
          "end": 59.55,
          "en": "very vulnerable to cross-site scripting attacks.",
          "zh": "非常容易受到跨站腳本攻擊。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 59.58,
          "end": 66.36,
          "en": "Let's say this is a real, maybe more beautiful application we're building and users may enter content",
          "zh": "假設這是一個真正的、也許更漂亮的應用程式，我們正在建立，而使用者可能在這裡輸入內容"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 66.36,
          "end": 66.87,
          "en": "here.",
          "zh": "這裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 67.05,
          "end": 73.11,
          "en": "Now, if that content is automatically executed as HTML code, then they can of course also add some",
          "zh": "現在，如果那個內容自動被當作 HTML 程式碼執行，那麼他們當然也可以加一些"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 73.11,
          "end": 74.58,
          "en": "script tags in there.",
          "zh": "script 標籤在裡面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 74.78999999999999,
          "end": 76.68,
          "en": "And for example, throw an alert.",
          "zh": "而例如，丟出一個 alert。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 76.71000000000001,
          "end": 77.5,
          "en": "Hello.",
          "zh": "Hello。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 78.28,
          "end": 79.94,
          "en": "Now here, this does not work.",
          "zh": "現在這裡，這行不通。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 79.94,
          "end": 83.08,
          "en": "It doesn't cause any harm because it's treated as text.",
          "zh": "它不會造成任何傷害，因為它被當成文字。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 83.28999999999999,
          "end": 90.01,
          "en": "Now, of course, you have scenarios where you want to output something as HTML code and have it treated",
          "zh": "現在當然，你有一些情況想把某樣東西當成 HTML 程式碼輸出，並讓它被當成"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 90.01,
          "end": 91.12,
          "en": "as HTML code.",
          "zh": "HTML 程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 91.15,
          "end": 97.39,
          "en": "You should always ensure that this output content is sanitized in such cases so that you make sure it's",
          "zh": "你應該永遠確保在這種情況輸出的內容被清理過，這樣你確定它是"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 97.39,
          "end": 101.43,
          "en": "safe that you can trust it because well does not check it for you.",
          "zh": "安全的、你可以信任它，因為 Svelte 不會替你檢查。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 101.44,
          "end": 107.28999999999999,
          "en": "So you should make sure that whenever you output content as HTML, it's from a safe source.",
          "zh": "所以你應該確保每當你把內容當成 HTML 輸出，它來自安全的來源。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 107.28999999999999,
          "end": 110.25999999999999,
          "en": "And it's it was sanitized.",
          "zh": "而且它被清理過。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 110.25999999999999,
          "end": 117.16,
          "en": "It does not contain any script text unless you want it to have, but really make sure you protect yourself",
          "zh": "它不含任何 script 標籤，除非你想要它有，但真的要確保你在那裡保護自己"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 117.16,
          "end": 117.69,
          "en": "there.",
          "zh": "那裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 117.7,
          "end": 123.67,
          "en": "But if you then know that you want to output this as HTML, you can do so here.",
          "zh": "但如果你那時知道你想把這個當成 HTML 輸出，你可以在這裡這樣做。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 123.85,
          "end": 127.6,
          "en": "When we say description should actually be treated as HTML code.",
          "zh": "當我們說 description 其實應該被當成 HTML 程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 129.12,
          "end": 130.47,
          "en": "Then you can just add.",
          "zh": "然後你只要加上"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 130.47,
          "end": 131.07,
          "en": "Add.",
          "zh": "@"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 132.05,
          "end": 134.09,
          "en": "xHTML in front of it.",
          "zh": "html 在它前面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 134.18,
          "end": 138.89,
          "en": "This again is a special syntax picked up by svelte and it tells svelte.",
          "zh": "這再次是 Svelte 會接收的特殊語法，而它告訴 Svelte。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 138.92000000000002,
          "end": 141.68,
          "en": "Well the result of this statement.",
          "zh": "嗯這個陳述式的結果。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 141.68,
          "end": 148.82,
          "en": "So in this case the value of this variable should not be output as text here, but it should be inserted",
          "zh": "所以在這個例子，這個變數的值不應該在這裡被當成文字輸出，而應該被插入"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 148.82,
          "end": 151.4,
          "en": "as HTML into the Dom.",
          "zh": "作為 HTML 進 DOM。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 151.88,
          "end": 154.85,
          "en": "What this means is that if we now save that.",
          "zh": "這意思是如果我們現在存檔。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 156.2,
          "end": 162.77,
          "en": "And I enter text here that of course still works because it's now entered as a text HTML node, but",
          "zh": "而我在這裡輸入文字，那當然仍然行得通，因為它現在被輸入成一個文字 HTML 節點，但"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 162.77,
          "end": 164.86,
          "en": "that still is displayed as text.",
          "zh": "那仍然顯示為文字。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 165.8,
          "end": 173.03,
          "en": "But I can also now use HTML tags in there like this.",
          "zh": "但我現在也可以在裡面使用 HTML 標籤，像這樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 180.32,
          "end": 186.32,
          "en": "See, it's not bold because I haven't downloaded the font for this, but it's red, so this is really",
          "zh": "看，它不是粗體，因為我還沒下載這個字型，但它是紅色的，所以這真的被"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 186.32,
          "end": 187.7,
          "en": "treated as HTML.",
          "zh": "當成 HTML。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 187.88,
          "end": 192.2,
          "en": "We could now also do the bad things and run some script code in there.",
          "zh": "我們現在也可以做壞事，並在裡面跑一些 script 程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 192.2,
          "end": 197.45,
          "en": "Here it won't work because we're typing it character by character and it's getting inserted dynamically",
          "zh": "這裡它不會運作，因為我們一個字元一個字元地打，而它被動態插入"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 197.45,
          "end": 198.44,
          "en": "into a paragraph.",
          "zh": "進一個段落。"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 198.44,
          "end": 200.3,
          "en": "But in other places this would work.",
          "zh": "但在其他地方這會運作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 200.3,
          "end": 203.42000000000002,
          "en": "That is why you should always be careful about that.",
          "zh": "那就是為什麼你應該永遠小心那個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 203.72,
          "end": 210.11,
          "en": "I will go back and revert this and only output text here because here I really don't need the HTML functionality.",
          "zh": "我會回去還原這個，並在這裡只輸出文字，因為這裡我真的不需要 HTML 功能。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "14689506",
      "title": "Setting Dynamic CSS Classes",
      "lectureOrder": 22,
      "videoOrder": 19,
      "sourceHash": "2f1d1d5c08718f9245bca08719aa4f1e54bc442c855bcc1e9bddf073ea7556dc",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.03,
          "end": 5.48,
          "en": "Now, we already learned a lot about the base syntax of Svelte.",
          "zh": "現在，我們已經學了很多 Svelte 的基礎語法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.48,
          "end": 11.75,
          "en": "Before concluding this section, let me dive into the dynamic styles I mentioned earlier on a slide",
          "zh": "在為這個區段做結之前，讓我深入我稍早在投影片上提到的動態樣式"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 11.75,
          "end": 13.7,
          "en": "because that is a thing.",
          "zh": "因為那是一件事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 13.7,
          "end": 21.83,
          "en": "You might have a use case or you might have a scenario where you need to dynamically add or remove a",
          "zh": "你可能有一個使用情況，或你可能有一個情境，需要動態加上或移除一個"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 21.83,
          "end": 23,
          "en": "CSS class.",
          "zh": "CSS class。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 23.15,
          "end": 25.55,
          "en": "And an example could be our image.",
          "zh": "而一個例子可以是我們的圖片。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 25.55,
          "end": 31.82,
          "en": "If we don't have an image and here I don't have one, for example, then we maybe don't want to output",
          "zh": "如果我們沒有圖片，而這裡我例如沒有，那麼我們也許不想輸出"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 31.82,
          "end": 37.25,
          "en": "this not so beautiful placeholder but instead have a solid background color.",
          "zh": "這個不太漂亮的佔位，而是有一個實心背景色。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 37.49,
          "end": 44.72,
          "en": "Now there are different ways of achieving this, but one way would be that we add different classes",
          "zh": "現在有不同方式做到這個，但一個方式是我們加上不同的 class"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 44.72,
          "end": 52.85,
          "en": "here to the thumbnail because to the thumbnail class, if I add a background of, let's say this gray,",
          "zh": "這裡到縮圖，因為對 thumbnail class，如果我加一個背景，假設這個灰色，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 52.94,
          "end": 59.42,
          "en": "then we have this as a background color here right now, I don't want to add that style conditional",
          "zh": "那麼我們現在這裡有這個當背景色，我不想有條件地加那個樣式"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 59.42,
          "end": 60.26,
          "en": "here, though.",
          "zh": "在這裡，不過。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 60.65,
          "end": 64.8,
          "en": "Even though we could do this as well, but instead, let's add a new class.",
          "zh": "即使我們也可以這樣做，但相對地，讓我們加一個新 class。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 65.61,
          "end": 66.36,
          "en": "Thump.",
          "zh": "thumb"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 67.78,
          "end": 68.41,
          "en": "Placeholder.",
          "zh": "placeholder。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 68.41,
          "end": 74.23,
          "en": "Maybe name is totally up to you and that will simply have that background color.",
          "zh": "也許名稱完全由你決定，而那會單純有那個背景色。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 74.26,
          "end": 81.22,
          "en": "Now the goal is to add this class here to this div whenever we have no image yet.",
          "zh": "現在目標是每當我們還沒有圖片，就把這個 class 加到這個 div。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 81.22,
          "end": 84.22,
          "en": "So whenever image is null or undefined.",
          "zh": "所以每當 image 是 null 或 undefined。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 84.25,
          "end": 86.35,
          "en": "Now it is undefined initially, right?",
          "zh": "現在它一開始是 undefined，對吧？"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 86.35,
          "end": 92.22999999999999,
          "en": "It's user image here is undefined initially as long as we haven't entered one in the app svelte file.",
          "zh": "這裡的 userImage 一開始是 undefined，只要我們還沒在 App.svelte 檔案裡輸入一個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 92.74000000000001,
          "end": 100.6,
          "en": "Now to add a class dynamically, we can simply go here and we have our class already.",
          "zh": "現在要動態加一個 class，我們可以單純到這裡，而我們已經有 class。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 100.63,
          "end": 108.72999999999999,
          "en": "Now we could of course write some code here to attach a different set of CSS classes based on a different",
          "zh": "現在我們當然可以在這裡寫一些程式碼，根據不同的條件附上不同的一組 CSS class，基於不同的"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 108.88,
          "end": 110.22999999999999,
          "en": "on different conditions.",
          "zh": "不同條件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 111.50999999999999,
          "end": 111.99000000000001,
          "en": "For this.",
          "zh": "為此。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 111.99000000000001,
          "end": 117.42,
          "en": "Let's add quotes here and then curly braces so that we can write some JavaScript code and now we can",
          "zh": "讓我們在這裡加引號，然後加大括號，這樣我們可以寫一些 JavaScript 程式碼，而現在我們可以"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 117.42,
          "end": 118.75,
          "en": "check a condition.",
          "zh": "檢查一個條件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 118.77000000000001,
          "end": 125.64,
          "en": "We can check if user image is true ish and null and undefined is automatically false ish.",
          "zh": "我們可以檢查 userImage 是否為 truthy，而 null 和 undefined 自動是 falsy。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 125.64,
          "end": 127.08,
          "en": "So user image.",
          "zh": "所以 userImage。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 127.09,
          "end": 129.92,
          "en": "And now let's use a ternary expression question mark.",
          "zh": "而現在讓我們用三元運算式，問號。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 129.93,
          "end": 135.45,
          "en": "So if user image is true, then we want to use thumb as a class.",
          "zh": "所以如果 userImage 是 true，那麼我們想用 thumb 當作 class。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 135.45,
          "end": 139.74,
          "en": "Otherwise we want to use thumb and thumb placeholder.",
          "zh": "否則我們想用 thumb 和 thumb placeholder。"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 139.89,
          "end": 144.12,
          "en": "So what this does is it uses a ternary expression, checks user image.",
          "zh": "所以這做的是使用三元運算式，檢查 userImage。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 144.12,
          "end": 150.45,
          "en": "We could compare this to true or to false, but we can also just write user image and then automatically",
          "zh": "我們可以把這個和 true 或 false 比較，但我們也可以只寫 userImage，然後自動"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 150.45,
          "end": 152.64,
          "en": "JavaScript will compare this to true.",
          "zh": "JavaScript 會把這個和 true 比較。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 152.64,
          "end": 155.78,
          "en": "And by default this is undefined, which is treated as false.",
          "zh": "而預設這是 undefined，被當成 false。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 155.79,
          "end": 158.55,
          "en": "If it were true, we would add the thumb class.",
          "zh": "如果它是 true，我們會加 thumb class。"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 158.55,
          "end": 162.72,
          "en": "But if it is false, we add the thumb class and the thumb placeholder class.",
          "zh": "但如果它是 false，我們加 thumb class 和 thumb placeholder class。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 162.75,
          "end": 167.1,
          "en": "Therefore, if we save that and it reloads, we have this value here.",
          "zh": "因此，如果我們存檔而它重新載入，我們這裡有這個值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 167.1,
          "end": 171.34,
          "en": "But as soon as we enter something, this is gone and we just have the image.",
          "zh": "但一旦我們輸入某樣東西，這個就消失，而我們只剩圖片。"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 171.34,
          "end": 178.48,
          "en": "And to prove that the class is gone, if we inspect that thumb here, that div, you just see thumb",
          "zh": "而為了證明 class 消失了，如果我們檢查這裡這個 thumb、那個 div，你只看到 thumb"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 178.48,
          "end": 184.6,
          "en": "being added here and the svelte Autogenerated class, but you don't see the thumb placeholder anywhere.",
          "zh": "被加在這裡，以及 Svelte 自動產生的 class，但你哪裡都看不到 thumb placeholder。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 184.72,
          "end": 189.79,
          "en": "And if I remove this, on the other hand, then you see thumb and thumb placeholder.",
          "zh": "而另一方面如果我移掉這個，那麼你看到 thumb 和 thumb placeholder。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 190.06,
          "end": 193.18,
          "en": "So this is how that works.",
          "zh": "所以這就是它怎麼運作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 194.25,
          "end": 195.96,
          "en": "It's a pretty long syntax.",
          "zh": "這是相當長的語法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 196.79,
          "end": 200.48,
          "en": "An alternative is that we simply add the classes we always want to add.",
          "zh": "另一個做法是我們單純加上我們永遠想加的 class。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 200.48,
          "end": 202.55,
          "en": "And then there's a special.",
          "zh": "然後有一個特殊的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 203.12,
          "end": 203.96,
          "en": "Syntax.",
          "zh": "語法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 203.96,
          "end": 208.22,
          "en": "Svelte understands we use class again, but then a colon thereafter.",
          "zh": "Svelte 理解，我們再次使用 class，但之後加一個冒號。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 208.22,
          "end": 211.94,
          "en": "And now the name of the class which we want to add conditionally.",
          "zh": "而現在是我們想有條件加上的 class 名稱。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 212.27,
          "end": 216.02,
          "en": "So some placeholder, for example.",
          "zh": "所以例如 placeholder。"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 216.14,
          "end": 223.07,
          "en": "And then between our curly braces on the right, we just have to condition the condition is that the",
          "zh": "然後在右邊我們的大括號之間，我們只要寫條件，條件是"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 223.07,
          "end": 226.28,
          "en": "user image is not true, hence the exclamation mark.",
          "zh": "userImage 不是 true，因此是驚嘆號。"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 226.65,
          "end": 233.45,
          "en": "Now with this syntax, get the same behavior as before, but now a little bit shorter, maybe a little",
          "zh": "現在用這個語法，得到和之前一樣的行為，但現在短一點，也許"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 233.45,
          "end": 234.71,
          "en": "bit easier to understand.",
          "zh": "好理解一點。"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 234.71,
          "end": 235.88,
          "en": "So that's also worth noting.",
          "zh": "所以那也值得注意。"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 235.88,
          "end": 242.48,
          "en": "There is this special class instruction or directive is the official name which you can use even if",
          "zh": "有這個特殊的 class 指令，官方名稱是 directive，即使"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 242.48,
          "end": 247.57,
          "en": "you already have a class on there to control whether this class gets added or not.",
          "zh": "你那裡已經有一個 class，你也可以用它來控制這個 class 是否被加上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 247.58,
          "end": 253.67,
          "en": "And this is quite common scenario that you want to add CSS classes dynamically based on some other condition.",
          "zh": "而這是相當常見的情況，你想根據某個其他條件動態加上 CSS class。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "14689510",
      "title": "Wrap Up",
      "lectureOrder": 23,
      "videoOrder": 20,
      "sourceHash": "32c015b88870cb14f5ffa938744a2b48376ec33230370ed62580be2220db21f0",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.25,
          "end": 4.66,
          "en": "That's it for this module.",
          "zh": "這個單元就到這裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.7,
          "end": 9.78,
          "en": "I would agree that we can improve the styling up there and I will do this off screen to prepare you",
          "zh": "我同意我們可以改善上面的樣式，而我會在螢幕外做這個，來為你準備"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 9.78,
          "end": 11.51,
          "en": "for the next module.",
          "zh": "下一個單元。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.52,
          "end": 15.41,
          "en": "But what we learned here was really helpful and important.",
          "zh": "但我們在這裡學的真的有幫助也很重要。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 15.42,
          "end": 23.85,
          "en": "You learned a lot about svelte core syntax, how you can react to events, how you can bind values in",
          "zh": "你學了很多 Svelte 核心語法，你怎麼回應事件，你怎麼雙向繫結值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 23.88,
          "end": 30,
          "en": "two directions, how you can work with multiple components by importing and using them, and how you",
          "zh": "你怎麼藉由匯入和使用它們來處理多個元件，以及你"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 30,
          "end": 35.94,
          "en": "can pass data around between components, how you can output some content conditionally though we'll",
          "zh": "怎麼在元件之間傳遞資料，你怎麼有條件地輸出一些內容，不過我們會"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 35.94,
          "end": 42.98,
          "en": "dive deeper into this later in the course and hopefully the core idea and base syntax is clear now.",
          "zh": "在課程稍後更深入這個，希望核心想法和基礎語法現在清楚了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 42.99,
          "end": 48.51,
          "en": "Now of course, we'll keep on using that throughout the course and then the next section we'll dig even",
          "zh": "現在當然，我們會在整門課繼續使用那個，然後下一個區段我們會挖得更"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 48.51,
          "end": 54.99,
          "en": "deeper and learn more cool core features, which you have to know if you're building svelte applications.",
          "zh": "深，並學更多很酷的核心功能，如果你在建立 Svelte 應用程式，你必須知道。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 54.99,
          "end": 59.16,
          "en": "Most importantly, we'll dive into loops and conditionals.",
          "zh": "最重要的是，我們會深入迴圈和條件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 59.16,
          "end": 66.22,
          "en": "So how you could output entire chunks of HTML code only when a certain condition is met and how you",
          "zh": "所以你怎麼只在某個條件滿足時輸出整塊 HTML 程式碼，以及你"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 66.22,
          "end": 73.78,
          "en": "can easily replicate chunks of code in your markup without you having to write it over and over again.",
          "zh": "怎麼在標記裡輕鬆複製程式碼區塊，而不必一再重寫。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "14689524",
      "title": "Module Introduction",
      "lectureOrder": 25,
      "videoOrder": 21,
      "sourceHash": "4ea89c429cde3bf102dc675e29bf0a7b1c70d36347a91b2d176842d386fddb6e",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 1.91,
          "end": 9.89,
          "en": "Now that we had a thorough look at the core syntax of Svelte and some of its most basic features.",
          "zh": "現在我們徹底看過 Svelte 的核心語法，以及它一些最基本的功能。"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 9.89,
          "end": 16.43,
          "en": "Let's dive a bit deeper into all of that and let's have a look at conditionals and loops and what this",
          "zh": "讓我們更深入這一切，並看看條件和迴圈，以及這"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 16.43,
          "end": 18.73,
          "en": "is and how it helps us.",
          "zh": "是什麼、它怎麼幫助我們。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 18.74,
          "end": 19.73,
          "en": "In its essence.",
          "zh": "本質上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 19.73,
          "end": 28.22,
          "en": "This module will be about how we can render different chunks of markup of HTML code based on conditions",
          "zh": "這個單元會關於我們怎麼根據條件渲染不同區塊的標記、HTML 程式碼"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 28.22,
          "end": 31.82,
          "en": "and how we can also repeat chunks of markup.",
          "zh": "以及我們怎麼也能重複標記區塊。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 31.82,
          "end": 36.4,
          "en": "Let's say you're building a to do app where users can add to do's.",
          "zh": "假設你在建立一個待辦應用程式，使用者可以加待辦。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 36.41,
          "end": 41.9,
          "en": "Then for every new entry you want to add a new tag with the input the user entered.",
          "zh": "那麼對每一筆新項目，你想加一個新標籤，帶著使用者輸入的內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 41.9,
          "end": 46.97,
          "en": "And this is really simple with svelte, these are the things we'll dive into in this module.",
          "zh": "而用 Svelte 這真的很簡單，這些是我們在這個單元要深入的事。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "14689526",
      "title": "Using \"if\" Statements in HTML",
      "lectureOrder": 26,
      "videoOrder": 22,
      "sourceHash": "468ae8054d3fcec8db41bcfb7b5e9843ae453b012798c6678493135e0bf4ed82",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.22,
          "end": 7.68,
          "en": "Now, I changed some of the styles and a little bit of the markup of the project we finished in the",
          "zh": "現在，我改了一些樣式，以及我們在上一個"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 7.68,
          "end": 12.95,
          "en": "last course section, you'll find my version attached and I recommend that you continue with that.",
          "zh": "課程區段完成的專案的一點標記，你會找到我的版本附件，而我建議你用那個繼續。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 13.26,
          "end": 15.81,
          "en": "It's generally the same looks a bit nicer.",
          "zh": "它大體一樣，看起來好看一點。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 15.84,
          "end": 22.43,
          "en": "I removed some markup from APS Weld added a little bit of new markup and again changed some styles also",
          "zh": "我從 App.svelte 移掉一些標記，加了一點新標記，並再次改了一些樣式，也"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 22.47,
          "end": 23.82,
          "en": "in the Global Scissors Fall.",
          "zh": "在 global.css 檔案裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 23.95,
          "end": 30.69,
          "en": "Therefore, download Desertec project and simply replace your files with that or simply take my UNSNAPPED",
          "zh": "因此，下載附件專案，並單純用那個取代你的檔案，或單純把我解壓縮的"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 30.69,
          "end": 34.48,
          "en": "fall as a new project folder thereafter.",
          "zh": "資料夾當作新的專案資料夾。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 34.5,
          "end": 38.94,
          "en": "You should have something like this one to restarted your development server in case you're not seeing",
          "zh": "你應該有像這樣的東西，並重新啟動你的開發伺服器，以防你沒看到"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 38.94,
          "end": 39.67,
          "en": "these changes.",
          "zh": "這些改變。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 39.69,
          "end": 45.51,
          "en": "Always open your developer tools and reload by emptying the cache to make sure you do see all of that.",
          "zh": "永遠打開你的開發者工具，並清空快取重新載入，確保你確實看到這一切。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 46.23,
          "end": 50.98,
          "en": "And in general, this still works the same way it did before.",
          "zh": "而一般來說，這仍然和之前一樣運作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 51.66,
          "end": 54.39,
          "en": "Now, however, I want to make some changes.",
          "zh": "現在不過，我想做一些改變。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 55.05,
          "end": 60.77,
          "en": "For one, the goal now is that we don't fill out this card on the go here.",
          "zh": "其一，現在的目標是我們不要在這裡邊走邊填這張卡片。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 61.11,
          "end": 67.17,
          "en": "Instead, we should have a button which we can press and only when we press it, this card is generated",
          "zh": "相對地，我們應該有一個按鈕可以按，而只有當我們按它，這張卡片才被產生"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 67.17,
          "end": 68.19,
          "en": "and added here.",
          "zh": "並加到這裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 68.82,
          "end": 74.85,
          "en": "As long as we don't have it, we ever see that button or we see some text which tells us how to fill",
          "zh": "只要我們還沒有它，我們就看到那個按鈕，或我們看到一些文字告訴我們怎麼填"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 74.85,
          "end": 76.92,
          "en": "out this form, whatever your application needs.",
          "zh": "這個表單，隨你的應用程式需要。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 77.32,
          "end": 83.13,
          "en": "Once you did press the button while we do show this card and maybe we even add a check to find out whether",
          "zh": "一旦你按了按鈕，我們才顯示這張卡片，而也許我們甚至加一個檢查，找出是否"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 83.13,
          "end": 84.84,
          "en": "all these values were added.",
          "zh": "所有這些值都被加上了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 85.02,
          "end": 89.4,
          "en": "So did we only add the card if we do have values that populated?",
          "zh": "所以我們是否只有在有填入的值時才加卡片？"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 90.19,
          "end": 94.49000000000001,
          "en": "And for this, we need to output content conditionally.",
          "zh": "而為此，我們需要有條件地輸出內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 95.2,
          "end": 97.22999999999999,
          "en": "Now, how does this work?",
          "zh": "現在，這怎麼運作？"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 97.24000000000001,
          "end": 99.37,
          "en": "What does conditional output mean?",
          "zh": "條件輸出是什麼意思？"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 99.88,
          "end": 101.62,
          "en": "Let's start really simple here.",
          "zh": "讓我們在這裡從非常簡單開始。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 101.62,
          "end": 104.44,
          "en": "In upswept, we have to contact card.",
          "zh": "在 App.svelte，我們有聯絡人卡片。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 104.44,
          "end": 112.6,
          "en": "And as I just mentioned, it really only makes sense to output this contact card once we filled out",
          "zh": "而如我剛提到的，只有我們填完"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 112.6,
          "end": 120.37,
          "en": "all these inputs so we could ever dynamically do this and kind of use a dynamic expression.",
          "zh": "所有這些輸入，輸出這張聯絡人卡片才真的有意義，所以我們可以動態地做這個，並使用一個動態運算式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 120.55,
          "end": 128.68,
          "en": "So this dollar sign column thing to store, true or false in some variable, when all of these fields",
          "zh": "所以這個 $: 的東西，在某個變數裡存 true 或 false，當所有這些欄位"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 128.68,
          "end": 135.61,
          "en": "are non-empty or we add a button which the user has to press once he's done now, every approach is",
          "zh": "都不是空的，或我們加一個按鈕，使用者完成後必須按，現在每種做法都"
