        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 185.99,
          "end": 191.48,
          "en": "Now, we can use that function down here and point at it in our listener.",
          "zh": "現在，我們可以在下面使用那個函式，並在我們的監聽器裡指向它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 192.4,
          "end": 201.46,
          "en": "And should now toggle that or set this well to done now contact card should only be output here.",
          "zh": "而現在應該切換那個，或把這個設成 done，現在聯絡人卡片只應該在這裡被輸出。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 201.46,
          "end": 204.75,
          "en": "This Mark-Up piece should only be output when done is true.",
          "zh": "這段標記只應該在 done 是 true 時被輸出。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 205.27,
          "end": 209.77,
          "en": "And for this, wealth gives us a special piece of syntax we can use.",
          "zh": "而為此，Svelte 給我們一段可以使用的特殊語法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 210.4,
          "end": 217.63,
          "en": "We can use curly braces here, but now not to output some text or to point at a function but with a",
          "zh": "我們可以在這裡使用大括號，但現在不是為了輸出一些文字或指向一個函式，而是用一個"
