        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 217.63,
          "end": 218.35,
          "en": "hash tag.",
          "zh": "井號。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 218.35,
          "end": 225.13,
          "en": "At the beginning we create a so-called block statement, which simply means that this is now a statement",
          "zh": "在開頭我們建立一個所謂的區塊陳述式，意思單純是這現在是一個陳述式"
