        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 225.13,
          "end": 229.12,
          "en": "that affects multiple lines of our markup code here.",
          "zh": "會影響我們這裡標記程式碼的多行。"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 229.93,
          "end": 231.16,
          "en": "And then we add if.",
          "zh": "然後我們加 if。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 232.3,
          "end": 238.95,
          "en": "The keyword right after the hashtag without a blink, and it's in between, no white space, just hashtag",
          "zh": "關鍵字就在井號之後，中間沒有空白，沒有空白字元，只是井號"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 238.96,
          "end": 246.1,
          "en": "if this marks are if Bulloch statement here next, you have your condition like in a normal JavaScript,",
          "zh": "if，這標示我們這裡的 if 區塊陳述式，接著你有你的條件，像在一般的 JavaScript"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 246.1,
          "end": 247.54,
          "en": "if statement here.",
          "zh": "if 陳述式裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 247.54,
          "end": 256.12,
          "en": "My condition is if is if done is true or just done again, like a normal JavaScript does checks for",
          "zh": "我的條件是如果 done 是 true，或只是 done，再次，像一般 JavaScript 檢查"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 256.24,
          "end": 257.29,
          "en": "this being true.",
          "zh": "這個是否為 true。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 258.46,
          "end": 264.7,
          "en": "Next, you need to mark the end of this block statement so all the content in between will then only",
          "zh": "接著，你需要標示這個區塊陳述式的結尾，所以中間的所有內容那時只會"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 264.7,
          "end": 265.18,
          "en": "be shown.",
          "zh": "被顯示。"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 265.18,
          "end": 270.46,
          "en": "If this is true, you can have multiple pieces of marchman in there, multiple lines.",
          "zh": "如果這是 true，你可以在裡面有多段標記、多行。"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 270.46,
          "end": 272.8,
          "en": "You can have a paragraph if you needed here.",
          "zh": "如果你這裡需要，你可以有一個段落。"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 272.8,
          "end": 274.3,
          "en": "I only need the contact card.",
          "zh": "我只需要聯絡人卡片。"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 274.3,
          "end": 277.98,
          "en": "And to mark the end of this block, you add forward slash.",
          "zh": "而要標示這個區塊的結尾，你加斜線。"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 278.2,
          "end": 285.27,
          "en": "If this closes this if block now, anything in between will only be shown if this condition is true.",
          "zh": "if，這關閉這個 if 區塊，現在中間的任何東西只會在這個條件為 true 時顯示。"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 285.28,
          "end": 289.78,
          "en": "And of course you can all have multiple conditions with end and or in there if you need it.",
          "zh": "而當然如果你需要，你可以在裡面有多個條件，用 and 和 or。"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 291.67,
          "end": 298.42,
          "en": "So if that let's save all of that and what you see now is that the card is not there, only if I click",
          "zh": "所以那樣，讓我們把這一切存檔，而你現在看到的是卡片不在那裡，只有如果我點"
