        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 298.42,
          "end": 300.54,
          "en": "this button, it should appear.",
          "zh": "這個按鈕，它才應該出現。"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 300.79,
          "end": 305.23,
          "en": "It doesn't right now, because I'm setting Dunta Falls and ad contact.",
          "zh": "它現在沒有，因為我把 done 設成 false，在 addContact 裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 305.23,
          "end": 307.03,
          "en": "Of course, I want to set it to true here.",
          "zh": "當然，我想在這裡把它設成 true。"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 307.03,
          "end": 308.23,
          "en": "It's falls initially here.",
          "zh": "它在這裡一開始是 false。"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 308.23,
          "end": 309.46,
          "en": "It should be set to true.",
          "zh": "它應該被設成 true。"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 310.15,
          "end": 315.88,
          "en": "But with that, if I go back now, if you click that button, the card appears of course still empty",
          "zh": "但這樣，如果我現在回去，如果你點那個按鈕，卡片當然出現，仍然是空的"
