          "start": 315.88,
          "end": 320.32,
          "en": "because I have no check in place that would check whether all these fields are valid.",
          "zh": "因為我沒有檢查來確認所有這些欄位是否有效。"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 320.71,
          "end": 322.87,
          "en": "But nonetheless, we see it.",
          "zh": "但儘管如此，我們看到它。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "14689530",
      "title": "if, else & else-if",
      "lectureOrder": 27,
      "videoOrder": 23,
      "sourceHash": "c8793b1617a17a019dc848c4e776b5a913bb797ebc476e9f73dd37a0eda5e929",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.15,
          "end": 4.46,
          "en": "The current state is not optimal though.",
          "zh": "不過目前的狀態不是最好的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.49,
          "end": 11.57,
          "en": "I can click this button and I see the card, but I don't really check whether the user did enter valid",
          "zh": "我可以點這個按鈕並看到卡片，但我沒有真正檢查使用者是否輸入了有效的"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 11.57,
          "end": 12.41,
          "en": "input.",
          "zh": "輸入。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12.98,
          "end": 22.01,
          "en": "And therefore let's maybe change done to form state and set this to empty initially.",
          "zh": "因此讓我們也許把 done 改成 formState，並一開始把這個設成空的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 22.66,
          "end": 26.47,
          "en": "Here I want to set form state to done.",
          "zh": "這裡我想把 formState 設成 done。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 26.62,
          "end": 33.43,
          "en": "But I only want to do this if we made sure that these four variables do not hold empty strings.",
          "zh": "但我只想在我們確認這四個變數沒有持有空字串時才這樣做。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 33.52,
          "end": 40.48,
          "en": "For this I can add a if statement here in my normal JavaScript code and check if name trim to remove",
          "zh": "為此我可以在我的一般 JavaScript 程式碼裡加一個 if 陳述式，並檢查 name.trim，來移除"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 40.48,
          "end": 44.14,
          "en": "excess whitespace at the beginning and the end length.",
          "zh": "開頭和結尾多餘的空白，的長度。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 44.17,
          "end": 58.72,
          "en": "If that is equal to zero or if title trim length is equal to zero or if image trim length is equal to",
          "zh": "如果那個等於零，或如果 title.trim 的長度等於零，或如果 image.trim 的長度等於"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 58.72,
          "end": 66.19,
          "en": "zero or last condition if description trim length is equal to zero.",
          "zh": "零，或最後一個條件，如果 description.trim 的長度等於零。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 66.22,
          "end": 72.34,
          "en": "If any of these conditions here is met of these four conditions, then I know that this form is not",
          "zh": "如果這裡這些條件的任何一個達到，這四個條件，那麼我知道這個表單不是"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 72.34,
          "end": 79,
          "en": "valid, that one of these inputs is empty and therefore I will set form state here to invalid.",
          "zh": "有效的，這些輸入之一是空的，因此我會在這裡把 formState 設成 invalid。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 80.2,
          "end": 81.34,
          "en": "And return.",
          "zh": "並 return。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 81.34,
          "end": 87.97,
          "en": "So we have three different form states now empty, invalid and done, and we manually set this here",
          "zh": "所以我們現在有三種不同的表單狀態，empty、invalid 和 done，而我們在這裡手動設定這個"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 87.97,
          "end": 93.13,
          "en": "whenever the button is clicked based on whether we did enter valid input or not.",
          "zh": "每當按鈕被點擊，根據我們是否輸入了有效輸入。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 93.31,
          "end": 97.66,
          "en": "So now we can go down there and say we want to output that card.",
          "zh": "所以現在我們可以到下面說我們想輸出那張卡片。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 97.69,
          "end": 107.2,
          "en": "If the form state, which is our new variable, is equal to done right, because done is the state we",
          "zh": "如果 formState，也就是我們的新變數，等於 done，對，因為 done 是我們"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 107.22999999999999,
          "end": 107.77000000000001,
          "en": "set it to.",
          "zh": "把它設成的狀態。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 107.8,
          "end": 114.19,
          "en": "If we make it past this check, since I return here, we'll only get here if this is not met.",
          "zh": "如果我們通過這個檢查，既然我在這裡 return，只有在這沒有達到時我們才會到這裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 114.43,
          "end": 119.92,
          "en": "So if we're done then I want to output the card because if it's done, I have all the input I need,",
          "zh": "所以如果我們是 done，那麼我想輸出卡片，因為如果它是 done，我有我需要的所有輸入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 119.92,
          "end": 123.85,
          "en": "but I want to show an error message if it's not valid.",
          "zh": "但如果它無效，我想顯示一則錯誤訊息。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 124.24,
          "end": 126.22,
          "en": "Now for that we can add another if check.",
          "zh": "現在為此我們可以再加一個 if 檢查。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 126.25,
          "end": 127.96,
          "en": "Of course we can add another.",
          "zh": "當然我們可以再加一個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 127.96,
          "end": 135.1,
          "en": "If check where we check if form state is equal to invalid because I'm setting form state to invalid",
          "zh": "if 檢查，我們檢查 formState 是否等於 invalid，因為我把 formState 設成 invalid"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 135.1,
          "end": 138.22,
          "en": "here if we do fail validation.",
          "zh": "這裡，如果我們驗證失敗。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 138.94,
          "end": 141.43,
          "en": "And then we can simply output.",
          "zh": "然後我們可以單純輸出。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 141.61,
          "end": 142.87,
          "en": "Let's also close it.",
          "zh": "讓我們也把它關掉。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 142.9,
          "end": 148.06,
          "en": "We can simply output a paragraph where we say invalid input or anything like that.",
          "zh": "我們可以單純輸出一個段落，我們說 invalid input 或任何像那樣的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 148.24,
          "end": 155.98,
          "en": "If you now save this and I click this button right now, I get invalid input and only if I fill out",
          "zh": "如果你現在存檔，而我現在點這個按鈕，我得到 invalid input，而只有如果我填完"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 155.98,
          "end": 157.24,
          "en": "all of that.",
          "zh": "這一切。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 157.48,
          "end": 162.43,
          "en": "For now I don't have a URL at hand, so I'll just enter some dummy input in there.",
          "zh": "目前我手邊沒有 URL，所以我只在那裡輸入一些假的輸入。"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 162.46,
          "end": 166.57,
          "en": "Of course that's not a valid image, but it will fulfill validation for now.",
          "zh": "當然那不是有效的圖片，但目前它會通過驗證。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 167.21,
          "end": 168.82999999999998,
          "en": "And I fill out the rest.",
          "zh": "而我填完其餘的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 170.25,
          "end": 171.66,
          "en": "And click this button now.",
          "zh": "而現在點這個按鈕。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 171.66,
          "end": 177.12,
          "en": "Now the card is added because whilst I don't have an image for the reasons I just stated, whilst they",
          "zh": "現在卡片被加上了，因為雖然我沒有圖片，原因我剛說了，雖然他們"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 177.12,
          "end": 183.69,
          "en": "don't have that, our validation criteria here is met because none of the inputs is empty or is holding",
          "zh": "沒有那個，我們這裡的驗證條件達到了，因為沒有任何輸入是空的，或持有"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 183.69,
          "end": 184.65,
          "en": "an empty string.",
          "zh": "一個空字串。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 186.66,
          "end": 190.68,
          "en": "This, however, is not the best way of doing this or not the shortest way at least.",
          "zh": "不過，這不是做這個的最好方式，或至少不是最短的方式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 190.71,
          "end": 195.9,
          "en": "Instead of having multiple if statements like this, which you can do, you can also get rid of that",
          "zh": "與其像這樣有多個 if 陳述式，你可以那樣做，你也可以拿掉那個"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 195.9,
          "end": 199.2,
          "en": "and add another in between statements.",
          "zh": "並在中間加另一個陳述式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 199.2,
          "end": 204,
          "en": "So in your block, if statement here, which you're opening here and you're closing down there, you",
          "zh": "所以在你的區塊 if 陳述式裡，你在這裡打開、在下面關閉，你"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 204,
          "end": 206.82,
          "en": "can add a intermediate statement.",
          "zh": "可以加一個中間陳述式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 206.82,
          "end": 215.76,
          "en": "So in between statement with colon and add else if and check for another condition and check if form",
          "zh": "所以中間陳述式，用冒號，並加 else if，並檢查另一個條件，檢查 form"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 215.76,
          "end": 218.46,
          "en": "state is equal to invalid.",
          "zh": "State 是否等於 invalid。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 218.49,
          "end": 224.49,
          "en": "This allows you to add a if statement to an existing if statement if your condition is an alternative",
          "zh": "這讓你把一個 if 陳述式加到既有的 if 陳述式，如果你的條件是這個條件的替代"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 224.49,
          "end": 225.48,
          "en": "to this condition.",
          "zh": "這個條件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 225.48,
          "end": 230.34,
          "en": "So like you have if and else if in normal JavaScript you also have it in here.",
          "zh": "所以就像你在一般 JavaScript 裡有 if 和 else if，你在這裡也有。"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 230.57999999999998,
          "end": 233.52,
          "en": "If you also have an else case, you can do that too.",
          "zh": "如果你也有 else 情況，你也可以那樣做。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 233.55,
          "end": 236.91,
          "en": "You can add colon else and then simply output.",
          "zh": "你可以加冒號 else，然後單純輸出。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 236.91,
          "end": 243.24,
          "en": "Please enter some data and hit the button and then this should be displayed at the beginning when our",
          "zh": "Please enter some data and hit the button，然後這個應該在一開始顯示，當我們的"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 243.24,
          "end": 244.83,
          "en": "form state is empty.",
          "zh": "formState 是 empty。"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 245.22,
          "end": 246.28,
          "en": "So there for now.",
          "zh": "所以目前那裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 246.28,
          "end": 247.93,
          "en": "This is the text we see at the beginning.",
          "zh": "這是我們在一開始看到的文字。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 247.96,
          "end": 249.91,
          "en": "The else blocks text.",
          "zh": "else 區塊的文字。"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 249.94,
          "end": 255.22,
          "en": "If I click this, we see invalid input and if I then do enter something valid here, then we get the",
          "zh": "如果我點這個，我們看到 invalid input，而如果我接著在這裡輸入有效的東西，那麼我們得到"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 255.22,
          "end": 255.9,
          "en": "card.",
          "zh": "卡片。"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 255.91,
          "end": 262.96,
          "en": "So these are conditionals in svelte and this is how you can output different pieces of markup with the",
          "zh": "所以這些是 Svelte 裡的條件，而這就是你怎麼用 if 區塊陳述式輸出不同的標記片段"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 262.96,
          "end": 265.18,
          "en": "help of the if block statement.",
          "zh": "的幫助。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "14689532",
      "title": "Outputting Lists with \"each\"",
      "lectureOrder": 28,
      "videoOrder": 24,
      "sourceHash": "3762246ad99106bef0c941215112c446fed0e4c294cfbe6cc77b0d9d6c323526",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.08,
          "end": 3.86,
          "en": "We learned about conditionals.",
          "zh": "我們學了條件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.88,
          "end": 10.3,
          "en": "Now, once we reach that point, when I click this button, we simply update the existing card here,",
          "zh": "現在，一旦我們到達那個點，當我點這個按鈕，我們只是更新這裡既有的卡片，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 10.3,
          "end": 10.93,
          "en": "right?",
          "zh": "對吧？"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.35,
          "end": 14.77,
          "en": "When I type here and when I click the button, nothing happens.",
          "zh": "當我在這裡打字，而當我點按鈕，什麼都沒發生。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 15.16,
          "end": 18.01,
          "en": "Now, this might not be the behavior we want.",
          "zh": "現在，這可能不是我們想要的行為。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 18.04,
          "end": 24.73,
          "en": "Maybe we want to add a new contact card with every button click, and then we don't want to have an",
          "zh": "也許我們想在每次按鈕點擊時加一張新的聯絡人卡片，然後我們不想有一個"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 24.73,
          "end": 32.47,
          "en": "ongoing live binding between our contact card and these variables so that when I type here, I don't",
          "zh": "持續的即時繫結，在我們的聯絡人卡片和這些變數之間，這樣當我在這裡打字，我不會"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 32.47,
          "end": 34.3,
          "en": "change the card I already created.",
          "zh": "改變我已經建立的卡片。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 34.3,
          "end": 39.97,
          "en": "Instead, I just save these values as inputs for the next card we add with another button click.",
          "zh": "相對地，我只是把這些值存成下一張卡片的輸入，我們用另一次按鈕點擊加上的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 40.57,
          "end": 48.19,
          "en": "Now, to get this behavior, we first of all, need to change the way we store our data and we then",
          "zh": "現在，要得到這個行為，我們首先需要改變我們儲存資料的方式，然後我們"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 48.19,
          "end": 50.68,
          "en": "use it for creating that contact card.",
          "zh": "用它來建立那張聯絡人卡片。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 52.23,
          "end": 56.1,
          "en": "I'll add a new variable created contact.",
          "zh": "我會加一個新變數 createdContact。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 56.1,
          "end": 57.48,
          "en": "And this is.",
          "zh": "而這是。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 58.23,
          "end": 62.4,
          "en": "Undefined initially and then here when we have a valid form.",
          "zh": "一開始 undefined，然後這裡當我們有一個有效的表單。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 64.66,
          "end": 70.53999999999999,
          "en": "I'll store a new value in created contact, a new JavaScript object which has a name and I store my",
          "zh": "我會在 createdContact 裡存一個新值，一個新的 JavaScript 物件，它有 name，而我把我的"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 70.53999999999999,
          "end": 77.86,
          "en": "name field in there, which has a job title where I store the title variable's value in there, which",
          "zh": "name 欄位存在那裡，它有 jobTitle，我把 title 變數的值存在那裡，它"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 77.86,
          "end": 85.6,
          "en": "has an image URL where I store the image variable's value in there and a desk for description field",
          "zh": "有一個 imageURL，我把 image 變數的值存在那裡，以及一個 desc 給 description 欄位"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 85.6,
          "end": 88.49,
          "en": "where I store descriptions value in there.",
          "zh": "我把 description 的值存在那裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 88.51,
          "end": 92.44,
          "en": "Now of course, this does not set up live connections to these variables.",
          "zh": "現在當然，這不會建立到這些變數的即時連結。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 92.44,
          "end": 98.65,
          "en": "It just takes the values from these variables and copies them into these key value pairs of this object.",
          "zh": "它只是從這些變數取值，並複製進這個物件的這些鍵值對。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 98.65,
          "end": 103.22999999999999,
          "en": "So when I thereafter change these variables, these changes will not be reflected here.",
          "zh": "所以當我之後改變這些變數，這些改變不會反映在這裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 103.24000000000001,
          "end": 105.75999999999999,
          "en": "That's normal JavaScript behavior.",
          "zh": "那是一般的 JavaScript 行為。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 105.97,
          "end": 111.94,
          "en": "Now we can use the created contact down there to fill out our values.",
          "zh": "現在我們可以在下面用 createdContact 來填我們的值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 111.94,
          "end": 118.41,
          "en": "So for username I use created contact name and thereafter I use job title, image, URL and desk.",
          "zh": "所以對 username 我用 createdContact.name，然後我用 jobTitle、imageURL 和 desc。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 118.42,
          "end": 124.7,
          "en": "So here it's name here it's created contact dot job title.",
          "zh": "所以這裡是 name，這裡是 createdContact.jobTitle。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 124.7,
          "end": 125.36,
          "en": "Here.",
          "zh": "這裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 125.36,
          "end": 132.05,
          "en": "We can't use the shortcut anymore because now the name of the property which I'm binding and the value",
          "zh": "我們不能再用捷徑，因為現在我正在繫結的屬性名稱和值"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 132.05,
          "end": 135.32,
          "en": "property is not the same or the value variable name is not the same.",
          "zh": "屬性不一樣，或值的變數名稱不一樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 135.32,
          "end": 142.37,
          "en": "Instead this now is created content dot desk and here it's created contact dot image URL.",
          "zh": "相對地這現在是 createdContact.desc，而這裡是 createdContact.imageURL。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 142.52,
          "end": 145.19,
          "en": "Now let's first of all check whether that works.",
          "zh": "現在讓我們先檢查那是否運作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 146.17000000000002,
          "end": 149.44,
          "en": "Let's enter some dummy content here.",
          "zh": "讓我們在這裡輸入一些假內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 149.47,
          "end": 150.55,
          "en": "That looks good.",
          "zh": "那看起來不錯。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 150.57999999999998,
          "end": 156.34,
          "en": "Now, if I type here, we get no live updates in the cart because now I'm taking the entered values",
          "zh": "現在，如果我在這裡打字，卡片裡沒有即時更新，因為現在我拿輸入的值"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 156.34,
          "end": 158.59,
          "en": "and I'm storing them in a new object.",
          "zh": "並把它們存在一個新物件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 158.59,
          "end": 165.16,
          "en": "I copy the values and since there is no live connections, typing in the fields doesn't change the cart.",
          "zh": "我複製值，而既然沒有即時連結，在欄位裡打字不會改變卡片。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 165.16,
          "end": 168.25,
          "en": "But the idea was to have more than one cart.",
          "zh": "但想法是要有不只一張卡片。"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 168.43,
          "end": 172.72,
          "en": "And for that let's actually create a new variable.",
          "zh": "而為此讓我們實際建立一個新變數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 174.42000000000002,
          "end": 182.43,
          "en": "Created contacts, which is an array, let's say, and let's add our object here to that array.",
          "zh": "createdContacts，它是一個陣列，假設，而讓我們把我們的物件加到那個陣列。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 182.46,
          "end": 183.93,
          "en": "We can do this.",
          "zh": "我們可以這樣做。"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 184.99,
          "end": 188.95,
          "en": "By using push and then pushing this new field.",
          "zh": "藉由使用 push，然後把這個新欄位推進去。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 191.3,
          "end": 193.88,
          "en": "Onto created contacts.",
          "zh": "到 createdContacts。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 193.88,
          "end": 196.28,
          "en": "So this new array variable.",
          "zh": "所以這個新的陣列變數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 196.28,
          "end": 198.44,
          "en": "So I'm adding my new object onto this array.",
          "zh": "所以我把我的新物件加到這個陣列上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 198.44,
          "end": 202.81,
          "en": "And now I want to output this array of cards down there.",
          "zh": "而現在我想在下面輸出這個卡片陣列。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 202.82,
          "end": 206.48,
          "en": "Not when my form state is done though.",
          "zh": "不過不是當我的 formState 是 done 時。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 206.51,
          "end": 214.28,
          "en": "Instead, I want to output different messages based on my form state, but I always want to output my",
          "zh": "相對地，我想根據我的 formState 輸出不同訊息，但我永遠想輸出我的"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 214.28,
          "end": 215.99,
          "en": "full array of contact cards.",
          "zh": "完整的聯絡人卡片陣列。"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 215.99,
          "end": 219.74,
          "en": "Initially it's simply empty and I have nothing to output, which is fine.",
          "zh": "一開始它單純是空的，而我沒有東西可輸出，那沒問題。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 220.04,
          "end": 223.1,
          "en": "Therefore, let's manipulate this a bit here.",
          "zh": "因此，讓我們在這裡稍微調整這個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 223.1,
          "end": 231.71,
          "en": "Let's grab this contact card, cut it out and here I just want to check if form state is invalid, in",
          "zh": "讓我們抓住這張聯絡人卡片，剪下來，而這裡我只想檢查 formState 是否是 invalid，在"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 231.71,
          "end": 234.11,
          "en": "which case output this else output this.",
          "zh": "那個情況輸出這個，否則輸出這個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 234.11,
          "end": 240.56,
          "en": "But now I want to output my contact card below that with the help of another block statement.",
          "zh": "但現在我想在那下面輸出我的聯絡人卡片，藉由另一個區塊陳述式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 240.59,
          "end": 247.64,
          "en": "D each block statement hashtag Each is another piece of syntax which is understood by svelte.",
          "zh": "{#each 區塊陳述式，井號 each，是另一段語法，Svelte 理解。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 247.64,
          "end": 255.57,
          "en": "And this allows us to loop through an array and replicate the markup which is inside of the each block",
          "zh": "而這讓我們迴圈一個陣列，並複製 each 區塊裡面的標記"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 255.57,
          "end": 256.29,
          "en": "statement.",
          "zh": "陳述式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 256.29,
          "end": 260.43,
          "en": "And therefore we also have to close this with forward slash each.",
          "zh": "因此我們也必須用斜線 each 關閉這個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 260.43,
          "end": 266.4,
          "en": "So the markup in between will be replicated for every element of the array we're using here.",
          "zh": "所以中間的標記會為我們在這裡使用的陣列的每個元素被複製。"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 266.55,
          "end": 271.41,
          "en": "Now the syntax is each and then the array name.",
          "zh": "現在語法是 each，然後陣列名稱。"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 271.41,
          "end": 277.32,
          "en": "So created contacts in this case as and now any name you want.",
          "zh": "所以這個例子是 createdContacts，as，而現在任何你想要的名稱。"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 278.34000000000003,
          "end": 279.87,
          "en": "Contact, for example.",
          "zh": "例如 contact。"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 279.99,
          "end": 282.27,
          "en": "Now created contacts is your array.",
          "zh": "現在 createdContacts 是你的陣列。"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 282.27,
          "end": 284.7,
          "en": "In our case, that is this variable here.",
          "zh": "在我們的例子，那是這裡這個變數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 284.7,
          "end": 289.98,
          "en": "And this has to be an array or an iterable object in general in JavaScript.",
          "zh": "而這必須是一個陣列，或一般來說 JavaScript 裡的可迭代物件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 289.98,
          "end": 293.1,
          "en": "And then as contact is up to you.",
          "zh": "然後 as contact 由你決定。"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 293.1,
          "end": 298.23,
          "en": "So you name this however you want, this will give you access to every element of that array as it loops",
          "zh": "所以你隨便命名這個，這會給你存取那個陣列的每個元素，當它迴圈"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 298.23,
          "end": 299.04,
          "en": "through the elements.",
          "zh": "遍歷元素時。"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 299.04,
          "end": 303.54,
          "en": "So it replicates this markup piece for every element in the array and for every iteration.",
          "zh": "所以它為陣列裡的每個元素複製這段標記，而對每次迭代。"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 303.54,
          "end": 307.59,
          "en": "It gives you access to the array element on this contact variable.",
          "zh": "它在這個 contact 變數上給你存取陣列元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 307.59,
          "end": 314.28,
          "en": "And this allows you to now use that array element here for this piece of markup which is getting generated.",
          "zh": "而這讓你現在為這段正在被產生的標記使用那個陣列元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 314.28,
          "end": 317.73,
          "en": "So now here instead of created contact, we use contact.",
          "zh": "所以現在這裡，我們用 contact，而不是 createdContact。"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 317.73,
          "end": 325.32,
          "en": "So this extracted variable or this variable pointing at this array element and we use that to extract",
          "zh": "所以這個取出的變數，或這個指向這個陣列元素的變數，而我們用那個來取出"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 325.32,
          "end": 327.27,
          "en": "the fields for this contact.",
          "zh": "這個聯絡人的欄位。"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 330.44,
          "end": 333.32,
          "en": "So now if I save this and go back.",
          "zh": "所以現在如果我存檔並回去。"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 333.88,
          "end": 335.95,
          "en": "Let me enter some dummy data here.",
          "zh": "讓我在這裡輸入一些假資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 336.07,
          "end": 338.23,
          "en": "Click that and.",
          "zh": "點那個，而。"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 339.05,
          "end": 340.1,
          "en": "Nothing there.",
          "zh": "那裡什麼都沒有。"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 340.13,
          "end": 341.65999999999997,
          "en": "Where is our card?",
          "zh": "我們的卡片在哪？"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 342.2,
          "end": 347.72,
          "en": "Well, that's something I'll come back to in the next course module when we talk a bit more about reactivity.",
          "zh": "嗯，那是我會在下一個課程單元回來談的，當我們再談一點反應性。"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 347.75,
          "end": 351.48,
          "en": "Using push does not do the trick.",
          "zh": "使用 push 行不通。"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 351.5,
          "end": 357.11,
          "en": "This is not something svelte can detect because arrays and objects are reference types.",
          "zh": "這不是 Svelte 能偵測的，因為陣列和物件是參考型別。"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 357.11,
          "end": 363.95,
          "en": "If you use operations like Push, which don't really change the array, they change the array of course,",
          "zh": "如果你使用像 push 這樣的操作，它們並沒有真正改變陣列，它們當然改變陣列，"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 363.95,
          "end": 370.93,
          "en": "but they don't change the value stored in this variable because the value is just a pointer.",
          "zh": "但它們沒有改變存在這個變數裡的值，因為那個值只是一個指標。"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 370.94,
          "end": 375.2,
          "en": "And if you want to learn more about that, again, I will dive into this later.",
          "zh": "而如果你想再了解那個，再次，我稍後會深入這個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 375.2,
          "end": 379.43,
          "en": "But you can also find a helpful article and video attached to this lecture.",
          "zh": "但你也可以在這一堂的附件找到一篇有幫助的文章和影片。"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 379.43,
          "end": 387.08,
          "en": "But basically JavaScript uses reference types here and Svelte is not able to detect changes on the array",
          "zh": "但基本上 JavaScript 在這裡使用參考型別，而 Svelte 無法偵測陣列上的改變"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 387.08,
          "end": 389.69,
          "en": "if we use push pop and so on.",
          "zh": "如果我們使用 push、pop 等等。"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 389.69,
          "end": 395.9,
          "en": "Instead, we always have to overwrite create contacts with a new value.",
          "zh": "相對地，我們永遠必須用一個新值覆寫 createdContacts。"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 395.9,
          "end": 401.82,
          "en": "So basically the equal sign is the trigger for svelte equal that is something svelte can detect.",
          "zh": "所以基本上等號是 Svelte 的觸發，等號是 Svelte 能偵測的東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 401.82,
          "end": 407.82,
          "en": "So if we store a new value in create contacts that is something Svelte will recognize and that is something",
          "zh": "所以如果我們在 createdContacts 裡存一個新值，那是 Svelte 會認出的，也是"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 407.82,
          "end": 410.94,
          "en": "which will trigger svelte to update our dom.",
          "zh": "會觸發 Svelte 更新我們 DOM 的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 411.15,
          "end": 416.88,
          "en": "Now of course I don't want to store an object or set created contacts equal to an object.",
          "zh": "現在當然我不想存一個物件，或把 createdContacts 設成等於一個物件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 416.88,
          "end": 418.77,
          "en": "I want to set it equal to an array.",
          "zh": "我想把它設成等於一個陣列。"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 418.77,
          "end": 421.53,
          "en": "So let's wrap this in square brackets.",
          "zh": "所以讓我們用方括號包住這個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 421.56,
          "end": 429.45,
          "en": "We can get rid of the parentheses and I want to add this new object to my existing list of created contacts.",
          "zh": "我們可以拿掉括號，而我想把這個新物件加到我既有的 createdContacts 清單。"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 429.45,
          "end": 432.27,
          "en": "For this, we can use a modern JavaScript feature.",
          "zh": "為此，我們可以使用一個現代 JavaScript 功能。"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 432.27,
          "end": 437.42,
          "en": "We can use the spread operator three dots and then created contacts.",
          "zh": "我們可以使用展開運算子，三個點，然後 createdContacts。"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 437.43,
          "end": 444.78,
          "en": "What this does is it pulls out all the elements out of created contacts, adds them to a new array,",
          "zh": "這做的是把 createdContacts 裡的所有元素拉出來，加到一個新陣列，"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 444.78,
          "end": 448.68,
          "en": "and adds this new object as a last element to that new array.",
          "zh": "並把這個新物件當作最後一個元素加到那個新陣列。"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 448.68,
          "end": 451.59,
          "en": "After the elements, it pulled out of the old array.",
          "zh": "在它從舊陣列拉出來的元素之後。"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 451.59,
          "end": 457.56,
          "en": "And then this new array overrides the old array instead of create a created contacts.",
          "zh": "然後這個新陣列覆寫舊陣列，而不是只建立 createdContacts。"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 457.56,
          "end": 463.92,
          "en": "And since we assign a new value, we overwrite the old one and that is now picked up by svelte.",
          "zh": "而既然我們指派一個新值，我們覆寫舊的，而那現在被 Svelte 接收。"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 464.13,
          "end": 468.81,
          "en": "So now if we do that and we save this, let's give this another try.",
          "zh": "所以現在如果我們那樣做並存檔，讓我們再試一次。"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 469.40999999999997,
          "end": 470.1,
          "en": "This looks better.",
          "zh": "這看起來比較好。"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 470.1,
          "end": 470.94,
          "en": "Here's our card.",
          "zh": "這是我們的卡片。"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 470.94,
          "end": 476.28,
          "en": "And if I click this button again, we get a second and a third and a fourth card.",
          "zh": "而如果我再點這個按鈕，我們得到第二張、第三張和第四張卡片。"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 476.31,
          "end": 483.36,
          "en": "So now we're outputting multiple pieces of markup with very little code by using that each block.",
          "zh": "所以現在我們用很少的程式碼輸出多段標記，藉由使用那個 each 區塊。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "14689534",
      "title": "\"each\", \"else\" & Extracting the Index",
      "lectureOrder": 29,
      "videoOrder": 25,
      "sourceHash": "71249ffee844767f523c06765fae1fdee62b82dae67a9baaac0d0e7a1aae4fe1",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.13,
          "end": 5.7,
          "en": "Now on that each block, you also have a couple of additional features.",
          "zh": "現在在那個 each 區塊上，你也有幾個額外功能。"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.79,
          "end": 13.17,
          "en": "One nice feature is that you can also specify a else in between statement here with Colon else.",
          "zh": "一個好功能是你也可以在這裡指定一個 else 中間陳述式，用冒號 else。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 13.26,
          "end": 17.28,
          "en": "Now you might be wondering what would be the else case here.",
          "zh": "現在你可能會想這裡的 else 情況會是什麼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 17.28,
          "end": 18,
          "en": "It's a loop.",
          "zh": "它是一個迴圈。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 18,
          "end": 19.11,
          "en": "It's no condition.",
          "zh": "它不是條件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 19.32,
          "end": 22.56,
          "en": "The else case is simply what if the array is empty?",
          "zh": "else 情況單純是如果陣列是空的呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 22.56,
          "end": 24.96,
          "en": "And indeed, initially this is empty.",
          "zh": "而確實，一開始這是空的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 26.36,
          "end": 32.39,
          "en": "So initially we could output please start adding some contacts.",
          "zh": "所以一開始我們可以輸出 please start adding some contacts。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 32.42,
          "end": 33.59,
          "en": "We found.",
          "zh": "我們找到。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 34.49,
          "end": 35.39,
          "en": "Non.",
          "zh": "沒有。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 35.69,
          "end": 42.26,
          "en": "So this is our dummy content which is then displayed initially until we start adding our first element.",
          "zh": "所以這是我們的假內容，一開始會顯示，直到我們開始加第一個元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 42.26,
          "end": 44.76,
          "en": "As soon as we have at least one element in the array.",
          "zh": "一旦陣列裡至少有一個元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 44.78,
          "end": 45.8,
          "en": "This is gone.",
          "zh": "這個就消失。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 45.8,
          "end": 47.66,
          "en": "So else is really useful.",
          "zh": "所以 else 真的有用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 47.93,
          "end": 54.5,
          "en": "And now we're useful feature is that you can get access to the index of the current element because",
          "zh": "而現在另一個有用的功能是你可以存取目前元素的索引，因為"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 54.5,
          "end": 57.95,
          "en": "sometimes you need that extra piece of information.",
          "zh": "有時候你需要那份額外資訊。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 57.95,
          "end": 62.15,
          "en": "You need to know well which position is this element at in the array?",
          "zh": "你需要知道，嗯這個元素在陣列裡的哪個位置？"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 62.18,
          "end": 66.14,
          "en": "Maybe because you just want to output it, maybe for other reasons.",
          "zh": "也許因為你只想輸出它，也許因為其他原因。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 66.44,
          "end": 74.09,
          "en": "Let's say here we want to add an H2 tag where we simply output which number this is in our array.",
          "zh": "假設這裡我們想加一個 h2 標籤，我們單純輸出這在我們的陣列裡是第幾號。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 74.18,
          "end": 80.66,
          "en": "Well then we can get the index by simply adding a comma after this contact or whatever you named it",
          "zh": "嗯那麼我們可以拿到索引，只要在這個 contact 之後加一個逗號，或不管你怎麼命名它"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 80.66,
          "end": 86.3,
          "en": "variable, and then you can add a second variable which you can also name however you want, which gives",
          "zh": "變數，然後你可以加第二個變數，你也可以隨便命名，它給"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 86.3,
          "end": 91.28,
          "en": "you access to the index of the element we're currently looking at in this iteration.",
          "zh": "你存取我們在這次迭代正在看的元素的索引。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 91.43,
          "end": 97.74000000000001,
          "en": "And typically you of course, name this index or I will go with I, but the name is up to you.",
          "zh": "而通常你當然把這個命名為 index，或我會用 i，但名稱由你決定。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 97.95,
          "end": 101.85,
          "en": "And now we could output this here dynamically with curly braces.",
          "zh": "而現在我們可以用大括號在這裡動態輸出這個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 101.85,
          "end": 106.47,
          "en": "And then I referring to this variable which is only available inside of this loop here.",
          "zh": "然後 i 指的是這個變數，它只在這裡這個迴圈裡面可用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 106.47,
          "end": 112.41,
          "en": "And then we are able to output this number, maybe I plus one because the index starts at zero.",
          "zh": "然後我們能夠輸出這個數字，也許 i 加一，因為索引從零開始。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 112.41,
          "end": 116.61,
          "en": "And maybe here I want to start with one visually to the user.",
          "zh": "而也許這裡我想對使用者視覺上從一開始。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 116.97,
          "end": 124.38,
          "en": "So again, if we try this and we start adding some cards, you see hash tag one, hash tag two and thereafter",
          "zh": "所以再次，如果我們試這個並開始加一些卡片，你看到 #1、#2，然後"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 124.38,
          "end": 125.94,
          "en": "hash tag three and so on.",
          "zh": "#3，等等。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 125.94,
          "end": 129.51,
          "en": "So getting access to the index is also nice.",
          "zh": "所以存取索引也很不錯。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "14689536",
      "title": "Lists & Keys",
      "lectureOrder": 30,
      "videoOrder": 26,
      "sourceHash": "35aa14b066c80dba79e5fd7f5df09780fd2b6dfe45fad56a6f0296b22e79888c",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.01,
          "end": 5.94,
          "en": "So we're able to add some contacts to our list here.",
          "zh": "所以我們能夠在這裡把一些聯絡人加到清單。"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 6.15,
          "end": 12.84,
          "en": "Now, let's say we also want to have buttons to remove the first or the last element in that list.",
          "zh": "現在，假設我們也想要按鈕，用來移除清單裡的第一個或最後一個元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 12.84,
          "end": 14.46,
          "en": "So the card, I mean.",
          "zh": "我是說那張卡片。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 15.98,
          "end": 20.69,
          "en": "For this, we can start by adding two new buttons.",
          "zh": "為此，我們可以先加兩個新按鈕。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 21.67,
          "end": 25.39,
          "en": "Delete first and delete last.",
          "zh": "Delete first 和 delete last。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 26.17,
          "end": 31.72,
          "en": "And of course, we now need some functions that actually help us with that.",
          "zh": "而當然，我們現在需要一些函式，真正幫我們做到這件事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 32.11,
          "end": 40.66,
          "en": "So in our script tags of the app component, we can add a function, delete first and also add a function",
          "zh": "所以在 App 元件的 script 標籤裡，我們可以加一個函式 deleteFirst，也加一個函式"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 40.66,
          "end": 43.15,
          "en": "delete last like this.",
          "zh": "deleteLast，像這樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 43.3,
          "end": 46.33,
          "en": "Hook these functions up to click listeners on the buttons.",
          "zh": "把這些函式接到按鈕上的 click 監聽器。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 46.33,
          "end": 54.91,
          "en": "So here we have onClick and then we have delete first and for the second button unsurprisingly, we",
          "zh": "所以這裡我們有 on:click，然後我們有 deleteFirst，而第二個按鈕毫不意外，我們"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 54.91,
          "end": 57.76,
          "en": "got delete last like that.",
          "zh": "接到 deleteLast，像那樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 58,
          "end": 60.94,
          "en": "Now what should happen in these functions for delete?",
          "zh": "現在這些刪除函式裡應該發生什麼？"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 60.94,
          "end": 68.08,
          "en": "First I'll set created contacts equal to created contacts.",
          "zh": "首先我會把 createdContacts 設成等於 createdContacts。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 69.02,
          "end": 69.77,
          "en": "Slice.",
          "zh": "slice。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 69.77,
          "end": 77.96000000000001,
          "en": "One slice is a built in method in JavaScript, which essentially returns a new array and it starts at",
          "zh": "slice(1) 是 JavaScript 內建方法，本質上回傳一個新陣列，而它從"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 77.96000000000001,
          "end": 78.77,
          "en": "this position.",
          "zh": "這個位置開始。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 78.77,
          "end": 85.34,
          "en": "So it takes created contacts, starts at index one, which is the second element and gives us well,",
          "zh": "所以它拿 createdContacts，從索引一開始，也就是第二個元素，然後給我們，嗯，"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 85.37,
          "end": 89.9,
          "en": "the whole array starting at index one, it essentially drops the first element.",
          "zh": "從索引一開始的整個陣列，它本質上丟掉第一個元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 89.9,
          "end": 98.84,
          "en": "Therefore for delete last, I can set created contacts equal created contacts.",
          "zh": "因此對 delete last，我可以把 createdContacts 設成等於 createdContacts。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 99.59,
          "end": 102.47999999999999,
          "en": "Slice zero minus one.",
          "zh": "slice(0, -1)。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 102.5,
          "end": 109.34,
          "en": "This is also using slice, but this essentially tells JavaScript start at the first element.",
          "zh": "這也是用 slice，但這本質上告訴 JavaScript 從第一個元素開始。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 109.37,
          "end": 114.22999999999999,
          "en": "Give me the whole array up to well minus one means the.",
          "zh": "把整個陣列給我，直到，嗯，負一的意思是"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 115.39,
          "end": 117.7,
          "en": "Element before the last element.",
          "zh": "最後一個元素之前的那個元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 118.06,
          "end": 124.72,
          "en": "So created context is updated and therefore we should be able to delete some elements.",
          "zh": "所以 createdContacts 被更新，因此我們應該能夠刪除一些元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 124.9,
          "end": 130.17,
          "en": "Now let's go back and let's add a card here, Max.",
          "zh": "現在讓我們回去，並在這裡加一張卡片，Max。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 130.18,
          "end": 134.17,
          "en": "Then let's add Max two so that we can see a difference in the cards.",
          "zh": "然後讓我們加 Max two，這樣我們能看出卡片的差別。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 134.17,
          "end": 137.05,
          "en": "And let's add Max three here.",
          "zh": "而讓我們在這裡加 Max three。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 137.05,
          "end": 138.79,
          "en": "So we get three elements.",
          "zh": "所以我們得到三個元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 139.39,
          "end": 140.56,
          "en": "Now let's delete.",
          "zh": "現在讓我們刪除。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 140.56,
          "end": 142.9,
          "en": "The first seems to work.",
          "zh": "第一個似乎有用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 143.14,
          "end": 144.57999999999998,
          "en": "Now let's delete the last.",
          "zh": "現在讓我們刪除最後一個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 144.62,
          "end": 145.72,
          "en": "Seems to work.",
          "zh": "似乎有用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 145.9,
          "end": 148.3,
          "en": "Now let me show you something that won't work.",
          "zh": "現在讓我給你看一件行不通的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 148.3,
          "end": 150.31,
          "en": "Let's go to the contact card.",
          "zh": "讓我們到聯絡人卡片。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 151.32999999999998,
          "end": 153.21,
          "en": "And let's add a new constant here.",
          "zh": "而讓我們在這裡加一個新的常數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 153.22,
          "end": 156.16,
          "en": "Initial name which I said equal to username.",
          "zh": "initialName，我把它設成等於 username。"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 156.16,
          "end": 161.68,
          "en": "So this will simply just copy the username we're passing in into the contact card component and store",
          "zh": "所以這會單純把我們傳進去的 username 複製進 Contact Card 元件，並存在"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 161.68,
          "end": 162.88,
          "en": "it in a constant.",
          "zh": "一個常數裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 163.39,
          "end": 166.03,
          "en": "And I will output this here.",
          "zh": "而我會在這裡輸出這個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 167.38,
          "end": 168.85,
          "en": "After my username.",
          "zh": "在我的 username 之後。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 168.85,
          "end": 171.13,
          "en": "So the slash here is no valid syntax.",
          "zh": "所以這裡的斜線不是有效語法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 171.13,
          "end": 172,
          "en": "That's normal text.",
          "zh": "那是一般文字。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 172,
          "end": 175.81,
          "en": "But then thereafter I will output initial name.",
          "zh": "但在那之後我會輸出 initialName。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 176.35,
          "end": 178.39,
          "en": "Let's save that and let's go back.",
          "zh": "讓我們存檔並回去。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 179.18,
          "end": 182.6,
          "en": "And now let's add a couple of cards, Max.",
          "zh": "而現在讓我們加幾張卡片，Max。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 182.81,
          "end": 185.18,
          "en": "Then let's add Max two.",
          "zh": "然後讓我們加 Max two。"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 185.21,
          "end": 187.25,
          "en": "And let's add Max three.",
          "zh": "而讓我們加 Max three。"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 187.28,
          "end": 188.45,
          "en": "These are the cards.",
          "zh": "這些是卡片。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 188.6,
          "end": 190.37,
          "en": "Let's delete the first element.",
          "zh": "讓我們刪除第一個元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 190.37,
          "end": 195.35,
          "en": "And what you see now is that now it's Max two slash Max, and this is Max three.",
          "zh": "而你現在看到的是，現在它是 Max two / Max，而這是 Max three。"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 195.35,
          "end": 196.67000000000002,
          "en": "Slash max two.",
          "zh": "/ Max two。"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 197.49,
          "end": 200.04,
          "en": "Now just to make sure you didn't miss that.",
          "zh": "現在只是確定你沒漏掉那個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 200.07,
          "end": 205.71,
          "en": "If I add the cards, Max and Max two and Max three, you see that?",
          "zh": "如果我加卡片 Max、Max two 和 Max three，你看到了嗎？"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 205.71,
          "end": 206.4,
          "en": "This is correct.",
          "zh": "這是正確的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 206.4,
          "end": 207.36,
          "en": "Max and Max.",
          "zh": "Max 和 Max。"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 207.36,
          "end": 207.72,
          "en": "Max.",
          "zh": "Max。"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 207.72,
          "end": 208.29,
          "en": "Two and Max.",
          "zh": "two 和 Max。"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 208.29,
          "end": 209.88,
          "en": "Two, Max three and Max three.",
          "zh": "two，Max three 和 Max three。"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 209.88,
          "end": 214.92000000000002,
          "en": "But as soon as I delete the first one, it's Max two and Max and Max three and Max two.",
          "zh": "但只要我刪掉第一個，它就變成 Max two 和 Max，以及 Max three 和 Max two。"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 214.95,
          "end": 216.54,
          "en": "So this is mixed up.",
          "zh": "所以這混在一起了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 216.57,
          "end": 218.34,
          "en": "If I delete the last one.",
          "zh": "如果我刪掉最後一個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 218.37,
          "end": 220.86,
          "en": "This doesn't seem to cause any harm though.",
          "zh": "不過這似乎沒有造成任何傷害。"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 220.98,
          "end": 223.11,
          "en": "So if I now add.",
          "zh": "所以如果我現在加。"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 225,
          "end": 226.5,
          "en": "More cards here, Max.",
          "zh": "更多卡片在這裡，Max。"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 226.5,
          "end": 227.76,
          "en": "Four and Max three.",
          "zh": "four 和 Max three。"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 227.79,
          "end": 231.09,
          "en": "If I delete the last one, this works only if I delete the first one.",
          "zh": "如果我刪掉最後一個，這有用，只有當我刪掉第一個時。"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 231.09,
          "end": 232.37,
          "en": "It kind of breaks.",
          "zh": "它就有點壞掉。"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 232.53,
          "end": 233.94,
          "en": "What's the issue here?",
          "zh": "這裡的問題是什麼？"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 235.32999999999998,
          "end": 240.32,
          "en": "That has to do with how svelte updates the list.",
          "zh": "那和 Svelte 怎麼更新清單有關。"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 240.34,
          "end": 241.96,
          "en": "When you change it.",
          "zh": "當你改變它時。"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 242.2,
          "end": 244.33,
          "en": "Specifically when you delete content.",
          "zh": "特別是當你刪除內容時。"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 244.33,
          "end": 245.87,
          "en": "But in general when you do.",
          "zh": "但一般來說當你做"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 245.89,
          "end": 248.29,
          "en": "Operations with items in the list.",
          "zh": "清單裡項目的操作時。"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 249.37,
          "end": 251.56,
          "en": "You have to understand that too.",
          "zh": "你也必須理解那個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 251.56,
          "end": 252.49,
          "en": "Svelte.",
          "zh": "Svelte。"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 253.15,
          "end": 256.69,
          "en": "These cards all look pretty similar in the Dom.",
          "zh": "這些卡片在 DOM 裡看起來都相當相似。"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 256.69,
          "end": 259.27,
          "en": "They're all divs with a header and so on.",
          "zh": "它們都是帶著 header 等等的 div。"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 259.3,
          "end": 261.97,
          "en": "There is no unique identifier on the cards.",
          "zh": "卡片上沒有唯一識別碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 261.97,
          "end": 262.15,
          "en": "Right?",
          "zh": "對吧？"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 262.15,
          "end": 265.81,
          "en": "If I add a second card, it has a different index, but that's no identifier.",
          "zh": "如果我加第二張卡片，它有不同的索引，但那不是識別碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 265.84,
          "end": 267.91,
          "en": "The index is generated dynamically.",
          "zh": "索引是動態產生的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 267.91,
          "end": 268.21,
          "en": "Right.",
          "zh": "對。"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 268.21,
          "end": 270.67,
          "en": "The second element always has the index two.",
          "zh": "第二個元素永遠有索引二。"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 270.7,
          "end": 276.25,
          "en": "If I later insert another element as a second element in the array, this also has the index.",
          "zh": "如果我稍後插入另一個元素當作陣列裡的第二個元素，這個也有那個索引。"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 276.25,
          "end": 282.7,
          "en": "That's not an identifier because if I insert a new element in front of the previous second element so",
          "zh": "那不是識別碼，因為如果我在先前的第二個元素前面插入一個新元素，所以"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 282.7,
          "end": 288.85,
          "en": "that the inserted element is now the second element, then the previously second element will move to",
          "zh": "被插入的元素現在是第二個元素，那麼先前的第二個元素會移到"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 288.85,
          "end": 290.08,
          "en": "position three.",
          "zh": "位置三。"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 290.35,
          "end": 296.14,
          "en": "If it has no unique identifier, I have no way of telling that it previously was the second element.",
          "zh": "如果它沒有唯一識別碼，我沒辦法分辨它先前是第二個元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 296.14,
          "end": 296.5,
          "en": "Right.",
          "zh": "對。"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 296.5,
          "end": 298.21,
          "en": "So that's the problem of svelte.",
          "zh": "所以那是 Svelte 的問題。"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 298.21,
          "end": 301.18,
          "en": "It can't tell these elements apart.",
          "zh": "它沒辦法把這些元素分辨開來。"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 301.81,
          "end": 307.72,
          "en": "The problem is if I now change that list, svelte somehow has to be able to update it.",
          "zh": "問題是如果我現在改變那個清單，Svelte 必須有辦法更新它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 307.84,
          "end": 314.6,
          "en": "And the default behavior of svelte simply is that it changes the list from its end.",
          "zh": "而 Svelte 的預設行為單純是它從結尾改變清單。"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 314.63,
          "end": 318.08,
          "en": "That is why delete last has no negative impact.",
          "zh": "那就是為什麼 delete last 沒有負面影響。"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 318.08,
          "end": 320.33,
          "en": "That is the expected behavior of svelte.",
          "zh": "那是 Svelte 預期的行為。"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 320.36,
          "end": 327.53,
          "en": "If you delete something, it updates the Dom as as if the last element was changed or deleted.",
          "zh": "如果你刪除某樣東西，它更新 DOM，好像最後一個元素被改變或刪除。"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 327.53,
          "end": 332.42,
          "en": "And if that is what you did in JavaScript code two, which is the case for the delete last button,",
          "zh": "而如果那就是你在 JavaScript 程式碼裡做的，delete last 按鈕就是這種情況，"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 332.42,
          "end": 334.1,
          "en": "then everything is fine.",
          "zh": "那麼一切都沒問題。"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 334.19,
          "end": 340.90999999999997,
          "en": "But if you delete the first element then the default behavior of svelte where it starts at the end of",
          "zh": "但如果你刪除第一個元素，那麼 Svelte 的預設行為，從清單結尾開始"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 340.90999999999997,
          "end": 344.57,
          "en": "the list and starts removing the item there is wrong.",
          "zh": "並從那裡開始移除項目，就是錯的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 344.69,
          "end": 349.94,
          "en": "Now of course you might argue, but it did work to a certain extent, right?",
          "zh": "現在當然你可能會爭辯，但它在某種程度上確實有用，對吧？"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 349.97,
          "end": 357.56,
          "en": "If I start adding elements here and I now delete the first other than this strange, strange behavior,",
          "zh": "如果我開始在這裡加元素，而我現在刪除第一個，除了這個奇怪、奇怪的行為，"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 357.56,
          "end": 363.14,
          "en": "it certainly did delete Max two because that first value is right and you are wrong.",
          "zh": "它確實刪掉了 Max two，因為那個第一個值是對的，而你是錯的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 363.2,
          "end": 370.19,
          "en": "Svelte deletes the last element, but then it goes through the list and sees which element needs to",
          "zh": "Svelte 刪除最後一個元素，但接著它走遍清單，看哪個元素需要"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 370.19,
          "end": 373.01,
          "en": "be changed, where it needs to change.",
          "zh": "被改變，它需要在哪裡改變。"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 373.01,
          "end": 376.28,
          "en": "The dom to reflect your data structure.",
          "zh": "DOM，來反映你的資料結構。"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 376.28,
          "end": 382.1,
          "en": "And it sees that the only element in the array in this example here has a title of max three, so it",
          "zh": "而它看到這個例子裡陣列中唯一的元素標題是 Max three，所以它"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 382.1,
          "end": 385.34,
          "en": "updates the only element it rendered with that title.",
          "zh": "用那個標題更新它渲染的唯一元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 385.61,
          "end": 387.5,
          "en": "The problem just is.",
          "zh": "問題只是。"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 389.38,
          "end": 396.27,
          "en": "That it removed the wrong element and therefore data we set up on the initialization of that element",
          "zh": "它移除了錯誤的元素，因此我們在那個元素初始化時設定的資料"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 396.28,
          "end": 403.87,
          "en": "which is not rebuilt or not re-executed that data is now connected to the wrong element.",
          "zh": "沒有被重建或沒有被重新執行，那份資料現在連到錯誤的元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 404.38,
          "end": 412.69,
          "en": "So the core problem still is that swell simply assumes that lists always change from the end.",
          "zh": "所以核心問題仍然是 Svelte 單純假設清單永遠從結尾改變。"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 412.78,
          "end": 416.23,
          "en": "Now how can we teach swell that this is not the case?",
          "zh": "現在我們怎麼教 Svelte 情況不是這樣？"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 416.23,
          "end": 418.6,
          "en": "If we clicked the delete first button?",
          "zh": "如果我們點了 delete first 按鈕？"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 418.96,
          "end": 420.7,
          "en": "We don't have to teach svelte.",
          "zh": "我們不必教 Svelte。"
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 420.73,
          "end": 425.53,
          "en": "We just have to give it a way of telling our different items apart.",
          "zh": "我們只要給它一個方式，把我們不同的項目分辨開來。"
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 425.56,
          "end": 433.66,
          "en": "If Svelte can clearly see that this second card is a different element than the first one, then it",
          "zh": "如果 Svelte 能清楚看到這第二張卡片是和第一張不同的元素，那麼它"
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 433.66,
          "end": 442.36,
          "en": "has a way easier time of comparing the rendered Dom to the data we're using because it can clearly connect",
          "zh": "比較已渲染的 DOM 和我們正在使用的資料會輕鬆很多，因為它能清楚連接"
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 442.36,
          "end": 446.59,
          "en": "every piece of data in JavaScript to a Dom element behind the scenes.",
          "zh": "JavaScript 裡每一份資料到幕後的一個 DOM 元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 446.62,
          "end": 448.93,
          "en": "Otherwise it has no way of doing that.",
          "zh": "否則它沒有辦法做到那個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 448.96,
          "end": 456.07,
          "en": "So we need a unique identifier to help svelte connect our data to the Dom markup because that's the",
          "zh": "所以我們需要一個唯一識別碼，幫助 Svelte 把我們的資料連到 DOM 標記，因為那是"
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 456.07,
          "end": 460.96,
          "en": "missing piece and that's why by default then simply says, okay, I always assume it's the last element",
          "zh": "缺少的那一塊，而那就是為什麼預設它就單純說，好，我永遠假設是最後一個元素"
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 460.96,
          "end": 465.62,
          "en": "that changed and therefore only if that really was the case, it's working correctly.",
          "zh": "改變了，因此只有那真的是情況時，它才正確運作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 465.86,
          "end": 468.79,
          "en": "So how do we get such a unique identifier?",
          "zh": "所以我們怎麼得到這樣的唯一識別碼？"
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 468.8,
          "end": 474.17,
          "en": "In most applications you have some unique identifier for pretty much all your data.",
          "zh": "在大多數應用程式裡，你幾乎所有資料都有某個唯一識別碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 474.2,
          "end": 477.59000000000003,
          "en": "If you're fetching data from a database, you most likely have an ID.",
          "zh": "如果你從資料庫抓資料，你很有可能有一個 ID。"
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 478.01,
          "end": 480.44,
          "en": "In this case here we have no database data.",
          "zh": "在這個例子我們沒有資料庫資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 480.44,
          "end": 485.63,
          "en": "We have no unique ID, but when we're creating a new contact here, we can of course generate one.",
          "zh": "我們沒有唯一 ID，但當我們在這裡建立一個新聯絡人，我們當然可以產生一個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 485.63,
          "end": 488.81,
          "en": "So here we could say a new ID is simply a random number.",
          "zh": "所以這裡我們可以說一個新的 ID 單純是一個隨機數字。"
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 488.84,
          "end": 494.3,
          "en": "This is not truly unique, but for this course or for this demo here, it will do.",
          "zh": "這不是真正唯一，但對這門課或這個示範，它就夠了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 494.51,
          "end": 499.19,
          "en": "Your unique ID can be anything, can be a string, can be a number, can be an object.",
          "zh": "你的唯一 ID 可以是任何東西，可以是字串，可以是數字，可以是物件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 499.19,
          "end": 499.69,
          "en": "Even.",
          "zh": "甚至。"
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 499.7,
          "end": 505.79,
          "en": "However, because objects and arrays are reference types and to avoid nasty bugs there it's recommended",
          "zh": "不過，因為物件和陣列是參考型別，而為了避免那裡討厭的 bug，建議"
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 505.79,
          "end": 509.04,
          "en": "that you use numbers or strings as identifiers.",
          "zh": "你用數字或字串當作識別碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 509.06,
          "end": 515.72,
          "en": "So here we have a number, but again, you could also use a string and now we can give that ID to Svelte",
          "zh": "所以這裡我們有一個數字，但再次，你也可以用字串，而現在我們可以把那個 ID 給 Svelte"
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 515.72,
          "end": 517.76,
          "en": "when it generates that list.",
          "zh": "當它產生那個清單時。"
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 518.09,
          "end": 524.39,
          "en": "We do that by simply adding an extra piece of information here in our each block at the very end, no",
          "zh": "我們這樣做，只要在 each 區塊的最尾端加一段額外資訊，沒有"
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 524.39,
          "end": 526.29,
          "en": "comma, just a blank.",
          "zh": "逗號，只是一個空白。"
        },
        {
          "id": 139,
          "start": 526.31,
          "end": 534.26,
          "en": "And then in parentheses, you add your ID, in this case, contact ID, So your unique key, whatever",
          "zh": "然後在括號裡，你加你的 ID，這個例子是 contact.id，所以你的唯一 key，不管"
        },
        {
          "id": 140,
          "start": 534.26,
          "end": 540.83,
          "en": "it is, doesn't have to be named ID, but anything that is unique for this piece of data and it should",
          "zh": "它是什麼，不必命名為 ID，但任何對這份資料是唯一的東西，而且它不應該"
        },
        {
          "id": 141,
          "start": 540.83,
          "end": 547.67,
          "en": "not be that index because that index is generated automatically, but anything that is unique can be",
          "zh": "是那個索引，因為那個索引是自動產生的，但任何唯一的東西都可以"
        },
        {
          "id": 142,
          "start": 547.67,
          "end": 549.05,
          "en": "picked as an ID here.",
          "zh": "在這裡被選為 ID。"
        },
        {
          "id": 143,
          "start": 549.05,
          "end": 555.59,
          "en": "And this will now help svelte update this correctly because it now does not discard the last element",
          "zh": "而這現在會幫助 Svelte 正確更新這個，因為它現在不會丟棄最後一個元素"
        },
        {
          "id": 144,
          "start": 555.59,
          "end": 556.41,
          "en": "automatically.",
          "zh": "自動地。"
        },
        {
          "id": 145,
          "start": 556.43,
          "end": 558.77,
          "en": "Instead, it's now really able to compare.",
          "zh": "相對地，它現在真的能夠比較。"
        },
        {
          "id": 146,
          "start": 558.8,
          "end": 560.51,
          "en": "Okay, where did the data change?",
          "zh": "好，資料在哪裡改變了？"
        },
        {
          "id": 147,
          "start": 560.51,
          "end": 566.78,
          "en": "How do I now need to update the Dom instead of first updating the Dom by deleting the last element and",
          "zh": "我現在需要怎麼更新 DOM，而不是先藉由刪除最後一個元素來更新 DOM，然後"
        },
        {
          "id": 148,
          "start": 566.78,
          "end": 569.06,
          "en": "then fitting the data into the new structure.",
          "zh": "把資料塞進新結構。"
        },
        {
          "id": 149,
          "start": 569.78,
          "end": 578.48,
          "en": "So therefore now if we add cards here with Max, Max two and Max three, if I now delete the first element,",
          "zh": "所以因此現在如果我們在這裡加卡片 Max、Max two 和 Max three，如果我現在刪除第一個元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 150,
          "start": 578.51,
          "end": 585.11,
          "en": "now you see we don't have that bug from before because again, now Svelte is able to first update the",
          "zh": "現在你看到我們沒有先前那個 bug，因為再次，現在 Svelte 能夠先更新"
        },
        {
          "id": 151,
          "start": 585.11,
          "end": 592.58,
          "en": "data and then update the Dom as needed instead of squeezing the updated data into the randomly updated",
          "zh": "資料，然後按需要更新 DOM，而不是把更新後的資料擠進隨機更新的"
        },
        {
          "id": 152,
          "start": 592.58,
          "end": 593.21,
          "en": "dom.",
          "zh": "DOM。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "14689538",
      "title": "A Closer Look at List Keys",
      "lectureOrder": 31,
      "videoOrder": 27,
      "sourceHash": "79334bc750134b4183f968f52f2b3eeb0806c08313c48ff41c34625879afc55e",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 1.99,
          "end": 7.63,
          "en": "Just as a little addition, because I know that this key thing can really be hard to wrap your head",
          "zh": "只是一點補充，因為我知道這個 key 的事真的可能很難想"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 7.63,
          "end": 8.29,
          "en": "around.",
          "zh": "通。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.33,
          "end": 10.63,
          "en": "Here's a really good example of what I meant.",
          "zh": "這裡有一個很好的例子，說明我的意思。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.66,
          "end": 13.36,
          "en": "This is the solution of the assignment.",
          "zh": "這是作業的解答。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.36,
          "end": 16.9,
          "en": "And I mentioned you could add a key here too, to improve performance.",
          "zh": "而我提到你也可以在這裡加一個 key，來改善效能。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.08,
          "end": 19.96,
          "en": "Now, let's first of all see what's happening without a key.",
          "zh": "現在，讓我們先看看沒有 key 時發生什麼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.14,
          "end": 24.06,
          "en": "For this, I open my developer tools and the elements tab there in Chrome.",
          "zh": "為此，我打開開發者工具，以及 Chrome 裡的 Elements 分頁。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 24.07,
          "end": 26.68,
          "en": "Let's add a couple of these passwords here.",
          "zh": "讓我們在這裡加幾個密碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.68,
          "end": 28.78,
          "en": "Different passwords, passwords.",
          "zh": "不同的密碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 29.08,
          "end": 34.9,
          "en": "Now let's expand this unordered list which outputs the passwords on the right and watch this part on",
          "zh": "現在讓我們展開這個無序清單，它在右邊輸出密碼，並看這個部分在"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 34.9,
          "end": 35.86,
          "en": "the right.",
          "zh": "右邊。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 35.89,
          "end": 40,
          "en": "The parts which are updated in the Dom will flash.",
          "zh": "DOM 裡被更新的部分會閃一下。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 40,
          "end": 44.14,
          "en": "So now I'm clicking the middle item and watch the part on the right.",
          "zh": "所以現在我點中間那個項目，並看右邊的部分。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 44.62,
          "end": 46.42,
          "en": "You see this flashed.",
          "zh": "你看到這個閃了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 46.45,
          "end": 52.81,
          "en": "Now this here is the last element now because I deleted the one in the middle and you see the list item",
          "zh": "現在這裡是最後一個元素，因為我刪掉了中間那個，而你看到清單項目"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 52.81,
          "end": 53.65,
          "en": "was re rendered.",
          "zh": "被重新渲染。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 53.65,
          "end": 56.14,
          "en": "This flashed and the text flashed.",
          "zh": "這個閃了，而文字也閃了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 56.41,
          "end": 59.2,
          "en": "Now, you could argue that neither of the two changed.",
          "zh": "現在，你可以爭辯這兩個都沒有改變。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 59.32,
          "end": 62.27,
          "en": "Of course, you could say, well, the middle one was deleted.",
          "zh": "當然，你可以說，嗯，中間那個被刪了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 62.27,
          "end": 64.76,
          "en": "So the last one is now the the middle one.",
          "zh": "所以最後一個現在是中間那個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 64.76,
          "end": 66.37,
          "en": "No, it's still the last one.",
          "zh": "不，它仍然是最後一個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 66.38,
          "end": 68.87,
          "en": "Instead, what happened is what I explained earlier.",
          "zh": "相對地，發生的是我稍早解釋的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 68.87,
          "end": 73.4,
          "en": "Svelte always removes the last element of the list.",
          "zh": "Svelte 永遠移除清單的最後一個元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 73.4,
          "end": 80.93,
          "en": "So the Dom list of the markup items and then squeezes the data, the array of passwords in this case",
          "zh": "所以標記項目的 DOM 清單，然後把資料擠進去，這個例子是密碼陣列"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 80.93,
          "end": 82.49,
          "en": "into this new Dom structure.",
          "zh": "進這個新的 DOM 結構。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 82.49,
          "end": 84.23,
          "en": "So it has an array with two elements.",
          "zh": "所以它有一個有兩個元素的陣列。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 84.23,
          "end": 86.27,
          "en": "It has a Dom list with two elements.",
          "zh": "它有一個有兩個元素的 DOM 清單。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 86.27,
          "end": 93.38,
          "en": "So of course this works, but because it has to squeeze that data in, it essentially has to touch this",
          "zh": "所以這當然行得通，但因為它必須把那份資料擠進去，它本質上必須碰到這個"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 93.38,
          "end": 93.68,
          "en": "element.",
          "zh": "元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 93.68,
          "end": 95.89,
          "en": "Again, even though we didn't change this.",
          "zh": "再次，即使我們沒有改變這個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 95.9,
          "end": 98,
          "en": "Let me delete the first element now and again.",
          "zh": "讓我現在刪除第一個元素，然後再次。"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 98,
          "end": 98.69,
          "en": "Watch.",
          "zh": "看。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 98.72,
          "end": 102.44,
          "en": "You see it flashes even though I deleted the other element.",
          "zh": "你看到它閃了，即使我刪的是另一個元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 102.44,
          "end": 104.06,
          "en": "So this one should never flash.",
          "zh": "所以這個永遠不應該閃。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 104.06,
          "end": 108.44,
          "en": "The other one should just be removed from the Dom and this one should not be touched at all.",
          "zh": "另一個應該只是從 DOM 被移除，而這個完全不應該被碰到。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 108.44,
          "end": 115.37,
          "en": "But Svelte has to touch it because it actually deleted the last element and then had to update the remaining",
          "zh": "但 Svelte 必須碰到它，因為它實際上刪了最後一個元素，然後必須更新剩下的"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 115.37,
          "end": 119.78,
          "en": "only element here to fit our existing array into it.",
          "zh": "這裡唯一的元素，來把我們既有的陣列塞進去。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 119.78,
          "end": 124.31,
          "en": "Because in the array we did not delete the last element but the first element.",
          "zh": "因為在陣列裡我們沒有刪最後一個元素，而是刪了第一個元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 124.31,
          "end": 129.95,
          "en": "Hence it had to take the remaining element of the array, which was not the same as the remaining element",
          "zh": "因此它必須拿陣列剩下的元素，而它和 DOM 裡剩下的元素不一樣"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 129.95,
          "end": 134.09,
          "en": "in the Dom and update the element in the Dom to fit our array.",
          "zh": "並更新 DOM 裡的元素來符合我們的陣列。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 134.09,
          "end": 140.42000000000002,
          "en": "Again, it does this from the end of the array to the start and therefore in this case it had to touch",
          "zh": "再次，它從陣列的結尾做到開頭，因此在這個例子它必須碰到"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 140.42000000000002,
          "end": 144.23,
          "en": "one element if I again add more passwords here.",
          "zh": "一個元素，如果我再次在這裡加更多密碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 146.24,
          "end": 147.17000000000002,
          "en": "Like this.",
          "zh": "像這樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 147.79,
          "end": 149.56,
          "en": "And I delete the first one.",
          "zh": "而我刪掉第一個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 149.56,
          "end": 154.03,
          "en": "You see, all of them are flashing because again, it removed the last one and then it goes from the",
          "zh": "你看到，它們全部都在閃，因為再次，它移除了最後一個，然後它從"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 154.03,
          "end": 161.62,
          "en": "last to the first one and squeezes the array of JavaScript elements so of strings in this case into",
          "zh": "最後一個走到第一個，並把 JavaScript 元素的陣列，這個例子是字串，擠進"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 161.62,
          "end": 163.99,
          "en": "our Dom list of list items.",
          "zh": "我們的清單項目 DOM 清單。"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 164.29,
          "end": 167.35,
          "en": "Now let me show you how this improves if we use a key.",
          "zh": "現在讓我給你看如果我們用 key，這怎麼改善。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 167.38,
          "end": 169.45,
          "en": "Now what could be a unique key here?",
          "zh": "現在這裡什麼可以當唯一 key？"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 169.9,
          "end": 171.85,
          "en": "Well, a password is just a string.",
          "zh": "嗯，密碼只是一個字串。"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 171.85,
          "end": 179.17000000000002,
          "en": "It's not an object where we would have an ID property, but let's assume we never have duplicate passwords.",
          "zh": "它不是一個我們會有 ID 屬性的物件，但讓我們假設我們永遠沒有重複的密碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 179.17000000000002,
          "end": 181.24,
          "en": "And therefore, this is just a demo here.",
          "zh": "因此，這只是這裡的示範。"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 181.24,
          "end": 185.05,
          "en": "It's not really something you could use in real life there.",
          "zh": "這不是你在真實生活裡可以用的東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 185.05,
          "end": 190.21,
          "en": "You would need some real unique key, which you again typically have if you get something from a database.",
          "zh": "你會需要某個真正的唯一 key，如果你從資料庫拿到東西，你通常又會有。"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 190.21,
          "end": 192.97,
          "en": "But here, let's say every password is unique.",
          "zh": "但這裡，讓我們說每個密碼都是唯一的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 193,
          "end": 197.89,
          "en": "In this case, we can just use the password itself as a key because if it never repeats, then every",
          "zh": "在這個情況，我們可以就把密碼本身當作 key，因為如果它永不重複，那麼每個"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 197.89,
          "end": 200.65,
          "en": "password has a unique key, its own value.",
          "zh": "密碼都有一個唯一 key，它自己的值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 200.65,
          "end": 203.92000000000002,
          "en": "So password is used as a key here and now.",
          "zh": "所以 password 在這裡被用作 key，而現在。"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 203.92000000000002,
          "end": 206.29,
          "en": "Let me show you how the behavior here changes.",
          "zh": "讓我給你看這裡的行為怎麼改變。"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 206.47,
          "end": 209.72,
          "en": "Let's add a couple of passwords, different passwords.",
          "zh": "讓我們加幾個密碼，不同的密碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 209.72,
          "end": 211.49,
          "en": "That's now really important.",
          "zh": "那現在真的很重要。"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 211.49,
          "end": 212.81,
          "en": "Shouldn't repeat.",
          "zh": "不應該重複。"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 212.93,
          "end": 219.53,
          "en": "Let's expand this and now see what flashes when I remove the first element on the left.",
          "zh": "讓我們展開這個，現在看當我移除左邊第一個元素時什麼會閃。"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 219.56,
          "end": 222.32,
          "en": "Previously, all our elements flashed.",
          "zh": "先前，我們所有元素都閃了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 222.32,
          "end": 226,
          "en": "Thereafter, both the list item elements and the text in there.",
          "zh": "在那之後，清單項目元素和裡面的文字都是。"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 226.01,
          "end": 232.46,
          "en": "Now if I remove the first element, nothing flashed, just the unordered list because there indeed we",
          "zh": "現在如果我移除第一個元素，什麼都沒閃，只有無序清單，因為那裡確實我們"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 232.46,
          "end": 237.14,
          "en": "did remove one list item, so we had to repaint a part of that.",
          "zh": "移除了一個清單項目，所以我們必須重繪它的一部分。"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 237.14,
          "end": 241.64,
          "en": "But these list items were not rerendered and that's the part I meant with.",
          "zh": "但這些清單項目沒有被重新渲染，而那是我說的部分。"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 241.64,
          "end": 246.53,
          "en": "The performance doesn't really matter here, but there is a difference technically here.",
          "zh": "效能在這裡其實不重要，但技術上這裡有差別。"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 246.53,
          "end": 253.85,
          "en": "Svelte had a unique identifier so it knew exactly which Dom item to remove and hadn't had to touch the",
          "zh": "Svelte 有一個唯一識別碼，所以它確切知道要移除哪個 DOM 項目，而不必碰到"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 253.85,
          "end": 254.57,
          "en": "others.",
          "zh": "其他的。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "14689540",
      "title": "Wrap Up",
      "lectureOrder": 32,
      "videoOrder": 28,
      "sourceHash": "ed481bd0a00547065041adf0705ee6fae6f9693fe52ec37152c46a99b1c514f1",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.09,
          "end": 2.87,
          "en": "That's it.",
          "zh": "就這樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.9,
          "end": 6.17,
          "en": "Now for conditionals and loops.",
          "zh": "現在談條件與迴圈。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.2,
          "end": 15.35,
          "en": "Two crucial concepts in Svelte, which allow you to output markup conditionally and to output repeated",
          "zh": "Svelte 裡兩個關鍵概念，讓你能有條件地輸出標記，以及輸出重複的"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 15.35,
          "end": 21.35,
          "en": "chunks of markup based on some array or iterable object in general, which you have now.",
          "zh": "標記片段，根據某個陣列或一般來說可迭代的物件，你現在已經有的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 21.35,
          "end": 27.59,
          "en": "In the next module we'll move on and dive a bit deeper into some concepts related to reactivity which",
          "zh": "下一單元我們會繼續，深入一點看一些和反應性有關的概念，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 27.59,
          "end": 33.8,
          "en": "you should be aware of to write efficient and correct code that really gets the job done you need to",
          "zh": "你應該知道這些，才能寫出有效且正確的程式碼，真正完成你需要"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 33.8,
          "end": 34.55,
          "en": "get done.",
          "zh": "完成的工作。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "14689546",
      "title": "Module Introduction",
      "lectureOrder": 34,
      "videoOrder": 29,
      "sourceHash": "ef782831db8fdf0a1c571208ac09ab2d84b152f5f38f298ff34b1b7dadbfb07b",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 1.95,
          "end": 5.76,
          "en": "Reactivity is a core concept in svelte or put.",
          "zh": "反應性是 Svelte 的核心概念，或者說。"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.76,
          "end": 12.42,
          "en": "In other words, svelte is all about reactivity, and reactivity simply means that when you change something",
          "zh": "換句話說，Svelte 全是關於反應性，而反應性單純意思是當你改變某樣東西"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 12.42,
          "end": 18.15,
          "en": "in your JavaScript code, when a new value gets stored, when a user clicked a button and some code",
          "zh": "在你的 JavaScript 程式碼裡，當一個新值被儲存，當使用者點了一個按鈕而某段程式碼"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 18.15,
          "end": 26.34,
          "en": "runs and stores the name of the user in a variable that if you then output that data in the markup in",
          "zh": "執行並把使用者的名字存在一個變數裡，如果你接著在標記裡、在"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 26.34,
          "end": 30.39,
          "en": "your HTML code, that svelte automatically updates the Dom.",
          "zh": "你的 HTML 程式碼裡輸出那份資料，Svelte 會自動更新 DOM。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 30.39,
          "end": 32.82,
          "en": "That's the whole idea of using svelte in the end.",
          "zh": "那就是最後使用 Svelte 的整個想法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 32.82,
          "end": 39.06,
          "en": "Right now, when we talk about reactivity, we talk about things like handling events, we talk about",
          "zh": "現在，當我們談反應性，我們談的是像處理事件這樣的事，我們談"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 39.06,
          "end": 45.3,
          "en": "things like updating data, and especially when we work with arrays and objects, this can be tricky.",
          "zh": "像更新資料這樣的事，尤其當我們使用陣列和物件時，這可能很棘手。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 45.33,
          "end": 53.88,
          "en": "This module is there to dive a bit deeper into these more advanced cases or the specific things and",
          "zh": "這個單元是為了更深入這些較進階的情況，或那些特定的事以及"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 53.88,
          "end": 56.4,
          "en": "special things you should be aware of.",
          "zh": "你應該注意的特別之處。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "14689548",
      "title": "Updating Arrays & Objects Immutably",
      "lectureOrder": 35,
      "videoOrder": 30,
      "sourceHash": "af226fff647377d818186de54392d35bb9991e35c3846454bfc168fc68f8440f",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.02,
          "end": 2.62,
          "en": "For that.",
          "zh": "為此。"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.62,
          "end": 10.21,
          "en": "I'm back to this mini application we built before already with our inputs here and with our contact",
          "zh": "我回到這個迷你應用程式，我們之前已經建好的，這裡有我們的輸入以及我們的聯絡人"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 10.21,
          "end": 11.56,
          "en": "cards, which we can add.",
          "zh": "卡片，我們可以新增的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.92,
          "end": 18.37,
          "en": "And when we talk about reactivity, we already saw one important concept and that was related to how",
          "zh": "而當我們談反應性，我們已經看過一個重要概念，那和我們如何"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 18.37,
          "end": 20.11,
          "en": "we update arrays.",
          "zh": "更新陣列有關。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 20.81,
          "end": 27.83,
          "en": "If you remember, you always had to update arrays by assigning a new array and not by using push or",
          "zh": "如果你記得，你總是必須藉由指派一個新陣列來更新陣列，而不是使用 push 或"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 27.83,
          "end": 29.64,
          "en": "pop or anything like that.",
          "zh": "pop 或類似那樣的東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 29.66,
          "end": 35.84,
          "en": "Instead, always store a new value in the variables which you use in your markup.",
          "zh": "相反，總是把一個新值存進你在標記裡使用的那些變數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 35.84,
          "end": 37.64,
          "en": "And that's a general rule.",
          "zh": "而那是一般規則。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 37.64,
          "end": 44,
          "en": "You can just memorize whatever you're outputting in your markup anywhere, in any component.",
          "zh": "你可以單純記住，無論你在標記裡任何地方、任何元件輸出什麼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 44.03,
          "end": 52.28,
          "en": "You should always reassign a value with a new equal sign if you want svelte to update the real Dom.",
          "zh": "如果你想讓 Svelte 更新真正的 DOM，你應該總是用一個新的等號重新指派一個值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 52.28,
          "end": 59.15,
          "en": "So if you want svelte to update what the user sees simply because the equal sign is the trigger for",
          "zh": "所以如果你想讓 Svelte 更新使用者看到的，單純因為等號是觸發器，讓"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 59.15,
          "end": 66.56,
          "en": "svelte to check what was changed and then whether that is output somewhere in the Dom and whether it",
          "zh": "Svelte 檢查改變了什麼，然後那個是否在 DOM 某處被輸出，以及它是否"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 66.56,
          "end": 68.09,
          "en": "then should change it there.",
          "zh": "接著應該在那裡改變它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 68.09,
          "end": 75.89,
          "en": "So the equal sign is the trigger and that's why non equal sign changes like you have it with created",
          "zh": "所以等號是觸發器，那就是為什麼沒有等號的改變，像你在 createdContacts"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 75.89,
          "end": 76.78999999999999,
          "en": "contacts.",
          "zh": "上有的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 76.78999999999999,
          "end": 80.95,
          "en": "Dot push won't do anything because here there is no equal sign involved.",
          "zh": "點 push 不會做任何事，因為這裡沒有牽涉等號。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 80.97,
          "end": 83.07,
          "en": "Hence svelte doesn't do anything.",
          "zh": "因此 Svelte 不做任何事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 83.61,
          "end": 91.23,
          "en": "On the other hand, what does work of course, are things like created contacts, equal created contacts,",
          "zh": "另一方面，當然有效的是像 createdContacts 等於 createdContacts、"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 91.23,
          "end": 95.99000000000001,
          "en": "slice or filter, which you also saw before, right?",
          "zh": "slice 或 filter 這樣的事，你之前也看過的，對吧？"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 96,
          "end": 96.87,
          "en": "Like here.",
          "zh": "像這裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 97.14,
          "end": 98.03999999999999,
          "en": "Of course.",
          "zh": "當然。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 98.03999999999999,
          "end": 101.97,
          "en": "Here I'm also using a method on my array, but I also have an equal sign.",
          "zh": "這裡我也在我的陣列上使用一個方法，但我也有一個等號。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 101.97,
          "end": 107.22,
          "en": "I only use this method to create a new or to calculate a new array based on the old one.",
          "zh": "我只用這個方法來建立一個新的，或根據舊的計算一個新陣列。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 107.22,
          "end": 110.82,
          "en": "And then I take this new array and overwrite the old one.",
          "zh": "然後我拿這個新陣列並覆寫舊的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 110.82,
          "end": 114.45,
          "en": "So that really is something crucial to memorize and to be aware of.",
          "zh": "所以那真的是必須記住並注意的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 114.47999999999999,
          "end": 116.15,
          "en": "Now, why is this required?",
          "zh": "現在，為什麼需要這樣？"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 116.16,
          "end": 123.21,
          "en": "Because arrays and objects in JavaScript are reference types now attached.",
          "zh": "因為 JavaScript 裡的陣列和物件是參考型別。現在，附上的資料裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 123.24,
          "end": 129.33,
          "en": "You find a full article and video where I dive deeper into this, which makes this way clearer where",
          "zh": "你會找到一篇完整文章和影片，我在那裡更深入這個，讓這件事更清楚，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 129.33,
          "end": 134.91,
          "en": "you can learn what this all is about and what I mean with reference types and primitives, which is",
          "zh": "你可以學到這一切是關於什麼，以及我說的參考型別和基本型別是什麼意思，那是"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 134.91,
          "end": 135.51,
          "en": "the opposite.",
          "zh": "相反的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 135.51,
          "end": 140.67000000000002,
          "en": "So to say that's a core JavaScript concept, not exclusive to svelte.",
          "zh": "所以可以說那是核心 JavaScript 概念，不是 Svelte 獨有的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 140.7,
          "end": 147.39,
          "en": "It just explains why you have to change it like this if we are working with arrays and objects.",
          "zh": "它只是解釋為什麼當我們使用陣列和物件時，你必須像這樣改變它。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "14689550",
      "title": "Understanding Event Modifiers",
      "lectureOrder": 36,
      "videoOrder": 31,
      "sourceHash": "e4d8425bf438a4b5d9b75b8abcef307ce517b62b09031565b292dc52e22f05b0",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.06,
          "end": 6.75,
          "en": "Now that is it for assignments which then trigger changes in the Dom.",
          "zh": "現在指派就到這裡，那些接著會觸發 DOM 裡的改變。"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 6.77,
          "end": 12.83,
          "en": "There are also two important things I want you to know about events.",
          "zh": "關於事件，還有兩件重要的事我想讓你知道。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 13.1,
          "end": 15.08,
          "en": "Now we do have our buttons here, right?",
          "zh": "現在我們這裡有按鈕，對吧？"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 15.08,
          "end": 19.34,
          "en": "And we do use onClick to trigger an event.",
          "zh": "而我們確實使用 on:click 來觸發一個事件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 19.73,
          "end": 29.33,
          "en": "Now, sometimes you have an event which you might only want to trigger once, and for that you have",
          "zh": "現在，有時你有一個事件你可能只想觸發一次，而為此你有"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 29.36,
          "end": 31.91,
          "en": "so called modifiers in svelte.",
          "zh": "Svelte 裡所謂的修飾詞。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 32.3,
          "end": 38.78,
          "en": "A modifier can be added after this event syntax so on colon and then the event name by adding the pipe",
          "zh": "修飾詞可以加在這個事件語法後面，所以是 on 冒號然後事件名稱，藉由加上管線"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 38.78,
          "end": 41.93,
          "en": "symbol which is this vertical line here.",
          "zh": "符號，也就是這裡這條垂直線。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 41.93,
          "end": 44.09,
          "en": "So this pipe symbol on your keyboard.",
          "zh": "所以你鍵盤上的這個管線符號。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 44.87,
          "end": 50.09,
          "en": "And then one of the supported modifiers now which modifiers are supported?",
          "zh": "然後是其中一個支援的修飾詞。現在支援哪些修飾詞？"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 50.81,
          "end": 53.95,
          "en": "There are five supported modifiers.",
          "zh": "有五個支援的修飾詞。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 53.96,
          "end": 56.12,
          "en": "One of them is once.",
          "zh": "其中一個是 once。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 56.27,
          "end": 61.13,
          "en": "Now the once modifier makes sure that this event can only fire well once and thereafter.",
          "zh": "現在 once 修飾詞確保這個事件只能觸發一次，之後"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 61.13,
          "end": 63.21,
          "en": "The event listener simply is detached.",
          "zh": "事件監聽器就單純被卸下。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 63.23,
          "end": 67.22,
          "en": "So if I now fill this out and I click this, it works, but it works.",
          "zh": "所以如果我現在填好這個並點這個，它有效，但它有效。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 67.22,
          "end": 70.49,
          "en": "No second time I'm clicking this and nothing happens.",
          "zh": "第二次我點這個，什麼都沒發生。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 70.52,
          "end": 77.18,
          "en": "Can be useful for scenarios where a button or whatever event you're working with should only fire once.",
          "zh": "對按鈕或你正在使用的任何事件應該只觸發一次的情境，這可以有用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 78.11,
          "end": 81.35,
          "en": "Other modifiers are passive.",
          "zh": "其他修飾詞是 passive。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 81.38,
          "end": 84.83,
          "en": "This can improve the scrolling performance.",
          "zh": "這可以改善捲動效能。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 84.95,
          "end": 88.19,
          "en": "However, you don't typically need to set this yourself.",
          "zh": "不過，你通常不需要自己設定這個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 88.19,
          "end": 90.02,
          "en": "Swelled will do it automatically.",
          "zh": "Svelte 會自動做這件事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 90.02,
          "end": 95,
          "en": "In most cases you can add Captcha to.",
          "zh": "在多數情況你可以加上 capture。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 96.08,
          "end": 100.61,
          "en": "Fire the event handler during the capture phase instead of the public phase.",
          "zh": "在捕捉階段觸發事件處理器，而不是冒泡階段。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 100.75999999999999,
          "end": 105.62,
          "en": "In case it's not clear what this is all about, attached, you find a helpful link on that.",
          "zh": "如果這一切是什麼不清楚，附上的資料裡你會找到一個有幫助的連結。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 105.89,
          "end": 115.1,
          "en": "And more important, you have stop propagation, which stops the event propagation and you have prevent",
          "zh": "而更重要的，你有 stopPropagation，它停止事件傳遞，而你有 prevent"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 115.1,
          "end": 116.15,
          "en": "default.",
          "zh": "預設。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 116.3,
          "end": 121.14,
          "en": "Now, this especially is useful if you're having a button inside of a form.",
          "zh": "現在，如果你在表單裡面有一個按鈕，這個特別有用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 121.16,
          "end": 122.96,
          "en": "Let me show you what I mean.",
          "zh": "讓我給你看我的意思。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 123.32,
          "end": 128.45,
          "en": "Let me remove this modifier and put this here into a real form.",
          "zh": "讓我去掉這個修飾詞，並把這個放進一個真正的表單。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 128.45,
          "end": 136.22,
          "en": "So I'll replace that div with the ID form with a form element with the ID form, and I'll move my button",
          "zh": "所以我會用一個 id 為 form 的 form 元素取代那個 id 為 form 的 div，而我會把我的按鈕"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 136.22,
          "end": 137.6,
          "en": "into this form now.",
          "zh": "移進這個表單。"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 138.86,
          "end": 142.2,
          "en": "And I will now give this button a type of submit.",
          "zh": "而我現在會給這個按鈕 type 為 submit。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 142.22,
          "end": 143.87,
          "en": "It should submit this form.",
          "zh": "它應該提交這個表單。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 143.87,
          "end": 150.02,
          "en": "Please note that this form has no action and no method because I don't want to send a request to a server.",
          "zh": "請注意這個表單沒有 action 也沒有 method，因為我不想送請求到伺服器。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 150.02,
          "end": 152.93,
          "en": "I want to handle this entirely on the client side.",
          "zh": "我想完全在用戶端處理這個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 152.93,
          "end": 159.41,
          "en": "Still, for semantic reasons, a form element makes sense if we now save this.",
          "zh": "儘管如此，為了語意，如果我們現在存檔，form 元素是合理的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 160.93,
          "end": 166.84,
          "en": "Well, of course, now this markup is a little bit more ugly because now there is a line break because",
          "zh": "嗯，當然，現在這個標記稍微醜一點，因為現在有換行，因為"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 166.84,
          "end": 169.39,
          "en": "we moved the button into another element.",
          "zh": "我們把按鈕移進另一個元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 169.42000000000002,
          "end": 177.34,
          "en": "Let me quickly fix this by giving my form element here an additional margin of one REM top and bottom.",
          "zh": "讓我快速修好這個，給這裡我的 form 元素額外的 margin，上下 1rem。"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 177.34,
          "end": 178.99,
          "en": "So there is some distance.",
          "zh": "所以有一些距離。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 178.99,
          "end": 183.52,
          "en": "But of course, the more important thing I want to show you is that if I now click this button, please",
          "zh": "但當然，我想給你看的更重要的事是，如果我現在點這個按鈕，請"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 183.52,
          "end": 185.71,
          "en": "watch this refresh icon here.",
          "zh": "看這裡這個重新整理圖示。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 186.43,
          "end": 190.78,
          "en": "You see the page reloaded and therefore all our content here is lost.",
          "zh": "你看到頁面重新載入，因此我們這裡所有內容都消失了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 190.78,
          "end": 196.61,
          "en": "And we didn't add a contact card because our app restarted and the entire JavaScript code ran again.",
          "zh": "而我們沒有新增聯絡人卡片，因為我們的應用程式重新啟動，整段 JavaScript 程式碼又跑了一次。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 196.63,
          "end": 202.75,
          "en": "Now when you're building such a client side application as we are doing it here, you typically don't",
          "zh": "現在當你建立像我們在這裡做的這種用戶端應用程式，你通常不"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 202.75,
          "end": 208.69,
          "en": "want that default browser behavior of a request being sent to your server because our server is not",
          "zh": "想要那個預設瀏覽器行為，也就是請求被送到你的伺服器，因為我們的伺服器沒有"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 208.69,
          "end": 209.68,
          "en": "prepared for that.",
          "zh": "為此準備好。"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 209.68,
          "end": 211.18,
          "en": "It's just a development server here.",
          "zh": "這裡只是一個開發伺服器。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 211.18,
          "end": 215.93,
          "en": "But also when we're deploying this, we might not have a server where we really expect that.",
          "zh": "但當我們部署這個時，我們也可能沒有一個真的預期那個的伺服器。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 215.95,
          "end": 221.98,
          "en": "Instead, you typically want to prevent that default so that no request is sent and then you want to",
          "zh": "相反，你通常想防止那個預設，這樣就不會送出請求，然後你想"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 221.98,
          "end": 223.03,
          "en": "run your own logic.",
          "zh": "執行你自己的邏輯。"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 223.03,
          "end": 228.61,
          "en": "Maybe at some point you do want to send a request to a server, but then typically to an API with some",
          "zh": "也許某個時候你確實想送請求到伺服器，但那時通常是送到一個 API，帶一些"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 228.61,
          "end": 236.5,
          "en": "Json data and not such a default Http request which is generated by HTML and the browser by default.",
          "zh": "JSON 資料，而不是 HTML 和瀏覽器預設產生的那種預設 HTTP 請求。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 236.89,
          "end": 244.36,
          "en": "Therefore, typically what you would do is in add contact, you get the event object.",
          "zh": "因此，通常你會做的是在 addContact 裡，你得到事件物件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 244.36,
          "end": 250.13,
          "en": "You always get this when you attach or when you call a function based on some event listener.",
          "zh": "當你根據某個事件監聽器附加或呼叫一個函式時，你總是得到這個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 250.13,
          "end": 252.95,
          "en": "So this is passed into your function by JavaScript.",
          "zh": "所以這是 JavaScript 傳進你的函式的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 252.95,
          "end": 254.45,
          "en": "By default, you could say.",
          "zh": "你可以說，預設就是這樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 254.54,
          "end": 258.5,
          "en": "And then typically you would call Event.preventdefault here.",
          "zh": "然後通常你會在這裡呼叫 event.preventDefault。"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 258.5,
          "end": 264.02,
          "en": "That is a default method you have on this event object to avoid that default behavior.",
          "zh": "那是你在這個事件物件上有的一個預設方法，用來避免那個預設行為。"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 264.02,
          "end": 268.46,
          "en": "And therefore now if I click this, you see now it works and we're not sending this request.",
          "zh": "因此現在如果我點這個，你看到現在它有效，而我們沒有送出這個請求。"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 268.67,
          "end": 276.05,
          "en": "You can absolutely do this with svelte too, but you can also shorten this and simply use that modifier.",
          "zh": "你用 Svelte 絕對也可以這樣做，但你也可以縮短這個，單純使用那個修飾詞。"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 276.05,
          "end": 283.25,
          "en": "So here on this click event here, I'll add the prevent default modifier here.",
          "zh": "所以在這裡這個 click 事件上，我會在這裡加上 preventDefault 修飾詞。"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 283.25,
          "end": 286.13,
          "en": "And what this does is you can probably guess it.",
          "zh": "而這做的事，你大概猜得到。"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 286.13,
          "end": 288.53,
          "en": "It does the same as our manual code.",
          "zh": "它和我們手動程式碼做的一樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 288.53,
          "end": 295.4,
          "en": "It prevents the default really handy and therefore modifiers like this can make your life easier and",
          "zh": "它防止預設，真的很方便，因此像這樣的修飾詞可以讓你的生活更輕鬆，"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 295.4,
          "end": 301.22,
          "en": "can make it really easy for you to make sure your events behave really exactly the way you want them",
          "zh": "也能讓你真的很容易確保你的事件表現得"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 301.22,
          "end": 302,
          "en": "to behave.",
          "zh": "完全是你要它們表現的方式。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "14689552",
      "title": "Using Inline Functions",
      "lectureOrder": 37,
      "videoOrder": 32,
      "sourceHash": "39512c9c107f3fc20d48ca6f0716e44e3ab20e08458b5ebeb1cb746dd9cbebb4",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.22,
          "end": 7.87,
          "en": "Talking about event listeners, there's one other quick thing I want to mention.",
          "zh": "談到事件監聽器，還有另一件我想提的小事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 7.89,
          "end": 15.63,
          "en": "Thus far, for all the events, I always point it at a function without parentheses to not execute this",
          "zh": "到目前為止，對所有事件，我總是指向一個沒有小括號的函式，這樣當程式碼被傳過去時不會執行它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 15.63,
          "end": 23.04,
          "en": "when the code gets passed, but to provide a pointer at this function so that when the event occurs,",
          "zh": "而是提供一個指向這個函式的指標，這樣當事件發生時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 23.04,
          "end": 24.89,
          "en": "this function can be executed.",
          "zh": "這個函式可以被執行。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 24.9,
          "end": 30.78,
          "en": "And this would be my recommended way of doing it because this is a really clear way of defining your",
          "zh": "而這會是我建議的做法，因為這是非常清楚的方式來定義你的"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 30.78,
          "end": 32.49,
          "en": "functions up there in the script.",
          "zh": "函式，在上面的 script"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 32.49,
          "end": 36.3,
          "en": "Tags makes it easy for other developers to understand your code.",
          "zh": "標籤裡，讓其他開發者容易理解你的程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 36.3,
          "end": 43.74,
          "en": "And then here you only have the pointers in your markup if you have really simple logic like maybe here",
          "zh": "然後這裡你在標記裡只有指標。如果你有真的簡單的邏輯，像也許這裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 43.74,
          "end": 50.37,
          "en": "where we really just update created contacts, then I would still recommend using such a function.",
          "zh": "我們真的只更新 createdContacts，那我仍會建議使用這樣的函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 50.37,
          "end": 53.64,
          "en": "But you can also use an inline function here.",
          "zh": "但你也可以在這裡使用行內函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 53.64,
          "end": 59.01,
          "en": "For this, you can use the modern JavaScript arrow function syntax which looks like this.",
          "zh": "為此，你可以使用現代 JavaScript 箭頭函式語法，看起來像這樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 59.8,
          "end": 63.82,
          "en": "And now here I'm getting some autocompletion, which I don't want.",
          "zh": "而現在這裡我得到一些自動完成，那不是我想要的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 63.85,
          "end": 67.06,
          "en": "We can avoid this by wrapping this in quotes.",
          "zh": "我們可以把這個包在引號裡來避免。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 68.5,
          "end": 76,
          "en": "This arrow function works such that here is the list of arguments so we could accept event here because",
          "zh": "這個箭頭函式的運作是，這裡是引數清單，所以我們可以在這裡接受 event，因為"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 76,
          "end": 76.93,
          "en": "we are getting this.",
          "zh": "我們正在得到這個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 76.93,
          "end": 79.27,
          "en": "I don't need it here, but we're still getting this.",
          "zh": "我這裡不需要它，但我們仍然得到這個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 79.27,
          "end": 85.75,
          "en": "And then here you have your function code and for short statements you can now just put your syntax",
          "zh": "然後這裡你有你的函式程式碼，而對短的陳述，你現在可以單純把你的語法"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 85.75,
          "end": 86.08,
          "en": "in there.",
          "zh": "放在那裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 86.08,
          "end": 88.33,
          "en": "You can even write multi-line statements here.",
          "zh": "你甚至可以在這裡寫多行陳述。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 88.33,
          "end": 94.33,
          "en": "But the more logic you put in here, the more I would recommend that you instead just point at a function",
          "zh": "但你放在這裡的邏輯越多，我就越建議你改為單純指向一個函式"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 94.33,
          "end": 95.86,
          "en": "and have your logic up there.",
          "zh": "並把你的邏輯放在上面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 95.86,
          "end": 102.43,
          "en": "But if it's really short, kind of a rule of thumb, if it fits into one line, then.",
          "zh": "但如果它真的很短，算是經驗法則，如果它放得進一行，那麼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 102.93,
          "end": 105,
          "en": "You can just do it here.",
          "zh": "你可以就在這裡做。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 107.95,
          "end": 111.52000000000001,
          "en": "And for example, use the logic from up there.",
          "zh": "而例如，使用上面的邏輯。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 111.97,
          "end": 114.28,
          "en": "Let me copy that for delete first.",
          "zh": "讓我先複製刪除第一個的那段。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 115.24000000000001,
          "end": 116.41,
          "en": "And put it in here.",
          "zh": "並把它放在這裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 116.83,
          "end": 122.05,
          "en": "Now, if you do that and you save this and I add my cards.",
          "zh": "現在，如果你那樣做並存檔，而我新增我的卡片。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 126.05,
          "end": 129.17,
          "en": "And I have an error here on prevent default.",
          "zh": "而我在 preventDefault 這裡有一個錯誤。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 141.01,
          "end": 142.36,
          "en": "Now add my card.",
          "zh": "現在新增我的卡片。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 142.39,
          "end": 148.99,
          "en": "If I delete first, this still works as before, but now I'm doing this inline with this arrow function.",
          "zh": "如果我刪除第一個，這仍然像之前一樣有效，但現在我用這個箭頭函式行內做這件事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 149.44,
          "end": 155.41,
          "en": "Now if it's only one statement as it is here, you can even omit these curly braces here because then",
          "zh": "現在如果它只有一個陳述，像這裡這樣，你甚至可以省略這些大括號，因為那時"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 155.41,
          "end": 160.12,
          "en": "this is treated as a statement, as the only statement of this function.",
          "zh": "這被當成一個陳述，當成這個函式唯一的陳述。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 160.12,
          "end": 162.04,
          "en": "The result of this will be returned.",
          "zh": "這個的結果會被回傳。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 162.07,
          "end": 163.51,
          "en": "Here we have no result.",
          "zh": "這裡我們沒有結果。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 163.51,
          "end": 164.37,
          "en": "Doesn't matter.",
          "zh": "沒關係。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 164.38,
          "end": 166.3,
          "en": "So now this will still work.",
          "zh": "所以現在這仍然會有效。"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 166.3,
          "end": 171.28,
          "en": "And this is an alternative for very short and concise statements.",
          "zh": "而這是非常短且簡潔的陳述的替代做法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 171.28,
          "end": 176.2,
          "en": "You can write them as inline functions here right on your click listener.",
          "zh": "你可以把它們寫成行內函式，就在你的 click 監聽器上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 176.2,
          "end": 181.69,
          "en": "Again, my recommendation for most functions would be that you instead point at a function which is",
          "zh": "再次，我對大多數函式的建議會是你改為指向一個函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 181.69,
          "end": 182.72,
          "en": "defined up there.",
          "zh": "定義在上面的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 182.74,
          "end": 185.56,
          "en": "I find this to be clearer and easier to read.",
          "zh": "我覺得這更清楚、更容易讀。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 185.59,
          "end": 188.74,
          "en": "Nonetheless, it is worth knowing this syntax.",
          "zh": "儘管如此，這個語法值得知道。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "14689554",
      "title": "Wrap Up",
      "lectureOrder": 38,
      "videoOrder": 33,
      "sourceHash": "3374be40f0b4c35e7d4e179ba71d2c4ec5b79cd7a32ce49d31bf7d1f772d6b48",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 1.98,
          "end": 4.08,
          "en": "That's it already for this module.",
          "zh": "這個單元就到這裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.08,
          "end": 11.76,
          "en": "Wasn't too long I guess, but contains some core things which are worth knowing when you work with svelte,",
          "zh": "我想不算太長，但包含一些核心的事，當你使用 Svelte 時值得知道，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 11.76,
          "end": 17.91,
          "en": "and especially with the reactive parts of svelte with functions and with updating data, especially",
          "zh": "尤其是 Svelte 的反應性部分，函式以及更新資料，尤其"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 17.91,
          "end": 20.04,
          "en": "when you're updating arrays and objects.",
          "zh": "當你更新陣列和物件時。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 20.31,
          "end": 27.96,
          "en": "With that, we got all the core features out of the way and now we can move forward towards the more",
          "zh": "有了那個，我們把所有核心功能都過完了，現在我們可以往前走向更"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 27.96,
          "end": 34.68,
          "en": "advanced features, some fun features and of course also dive into our little course project so that",
          "zh": "進階的功能、一些有趣的功能，當然也進入我們的小課程專案，這樣"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 34.68,
          "end": 41.04,
          "en": "you see all these things which we had in tiny demos thus far come together in the context of a slightly",
          "zh": "你會看到到目前為止我們在小型示範裡有的這些東西，在一個稍微"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 41.04,
          "end": 42.39,
          "en": "bigger application.",
          "zh": "更大的應用程式脈絡裡湊在一起。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "14689558",
      "title": "Module Introduction",
      "lectureOrder": 40,
      "videoOrder": 34,
      "sourceHash": "f00d2f5af9b112bf81384cb96b128e8eeaa1be9d632884083f7264950f067394",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.02,
          "end": 8.32,
          "en": "After all, the theory and the mini projects we worked on thus far were the demos, which are of course",
          "zh": "畢竟，到目前為止我們做的理論和迷你專案是示範，那當然"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 8.32,
          "end": 11.11,
          "en": "crucial for understanding the bass syntax.",
          "zh": "對理解基礎語法很關鍵。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 11.11,
          "end": 15.94,
          "en": "But after all of that, it's now time to start working on our course project.",
          "zh": "但在那一切之後，現在是開始做我們課程專案的時候。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 15.97,
          "end": 22.27,
          "en": "The idea behind the course project, of course, is that you get a better understanding of how to apply",
          "zh": "課程專案背後的想法，當然，是讓你更了解如何在真實世界情境套用"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 22.27,
          "end": 29.14,
          "en": "these different concepts in a real world scenario, so when to use which tool and so on.",
          "zh": "這些不同概念，所以何時用哪個工具，諸如此類。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 29.38,
          "end": 35.5,
          "en": "Now in this module here, the core goals are that we practice the core syntax.",
          "zh": "現在在這個單元，核心目標是我們練習核心語法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 35.5,
          "end": 37.18,
          "en": "You learn about that.",
          "zh": "你學習那個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 37.18,
          "end": 44.02,
          "en": "You generally get a feeling for components and how you work with them in which role they play in applications",
          "zh": "你一般會對元件有感覺，以及你如何使用它們、它們在你用 Svelte 建立的應用程式裡扮演什麼角色，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 44.02,
          "end": 46.63,
          "en": "you're building with svelte and how you use them.",
          "zh": "以及你如何使用它們。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 46.66,
          "end": 52.78,
          "en": "Of course, that you also learn about different types or kinds of components you can build.",
          "zh": "當然，你也學習你可以建立的不同型別或種類的元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 52.78,
          "end": 60.37,
          "en": "And that's not an official differentiation, but you will see that there are two main types of components",
          "zh": "而那不是官方區分，但你會看到有兩種主要元件型別"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 60.37,
          "end": 63.61,
          "en": "you can differentiate, and that is important.",
          "zh": "你可以區分，而那很重要。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 63.62,
          "end": 70.22,
          "en": "And overall, it's simply also important that you learn how to apply the concepts in a more realistic",
          "zh": "而整體來說，單純也很重要的是你學習如何在更真實的"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 70.22,
          "end": 75.92,
          "en": "environment and therefore are able to build real applications with the knowledge you're gaining in this",
          "zh": "環境套用這些概念，因此能夠用你在這門"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 75.92,
          "end": 76.64,
          "en": "course.",
          "zh": "課程獲得的知識建立真正的應用程式。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "14689560",
      "title": "Project Setup & A First Component",
      "lectureOrder": 41,
      "videoOrder": 35,
      "sourceHash": "37b191bec3ef19c9beb01be0e616533c9bd83a993f33bbce93834c1f90129733",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 1.99,
          "end": 8.05,
          "en": "Now for this course project, we'll start a brand new project which you find attached to this video.",
          "zh": "現在這個課程專案，我們會開始一個全新專案，你會在這支影片的附件找到。"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 8.14,
          "end": 14.44,
          "en": "It's a very simple project, exactly the same structure you saw before with the app Svelte file, which",
          "zh": "它是非常簡單的專案，結構和你之前看到的完全一樣，有 App.svelte 檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 14.44,
          "end": 20.98,
          "en": "looks like this pretty empty and the main JS file where we basically attach this app component to our",
          "zh": "看起來相當空，以及 main.js 檔案，我們基本上把這個 App 元件接到我們的"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 20.98,
          "end": 23.62,
          "en": "document body and the body.",
          "zh": "document.body。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 23.62,
          "end": 29.98,
          "en": "We get nothing else but that script import and we simply replace everything but that script import with",
          "zh": "我們除了那個 script 匯入之外什麼都沒有，而我們單純用"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 29.98,
          "end": 31.27,
          "en": "our app component.",
          "zh": "我們的 App 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 31.27,
          "end": 36.43,
          "en": "Here in the global CSS file, I got some global styling and font import up here.",
          "zh": "這裡在全域 CSS 檔案，我上面有一些全域樣式和字型匯入。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 36.46,
          "end": 37.87,
          "en": "Nothing too fancy.",
          "zh": "沒什麼太花俏。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 37.87,
          "end": 39.4,
          "en": "So that is what we'll work on.",
          "zh": "所以那就是我們要做的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 39.4,
          "end": 43.21,
          "en": "Now the question of course, is what are we going to build in this course?",
          "zh": "現在問題當然是，我們在這門課要建立什麼？"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 43.21,
          "end": 50.68,
          "en": "And the answer is we will build a simple meetup website where you can create meetups, where you can",
          "zh": "答案是我們會建立一個簡單的聚會網站，你可以建立聚會，你可以"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 50.68,
          "end": 55.99,
          "en": "edit them, where you can favorite them, where you can also contact the organizers of a meetup if you",
          "zh": "編輯它們，你可以把它們加到最愛，你也可以聯絡聚會的主辦人，如果你"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 55.99,
          "end": 56.62,
          "en": "want to join.",
          "zh": "想參加。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 56.62,
          "end": 63.71,
          "en": "For example, this application, whilst being relatively simple, will give us plenty of opportunities",
          "zh": "例如，這個應用程式雖然相對簡單，會給我們很多機會"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 63.71,
          "end": 65.87,
          "en": "to practice the things we learned.",
          "zh": "練習我們學過的東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 66.05,
          "end": 68.18,
          "en": "So that's the starting setup.",
          "zh": "所以那是起始設定。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 68.18,
          "end": 73.13,
          "en": "And the question now of course is how do we start such a project?",
          "zh": "而現在的問題當然是，我們如何開始這樣的專案？"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 73.49,
          "end": 76.46000000000001,
          "en": "How do we build real svelte apps?",
          "zh": "我們如何建立真正的 Svelte 應用程式？"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 76.61,
          "end": 80.81,
          "en": "It always helps to get an understanding for which features we need.",
          "zh": "先理解我們需要哪些功能，總是有幫助。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 80.81,
          "end": 86.72,
          "en": "And as I said, we'll build a meetups application and therefore here in the source folder, I will start",
          "zh": "而如我所說，我們會建立一個聚會應用程式，因此這裡在 source 資料夾，我會先"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 86.72,
          "end": 95.21000000000001,
          "en": "by creating a new folder meetups which should hold all the components that are directly related to meetups.",
          "zh": "建立一個新資料夾 meetups，它應該放所有和聚會直接相關的元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 95.21000000000001,
          "end": 102.44,
          "en": "So be that my list of meetups, a single list item or the page where we can create a new meetup and",
          "zh": "所以像我的聚會清單、單一清單項目，或我們可以建立新聚會的頁面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 102.44,
          "end": 103.16,
          "en": "so on.",
          "zh": "諸如此類。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 103.55,
          "end": 111.08,
          "en": "The other big chunk I'll have in this application are general user interface components which will help",
          "zh": "我在這個應用程式會有的另一大塊，是一般使用者介面元件，會幫助"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 111.08,
          "end": 113.06,
          "en": "me build a nice user interface.",
          "zh": "我建立漂亮的使用者介面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 113.09,
          "end": 119.27000000000001,
          "en": "Things like buttons, which we repeat all over the application and where I want to be able to use my",
          "zh": "像按鈕這樣的東西，我們在整個應用程式重複使用，而我想能夠使用我"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 119.27000000000001,
          "end": 124.19,
          "en": "own component to get a pre-styled and ready to use button.",
          "zh": "自己的元件，得到一個預先套好樣式、可直接使用的按鈕。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 124.19,
          "end": 129.77,
          "en": "And therefore the second part, I'll add the second folder I'll add here is simply a UI folder.",
          "zh": "因此第二部分，我這裡要加的第二個資料夾，單純是一個 UI 資料夾。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 129.77,
          "end": 134.75,
          "en": "Now you can name these folders however you want, but in general I would recommend that you structure",
          "zh": "現在這些資料夾你可以隨便命名，但一般我會建議你這樣組織"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 134.75,
          "end": 140.51,
          "en": "your application such that you have folders named by the different features of your app.",
          "zh": "你的應用程式：資料夾以你應用程式的不同功能命名。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 140.51,
          "end": 147.11,
          "en": "So things like meetups, products, authentication, whatever your app needs, and maybe some general",
          "zh": "所以像 meetups、products、authentication，無論你的應用程式需要什麼，也許還有一些一般的"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 147.11,
          "end": 155.39,
          "en": "shared or UI or components folder which holds your general user interface components which are not specific",
          "zh": "共用或 UI 或 components 資料夾，放你的一般使用者介面元件，那些不是針對"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 155.39,
          "end": 157.94,
          "en": "to a feature of your application.",
          "zh": "你應用程式某個功能的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 157.94,
          "end": 163.46,
          "en": "So these buttons could be used anywhere, not just in the meetup area, but which you want to reuse",
          "zh": "所以這些按鈕可以在任何地方使用，不只在聚會區域，而是你想在"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 163.46,
          "end": 164.84,
          "en": "across your application.",
          "zh": "整個應用程式重複使用的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 164.84,
          "end": 170.93,
          "en": "And of course this will become clearer as we progress through this module and through this entire course.",
          "zh": "而當然，當我們進行這個單元以及這整門課，這會變得更清楚。"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 171.86,
          "end": 178.4,
          "en": "Now that's the general structure, these two subfolders that should help us organize our different components",
          "zh": "現在那是一般結構，這兩個子資料夾應該幫助我們組織不同的元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 178.4,
          "end": 183.5,
          "en": "because that is the core thing of any svelte app components.",
          "zh": "因為那是任何 Svelte 應用程式的核心：元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 183.59,
          "end": 187.87,
          "en": "This is really something you have to understand and you can memorize.",
          "zh": "這真的是你必須理解、也可以記住的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 187.88,
          "end": 191.93,
          "en": "You build svelte applications from a bunch of components.",
          "zh": "你用一堆元件建立 Svelte 應用程式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 191.96,
          "end": 199.37,
          "en": "The idea is not that you put everything in your app component, that you add your header here and then",
          "zh": "想法不是把一切都放進你的 App 元件，在這裡加你的標頭，然後"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 199.37,
          "end": 203.3,
          "en": "different if blocks to render different parts of your application.",
          "zh": "用不同的 if 區塊來呈現你應用程式的不同部分。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 203.3,
          "end": 206.51,
          "en": "Have your entire new meetup form in here.",
          "zh": "把你整個新增聚會表單放在這裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 206.51,
          "end": 208.53,
          "en": "Have your list of meetups in here.",
          "zh": "把你的聚會清單放在這裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 208.55,
          "end": 213.2,
          "en": "That's not the idea because your app svelte file would become super large.",
          "zh": "那不是想法，因為你的 App.svelte 檔案會變得超大。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 213.2,
          "end": 217.16,
          "en": "It would be pretty hard to manage, especially if you're working in a team.",
          "zh": "它會相當難管理，尤其如果你在團隊裡工作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 217.25,
          "end": 223.28,
          "en": "Hence the idea is to split your application into building blocks which make up your user interface.",
          "zh": "因此想法是把你的應用程式拆成組成使用者介面的建構區塊。"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 223.28,
          "end": 230.51,
          "en": "And these building blocks are structured by feature or simply by well, the role they play in the user",
          "zh": "而這些建構區塊依功能組織，或單純依它們在使用者"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 230.51,
          "end": 231.51,
          "en": "interface.",
          "zh": "介面裡扮演的角色。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 231.54,
          "end": 234.26,
          "en": "But let's leave the theory.",
          "zh": "但我們先離開理論。"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 234.27,
          "end": 236.03,
          "en": "Let's simply dive into some practice.",
          "zh": "我們單純進入一些實作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 236.07,
          "end": 241.17,
          "en": "Let's say every application, every website you're visiting probably has some header here.",
          "zh": "假設每個應用程式、你造訪的每個網站，這裡大概都有某個標頭。"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 241.17,
          "end": 248.1,
          "en": "So in the app svelte file, we can add a header which could look something like this, and a very simple",
          "zh": "所以在 App.svelte 檔案，我們可以加一個標頭，看起來可以像這樣，而一個非常簡單的"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 248.1,
          "end": 250.26,
          "en": "header might just have our logo in there.",
          "zh": "標頭也許裡面只有我們的標誌。"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 250.26,
          "end": 256.26,
          "en": "Let's say our title and I'll name my app, meet us, you can name it meetups, you can name it whatever",
          "zh": "假設是我們的標題，我會把應用程式命名為 Meet Us，你可以命名為 meetups，你可以命名成任何"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 256.26,
          "end": 257.06,
          "en": "you want.",
          "zh": "你想要的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 257.07,
          "end": 259.5,
          "en": "So that could be a header of our application.",
          "zh": "所以那可以是我們應用程式的標頭。"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 259.5,
          "end": 263.6,
          "en": "And now that header of course should have some styling.",
          "zh": "而現在那個標頭當然應該有一些樣式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 263.61,
          "end": 265.83,
          "en": "Now how should the header be styled?",
          "zh": "現在標頭應該怎麼設定樣式？"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 266.01,
          "end": 268.2,
          "en": "I want to have a header with a.",
          "zh": "我想要一個標頭，帶有"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 269.06,
          "end": 270.47,
          "en": "Fixed position.",
          "zh": "固定定位。"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 270.56,
          "end": 276.62,
          "en": "I want to have the header have a width of 100% so that it spans the full width of the page.",
          "zh": "我想讓標頭 width 是 100%，這樣它橫跨頁面的整個寬度。"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 276.86,
          "end": 284,
          "en": "Should have top zero left zero so that its starts in the top left corner, maybe a height of four REM.",
          "zh": "應該 top 為 0、left 為 0，這樣它從左上角開始，也許 height 是 4rem。"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 284,
          "end": 290.3,
          "en": "And I don't want to turn this into a CSS course so I won't explain every property here in great detail.",
          "zh": "而我不想把這變成一門 CSS 課，所以我不會在這裡詳細解釋每個屬性。"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 290.3,
          "end": 295.07,
          "en": "If you want to learn all about CSS, I've got a dedicated course on this and later throughout the course",
          "zh": "如果你想全面學 CSS，我有一門專門的課，而稍後在整門課"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 295.07,
          "end": 300.59,
          "en": "I will also often skip CSS and just attach it to the lectures so that I don't bore you with that.",
          "zh": "我也會常常略過 CSS，只把它附在講義上，這樣我不會用那個讓你無聊。"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 300.59,
          "end": 305.51,
          "en": "But here for our first course project component, let's actually create it together.",
          "zh": "但這裡對我們第一個課程專案元件，我們實際一起建立它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 305.51,
          "end": 307.88,
          "en": "So I just edit the height of the header.",
          "zh": "所以我只是編輯標頭的 height。"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 308.3,
          "end": 317.42,
          "en": "Let's also give the background color and I picked a nice reddish color which has the hex code CF 0056.",
          "zh": "我們也給背景色，我挑了一個不錯的偏紅色，十六進位碼是 #CF0056。"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 317.42,
          "end": 320.75,
          "en": "Of course you can pick a different one if you prefer a different color.",
          "zh": "當然如果你偏好不同顏色，可以挑另一個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 320.75,
          "end": 325.64,
          "en": "And I will use Flexbox to center my title horizontally and vertically.",
          "zh": "而我會用 Flexbox 讓我的標題水平與垂直置中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 326,
          "end": 332.61,
          "en": "We can do this with display, flex and justify content center and align items center here.",
          "zh": "我們可以用 display: flex、justify-content: center 以及這裡的 align-items: center 做到。"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 332.88,
          "end": 340.26,
          "en": "Last but not least, I'll give this a slight box shadow with zero two pixels, six pixels and then rgba",
          "zh": "最後，我會給這個一點 box-shadow，0 2px 6px，然後 rgba"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 340.29,
          "end": 345.72,
          "en": "000.26 which will give this just a slight drop shadow.",
          "zh": "0, 0, 0, 0.26，這會給它一點淡淡的陰影。"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 346.02,
          "end": 350.67,
          "en": "Now the H1 tag in the header also should have a certain styling.",
          "zh": "現在標頭裡的 h1 標籤也應該有特定樣式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 350.67,
          "end": 351.99,
          "en": "I'll give it a white color.",
          "zh": "我會給它白色。"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 352.11,
          "end": 362.94,
          "en": "Use a font family of Roboto slab fallback is a serif font and I do import that font here in the global",
          "zh": "使用字型家族 Roboto Slab，後備是 serif 字型，而我確實在全域"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 362.94,
          "end": 363.66,
          "en": "CSS file.",
          "zh": "CSS 檔案匯入那個字型。"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 363.66,
          "end": 365.49,
          "en": "So that is where this is coming from.",
          "zh": "所以那就是這個的來源。"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 367.35,
          "end": 369.3,
          "en": "Back to the apps world file.",
          "zh": "回到 App.svelte 檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 369.39,
          "end": 373.47,
          "en": "Last but not least, I'll give this a margin of zero to overwrite the default margin.",
          "zh": "最後，我會給這個 margin 為 0，以覆寫預設 margin。"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 373.59,
          "end": 379.74,
          "en": "If we now save this, you should see this header and as always right click on the refresh icon with",
          "zh": "如果我們現在存檔，你應該看到這個標頭，而一如往常，在重新整理圖示上按右鍵，"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 379.74,
          "end": 382.53,
          "en": "the dev tools open and click empty cache and hard reload.",
          "zh": "開發者工具開著，然後點清空快取並強制重新載入。"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 382.53,
          "end": 389.94,
          "en": "If you're not seeing this and this is at least a start, I'd say, But what did I violate that I just",
          "zh": "如果你沒看到這個，而這至少是一個開始，我會說。但我剛剛違反了什麼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 389.94,
          "end": 391.38,
          "en": "said a few minutes ago?",
          "zh": "幾分鐘前我才說過的？"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 392.07,
          "end": 395.43,
          "en": "Well, we want to split our application into components.",
          "zh": "嗯，我們想把應用程式拆成元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 395.43,
          "end": 397.79,
          "en": "And I did exactly the opposite.",
          "zh": "而我做的正好相反。"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 397.8,
          "end": 401.52,
          "en": "I put my header and the styles for the header in the app svelte file.",
          "zh": "我把標頭和標頭的樣式放在 App.svelte 檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 401.52,
          "end": 406.98,
          "en": "I did this on purpose, of course, because I hope that this already gives you a feeling for the problem",
          "zh": "我當然是故意的，因為我希望這已經讓你感受到問題"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 406.98,
          "end": 408.72,
          "en": "we might run into later.",
          "zh": "我們稍後可能遇到的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 408.72,
          "end": 410.7,
          "en": "At the moment, of course we can handle this.",
          "zh": "此刻我們當然可以處理這個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 410.73,
          "end": 416.43,
          "en": "It's a pretty lean file still, but it's only a header and still, especially with the styles, we take",
          "zh": "它仍然是相當精簡的檔案，但它只是一個標頭，儘管如此，尤其加上樣式，我們"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 416.43,
          "end": 423.3,
          "en": "up quite a lot of space on the page and therefore I want to take that header and move it into a separate",
          "zh": "在頁面上佔了相當多空間，因此我想把那個標頭移到一個分開的"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 423.3,
          "end": 427.74,
          "en": "component so that in the app svelte file I just include that component.",
          "zh": "元件，這樣在 App.svelte 檔案我只是包含那個元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 428.04,
          "end": 434.43,
          "en": "So for this we can create a new file header dot svelte and in there.",
          "zh": "所以為此我們可以建立一個新檔案 Header.svelte，而在那裡面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 435.08,
          "end": 444.14,
          "en": "Let's put our header markup this and let's also take the styles here, remove them from the app svelte",
          "zh": "我們放上標頭標記，這個，也把這裡的樣式拿過去，從 App.svelte"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 444.14,
          "end": 446.87,
          "en": "file and move them into the header svelte file.",
          "zh": "檔案移除它們，並移進 Header.svelte 檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 447.02,
          "end": 452.57,
          "en": "And now we could argue that the header is a general UI component even though we'll not reuse it in this",
          "zh": "而現在我們可以說標頭是一般的 UI 元件，即使我們不會在這個"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 452.57,
          "end": 453.26,
          "en": "application.",
          "zh": "應用程式重複使用它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 453.26,
          "end": 457.34000000000003,
          "en": "We only use it in the app component, but still it is a UI component.",
          "zh": "我們只在 App 元件使用它，但它仍然是 UI 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 457.34000000000003,
          "end": 464.84000000000003,
          "en": "So I will move the header svelte file in the UI folder and now in app svelte we can simply import header",
          "zh": "所以我會把 Header.svelte 檔案移進 UI 資料夾，而現在在 App.svelte 我們可以單純匯入 Header，"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 464.84000000000003,
          "end": 467.9,
          "en": "and make sure you're using Pascal casing here.",
          "zh": "並確定你這裡使用 PascalCase。"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 468.2,
          "end": 474.86,
          "en": "That is expected by svelte when you use it in markup so that it can differentiate your own components",
          "zh": "當你在標記裡使用它時，Svelte 預期那樣，這樣它能區分你自己的元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 474.86,
          "end": 477.5,
          "en": "from the default HTML elements.",
          "zh": "和預設的 HTML 元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 477.71,
          "end": 483.11,
          "en": "And therefore we now import this with Pascal case naming from UI header svelte.",
          "zh": "因此我們現在用 PascalCase 命名，從 UI/Header.svelte 匯入這個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 483.11,
          "end": 488.54,
          "en": "And the import path is dot slash UI a relative path and then header dot svelte.",
          "zh": "而匯入路徑是 ./UI，相對路徑，然後 Header.svelte。"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 488.75,
          "end": 494.54,
          "en": "And now here in the markup of the app svelte file, we just can use header like this as a self-closing",
          "zh": "而現在這裡在 App.svelte 檔案的標記裡，我們可以像這樣使用 Header，當成自閉合"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 494.57,
          "end": 495.47,
          "en": "tag.",
          "zh": "標籤。"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 495.47,
          "end": 500.96,
          "en": "And if we now save this, we have exactly the same output as before, but we get a lean app, svelte",
          "zh": "而如果我們現在存檔，我們得到和之前完全一樣的輸出，但我們得到精簡的 App.svelte"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 500.96,
          "end": 507.08,
          "en": "file and a lean header svelte file and whatever we add to our application will go neither into here",
          "zh": "檔案和精簡的 Header.svelte 檔案，而我們加到應用程式的任何東西都不會進這裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 507.11,
          "end": 511.37,
          "en": "nor into the app svelte file and therefore these files will stay lean.",
          "zh": "也不會進 App.svelte 檔案，因此這些檔案會保持精簡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 511.37,
          "end": 515.33,
          "en": "And that really is an important concept and that is why I'm emphasizing it.",
          "zh": "而那真的是重要概念，那就是為什麼我強調它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 515.33,
          "end": 519.23,
          "en": "You have to understand how you structure and build your applications.",
          "zh": "你必須理解你如何組織並建立你的應用程式。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "14689562",
      "title": "Different Ways of Mounting Components",
      "lectureOrder": 42,
      "videoOrder": 36,
      "sourceHash": "266e8509456874177c9c6eeffd56a3b1a7a8d30b7a0958e06d997cf9afc1caef",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.11,
          "end": 7.6,
          "en": "Now, one other thing I really want to highlight, because it can be hard to wrap your head around,",
          "zh": "現在，另一件我真的想強調的事，因為它可能很難想通，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 7.63,
          "end": 14.47,
          "en": "is why I'm creating or why the app component is created like this in the Main.js file.",
          "zh": "是為什麼我建立，或為什麼 App 元件在 main.js 檔案裡是這樣建立的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 14.47,
          "end": 19.72,
          "en": "And the header component on the other hand, is imported into the app component file and use the markup.",
          "zh": "而另一方面，Header 元件被匯入 App 元件檔案，並在標記裡使用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 19.72,
          "end": 21.91,
          "en": "We use these two components differently, right?",
          "zh": "我們以不同方式使用這兩個元件，對吧？"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 21.91,
          "end": 25.24,
          "en": "The app component gets used differently than the header component.",
          "zh": "App 元件的使用方式和 Header 元件不同。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 25.24,
          "end": 28.45,
          "en": "The app component gets created here in JavaScript code.",
          "zh": "App 元件在這裡的 JavaScript 程式碼裡被建立。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 28.72,
          "end": 32.65,
          "en": "Now you could create both components this way.",
          "zh": "現在你可以用這種方式建立兩個元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 33.07,
          "end": 37.57,
          "en": "Let me go to the index.html file and show you how this could work.",
          "zh": "讓我到 index.html 檔案，給你看這可以如何運作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 37.75,
          "end": 42.61,
          "en": "You could add a div maybe with an ID header and another with the id.",
          "zh": "你可以加一個 div，也許 id 是 header，另一個 id 是"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 45.46,
          "end": 46.12,
          "en": "App.",
          "zh": "app。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 46.16,
          "end": 52.92,
          "en": "Okay, so now I got two divs here in my index.html file header and app are the ids I'm using in main.js.",
          "zh": "好，所以現在我在 index.html 檔案有兩個 div，header 和 app 是我在 main.js 使用的 id。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 52.93,
          "end": 58.78,
          "en": "We could now import app like this and then simply target document.",
          "zh": "我們現在可以像這樣匯入 App，然後單純以 document"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 59.54,
          "end": 60.95,
          "en": "Query selector.",
          "zh": "querySelector"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 61.61,
          "end": 67.37,
          "en": "Hashtag app for the app component, but also import the header here.",
          "zh": "#app 為目標給 App 元件，但也在這裡匯入 Header。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 69.66,
          "end": 77.13,
          "en": "From dot slash hoops UI headers, welt and then also create.",
          "zh": "從 ./UI/Header.svelte，然後也建立"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 79.25,
          "end": 80.84,
          "en": "A header with new.",
          "zh": "一個 Header，用 new。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 81.53,
          "end": 91.31,
          "en": "Header where we pass an object where I set the target to document query selector hashtag header, selecting",
          "zh": "Header，我們傳入一個物件，我把 target 設成 document.querySelector('#header')，選取"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 91.31,
          "end": 94.31,
          "en": "the div with the ID of header.",
          "zh": "id 為 header 的 div。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 95,
          "end": 98.50999999999999,
          "en": "Let's now go to the apps world file and comment out the header here.",
          "zh": "現在到 App.svelte 檔案，把這裡的 Header 註解掉。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 99.2,
          "end": 101.24000000000001,
          "en": "We now save this and we reload.",
          "zh": "我們現在存檔並重新載入。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 101.6,
          "end": 104,
          "en": "We still have the header here at the top.",
          "zh": "我們頂端這裡仍然有標頭。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 104.18,
          "end": 108.62,
          "en": "If we inspect this in the dev tools, we see a difference though here in the body.",
          "zh": "如果我們在開發者工具檢查這個，我們在 body 裡看到一個差異。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 108.62,
          "end": 114.44,
          "en": "This is the div with the ID header and you see that inside of this div our header component was attached.",
          "zh": "這是 id 為 header 的 div，而你看到在這個 div 裡面，我們的 Header 元件被接上了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 114.65,
          "end": 119.3,
          "en": "Here is the div with the ID app and in there our app component was attached, which we don't really",
          "zh": "這裡是 id 為 app 的 div，而在那裡面我們的 App 元件被接上了，我們並沒有真的"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 119.3,
          "end": 120.56,
          "en": "see because it's empty.",
          "zh": "看到它，因為它是空的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 120.56,
          "end": 124.52,
          "en": "But if I add, let's say H1 tag where I say the app.",
          "zh": "但如果我加，假設一個 h1 標籤，我說 the app。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 125.48,
          "end": 126.47,
          "en": "Then you see it here.",
          "zh": "然後你在這裡看到它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 126.47,
          "end": 132.23,
          "en": "It's just beneath the header because the header has position fixed, but it is there in the Dom, so",
          "zh": "它就在標頭下面，因為標頭有 position: fixed，但它在 DOM 裡，所以"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 132.23,
          "end": 139.85,
          "en": "you can absolutely attach your components through main.js by targeting different places in the index.html",
          "zh": "你絕對可以透過 main.js 接上你的元件，針對不同地方，在 index.html"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 139.85,
          "end": 140.45,
          "en": "file.",
          "zh": "檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 140.6,
          "end": 145.31,
          "en": "There is an important difference to the approach where you use it in the markup.",
          "zh": "和你在標記裡使用它的做法，有一個重要差異。"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 145.31,
          "end": 151.82,
          "en": "Instead though, when you import a component and into another component and use it in the markup there,",
          "zh": "不過相反，當你把一個元件匯入另一個元件並在那裡的標記裡使用它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 151.91,
          "end": 154.57999999999998,
          "en": "then these two components can communicate.",
          "zh": "這兩個元件就能溝通。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 154.61,
          "end": 160.07,
          "en": "The app component can pass data into the header component if it should need to.",
          "zh": "如果需要，App 元件可以把資料傳進 Header 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 160.57999999999998,
          "end": 169.4,
          "en": "If you set up your components like this, they co-exist as separated root level components in your application",
          "zh": "如果你像這樣設定元件，它們在你的應用程式裡作為分開的根層級元件共存，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 169.4,
          "end": 172.99,
          "en": "root level because they're both attached directly into the document.",
          "zh": "根層級是因為它們都直接接到文件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 173,
          "end": 178.73,
          "en": "So here in the app component, if we had a button which we can click, which should change the title",
          "zh": "所以這裡在 App 元件，如果我們有一個可以點的按鈕，應該改變標頭裡的"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 178.73,
          "end": 183.59,
          "en": "in the header, that's not really possible or not easy to do.",
          "zh": "標題，那並不是真的可能，或並不容易做到。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 183.62,
          "end": 188.94,
          "en": "When we have this setup, which we have at the moment, where they co-exist because they are mounted",
          "zh": "當我們有目前這個設定，它們共存，因為它們被掛載"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 188.94,
          "end": 193.71,
          "en": "into different sibling places in our index.html file.",
          "zh": "到我們 index.html 檔案裡不同的同層位置。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 193.71,
          "end": 195.06,
          "en": "This is not one app.",
          "zh": "這不是一個應用程式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 195.06,
          "end": 197.76,
          "en": "These are two svelte apps running next to each other.",
          "zh": "這是兩個 Svelte 應用程式並排執行。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 197.76,
          "end": 201.69,
          "en": "You could say of course, in the context of one website being loaded.",
          "zh": "你可以說，當然，是在一個網站被載入的脈絡裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 201.69,
          "end": 207,
          "en": "But these two component trees which we're building here, component tree one, component tree two,",
          "zh": "但我們這裡建立的這兩個元件樹，元件樹一、元件樹二，"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 207.03,
          "end": 213.21,
          "en": "they don't really have a direct communication line and therefore you should really only use this approach",
          "zh": "它們並沒有真正的直接溝通線，因此你真的只應該在這種情況使用這個做法："
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 213.21,
          "end": 219.78,
          "en": "if you have two totally separate parts in your application, two totally separate component trees where",
          "zh": "你的應用程式有兩個完全分開的部分，兩棵完全分開的元件樹，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 219.78,
          "end": 227.22,
          "en": "each tree might communicate inside of itself, but where the two trees need no direct connection.",
          "zh": "每棵樹也許在自己內部溝通，但兩棵樹不需要直接連接。"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 227.25,
          "end": 229.8,
          "en": "Therefore, this is not the approach I'll use here.",
          "zh": "因此，這不是我這裡會用的做法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 230.01,
          "end": 233.52,
          "en": "I'll comment this out in the index.html file and in the main.js file.",
          "zh": "我會在 index.html 檔案把這個註解掉，而在 main.js 檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 233.52,
          "end": 236.82,
          "en": "I'll also comment this out and comment out this import.",
          "zh": "我也會把這個註解掉，並把這個匯入註解掉。"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 236.82,
          "end": 240.21,
          "en": "And here I will also not use this approach.",
          "zh": "而這裡我也不會使用這個做法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 240.21,
          "end": 246.54,
          "en": "I'll comment this out instead, but instead use target Document.body to simply mount our app component",
          "zh": "我會改把這個註解掉，但改用 target: document.body，單純把我們的 App 元件掛載"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 246.54,
          "end": 252.72,
          "en": "into the entire index.html document body because I indeed want to use the header here.",
          "zh": "進整個 index.html 的 document.body，因為我確實想在這裡使用標頭。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 252.72,
          "end": 255.21,
          "en": "It is embedded way in the app component.",
          "zh": "它是以嵌入的方式放在 App 元件裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 255.21,
          "end": 259.92,
          "en": "So now that we could pass data into the header, which we don't really need to, but we will need to",
          "zh": "所以現在我們可以把資料傳進標頭，我們並不是真的需要，但我們稍後會需要"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 259.92,
          "end": 261.78,
          "en": "do this later for other components.",
          "zh": "對其他元件這樣做。"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 261.78,
          "end": 267.18,
          "en": "So the header could theoretically coexist to the app component because we need no direct communication,",
          "zh": "所以標頭理論上可以和 App 元件共存，因為我們不需要直接溝通，"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 267.18,
          "end": 272.01,
          "en": "but if we ever would need it because we have some button in the header or anything like that, then",
          "zh": "但如果我們以後需要，因為標頭裡有某個按鈕或類似那樣，那麼"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 272.01,
          "end": 277.86,
          "en": "we would have a hard time if we mount them into different places and therefore in most cases in most",
          "zh": "如果我們把它們掛載到不同地方，我們會很辛苦，因此在多數情況、在多數"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 277.86,
          "end": 284.19,
          "en": "applications you're building, you only have one root component, your app component and your entire",
          "zh": "你建立的應用程式，你只有一個根元件，你的 App 元件，而你整個"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 284.19,
          "end": 287.49,
          "en": "other app is mounted as a component tree.",
          "zh": "其他應用程式被掛載成一棵元件樹。"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 287.49,
          "end": 293.67,
          "en": "So as embedded components into this app component and into other components which are then mounted in",
          "zh": "所以是嵌入的元件，進到這個 App 元件，以及進到其他接著被掛載在"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 293.67,
          "end": 293.97,
          "en": "here.",
          "zh": "這裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 293.97,
          "end": 297.6,
          "en": "So instead of the header component, we can embed yet other components.",
          "zh": "所以除了 Header 元件，我們還可以嵌入其他元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 297.62,
          "end": 300.96,
          "en": "That is true for any component of course in this application.",
          "zh": "對這個應用程式裡的任何元件當然都是這樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 300.96,
          "end": 305.19,
          "en": "So I hope this is clear why I'm using this approach and what its advantages.",
          "zh": "所以我希望這說清楚了為什麼我用這個做法，以及它的優點是什麼。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "14689566",
      "title": "Adding Data",
      "lectureOrder": 44,
      "videoOrder": 37,
      "sourceHash": "74b351a2d33d394760177cefb4a603a9e3dfd49f21060103534e6d2880d7c581",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.04,
          "end": 8.37,
          "en": "So now that we have the header out of the way, and most importantly, we got an understanding of why",
          "zh": "所以現在標頭處理完了，而最重要的是，我們理解了為什麼"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 8.37,
          "end": 12.27,
          "en": "we're mounting the components into the Dom the way we are doing it.",
          "zh": "我們用現在這種方式把元件掛載進 DOM。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 12.82,
          "end": 15.13,
          "en": "Let's work on our app a bit more.",
          "zh": "讓我們再多做一點我們的應用程式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 15.16,
          "end": 19.99,
          "en": "Thus far we only have the header, but of course our app is not just about the header.",
          "zh": "到目前為止我們只有標頭，但我們的應用程式當然不只是標頭。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 20.29,
          "end": 28.42,
          "en": "We're building a meetup application and therefore what we need is probably a list of meetups, right?",
          "zh": "我們在建立一個聚會應用程式，因此我們需要的大概是一份聚會清單，對吧？"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 28.6,
          "end": 31.15,
          "en": "So why don't we go into our app component?",
          "zh": "所以我們何不進到我們的 App 元件？"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 31.15,
          "end": 36.13,
          "en": "So I'm in the app svelte file here and in there we add.",
          "zh": "所以我在這裡的 App.svelte 檔案，而在那裡面我們加上"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 36.8,
          "end": 44.27,
          "en": "A meet ups array like this and each meet up is just a JavaScript object with an ID, and for now I will",
          "zh": "一個 meetups 陣列，像這樣，而每個 meetup 只是一個 JavaScript 物件，有一個 id，而現在我會"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 44.27,
          "end": 45.41,
          "en": "just hard code this.",
          "zh": "單純把它寫死。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 45.41,
          "end": 47.42,
          "en": "So I'll give it an ID of one.",
          "zh": "所以我會給它 id 為 1。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 47.45,
          "end": 49.76,
          "en": "Of course you can pick any ID you want.",
          "zh": "當然你可以挑任何你想要的 id。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 50.24,
          "end": 53.43,
          "en": "Every ID, every meetup should also have a title.",
          "zh": "每個 id、每個聚會也應該有一個標題。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 53.45,
          "end": 57.05,
          "en": "Let's say coding bootcamp.",
          "zh": "假設是 coding bootcamp。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 58.01,
          "end": 60.05,
          "en": "Maybe also a subtitle.",
          "zh": "也許還有一個副標題。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 60.14,
          "end": 63.77,
          "en": "Learn to code in two hours.",
          "zh": "Learn to code in two hours。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 65.4,
          "end": 67.41,
          "en": "Maybe also a description.",
          "zh": "也許還有一段描述。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 69.03,
          "end": 69.63,
          "en": "And this.",
          "zh": "而這個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 71.39,
          "end": 79.03999999999999,
          "en": "In this meetup, we will have some experts that teach you how to code.",
          "zh": "在這個聚會，我們會有一些專家教你如何寫程式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 80.1,
          "end": 85.77,
          "en": "And probably also an image which helps us with the meetup.",
          "zh": "而大概還有一張圖片，幫助我們呈現這個聚會。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 86.63,
          "end": 87.11,
          "en": "Here.",
          "zh": "這裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 87.11,
          "end": 89.53999999999999,
          "en": "I grabbed an image from Wikimedia.",
          "zh": "我從 Wikimedia 抓了一張圖片。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 89.57,
          "end": 91.76,
          "en": "Of course you can pick any image URL.",
          "zh": "當然你可以挑任何圖片網址。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 91.97,
          "end": 93.8,
          "en": "We want an address.",
          "zh": "我們要一個地址。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 94.72,
          "end": 102.00999999999999,
          "en": "That's 27th nerd wrote in some random postal code.",
          "zh": "那是某組隨機郵遞區號裡的 27th Nerd Road。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 103.95,
          "end": 104.61,
          "en": "New York.",
          "zh": "New York。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 104.64,
          "end": 107.64,
          "en": "And no, that's probably not the postal code of New York.",
          "zh": "而不是，那大概不是紐約的郵遞區號。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 107.97,
          "end": 116.72999999999999,
          "en": "And we got a contact email, which is code at test.com, which of course is also not a real email address.",
          "zh": "而我們有一個聯絡信箱，是 code@test.com，那當然也不是真正的電子郵件地址。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 117.06,
          "end": 122.04,
          "en": "So that's my first meetup and I'll duplicate this, add a second one.",
          "zh": "所以那是我的第一個聚會，而我會複製這個，加上第二個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 123.02,
          "end": 125.24,
          "en": "Swim together.",
          "zh": "Swim together。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 129.77,
          "end": 132.81,
          "en": "Let's go for some swimming.",
          "zh": "我們去游泳吧。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 132.83,
          "end": 138.05,
          "en": "Please note that I escaped that single quote here so that we can use single quotes inside of surrounding",
          "zh": "請注意我在這裡跳脫了那個單引號，這樣我們可以在外層"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 138.05,
          "end": 139.13,
          "en": "single quotes.",
          "zh": "單引號裡面使用單引號。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 141.68,
          "end": 146.2,
          "en": "We will simply swim some rounds.",
          "zh": "我們會單純游幾圈。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 146.21,
          "end": 149.93,
          "en": "Feel free to be more creative than I am here regarding the texts.",
          "zh": "關於文字，請隨意比我這裡更有創意。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 150.96,
          "end": 152.73,
          "en": "Picked another image for that.",
          "zh": "那個也挑了另一張圖片。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 156.01,
          "end": 159.93,
          "en": "And I'll leave the address to save some time and have some warmth.",
          "zh": "而我會略過地址以節省時間，並有 somewarmth"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 159.94,
          "end": 166.84,
          "en": "Test.com So I've got two meetups here simply in that JavaScript array and now we want to output these",
          "zh": "@test.com。所以我這裡單純在那個 JavaScript 陣列裡有兩個聚會，現在我們想輸出這些"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 166.84,
          "end": 172.62,
          "en": "meetups here and of course in a relatively beautiful way if possible.",
          "zh": "聚會，而如果可能，當然要用相對漂亮的方式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 172.63,
          "end": 180.55,
          "en": "So for that, again, we can create some markup here, but we could also create a component for that",
          "zh": "所以為此，我們再次可以在這裡建立一些標記，但我們也可以建立一個元件，給那個"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 180.55,
          "end": 181.36,
          "en": "markup.",
          "zh": "標記。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 181.51,
          "end": 184.78,
          "en": "The question now just is which kind of component?",
          "zh": "現在的問題只是，哪一種元件？"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 184.81,
          "end": 191.05,
          "en": "Well, since I plan on outputting a list of meetups, I think it makes sense to create a meetup item",
          "zh": "嗯，既然我計畫輸出一份聚會清單，我覺得建立一個 MeetupItem"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 191.05,
          "end": 193.24,
          "en": "dot svelte file in the meetups folder.",
          "zh": ".svelte 檔案、放在 meetups 資料夾是合理的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 193.39,
          "end": 200.53,
          "en": "Now the idea behind the meetup item component is that it contains all the markup we need for outputting",
          "zh": "現在 MeetupItem 元件背後的想法是，它包含我們輸出"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 200.56,
          "end": 203.32,
          "en": "a single meetup in a list of meetups.",
          "zh": "一份聚會清單裡單一個聚會所需的所有標記。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 203.32,
          "end": 207.61,
          "en": "In a preview of meetups, let's say so in a list of previews.",
          "zh": "假設是聚會的預覽，所以是一份預覽清單。"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 208.4,
          "end": 210.8,
          "en": "For that in a meetup item component here.",
          "zh": "為此，在這裡的 MeetupItem 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 210.8,
          "end": 212.63,
          "en": "Let's write some markup next.",
          "zh": "接下來我們寫一些標記。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "14689568",
      "title": "Adding a New Component (MeetupItem)",
      "lectureOrder": 45,
      "videoOrder": 38,
      "sourceHash": "6499a77d2292fdad7e46656b246c4ad44e835a9cb26f0c72895357f356a2506b",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.37,
          "end": 3.99,
          "en": "For every meetup item.",
          "zh": "對每個 meetup 項目。"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.6,
          "end": 6.85,
          "en": "Let's say we have an article element.",
          "zh": "讓我們說我們有一個 article 元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.88,
          "end": 12.52,
          "en": "Of course you could also use a div, whatever you prefer here or whatever you need in your application",
          "zh": "當然你也可以用 div，這裡隨你偏好，或你的應用程式需要什麼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12.85,
          "end": 14.56,
          "en": "in there, maybe a header.",
          "zh": "在裡面，也許一個 header。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.71,
          "end": 21.43,
          "en": "And inside of the header we got an H1 tag where we later want to output our title H2 tag where we want",
          "zh": "而在 header 裡面我們有一個 h1 標籤，我們稍後想輸出標題，h2 標籤，我們想"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 21.43,
          "end": 23.5,
          "en": "to output the subtitle probably.",
          "zh": "輸出副標題，大概。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 24.43,
          "end": 28.99,
          "en": "Then maybe a div with a class of image.",
          "zh": "然後也許一個 class 是 image 的 div。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 29.59,
          "end": 32.77,
          "en": "So div class image here and in there.",
          "zh": "所以這裡是 div class image，而在裡面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 32.77,
          "end": 38.38,
          "en": "I really want to have an image which is the thumbnail we store for every meetup.",
          "zh": "我真的想要一張圖片，那是我們為每個 meetup 儲存的縮圖。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 39.14,
          "end": 40.04,
          "en": "Below that.",
          "zh": "在那下面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 40.04,
          "end": 46.46,
          "en": "Probably a div with a class of content or anything like that where we can output um, our description,",
          "zh": "大概一個 class 是 content 或類似的 div，我們可以在那裡輸出，嗯，我們的描述，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 46.46,
          "end": 48.11,
          "en": "let's say here in a paragraph.",
          "zh": "讓我們說這裡在一個段落裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 48.8,
          "end": 50.48,
          "en": "And then maybe some fodder.",
          "zh": "然後也許一些 footer。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 51.1,
          "end": 56.77,
          "en": "Where we can output some buttons that allow us to interact with that meetup later on so that we can",
          "zh": "我們可以在那裡輸出一些按鈕，讓我們稍後能和那個 meetup 互動，這樣我們可以"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 56.77,
          "end": 61.93,
          "en": "edit it, favorite it, or view the details of that meetup for example.",
          "zh": "編輯它、把它加到最愛，或查看那個 meetup 的詳細資料，例如。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 63.37,
          "end": 65.44,
          "en": "For now, I'll simply add two buttons here.",
          "zh": "目前，我會在這裡單純加兩個按鈕。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 65.44,
          "end": 70.03999999999999,
          "en": "Show details and favorite.",
          "zh": "顯示詳細資料，以及最愛。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 70.06,
          "end": 71.05,
          "en": "Something like that.",
          "zh": "類似那樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 75.14,
          "end": 76.64,
          "en": "That could be a meetup item.",
          "zh": "那可以是一個 meetup 項目。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 76.64,
          "end": 82.59,
          "en": "And now the idea is that we repeat this meetup item for every meetup we got here and I just shrank this.",
          "zh": "而現在的想法是，我們對這裡有的每個 meetup 重複這個 meetup 項目，而我剛縮小了這個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 82.61,
          "end": 84.05,
          "en": "These are two meetups, right?",
          "zh": "這些是兩個 meetup，對吧？"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 84.17,
          "end": 89.57,
          "en": "So want to go through that list and repeat my meetup item component for every meetup we have here.",
          "zh": "所以想走遍那份清單，並對我們這裡有的每個 meetup 重複我的 meetup item 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 89.78,
          "end": 91.13,
          "en": "And how does that work?",
          "zh": "而那怎麼運作？"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 91.16,
          "end": 92.84,
          "en": "Well, with each right.",
          "zh": "嗯，用 each，對吧。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 92.84,
          "end": 100.77000000000001,
          "en": "So first of all, we need to import the meetup item here from dot slash meetups, meetup item group",
          "zh": "所以首先，我們需要在這裡從 ./meetups/MeetupItem.svelte 匯入 meetup item，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 100.78999999999999,
          "end": 101.78,
          "en": "like this.",
          "zh": "像這樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 104.25,
          "end": 109.02000000000001,
          "en": "And with that imported down there below the header, of course we create such a block.",
          "zh": "而有了那個被匯入，下面那裡在 header 之下，我們當然建立這樣一個區塊。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 109.02000000000001,
          "end": 110.97,
          "en": "And do you remember how that worked?",
          "zh": "而你記得那怎麼運作嗎？"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 112.24000000000001,
          "end": 117.94,
          "en": "You use hashtag each year for a loop and you need to close that block with slash each.",
          "zh": "你用 {#each} 做迴圈，而你需要用 {/each} 關閉那個區塊。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 117.97,
          "end": 121.18,
          "en": "In this case, we want to go through our meetups.",
          "zh": "在這個情況，我們想走遍我們的 meetups。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 121.18,
          "end": 125.26,
          "en": "So meetups here refers to this constant name.",
          "zh": "所以這裡的 meetups 指這個常數名稱。"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 125.9,
          "end": 131.03,
          "en": "I'm going through these meet ups and then we extract every single meet up for this iteration here and",
          "zh": "我走遍這些 meetup，然後我們為這裡這次迭代取出每一個 meetup，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 131.03,
          "end": 133.79,
          "en": "store it in a variable which we can name Meetup.",
          "zh": "並把它存在一個變數裡，我們可以命名為 meetup。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 134.15,
          "end": 139.2,
          "en": "And in between we put the markup, which we want to repeat for all the elements in that meetups array.",
          "zh": "而在中間我們放標記，我們想對那個 meetups 陣列裡所有元素重複的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 139.22,
          "end": 142.34,
          "en": "So in this case that would be meetup item.",
          "zh": "所以在這個情況那會是 MeetupItem。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 143.18,
          "end": 147.32,
          "en": "If we do that and we save this, we already see two meetup items.",
          "zh": "如果我們那樣做並存這個，我們已經看到兩個 meetup 項目。"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 147.35,
          "end": 151.64,
          "en": "Now they're missing some styles, so let's make sure we get some styling.",
          "zh": "現在它們缺少一些樣式，所以讓我們確定我們得到一些樣式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 152.6,
          "end": 158.75,
          "en": "And for this attached to this video, you find an edited meetup item, svelte file, which simply is",
          "zh": "而為此，附在這支影片，你找到一個編輯過的 MeetupItem.svelte 檔案，它單純是"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 158.75,
          "end": 164,
          "en": "the file with the same markup, but with this added style tag here with some styles I'm providing so",
          "zh": "有相同標記的檔案，但這裡加了這個 style 標籤，有一些我提供的樣式，這樣"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 164,
          "end": 164.93,
          "en": "that you get this.",
          "zh": "你得到這個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 164.93,
          "end": 166.7,
          "en": "Look, it's still not perfect.",
          "zh": "看，它仍然不完美。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 166.73,
          "end": 171.35,
          "en": "We have a light slight overlapping here, but we'll fix this in a different place.",
          "zh": "我們這裡有一點重疊，但我們會在別的地方修正這個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 171.35,
          "end": 175.46,
          "en": "But besides that, I have this nice card look with title subtitle.",
          "zh": "但除此之外，我有這個不錯的卡片外觀，有標題、副標題。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 175.46,
          "end": 180.56,
          "en": "Then some whitespace here where we can later add our description image and so on.",
          "zh": "然後這裡一些空白，我們稍後可以加描述、圖片等等。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 180.56,
          "end": 185.33,
          "en": "And the buttons which also of course don't look that beautiful yet, but we will get there.",
          "zh": "以及按鈕，它們當然看起來也還不漂亮，但我們會到達那裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 185.33,
          "end": 187.43,
          "en": "So attached you find this file.",
          "zh": "所以附件裡你找到這個檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 188.13,
          "end": 195.63,
          "en": "And with that added, The next goal, of course, is to not just output title and subtitle, but to",
          "zh": "而有了那個被加上，下一個目標當然是不只輸出標題和副標題，而是"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 195.63,
          "end": 199.71,
          "en": "output the real meetup data and of course to avoid this overlapping.",
          "zh": "輸出真正的 meetup 資料，當然也避免這個重疊。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 199.71,
          "end": 205.82999999999998,
          "en": "So for the overlapping, since we have our meetup items here, why don't we simply add a section here?",
          "zh": "所以對重疊，既然我們這裡有 meetup 項目，我們為什麼不在這裡單純加一個 section？"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 207.24,
          "end": 211.8,
          "en": "With maybe an idea of meetups or a class of meetups, whatever you prefer.",
          "zh": "也許 id 是 meetups，或 class 是 meetups，隨你偏好。"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 211.82999999999998,
          "end": 215.16,
          "en": "Let's move our each block into this section.",
          "zh": "讓我們把 each 區塊移進這個 section。"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 216.32999999999998,
          "end": 222.31,
          "en": "And now we can use the ID meetups here to add a simple style.",
          "zh": "而現在我們可以用這裡的 id meetups 來加一個簡單樣式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 222.32999999999998,
          "end": 230.34,
          "en": "So here in style tags in the app Svelte file, we can select meetups and give this a margin top of five",
          "zh": "所以這裡在 App.svelte 檔案的 style 標籤裡，我們可以選 meetups，並給這個 margin-top 5"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 230.34,
          "end": 233.76,
          "en": "REM because the header will have a height of four REM.",
          "zh": "rem，因為 header 會有 4rem 的高度。"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 233.76,
          "end": 237.37,
          "en": "So this will now add one extra ram of spacing and this looks good.",
          "zh": "所以這現在會加額外 1rem 的間距，而這看起來不錯。"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 237.39,
          "end": 240.98,
          "en": "So now the next step is to pass some data into these components.",
          "zh": "所以現在下一步是把一些資料傳進這些元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 240.99,
          "end": 247.44,
          "en": "And before we do that, this is the place where I want to dive into the two different main types of",
          "zh": "而在我們做那個之前，這是我想深入兩種主要類型的地方，"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 247.44,
          "end": 253.44,
          "en": "components you have in not just in svelte apps, but actually also in React and Vue and Angular apps,",
          "zh": "你在不只是 Svelte App、實際上也在 React、Vue 和 Angular App 裡有的元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 253.44,
          "end": 256.05,
          "en": "but well, also in svelte apps.",
          "zh": "但嗯，也在 Svelte App 裡。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "14689572",
      "title": "Working with Different Component Types",
      "lectureOrder": 46,
      "videoOrder": 39,
      "sourceHash": "ba7d492074365525440c8b575464c23acd48b313bf0e780323667f818c229d8b",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.32,
          "end": 5.27,
          "en": "Which different types of components do we have?",
          "zh": "我們有哪些不同類型的元件？"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.29,
          "end": 10.6,
          "en": "And now, please, let me note that these are not official differentiations, not official types.",
          "zh": "而現在，請讓我註明，這些不是官方的區分，不是官方類型。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 10.6,
          "end": 13.56,
          "en": "You don't create these different components differently.",
          "zh": "你不是以不同方式建立這些不同元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 13.57,
          "end": 18.52,
          "en": "You don't have to annotate them or set a specific specific configuration.",
          "zh": "你不必註解它們，或設定一個特定設定。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 18.52,
          "end": 25.66,
          "en": "Instead, it's just about how you use them in any app you're building and actually with any framework,",
          "zh": "相反，這只是關於你在你建立的任何 App 裡怎麼使用它們，而實際上用任何框架，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 25.69,
          "end": 32.74,
          "en": "be that a compiler like Svelte or be that a real framework like Angular or Vue or a library like React,",
          "zh": "無論是像 Svelte 這樣的編譯器，或像 Angular 或 Vue 這樣的真正框架，或像 React 這樣的函式庫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 32.89,
          "end": 40.12,
          "en": "you typically have stateful components, also called containers and presentational components.",
          "zh": "你通常有有狀態元件，也叫容器，以及展示元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 40.15,
          "end": 41.56,
          "en": "Now what's the difference?",
          "zh": "現在差別是什麼？"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 42.22,
          "end": 50.13,
          "en": "Stateful components are all about holding and managing data and passing data around to other components.",
          "zh": "有狀態元件全是關於持有並管理資料，並把資料傳給其他元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 50.14,
          "end": 57.07,
          "en": "The state in stateful is basically the data, and stateful means that this data is not necessarily static,",
          "zh": "有狀態裡的狀態基本上是資料，而有狀態表示這份資料不一定是靜態的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 57.07,
          "end": 63.11,
          "en": "but that it may change, may change because of user interaction, because it's fetched from a server",
          "zh": "而是它可能改變，可能因為使用者互動而改變，因為它從伺服器被取得，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 63.11,
          "end": 64.64,
          "en": "for whatever reason.",
          "zh": "無論什麼理由。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 65.03,
          "end": 72.38,
          "en": "In a presentational component you might have some static data, but besides that, all the data you",
          "zh": "在展示元件裡，你也許有一些靜態資料，但除此之外，你"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 72.38,
          "end": 78.35,
          "en": "you use in that component is received from outside and in a presentational component, you typically",
          "zh": "在那個元件裡使用的所有資料都是從外面收到的，而在展示元件裡，你通常"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 78.35,
          "end": 84.38,
          "en": "also don't change that data, you don't manipulate it, instead you just output it.",
          "zh": "也不改變那份資料，你不操作它，相反你只輸出它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 84.38,
          "end": 89.84,
          "en": "You might also output a button that allows the user to interact, but then you would always just take",
          "zh": "你也許也輸出一個按鈕，讓使用者能互動，但那時你永遠只是拿"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 89.84,
          "end": 96.22999999999999,
          "en": "that interaction and pass it back to a stateful component so that the stateful component can act and",
          "zh": "那個互動並傳回一個有狀態元件，這樣有狀態元件可以行動並"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 96.22999999999999,
          "end": 98.39,
          "en": "change data or whatever needs to be done.",
          "zh": "改變資料，或做任何需要做的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 98.78,
          "end": 105.25999999999999,
          "en": "Examples for stateful components in general could be your app component, which often is a root place",
          "zh": "一般來說，有狀態元件的例子可以是你的 App 元件，它常常是資料管理的根位置，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 105.25999999999999,
          "end": 108.65,
          "en": "for data management or main feature components.",
          "zh": "或主要功能元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 108.65,
          "end": 113.84,
          "en": "If you're building a shop that could be products or checkout components in our app, we might later",
          "zh": "如果你在建立商店，那可以是產品或結帳元件，在我們的 App 裡，我們稍後也許"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 113.84,
          "end": 118.31,
          "en": "have some meet ups component that helps us with managing meet ups.",
          "zh": "有某個 meetups 元件，幫我們管理 meetup。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 118.58,
          "end": 126.23,
          "en": "Presentational component examples would be things like modals cards, buttons, So basically user interface",
          "zh": "展示元件的例子會是像 modal、卡片、按鈕這樣的東西，所以基本上是使用者介面"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 126.23,
          "end": 132.38,
          "en": "elements you could say, or also something like our meet up item in this app, we're building components",
          "zh": "元素，你可以說，或也像我們這個 App 裡的 meetup item，我們在建立的元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 132.38,
          "end": 137.24,
          "en": "that simply output something and shouldn't really change our data.",
          "zh": "單純輸出某樣東西，而且不該真的改變我們的資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 137.27,
          "end": 139.55,
          "en": "Now why do we have this differentiation?",
          "zh": "現在我們為什麼有這個區分？"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 139.55,
          "end": 145.37,
          "en": "Why doesn't every component do what it needs to do and change data if it has a button and instead of",
          "zh": "為什麼不是每個元件做它需要做的事，如果它有按鈕就改變資料，而不是"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 145.37,
          "end": 149.93,
          "en": "passing that action back to another component which then changes data?",
          "zh": "把那個動作傳回另一個元件，然後那個元件改變資料？"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 150.62,
          "end": 154.97,
          "en": "The idea here is that we keep our app maintainable.",
          "zh": "這裡的想法是我們讓 App 可維護。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 155.09,
          "end": 161.66,
          "en": "If every component does everything, it's pretty hard to manage your application as it grows, especially",
          "zh": "如果每個元件什麼都做，隨著它成長，管理你的應用程式相當難，尤其"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 161.66,
          "end": 163.22,
          "en": "if you're working in a team.",
          "zh": "如果你在團隊裡工作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 163.22,
          "end": 169.61,
          "en": "Instead, if you have a few sources of truth, as it's also called, so only a few components which",
          "zh": "相反，如果你有少數事實來源，如它也被稱呼的，所以只有少數元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 169.61,
          "end": 175.19,
          "en": "are changing stuff, then the vast majority of components is pretty easy to manage and you don't really",
          "zh": "在改變東西，那麼絕大多數元件相當容易管理，而你不必真的"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 175.19,
          "end": 180.29,
          "en": "need to worry about whether that component edits or changes your meet up data.",
          "zh": "擔心那個元件是否編輯或改變你的 meetup 資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 180.29,
          "end": 183.74,
          "en": "You know, I only got two components which interact with meet up data.",
          "zh": "你知道，我只有兩個元件和 meetup 資料互動。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 183.74,
          "end": 190.7,
          "en": "All the other components are only there so that I can encapsulate my styles and my markup and output",
          "zh": "所有其他元件只是在那裡，這樣我可以封裝我的樣式和我的標記，並以"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 190.7,
          "end": 193.12,
          "en": "content in a nice and pleasant way.",
          "zh": "好看、愉快的方式輸出內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 193.13,
          "end": 198.92000000000002,
          "en": "So this differentiation is something you see in any framework and it makes a lot of sense because it",
          "zh": "所以這個區分是你在任何框架裡看到的東西，而它很有道理，因為它"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 198.92000000000002,
          "end": 206.24,
          "en": "ensures that your app stays maintainable and therefore you only have a few stateful components typically,",
          "zh": "確保你的 App 保持可維護，因此你通常只有少數有狀態元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 206.24,
          "end": 210.02,
          "en": "and you have plenty of presentational components.",
          "zh": "而你有大量展示元件。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "14689576",
      "title": "Passing Data Into Components",
      "lectureOrder": 47,
      "videoOrder": 40,
      "sourceHash": "fcbf246036fec40a78105a319e0d8ae6df8b865343fc0db3f89498d0a0e228e5",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.22,
          "end": 7.89,
          "en": "Now back in our application meet up item actually will be a presentational component.",
          "zh": "現在回到我們的應用程式，meetup item 實際上會是一個展示元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 7.92,
          "end": 8.58,
          "en": "Why?",
          "zh": "為什麼？"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.61,
          "end": 13.44,
          "en": "Because this component should only worry about outputting some content.",
          "zh": "因為這個元件只該擔心輸出一些內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 13.47,
          "end": 17.37,
          "en": "Yes, we do have buttons, but for now these buttons don't do anything.",
          "zh": "對，我們有按鈕，但目前這些按鈕什麼都不做。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 17.37,
          "end": 23.7,
          "en": "And later, when they will do something, we'll just use these buttons to pass the event to another",
          "zh": "而稍後，當它們會做某件事時，我們只會用這些按鈕把事件傳給另一個"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 23.7,
          "end": 25.92,
          "en": "component, which we don't have yet.",
          "zh": "元件，我們還沒有的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 25.95,
          "end": 29.31,
          "en": "We don't have that functionality yet, but we'll do that later.",
          "zh": "我們還沒有那個功能，但我們稍後會做那個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 29.61,
          "end": 34.65,
          "en": "So for the moment, let's just ensure that we receive data here and we can output that data.",
          "zh": "所以目前，讓我們只確定我們在這裡收到資料，而我們可以輸出那份資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 34.77,
          "end": 36.9,
          "en": "Let me shrink my styles for that.",
          "zh": "讓我為那個縮小我的樣式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 37.66,
          "end": 42.13,
          "en": "How do we then receive data in a component you learned about that to?",
          "zh": "那麼我們怎麼在元件裡收到資料，你也學過那個？"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 42.92,
          "end": 50.93,
          "en": "Well, we need our script tags and then you use export let and then variable names here like title or",
          "zh": "嗯，我們需要 script 標籤，然後你使用 export let，然後這裡的變數名稱，像 title，或"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 50.93,
          "end": 51.32,
          "en": "export.",
          "zh": "export"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 51.32,
          "end": 54.74,
          "en": "Let subtitle and you can name these variables whatever you want.",
          "zh": "let subtitle，而你可以隨你高興命名這些變數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 55.13,
          "end": 63.02,
          "en": "We also can have our image URL whoops export let and by using the export keyword, svelte understands",
          "zh": "我們也可以有 imageUrl，哎呀，export let，而藉由使用 export 關鍵字，Svelte 理解"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 63.02,
          "end": 70.91,
          "en": "that these variables in this component are settable from outside and from outside always means from",
          "zh": "這個元件裡的這些變數可以從外面設定，而從外面永遠表示從"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 70.91,
          "end": 75.56,
          "en": "inside the component where you are embedding this meetup item component later.",
          "zh": "你稍後嵌入這個 meetup item 元件的那個元件裡面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 76.31,
          "end": 81.7,
          "en": "So besides title, subtitle and image URL, we also have our description.",
          "zh": "所以除了 title、subtitle 和 imageUrl，我們也有 description。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 81.71000000000001,
          "end": 83.48,
          "en": "We also have our.",
          "zh": "我們也有我們的"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 84.23,
          "end": 85.09,
          "en": "Address.",
          "zh": "address。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 85.1,
          "end": 89.21000000000001,
          "en": "So here we can now output title with the single curly braces.",
          "zh": "所以這裡我們現在可以用單一大括號輸出 title。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 89.21000000000001,
          "end": 91.67,
          "en": "This is how you output data from your script tags.",
          "zh": "這是你怎麼從 script 標籤輸出資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 91.67,
          "end": 92.12,
          "en": "Right?",
          "zh": "對吧？"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 92.12,
          "end": 99.25999999999999,
          "en": "So how you refer to JavaScript expressions or two variables that yield a value which you want to output.",
          "zh": "所以你怎麼參考 JavaScript 運算式，或產生你想輸出的值的變數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 99.38,
          "end": 101.63,
          "en": "Let's do the same for subtitle here.",
          "zh": "讓我們在這裡對 subtitle 做同樣的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 101.66,
          "end": 104.45,
          "en": "Let's do the same for the image source here.",
          "zh": "讓我們在這裡對圖片來源做同樣的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 104.45,
          "end": 109.03999999999999,
          "en": "The variable name is image URL and for the alt text I'll use the title again.",
          "zh": "變數名稱是 imageUrl，而對 alt 文字我會再次使用 title。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 109.16,
          "end": 111.65,
          "en": "These quotation marks here are optional.",
          "zh": "這裡這些引號是選擇性的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 111.65,
          "end": 116.84,
          "en": "You don't have to use them, but you can and they can help in some editors with formatting.",
          "zh": "你不必使用它們，但你可以，而它們可以在某些編輯器裡幫格式化。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 117.38,
          "end": 123.44,
          "en": "Now, the paragraph here should not be a self-closing tag, but instead in between I want to have my",
          "zh": "現在，這裡的段落不該是自閉合標籤，而是在中間我想要我的"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 123.47,
          "end": 124.64,
          "en": "description.",
          "zh": "description。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 125.3,
          "end": 127.52,
          "en": "And that is it for for now.",
          "zh": "而目前就是這樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 127.52,
          "end": 129.98,
          "en": "But of course, that alone doesn't do the trick.",
          "zh": "但當然，那單獨不會成功。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 129.98,
          "end": 136.82,
          "en": "Now that we have these bindable, these settable variables, we need to set them.",
          "zh": "現在我們有這些可繫結、這些可設定的變數，我們需要設定它們。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 136.82,
          "end": 142.01,
          "en": "We want to set them there where we use that meetup item here in app Svelte here I'm looping through",
          "zh": "我們想在我們使用那個 meetup item 的地方設定它們，這裡在 App.svelte，我正在迴圈"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 142.01,
          "end": 145.85,
          "en": "all my meetups and I'm replicating this meetup item markup for every meetup.",
          "zh": "所有我的 meetup，而我為每個 meetup 複製這個 meetup item 標記。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 145.85,
          "end": 151.31,
          "en": "That means that now here we can set these variables and you have to use the exact same names now for",
          "zh": "那表示現在這裡我們可以設定這些變數，而你現在必須使用完全相同的名稱來"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 151.31,
          "end": 151.97,
          "en": "setting.",
          "zh": "設定。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 151.97,
          "end": 156.92000000000002,
          "en": "So we're setting the title here equal to meetup dot title.",
          "zh": "所以我們在這裡把 title 設成等於 meetup.title。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 156.95,
          "end": 161.18,
          "en": "We're setting the subtitle equal to meetup dot subtitle.",
          "zh": "我們把 subtitle 設成等於 meetup.subtitle。"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 161.54,
          "end": 164.6,
          "en": "Now, by the way, the dot title dot subtitle.",
          "zh": "現在，順便說，.title、.subtitle。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 164.69,
          "end": 170.27,
          "en": "These property names here don't have to match the variable names you defined in meetup item.",
          "zh": "這裡這些屬性名稱不必符合你在 meetup item 裡定義的變數名稱。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 170.27,
          "end": 173.75,
          "en": "You just have to use the property names you defined here in your objects.",
          "zh": "你只必須使用你在這裡的物件裡定義的屬性名稱。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 173.75,
          "end": 176.24,
          "en": "So I got title, subtitle description, and so on here.",
          "zh": "所以我這裡有 title、subtitle、description，等等。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 176.24,
          "end": 178.01,
          "en": "Hence I have to use the same here.",
          "zh": "因此我必須在這裡使用同樣的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 178.55,
          "end": 180.77,
          "en": "So we got that.",
          "zh": "所以我們有那個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 180.77,
          "end": 186.9,
          "en": "I also want to forward my description from Meetup dot description.",
          "zh": "我也想從 meetup.description 轉送我的 description。"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 187.52,
          "end": 191.18,
          "en": "Let me split this across multiple lines to make it easier to read.",
          "zh": "讓我把這個拆成多行，讓它更容易讀。"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 191.21,
          "end": 195.32,
          "en": "Want to set my image URL, which is meetup dot image URL?",
          "zh": "想設定我的 imageUrl，那是 meetup.imageUrl？"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 195.53,
          "end": 197.78,
          "en": "And what else do we need?",
          "zh": "而我們還需要什麼？"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 199.16,
          "end": 200.39,
          "en": "Yeah, that should be it.",
          "zh": "對，那應該就是了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 200.45,
          "end": 204.11,
          "en": "Think I'm missing my contact for now.",
          "zh": "我想我目前缺少我的聯絡方式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 204.11,
          "end": 208.25,
          "en": "So let me add an anchor tag here in meetup item where we have mail to.",
          "zh": "所以讓我在 meetup item 裡這裡加一個錨點標籤，我們有 mailto:。"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 208.25,
          "end": 210.98,
          "en": "And now you can also use a dynamic expression here.",
          "zh": "而現在你也可以在這裡使用一個動態運算式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 210.98,
          "end": 217.31,
          "en": "So you can use the single curly braces here in combination with some text on the href attribute.",
          "zh": "所以你可以在 href 屬性上，把單一大括號和一些文字一起使用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 217.31,
          "end": 220.01,
          "en": "And then I can refer to, let's say, email.",
          "zh": "然後我可以參考，讓我們說，email。"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 220.19,
          "end": 223.52,
          "en": "And for that I just have to add export, let email.",
          "zh": "而為此我只必須加 export let email。"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 223.52,
          "end": 229.46,
          "en": "So that is a syntax we haven't seen before, but we can basically use these curly braces to output something",
          "zh": "所以那是我們之前沒看過的語法，但我們基本上可以使用這些大括號，在"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 229.46,
          "end": 233.48,
          "en": "anywhere where text is expected and here text is expected.",
          "zh": "預期文字的任何地方輸出某樣東西，而這裡預期文字。"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 233.51,
          "end": 237.59,
          "en": "Normally you would have something like mail to test at test.com.",
          "zh": "通常你會有像 mailto:test@test.com 這樣的東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 237.59,
          "end": 243.11,
          "en": "Well, if we know that we get this email address dynamically, then we can just use a dynamic expression",
          "zh": "嗯，如果我們知道我們動態得到這個電子郵件地址，那麼我們可以只在這裡使用一個動態運算式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 243.11,
          "end": 243.56,
          "en": "here.",
          "zh": "這裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 244.44,
          "end": 246.69,
          "en": "And here the text will just contact.",
          "zh": "而這裡文字會"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 246.81,
          "end": 248.01,
          "en": "Just be contact.",
          "zh": "只是 contact。"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 248.04,
          "end": 255.48,
          "en": "So now in apps world, we also need to forward that email and that is meetup dot contact email.",
          "zh": "所以現在在 App.svelte，我們也需要轉送那個 email，而那是 meetup.contactEmail。"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 255.69,
          "end": 260.13,
          "en": "If we now save this and we go back, this looks way better, right?",
          "zh": "如果我們現在存這個並回去，這看起來好得多，對吧？"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 260.13,
          "end": 261.78,
          "en": "These are our meetups here.",
          "zh": "這些是我們這裡的 meetup。"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 261.78,
          "end": 268.65,
          "en": "We got our content populated into the meetups, which looks pretty sweet to me.",
          "zh": "我們把內容填進 meetup，對我來說看起來相當不錯。"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 268.98,
          "end": 275.34000000000003,
          "en": "One thing I'm missing and I'm getting a warning here is that my meetup item was created without the",
          "zh": "我缺少的一件事，而我這裡得到一個警告，是我的 meetup item 被建立時沒有"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 275.34000000000003,
          "end": 275.61,
          "en": "address.",
          "zh": "address。"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 275.61,
          "end": 279.15,
          "en": "I'm expecting the address here, though, but I'm not outputting it here.",
          "zh": "不過我在這裡預期 address，但我沒有在這裡輸出它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 280.05,
          "end": 281.34000000000003,
          "en": "I can certainly change that.",
          "zh": "我當然可以改變那個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 281.34000000000003,
          "end": 282.6,
          "en": "Maybe here in the header.",
          "zh": "也許這裡在 header 裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 282.6,
          "end": 288.93,
          "en": "Add the address in a paragraph below the H2 tag by referring to address here.",
          "zh": "在 h2 標籤下面的段落裡加 address，藉由在這裡參考 address。"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 288.93,
          "end": 295.2,
          "en": "And let's now make sure we also pass the address into this component by adding address equal to.",
          "zh": "而現在讓我們也確定我們把 address 傳進這個元件，藉由加 address 等於。"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 296.21,
          "end": 298.1,
          "en": "Meet up address here.",
          "zh": "這裡的 meetup.address。"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 298.22,
          "end": 300.41,
          "en": "Now, if I save this, the address is here too.",
          "zh": "現在，如果我存這個，address 也在這裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 300.56,
          "end": 300.86,
          "en": "Okay.",
          "zh": "好。"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 300.86,
          "end": 301.82,
          "en": "This doesn't look too bad.",
          "zh": "這看起來不太糟。"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 301.82,
          "end": 307.73,
          "en": "And I hope the general idea of how we work with components and how we pass data from a parent component",
          "zh": "而我希望和元件一起工作、以及我們怎麼從父元件把資料傳給"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 307.73,
          "end": 309.44,
          "en": "to a child component is clear.",
          "zh": "子元件的一般想法是清楚的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 309.5,
          "end": 314.11,
          "en": "By the way, if you're wondering how you pass data the other way around, we will learn this later.",
          "zh": "順便說，如果你在想你怎麼反方向傳資料，我們稍後會學這個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 314.12,
          "end": 314.93,
          "en": "No worries.",
          "zh": "不用擔心。"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 316.01,
          "end": 318.05,
          "en": "So that's the general setup.",
          "zh": "所以那是一般設定。"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 318.14,
          "end": 321.38,
          "en": "I'm, of course, not fully there.",
          "zh": "我當然還沒完全到那裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 321.38,
          "end": 325.97,
          "en": "Regarding the look of that, I don't want to have these huge cards here.",
          "zh": "關於那個外觀，我不想要這裡這些巨大的卡片。"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 325.97,
          "end": 327.5,
          "en": "I want to have a different layout.",
          "zh": "我想要一個不同的版面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 327.53,
          "end": 329.66,
          "en": "I also want to have different buttons.",
          "zh": "我也想要不同的按鈕。"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 329.66,
          "end": 333.17,
          "en": "And it would be nice if we could add meetups ourselves, right?",
          "zh": "而如果我們能自己加 meetup，會很好，對吧？"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 333.17,
          "end": 335.3,
          "en": "So these are the next things we'll tackle.",
          "zh": "所以這些是我們接下來要處理的事。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "14689578",
      "title": "Adding a \"MeetupGrid\" Component",
      "lectureOrder": 48,
      "videoOrder": 41,
      "sourceHash": "ab93721a7efc08cc56d242d12ce84964d3e8d17a3ceeb5771be96b397865498a",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.25,
          "end": 5.55,
          "en": "Let's start with organizing these meetups in a grid.",
          "zh": "讓我們從把這些 meetup 組織成格子開始。"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.58,
          "end": 13.86,
          "en": "I want to have two columns here and yeah, on smaller devices, if we preview this here on smaller devices,",
          "zh": "我想在這裡有兩欄，而對，在較小的裝置上，如果我們在這裡預覽較小的裝置，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 13.86,
          "end": 15.42,
          "en": "this look is fine, of course.",
          "zh": "這個外觀當然沒問題。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 15.66,
          "end": 21.09,
          "en": "So for that, let's add a new component and I'll add it in the meetups folder because it will be a component",
          "zh": "所以為此，讓我們加一個新元件，而我會把它加在 meetups 資料夾裡，因為它會是一個元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 21.09,
          "end": 27.42,
          "en": "that is relevant to our our meetup feature.",
          "zh": "和我們的 meetup 功能相關的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 27.45,
          "end": 32.94,
          "en": "Though you could even argue that since I'll be building a grid in there, we could build a general UI",
          "zh": "不過你甚至可以主張，既然我會在裡面建立一個格子，我們也可以在這裡建立一個一般的介面"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 32.97,
          "end": 38.55,
          "en": "component here too, which is only about organizing items in a grid.",
          "zh": "元件，它只關於把項目組織成格子。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 39.19,
          "end": 46.24,
          "en": "I will move my meet up loop loops into that grid though, and therefore it will definitely be a grid",
          "zh": "不過我會把我的 meetup 迴圈移進那個格子，因此它絕對會是一個格子，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 46.27,
          "end": 49.58,
          "en": "only focusing on meet ups and hence I'll create it here in the meet ups folder.",
          "zh": "只聚焦 meetup，因此我會在 meetups 資料夾裡這裡建立它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 49.63,
          "end": 51.9,
          "en": "I'll name it meet up grid dot svelte.",
          "zh": "我會把它命名為 MeetupGrid.svelte。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 51.91,
          "end": 53.14,
          "en": "That's the file name.",
          "zh": "那是檔名。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 53.38,
          "end": 55.72,
          "en": "The component is therefore named meet up grid.",
          "zh": "因此元件被命名為 MeetupGrid。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 56.41,
          "end": 57.58,
          "en": "Now in there.",
          "zh": "現在在裡面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 58.66,
          "end": 60.1,
          "en": "Let's add a section.",
          "zh": "讓我們加一個 section。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 62.15,
          "end": 64.88,
          "en": "And in that section, I just want to have that.",
          "zh": "而在那個 section 裡，我只想要那個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 65,
          "end": 67.07,
          "en": "Well, basically, I want to have that section there.",
          "zh": "嗯，基本上，我想要那個 section 在那裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 67.07,
          "end": 72.32,
          "en": "So let's cut that section from Apps World and let's move it in here into Meetup grid Svelte.",
          "zh": "所以讓我們從 App.svelte 剪下那個 section，並把它移到這裡，進 MeetupGrid.svelte。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 73.72,
          "end": 76.18,
          "en": "In here in that meetup grid.",
          "zh": "在這裡，在那個 meetup grid 裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 77.08,
          "end": 83.8,
          "en": "I'll add a script and I will import my meetup item, of course, because I'm using that component in",
          "zh": "我會加一個 script，而我當然會匯入我的 MeetupItem，因為我在"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 83.8,
          "end": 84.94,
          "en": "this meetup grid component.",
          "zh": "這個 MeetupGrid 元件裡使用那個元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 84.94,
          "end": 89.26,
          "en": "So let's import meetup item from dot slash meetup item dot svelte.",
          "zh": "所以讓我們從 ./MeetupItem.svelte 匯入 MeetupItem。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 89.47,
          "end": 91.66,
          "en": "And we also need our meetups, right?",
          "zh": "而我們也需要我們的 meetups，對吧？"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 91.66,
          "end": 93.22,
          "en": "Because I'm looping through them here.",
          "zh": "因為我在這裡迴圈它們。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 93.22,
          "end": 100.15,
          "en": "So let's export, let meetups here so that we expect a meetups variable to be passed into this meetup",
          "zh": "所以讓我們在這裡 export let meetups，這樣我們預期一個 meetups 變數被傳進這個 meetup"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 100.15,
          "end": 103.78,
          "en": "grid item from outside so that this code is valid.",
          "zh": "grid，從外面，這樣這段程式碼有效。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 104.91,
          "end": 106.38,
          "en": "We also need some styles.",
          "zh": "我們也需要一些樣式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 106.38,
          "end": 109.11,
          "en": "And as before, you find these attached.",
          "zh": "而和之前一樣，你找到這些附件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 109.41,
          "end": 111.66,
          "en": "This time it's simply a CSS file.",
          "zh": "這次它單純是一個 CSS 檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 111.66,
          "end": 117.81,
          "en": "So you can just add style tags here and then just copy in the CSS code you find in the attached CSS",
          "zh": "所以你可以在這裡加 style 標籤，然後只複製你在附件 CSS"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 117.81,
          "end": 118.39,
          "en": "file.",
          "zh": "檔案裡找到的 CSS 程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 118.41,
          "end": 119.3,
          "en": "It's pretty trivial.",
          "zh": "它相當簡單。"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 119.31,
          "end": 121.29,
          "en": "Just sets up a CSS grid here.",
          "zh": "只是在這裡設定一個 CSS grid。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 121.59,
          "end": 123.03,
          "en": "Nothing too fancy.",
          "zh": "沒有太花俏。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 123.04,
          "end": 127.47,
          "en": "And now as a next step, we just have to use the meetup grid in the app svelte file.",
          "zh": "而現在作為下一步，我們只必須在 App.svelte 檔案裡使用 MeetupGrid。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 127.5,
          "end": 130.62,
          "en": "Again, keeping our app component relatively lean.",
          "zh": "再次，讓我們的 App 元件保持相對精簡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 130.62,
          "end": 134.76,
          "en": "We just have the header and thereafter our grid.",
          "zh": "我們只是有 header，然後是我們的格子。"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 136.07,
          "end": 141.05,
          "en": "And I want to add a main element here now which receives that margin top.",
          "zh": "而我現在想在這裡加一個 main 元素，它收到那個 margin-top。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 141.05,
          "end": 146.09,
          "en": "So a tiny change here, but most importantly inside of that main element, main, by the way, is a",
          "zh": "所以這裡一個小小的改變，但最重要的是，在那個 main 元素裡面，main 順便說是一個"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 146.09,
          "end": 147.5,
          "en": "default HTML element.",
          "zh": "預設的 HTML 元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 147.5,
          "end": 150.92000000000002,
          "en": "But most importantly, inside of that main element, I want to use the grid.",
          "zh": "但最重要的是，在那個 main 元素裡面，我想使用格子。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 150.95,
          "end": 155.63,
          "en": "Now, we don't need to import meet up item here anymore because we're not directly using the meet up",
          "zh": "現在，我們不再需要在這裡匯入 MeetupItem，因為我們沒有直接使用 meetup"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 155.63,
          "end": 157.79,
          "en": "item component in the app component.",
          "zh": "item 元件，在 App 元件裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 157.79,
          "end": 158.39,
          "en": "Right.",
          "zh": "對。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 158.57,
          "end": 167.54,
          "en": "Nowhere here are we using it so we can just use or import meet up grid instead from meet up slash meet",
          "zh": "這裡沒有任何地方我們在使用它，所以我們可以改為使用或匯入 MeetupGrid，從 meetups/"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 167.54,
          "end": 173.6,
          "en": "up grid dot svelte and now we can use the meet up grid component here.",
          "zh": "MeetupGrid.svelte，而現在我們可以在這裡使用 MeetupGrid 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 174.56,
          "end": 177.95,
          "en": "Meet up grid instead of the main element.",
          "zh": "MeetupGrid，而不是 main 元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 177.95,
          "end": 184.04,
          "en": "And remember that the meet up grid expects to get meet ups as a prop.",
          "zh": "而記住 MeetupGrid 預期得到 meetups 作為 prop。"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 184.04,
          "end": 186.14,
          "en": "So we need to pass that down.",
          "zh": "所以我們需要把那個傳下去。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 186.14,
          "end": 194.33,
          "en": "We pass meet ups here and that are just our meet ups and meet ups here on the right side refers to this",
          "zh": "我們在這裡傳 meetups，而那只是我們的 meetups，而右邊這裡的 meetups 指這個"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 194.33,
          "end": 198.29,
          "en": "constant of course, our JavaScript array of meet up data later.",
          "zh": "常數，當然，我們稍後的 meetup 資料 JavaScript 陣列。"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 198.29,
          "end": 202.7,
          "en": "Of course this will be fetched from a server, but for now we just hardcode that here.",
          "zh": "當然這會從伺服器被取得，但目前我們只在這裡把它寫死。"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 203.09,
          "end": 210.95,
          "en": "Now you'll learn about a convenient shortcut if your prop name or your attribute name here is the same",
          "zh": "現在你會學到一個方便的捷徑，如果你的 prop 名稱或這裡的屬性名稱和"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 210.95,
          "end": 213.65,
          "en": "as the variable name that holds the data.",
          "zh": "持有資料的變數名稱一樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 213.68,
          "end": 216.29,
          "en": "You can use this shortcut here, right?",
          "zh": "你可以使用這裡這個捷徑，對吧？"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 216.29,
          "end": 217.64,
          "en": "So let's use that here.",
          "zh": "所以讓我們在這裡使用那個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 217.67000000000002,
          "end": 219.44,
          "en": "Let's save everything.",
          "zh": "讓我們存一切。"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 219.44,
          "end": 221.15,
          "en": "And that looks like a nice grid.",
          "zh": "而那看起來像一個不錯的格子。"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 221.15,
          "end": 223.82,
          "en": "And on smaller devices, this also looks good.",
          "zh": "而在較小的裝置上，這看起來也不錯。"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 223.91,
          "end": 228.32,
          "en": "So now we have another example for a presentational component.",
          "zh": "所以現在我們有另一個展示元件的例子。"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 228.35,
          "end": 232.61,
          "en": "This is also just a component that receives data and then outputs data.",
          "zh": "這也只是一個收到資料然後輸出資料的元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 232.61,
          "end": 238.14,
          "en": "In this case, it outputs a different component and also some normal HTML elements.",
          "zh": "在這個情況，它輸出一個不同的元件，也有一些一般的 HTML 元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 238.14,
          "end": 239.85,
          "en": "But it doesn't matter what it outputs.",
          "zh": "但它輸出什麼不重要。"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 239.85,
          "end": 242.73,
          "en": "The core thing is it doesn't change meet ups.",
          "zh": "核心是它不改變 meetups。"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 242.73,
          "end": 246.72,
          "en": "We change meet ups neither here in meet up grid nor in meet up items.",
          "zh": "我們既不在 MeetupGrid 裡改變 meetups，也不在 MeetupItem 裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 246.72,
          "end": 253.62,
          "en": "We only change it in the way of setting it in app svelte and this is a pretty default setup.",
          "zh": "我們只以在 App.svelte 裡設定它的方式改變它，而這是相當預設的設定。"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 253.62,
          "end": 259.92,
          "en": "We have more presentational components than stateful components because right now the app svelte file,",
          "zh": "我們有比有狀態元件更多的展示元件，因為現在 App.svelte 檔案、"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 259.95,
          "end": 263.34,
          "en": "the app component is our only stateful component.",
          "zh": "App 元件是我們唯一的有狀態元件。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "14689582",
      "title": "Adding New Meetups via a Form",
      "lectureOrder": 49,
      "videoOrder": 42,
      "sourceHash": "c8f17f2f7171963ef32ec206f7ddd73ec0a884f9334ec5a905052374f8368b36",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.2,
          "end": 9.82,
          "en": "With the meetup grid added, It's now also time to make sure that we can add meetups now for adding",
          "zh": "加上了 MeetupGrid，現在也是確定我們能加 meetup 的時候，現在為了加"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 9.82,
          "end": 10.27,
          "en": "meetups.",
          "zh": "meetup。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 10.27,
          "end": 12.7,
          "en": "I'll start in the app Svelte file later.",
          "zh": "我稍後會從 App.svelte 檔案開始。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12.7,
          "end": 17.89,
          "en": "We'll outsource this functionality into a different component too, but for the moment we would hit",
          "zh": "我們也會把這個功能外包到一個不同的元件，但目前我們會碰到"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 17.89,
          "end": 22.96,
          "en": "a problem when we want to pass data around and I'll show which problem this is later.",
          "zh": "一個問題，當我們想把資料傳來傳去，而我稍後會給你看這是哪個問題。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 22.96,
          "end": 29.26,
          "en": "For now, let's just add our, um, our add form, so to say.",
          "zh": "目前，讓我們只加我們的，嗯，我們的新增表單，可以說。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 30.01,
          "end": 36.34,
          "en": "So in here I'll add a form element with no action because I don't want to send an Http request here",
          "zh": "所以在這裡我會加一個 form 元素，沒有 action，因為我不想在這裡送一個 HTTP 請求，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 36.34,
          "end": 37.75,
          "en": "in the main section.",
          "zh": "在 main 區段裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 37.75,
          "end": 42.28,
          "en": "This is our form and in there we need a couple of inputs and we need a button now.",
          "zh": "這是我們的表單，而在裡面我們需要幾個輸入，而我們現在需要一個按鈕。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 42.28,
          "end": 45.19,
          "en": "We need inputs for all the data fields we have in a meetup.",
          "zh": "我們需要輸入，給 meetup 裡我們有的所有資料欄位。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 45.19,
          "end": 48.97,
          "en": "We have a title, subtitle description, image, URL, address and contact email.",
          "zh": "我們有 title、subtitle、description、imageUrl、address 和 contactEmail。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 49,
          "end": 51.4,
          "en": "The ID will be generated automatically.",
          "zh": "ID 會自動產生。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 52.24,
          "end": 55.63,
          "en": "Therefore, in here, let's maybe add a couple of divs.",
          "zh": "因此，在這裡，讓我們也許加幾個 div。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 55.66,
          "end": 60.7,
          "en": "Each div receives a class of form control just for styling reasons.",
          "zh": "每個 div 收到 class 是 form-control，只為了樣式理由。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 60.7,
          "end": 66.52,
          "en": "Then we have a label, um, for the title for example, where we say title and below that we have a",
          "zh": "然後我們有一個 label，嗯，例如給 title，我們說 title，而在那下面我們有一個"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 66.52,
          "end": 69.91,
          "en": "input of type text with ID title.",
          "zh": "type 是 text、id 是 title 的 input。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 71.7,
          "end": 78.12,
          "en": "Now we can repeat this a couple of times for the different pieces of data we're collecting.",
          "zh": "現在我們可以對我們正在收集的不同資料重複這個幾次。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 78.12,
          "end": 80.61,
          "en": "So we have the subtitle here, for example.",
          "zh": "所以我們這裡有 subtitle，例如。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 80.73,
          "end": 82.86,
          "en": "So here we also want to.",
          "zh": "所以這裡我們也想"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 83.61,
          "end": 85.65,
          "en": "Use the subtitle.",
          "zh": "使用 subtitle。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 86.31,
          "end": 88.86,
          "en": "We also have our.",
          "zh": "我們也有我們的"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 90.88,
          "end": 91.42,
          "en": "Um.",
          "zh": "嗯。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 91.42,
          "end": 92.62,
          "en": "Address.",
          "zh": "address。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 94.12,
          "end": 95.56,
          "en": "Which we handle like this.",
          "zh": "我們像這樣處理的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 95.65,
          "end": 99.82,
          "en": "We have our image URL which should be entered here.",
          "zh": "我們有 imageUrl，應該在這裡被輸入。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 100.58,
          "end": 101.74000000000001,
          "en": "Image URL.",
          "zh": "imageUrl。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 102.39,
          "end": 103.44,
          "en": "Like this.",
          "zh": "像這樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 104.03999999999999,
          "end": 106.27000000000001,
          "en": "We also what else do we have?",
          "zh": "我們還有什麼？"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 106.28999999999999,
          "end": 110.64,
          "en": "We also have a description and our contact email.",
          "zh": "我們也有 description 和 contactEmail。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 110.94,
          "end": 113.84,
          "en": "So let's continue with the email.",
          "zh": "所以讓我們繼續 email。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 113.85,
          "end": 119.22,
          "en": "This will be for email and the type here will also be email on mobile devices.",
          "zh": "這會是給 email，而這裡的 type 在行動裝置上也會是 email。"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 119.22,
          "end": 121.35,
          "en": "This ensures that we get the right keyboard.",
          "zh": "這確保我們得到正確的鍵盤。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 121.5,
          "end": 127.5,
          "en": "And last but not least, we'll have another form control for the description.",
          "zh": "最後，我們會有另一個給 description 的 form-control。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 129.87,
          "end": 131.16,
          "en": "Like this.",
          "zh": "像這樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 131.7,
          "end": 134.01,
          "en": "But here, this is not an input.",
          "zh": "但這裡，這不是一個 input。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 134.04,
          "end": 140.01,
          "en": "This will actually be a text area and this is not a self-closing tag, but we need to close it like",
          "zh": "這實際上會是一個 textarea，而這不是自閉合標籤，但我們需要像"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 140.01,
          "end": 140.43,
          "en": "this.",
          "zh": "這樣關閉它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 140.43,
          "end": 143.13,
          "en": "And it has no type, but it has rows.",
          "zh": "而它沒有 type，但它有 rows。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 144.69,
          "end": 147.81,
          "en": "And actually you can write that as a self-closing tab here.",
          "zh": "而實際上你可以在這裡把它寫成自閉合標籤。"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 147.99,
          "end": 150.27,
          "en": "That would not be a regular HTML.",
          "zh": "那不會是一般的 HTML。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 150.3,
          "end": 157.86,
          "en": "But since this is parsed by Svelte first, it gives you some extra shortcuts where it automatically",
          "zh": "但因為這首先被 Svelte 解析，它給你一些額外捷徑，它自動"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 157.86,
          "end": 163.11,
          "en": "extends this to the right HTML markup once this gets shipped to the browser, so to say.",
          "zh": "把這個擴展成正確的 HTML 標記，一旦這被送到瀏覽器，可以說。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 164.19,
          "end": 165.48,
          "en": "So this is our form.",
          "zh": "所以這是我們的表單。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 165.48,
          "end": 168.27,
          "en": "Super ugly, obviously, but it has the fields we need.",
          "zh": "顯然超級醜，但它有我們需要的欄位。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 168.3,
          "end": 170.37,
          "en": "Let's also add a button in there.",
          "zh": "讓我們也在裡面加一個按鈕。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 171.46,
          "end": 171.91,
          "en": "Um.",
          "zh": "嗯。"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 172.77,
          "end": 173.42000000000002,
          "en": "In here.",
          "zh": "在這裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 173.44,
          "end": 178.8,
          "en": "The button where we say save button type will be submit.",
          "zh": "我們說 save 的按鈕，type 會是 submit。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 179.01,
          "end": 180.96,
          "en": "And now we could add a click listener here.",
          "zh": "而現在我們可以在這裡加一個點擊監聽器。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 180.96,
          "end": 186.39,
          "en": "But actually, when we have a submit button in a form, what will happen is that the form gets submitted.",
          "zh": "但實際上，當我們在表單裡有一個送出按鈕，會發生的是表單被送出。"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 186.39,
          "end": 189.18,
          "en": "So here we can listen to on submit on the form.",
          "zh": "所以這裡我們可以在表單上聽 on:submit。"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 189.18,
          "end": 193.35,
          "en": "We haven't done that before in the course and on click on the button would also work.",
          "zh": "我們在課程裡之前沒做過那個，而按鈕上的 on:click 也會有效。"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 193.35,
          "end": 197.61,
          "en": "But this approach here is even a bit more correct, so to say.",
          "zh": "但這裡這個做法甚至可以說更正確一點。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 197.61,
          "end": 200.34,
          "en": "So we have on submit and important.",
          "zh": "所以我們有 on:submit，而重要的是。"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 200.34,
          "end": 205.26,
          "en": "I want to prevent the default here so that no Http request gets sent.",
          "zh": "我想在這裡 preventDefault，這樣不會有 HTTP 請求被送出。"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 205.59,
          "end": 209.1,
          "en": "Instead, we can handle this entirely on the client side.",
          "zh": "相反，我們可以完全在用戶端處理這個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 209.31,
          "end": 212.16,
          "en": "So we got on submit like this here.",
          "zh": "所以我們有像這裡這樣的 on:submit。"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 212.28,
          "end": 219.36,
          "en": "Now when we do click submit here, I want to trigger a function which we have to add in the app component",
          "zh": "現在當我們在這裡點送出，我想觸發一個函式，我們必須在 App 元件裡加的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 219.36,
          "end": 221.22,
          "en": "here in our script section.",
          "zh": "這裡在我們的 script 區段。"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 221.43,
          "end": 228.99,
          "en": "Add meetup like this, and I'm simply pointing at this function here between curly braces.",
          "zh": "像這樣的 addMeetup，而我只是在大括號之間指向這裡這個函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 228.99,
          "end": 230.34,
          "en": "These are always required.",
          "zh": "這些永遠是必須的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 230.34,
          "end": 234.55,
          "en": "And now here, this does not output data because it's on an event handler.",
          "zh": "而現在這裡，這不輸出資料，因為它在一個事件處理器上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 234.57999999999998,
          "end": 240.61,
          "en": "Therefore here this always should be a pointer at a function which gets executed when this event gets",
          "zh": "因此這裡這永遠應該是一個函式的指標，當這個事件被"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 240.61,
          "end": 241.24,
          "en": "triggered.",
          "zh": "觸發時被執行。"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 242.53,
          "end": 244.96,
          "en": "So with that, we have this function place.",
          "zh": "所以有了那個，我們有這個函式的位置。"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 244.96,
          "end": 250.75,
          "en": "We have this ugly form in place Before we take care about the styling, let's actually add the logic",
          "zh": "我們有這個醜表單就位。在我們處理樣式之前，讓我們實際上加"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 250.75,
          "end": 251.88,
          "en": "for adding a meetup.",
          "zh": "新增 meetup 的邏輯。"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 251.89,
          "end": 255.76,
          "en": "So at meetup runs when we submit this form.",
          "zh": "所以當我們送出這個表單時 addMeetup 跑。"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 255.76,
          "end": 262.3,
          "en": "Now of course, to fetch all these inputs, we have to store the values the user enters and for that",
          "zh": "現在當然，要取得所有這些輸入，我們必須儲存使用者輸入的值，而為此"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 262.3,
          "end": 265.15,
          "en": "we can use the two way binding syntax you learn about.",
          "zh": "我們可以使用你學過的雙向繫結語法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 266.05,
          "end": 268.75,
          "en": "You can add a couple of variables here.",
          "zh": "你可以在這裡加幾個變數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 269.48,
          "end": 273.32,
          "en": "Title and so on, and I'll initialize them with empty strings.",
          "zh": "title 等等，而我會用空字串初始化它們。"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 273.32,
          "end": 281.42,
          "en": "So we have the same for subtitle, we have the same for the address with the same for the email and",
          "zh": "所以我們對 subtitle 有同樣的，我們對 address 有同樣的，對 email 有同樣的，以及"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 281.42,
          "end": 281.96,
          "en": "so on.",
          "zh": "等等。"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 281.96,
          "end": 288.05,
          "en": "So let's just initialize all the variables that hold the data we expect the user to enter and now we",
          "zh": "所以讓我們只初始化所有持有我們預期使用者輸入的資料的變數，而現在我們"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 288.05,
          "end": 289.34000000000003,
          "en": "can bind this.",
          "zh": "可以繫結這個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 289.37,
          "end": 289.7,
          "en": "Oops.",
          "zh": "哎呀。"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 289.7,
          "end": 293.96,
          "en": "We also need the image URL and now we can bind this to our inputs.",
          "zh": "我們也需要 imageUrl，而現在我們可以把這個繫結到我們的輸入。"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 294.68,
          "end": 297.2,
          "en": "With that special bind directive.",
          "zh": "用那個特殊的 bind 指令。"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 297.73,
          "end": 304.15,
          "en": "So here on the title input, for example, we can use bind value and set this equal to title and title",
          "zh": "所以這裡例如在 title 輸入上，我們可以使用 bind:value，並把這個設成等於 title，而 title"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 304.15,
          "end": 307.42,
          "en": "here simply refers to this title variable.",
          "zh": "這裡單純指這個 title 變數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 307.42,
          "end": 312.55,
          "en": "So we set the value that's stored in here initially an empty string as a value for the input.",
          "zh": "所以我們把存在這裡的值，一開始是空字串，設成輸入的值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 312.55,
          "end": 317.14,
          "en": "But once we type there, the entered value will be saved back into this variable.",
          "zh": "但一旦我們在那裡打字，輸入的值會被存回這個變數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 317.14,
          "end": 321.04,
          "en": "So this is a live connection we set up with the help of the Bind directive.",
          "zh": "所以這是我們藉助 bind 指令建立的即時連接。"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 322.21,
          "end": 324.67,
          "en": "Now I will use the same here.",
          "zh": "現在我會在這裡使用同樣的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 325.34,
          "end": 326.9,
          "en": "For the subtitle.",
          "zh": "對 subtitle。"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 326.9,
          "end": 333.62,
          "en": "So let's exchange title for subtitle here and repeat the same for address.",
          "zh": "所以讓我們在這裡把 title 換成 subtitle，並對 address 重複同樣的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 333.8,
          "end": 336.68,
          "en": "For image URL.",
          "zh": "對 imageUrl。"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 337.68,
          "end": 340.23,
          "en": "For email.",
          "zh": "對 email。"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 341.55,
          "end": 344.43,
          "en": "And of course also for description, which I also created.",
          "zh": "而當然也對 description，我也建立了的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 344.43,
          "end": 346.32,
          "en": "Yes, I did so for description.",
          "zh": "對，我對 description 那樣做了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 346.32,
          "end": 351.36,
          "en": "And here also on the text area, you add bind value description.",
          "zh": "而這裡在 textarea 上也加 bind:value={description}。"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 351.57,
          "end": 353.52,
          "en": "With that, all the data is stored.",
          "zh": "有了那個，所有資料都被儲存。"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 353.52,
          "end": 360.12,
          "en": "Now in Add Meetup, we want to add our meetup to the meetups array so we can create a new meetup here,",
          "zh": "現在在 addMeetup 裡，我們想把我們的 meetup 加到 meetups 陣列，所以我們可以在這裡建立一個新 meetup，"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 360.12,
          "end": 361.92,
          "en": "which is a new JavaScript object.",
          "zh": "那是一個新的 JavaScript 物件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 361.92,
          "end": 365.25,
          "en": "And now that should have the same structure as our other meetups here.",
          "zh": "而現在那應該有和我們這裡其他 meetup 一樣的結構。"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 365.25,
          "end": 372.3,
          "en": "So we need an ID and for now I will generate that with Math.random, which again is not truly unique,",
          "zh": "所以我們需要一個 ID，而目前我會用 Math.random 產生那個，那再次不是真正唯一的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 372.3,
          "end": 373.56,
          "en": "but fair enough.",
          "zh": "但夠了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 373.56,
          "end": 375.21,
          "en": "And I'll convert it to a string.",
          "zh": "而我會把它轉成字串。"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 375.21,
          "end": 381.33,
          "en": "You don't have to do that, but I'm using string IDs here too, so I want to continue using that here.",
          "zh": "你不必那樣做，但我也在這裡使用字串 ID，所以我想在這裡繼續使用那個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 381.33,
          "end": 387.45,
          "en": "And then I add a title property to that object and the value will be the value stored in that title",
          "zh": "然後我給那個物件加一個 title 屬性，而值會是存在那個 title"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 387.45,
          "end": 390.69,
          "en": "variable because that is the variable bound to our inputs.",
          "zh": "變數裡的值，因為那是繫結到我們輸入的變數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 390.69,
          "end": 398.97,
          "en": "So here we can now set title and I do the same for subtitle, of course, the same for description,",
          "zh": "所以這裡我們現在可以設定 title，而我當然對 subtitle 做同樣的，對 description 做同樣的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 398.97,
          "end": 402.76,
          "en": "the same for the image URL and so on.",
          "zh": "對 imageUrl 做同樣的，等等。"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 403.24,
          "end": 407.08,
          "en": "Important for the email, I named it contact email for the other.",
          "zh": "對 email 重要的是，我把它命名為 contactEmail，對其他的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 407.38,
          "end": 407.72,
          "en": "Um.",
          "zh": "嗯。"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 409.21,
          "end": 413.38,
          "en": "Meet up here, so we should use contact email here to the variable that stores.",
          "zh": "這裡的 meetup，所以我們應該在這裡使用 contactEmail，對儲存的變數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 413.38,
          "end": 415.33,
          "en": "The email though, is just named email.",
          "zh": "不過 email 只是被命名為 email。"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 415.33,
          "end": 416.83,
          "en": "So here this differs.",
          "zh": "所以這裡這個不同。"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 416.83,
          "end": 421.6,
          "en": "We have email on the right referring to that variable and contact email on the left, referring to the",
          "zh": "我們右邊有 email，指那個變數，左邊有 contactEmail，指"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 421.6,
          "end": 425.08,
          "en": "property that should be added to our meetup object.",
          "zh": "應該被加到我們 meetup 物件的屬性。"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 425.17,
          "end": 427.72,
          "en": "We also have our address of course.",
          "zh": "我們當然也有 address。"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 428.97,
          "end": 430.32,
          "en": "So that is a new meetup.",
          "zh": "所以那是一個新 meetup。"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 430.32,
          "end": 436.35,
          "en": "Now, that new meetup here, of course, should be added to the meetups and you'll learn that this does",
          "zh": "現在，這裡那個新 meetup 當然應該被加到 meetups，而你會學到這"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 436.35,
          "end": 437.22,
          "en": "not work.",
          "zh": "無效。"
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 437.25,
          "end": 439.26,
          "en": "Meetups Push new meetup.",
          "zh": "meetups.push(newMeetup)。"
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 439.38,
          "end": 443.76,
          "en": "Now it's important that you know that, but it's also important that you know why it doesn't work.",
          "zh": "現在重要的是你知道那個，但知道它為什麼無效也很重要。"
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 443.76,
          "end": 445.53,
          "en": "So do you know why it doesn't work?",
          "zh": "所以你知道它為什麼無效嗎？"
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 446.25,
          "end": 453.57,
          "en": "The problem here was that this is not a trigger that signals to svelte that it needs to check the Dom",
          "zh": "這裡的問題是，這不是一個向 Svelte 示意它需要檢查 DOM"
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 453.57,
          "end": 455.64,
          "en": "and potentially update the dom.",
          "zh": "並可能更新 DOM 的觸發。"
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 455.67,
          "end": 458.13,
          "en": "The trigger is the equal sign instead.",
          "zh": "觸發反而是等號。"
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 458.13,
          "end": 460.95,
          "en": "So this here is simply not picked up by svelte.",
          "zh": "所以這裡這個單純不被 Svelte 撿起來。"
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 460.98,
          "end": 464.58,
          "en": "So this does not work.",
          "zh": "所以這無效。"
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 465.6,
          "end": 471.18,
          "en": "Instead, what you should do is set meetups equal to a new array created here with square brackets,",
          "zh": "相反，你該做的是把 meetups 設成等於這裡用方括號建立的新陣列，"
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 471.18,
          "end": 477.33,
          "en": "and then we can use some modern JavaScript syntax, take all our old meetups with the spread operator,",
          "zh": "然後我們可以使用一些現代 JavaScript 語法，用展開運算子拿出所有舊 meetup，"
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 477.33,
          "end": 479.5,
          "en": "and then add the new meetup like this.",
          "zh": "然後像這樣加新 meetup。"
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 479.52,
          "end": 484.83,
          "en": "Or if you want to add the new meetup in front, which I do, you simply add it as the first element",
          "zh": "或如果你想把新 meetup 加在前面，我就是這樣，你單純把它當第一個元素加上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 484.83,
          "end": 490.38,
          "en": "and then you add all the other extracted meetups with the equal sign here.",
          "zh": "然後你用這裡的展開加上所有其他取出的 meetup。"
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 490.41,
          "end": 496.44,
          "en": "Svelte recognizes that it has something to do and now it will check the Dom and update it where needed.",
          "zh": "Svelte 認出它有事要做，而現在它會檢查 DOM，並在需要的地方更新它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 497.04,
          "end": 500.13,
          "en": "So with that now we should have everything in place.",
          "zh": "所以有了那個，現在我們應該一切就位。"
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 500.13,
          "end": 501.95,
          "en": "We need to add a new meetup.",
          "zh": "我們需要加一個新 meetup。"
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 501.96,
          "end": 507.84,
          "en": "So let's fill this out real quick and real ugly here just to check whether it works and click Save.",
          "zh": "所以讓我們很快填這個，這裡真的很醜，只是檢查它是否有效，並點 Save。"
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 508.99,
          "end": 513.58,
          "en": "And I'm getting some auto checking here by my browser.",
          "zh": "而我這裡被瀏覽器做一些自動檢查。"
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 513.58,
          "end": 515.83,
          "en": "Let's enter a valid email address and click save.",
          "zh": "讓我們輸入一個有效的電子郵件地址並點 save。"
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 516.7,
          "end": 520.36,
          "en": "And I'm getting an error assignment to constant variable.",
          "zh": "而我得到一個錯誤，assignment to constant variable。"
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 521.02,
          "end": 526.63,
          "en": "The problem here is that my meetups up there are stored as a const, so when I try to reassign with",
          "zh": "這裡的問題是我上面的 meetups 被存成 const，所以當我試著用"
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 526.63,
          "end": 530.68,
          "en": "a equal sign, I correctly get an error because it's a constant value.",
          "zh": "等號重新指派，我正確地得到一個錯誤，因為它是一個常數值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 530.86,
          "end": 534.52,
          "en": "The fix is to simply turn this into a variable with let.",
          "zh": "修正是單純用 let 把這個變成一個變數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 139,
          "start": 534.67,
          "end": 541.3,
          "en": "So let's convert meetups to let instead of const and let's try this again here real quick.",
          "zh": "所以讓我們把 meetups 轉成 let 而不是 const，並讓我們在這裡很快再試一次。"
        },
        {
          "id": 140,
          "start": 542.79,
          "end": 544.86,
          "en": "Click save and here's our new meetup.",
          "zh": "點 save，而這是我們的新 meetup。"
        },
        {
          "id": 141,
          "start": 544.89,
          "end": 550.95,
          "en": "Of course, not really looking that sweet because I entered just some random content, especially for",
          "zh": "當然，看起來真的不那麼好，因為我只輸入一些隨機內容，尤其對"
        },
        {
          "id": 142,
          "start": 550.95,
          "end": 551.7,
          "en": "the image.",
          "zh": "圖片。"
        },
        {
          "id": 143,
          "start": 551.91,
          "end": 555.69,
          "en": "But other than that, this is looking good and this seems to work.",
          "zh": "但除此之外，這看起來不錯，而這似乎有效。"
        },
        {
          "id": 144,
          "start": 555.93,
          "end": 562.29,
          "en": "So let's now work on the styling of these inputs and let's make sure that that looks pretty good to.",
          "zh": "所以讓我們現在處理這些輸入的樣式，並確定那看起來也相當好。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "14689584",
      "title": "Creating a \"TextInput\" Component",
      "lectureOrder": 50,
      "videoOrder": 43,
      "sourceHash": "c64206e7a339f1515c7d6fd4a85c968740f8aa52073fd08b91f2a5fdd2a1ea35",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 1.92,
          "end": 7.23,
          "en": "We got these inputs here and they work, but they are looking super ugly.",
          "zh": "我們這裡有這些輸入，而它們有效，但它們看起來超級醜。"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 7.68,
          "end": 11.64,
          "en": "Now, to make them look less ugly, of course, styling is the key.",
          "zh": "現在，要讓它們看起來不那麼醜，當然，樣式是關鍵。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 11.67,
          "end": 16.47,
          "en": "Now, I don't really want to dive too much into the CSS styling since this is no CSS course.",
          "zh": "現在，我真的不想太深入 CSS 樣式，因為這不是 CSS 課程。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 16.47,
          "end": 17.88,
          "en": "And again, I've got a course on that.",
          "zh": "而再次，我有一門關於那個的課程。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 17.88,
          "end": 21.33,
          "en": "If you want to learn all about styling things properly.",
          "zh": "如果你想學怎麼正確地為東西加上樣式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 21.51,
          "end": 24.58,
          "en": "Instead, the question is how should we style it?",
          "zh": "相反，問題是我們該怎麼設定它的樣式？"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 24.6,
          "end": 29.13,
          "en": "Should we set up some global form control and input styles?",
          "zh": "我們該設定一些全域的 form-control 和 input 樣式嗎？"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 29.31,
          "end": 33,
          "en": "We could certainly do that and that wouldn't be wrong.",
          "zh": "我們當然可以那樣做，而那不會是錯的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 33.33,
          "end": 42.18,
          "en": "But in my opinion, it would also be very nice if we could just have some custom input components,",
          "zh": "但依我的意見，如果我們可以只是有一些自訂輸入元件，也會非常好，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 42.18,
          "end": 48.57,
          "en": "maybe named text input, but the name doesn't matter which we use like that, where we set a label of",
          "zh": "也許命名為 TextInput，但名稱不重要，我們像那樣使用，我們設定一個 label 為"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 48.57,
          "end": 54.15,
          "en": "title and set some other props and then this replaces this entire block.",
          "zh": "title，並設定一些其他 prop，然後這個取代這整個區塊。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 54.18,
          "end": 60.54,
          "en": "Then our forms would get much leaner and no matter where we use inputs in our application, they always",
          "zh": "然後我們的表單會精簡得多，而且無論我們在應用程式裡哪裡使用輸入，它們永遠"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 60.54,
          "end": 65.17,
          "en": "have the same style and are shorter when it comes to the markup.",
          "zh": "有同樣的樣式，而在標記方面更短。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 65.17,
          "end": 68.89,
          "en": "We have to write because we don't have to write that extra div and that extra label.",
          "zh": "我們必須寫的，因為我們不必寫那個額外的 div 和那個額外的 label。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 68.89,
          "end": 75.73,
          "en": "If all we want is an input with a label and a good look and therefore a custom component makes sense.",
          "zh": "如果我們想要的全部是一個有 label 和好外觀的輸入，因此自訂元件有道理。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 75.97,
          "end": 79.36,
          "en": "Now this however, will not be a meetup specific component.",
          "zh": "現在然而，這不會是一個 meetup 專用的元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 79.36,
          "end": 85.42,
          "en": "Instead I'll create it in the UI folder because that will be a general text input input component.",
          "zh": "相反我會在 UI 資料夾裡建立它，因為那會是一個一般的文字輸入元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 85.42,
          "end": 87.94,
          "en": "And again, you can name this whatever you want.",
          "zh": "而再次，你可以隨你高興命名這個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 88.27,
          "end": 94.33,
          "en": "Now the idea here is that we grab such a block here, which makes up an input.",
          "zh": "現在這裡的想法是，我們抓住這裡這樣一個區塊，它組成一個輸入。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 95,
          "end": 96.97999999999999,
          "en": "Copy that into text input.",
          "zh": "把那個複製進 TextInput。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 96.97999999999999,
          "end": 99.2,
          "en": "This is the general markup we want to have in there.",
          "zh": "這是我們想在裡面有的一般標記。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 99.22999999999999,
          "end": 101.27000000000001,
          "en": "Of course it needs some fine tuning, though.",
          "zh": "不過它當然需要一些微調。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 101.9,
          "end": 108.86,
          "en": "For example, the fine tuning we need is that a text input in this application actually can be an input",
          "zh": "例如，我們需要的微調是，這個應用程式裡的文字輸入實際上可以是一個輸入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 108.86,
          "end": 113.27000000000001,
          "en": "with different types, text and email, but also a text area.",
          "zh": "有不同型別，text 和 email，但也是一個 textarea。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 113.75,
          "end": 120.29,
          "en": "So we should create our text input component in a way that is flexible enough to handle these different",
          "zh": "所以我們應該以夠彈性的方式建立我們的 TextInput 元件，來處理這些不同"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 120.29,
          "end": 121.13,
          "en": "types.",
          "zh": "型別。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 121.37,
          "end": 126.32,
          "en": "And of course the solution is again to use props here.",
          "zh": "而解法當然再次是在這裡使用 prop。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 126.5,
          "end": 134.3,
          "en": "We can, for example, enter or add a control type prop, and the control type here can then define",
          "zh": "我們可以，例如，輸入或加一個 controlType prop，而這裡的 controlType 接著可以定義"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 134.3,
          "end": 136.95,
          "en": "whether it is an input or a text area.",
          "zh": "它是一個 input 還是一個 textarea。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 136.97,
          "end": 143.93,
          "en": "So with that, we can add if check down there and check if control type is, let's say equal to text",
          "zh": "所以有了那個，我們可以在下面那裡加 if 檢查，並檢查 controlType 是否，讓我們說，等於"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 143.93,
          "end": 144.65,
          "en": "area.",
          "zh": "textarea。"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 145.28,
          "end": 148.55,
          "en": "And if it is, then I want to render something else.",
          "zh": "而如果是，那麼我想渲染別的東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 148.57999999999998,
          "end": 152.69,
          "en": "Otherwise, I'll render this content down there.",
          "zh": "否則，我會渲染下面那裡這個內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 153.93,
          "end": 159.24,
          "en": "Now there's something else I would want to render is, of course, my text area block.",
          "zh": "現在我還想渲染的別的東西，當然是我的 textarea 區塊。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 159.27,
          "end": 160.26,
          "en": "This one.",
          "zh": "這個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 160.29,
          "end": 162.84,
          "en": "So let's copy that as well and move that in here.",
          "zh": "所以讓我們也複製那個，並把它移到這裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 163.2,
          "end": 167.82,
          "en": "Now, of course, you can quickly see that the div and the label are not really different, so it would",
          "zh": "現在，你當然可以很快看到 div 和 label 並沒有真的不同，所以"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 167.82,
          "end": 174.18,
          "en": "make sense to move these out of the if block remove the closing div here, move the closing div out",
          "zh": "把它們移出 if 區塊有道理，移除這裡的結束 div，把結束 div 移出"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 174.18,
          "end": 174.84,
          "en": "of here too.",
          "zh": "這裡也是。"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 174.84,
          "end": 180.48,
          "en": "And here remove the div and the label so that the div and the label are always there and it just differs",
          "zh": "而這裡移除 div 和 label，這樣 div 和 label 永遠在那裡，而它只是不同，"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 180.48,
          "end": 183.39,
          "en": "regarding whether we add a text area or an input.",
          "zh": "關於我們加 textarea 還是 input。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 184.07,
          "end": 186.74,
          "en": "Now we're using a couple of other properties here too.",
          "zh": "現在我們這裡也使用幾個其他屬性。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 186.77,
          "end": 196.37,
          "en": "For example, we have an ID on our inputs, so we should also export an ID here so that here on for",
          "zh": "例如，我們的輸入上有一個 id，所以我們也應該在這裡 export 一個 id，這樣這裡在 for 上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 196.37,
          "end": 202.64,
          "en": "where we are pointing at an ID and of course on ID itself we simply use.",
          "zh": "我們指向一個 id 的地方，而當然在 id 本身我們單純使用"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 203.43,
          "end": 204.93,
          "en": "Curly brace ID.",
          "zh": "{id}。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 205.11,
          "end": 210.57,
          "en": "So using that property we're receiving because that is the ID for this input.",
          "zh": "所以使用我們正在收到的那個屬性，因為那是這個輸入的 id。"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 211.05,
          "end": 214.56,
          "en": "The label text, of course, should also be settable from outside.",
          "zh": "label 文字當然也應該可以從外面設定。"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 214.56,
          "end": 216.26,
          "en": "So maybe we name this label.",
          "zh": "所以也許我們把這個命名為 label。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 216.27,
          "end": 217.65,
          "en": "These names are totally up to you.",
          "zh": "這些名稱完全由你決定。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 217.65,
          "end": 220.53,
          "en": "Of course, you just have to make sure you're using them down there.",
          "zh": "當然，你只必須確定你在下面那裡使用它們。"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 220.82999999999998,
          "end": 227.04,
          "en": "So now here label is also output dynamically based on the prop we're getting from outside.",
          "zh": "所以現在這裡 label 也基於我們從外面得到的 prop 被動態輸出。"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 227.57999999999998,
          "end": 230.67000000000002,
          "en": "The rows also are set from outside.",
          "zh": "rows 也是從外面設定的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 230.67000000000002,
          "end": 234.18,
          "en": "So here we get our rows and we output them there.",
          "zh": "所以這裡我們得到我們的 rows，並在那裡輸出它們。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 235.38,
          "end": 240.06,
          "en": "Now hear this Bindvalue thing doesn't really work across components like this.",
          "zh": "現在這裡這個 bind:value 的東西，像這樣跨元件真的無效。"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 240.27,
          "end": 247.56,
          "en": "You can generally use it on component props, but if you have a form control, like a text area or an",
          "zh": "你一般可以在元件 prop 上使用它，但如果你有一個表單控制，像 textarea 或"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 247.56,
          "end": 254.91,
          "en": "input in a component that encapsulates it, and then you have another component later, this app component",
          "zh": "元件裡的 input，它把它封裝起來，然後你稍後有另一個元件，這個 App 元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 254.91,
          "end": 257.04,
          "en": "where you plan on using your own component.",
          "zh": "你計畫使用你自己的元件的地方。"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 257.04,
          "end": 261.78,
          "en": "Then this bind syntax doesn't work across components, but that's no problem.",
          "zh": "那時這個 bind 語法不跨元件有效，但那沒問題。"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 261.78,
          "end": 263.22,
          "en": "We know how to handle that.",
          "zh": "我們知道怎麼處理那個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 263.22,
          "end": 265.26,
          "en": "We saw the long form earlier.",
          "zh": "我們稍早看過長的形式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 265.29,
          "end": 267.81,
          "en": "We can simply use value.",
          "zh": "我們可以單純使用 value。"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 270.85,
          "end": 272.74,
          "en": "And set this equal to.",
          "zh": "並把這個設成等於"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 275.02,
          "end": 277,
          "en": "A value prop were receiving.",
          "zh": "我們正在收到的 value prop。"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 278.2,
          "end": 280.72,
          "en": "And we can listen to the input event.",
          "zh": "而我們可以聽 input 事件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 280.72,
          "end": 282.67,
          "en": "And now we just need to forward this.",
          "zh": "而現在我們只需要轉送這個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 282.67,
          "end": 284.40999999999997,
          "en": "And this is something we haven't learned about.",
          "zh": "而這是我們還沒學過的某樣東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 284.40999999999997,
          "end": 290.05,
          "en": "And I will come back to this, but for now, you can just remember or just take this as an additional",
          "zh": "而我會回到這個，但目前，你可以只記住，或只把這個當額外"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 290.05,
          "end": 291.99,
          "en": "piece of knowledge I'm giving you right here.",
          "zh": "知識，我正在這裡給你的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 292,
          "end": 298.24,
          "en": "If you right on input like this without assigning a handler, a handler on the right side, then this",
          "zh": "如果你像這樣在 input 上寫，而沒有指派一個處理器，右邊的處理器，那麼這個"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 298.24,
          "end": 301.06,
          "en": "simply gets forwarded to the parent component.",
          "zh": "單純被轉送到父元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 301.06,
          "end": 306.58,
          "en": "So here on input is now not handled inside of the text input component, but we can simply listen to",
          "zh": "所以這裡的 on:input 現在不是在 TextInput 元件裡面被處理，但我們可以單純再次聽"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 306.58,
          "end": 310.45,
          "en": "it again on whichever component uses the text input component.",
          "zh": "它，在任何使用 TextInput 元件的元件上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 310.48,
          "end": 316.72,
          "en": "Normally events do not get forwarded, so if we wouldn't add this, we couldn't listen on input on our",
          "zh": "通常事件不會被轉送，所以如果我們不加這個，我們不能在我們的"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 316.72,
          "end": 320.68,
          "en": "text input component, but by adding this syntax it gets forwarded.",
          "zh": "TextInput 元件上聽 on:input，但藉由加這個語法，它被轉送。"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 320.68,
          "end": 323.41,
          "en": "But again, I will come back to this later.",
          "zh": "但再次，我稍後會回到這個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 326.21,
          "end": 327.77,
          "en": "Now here for the input.",
          "zh": "現在這裡對 input。"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 327.77,
          "end": 328.46,
          "en": "It's the same.",
          "zh": "一樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 328.46,
          "end": 333.23,
          "en": "We bind value to value and we want to forward.",
          "zh": "我們把 value 繫結到 value，而我們想轉送"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 333.78,
          "end": 335.01,
          "en": "Input like this.",
          "zh": "像這樣的 input。"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 335.43,
          "end": 337.5,
          "en": "So now this doesn't look too bad.",
          "zh": "所以現在這看起來不太糟。"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 337.53,
          "end": 341.03,
          "en": "Of course, we also want would want to add some styling here.",
          "zh": "當然，我們也想在這裡加一些樣式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 341.04,
          "end": 344.52,
          "en": "And as before, here's some style tags and attached.",
          "zh": "而和之前一樣，這裡有一些 style 標籤，以及附件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 344.55,
          "end": 350.07,
          "en": "You find a CSS file with some styles that you can just copy into these style tags here.",
          "zh": "你找到一個有一些樣式的 CSS 檔案，你可以只複製進這裡這些 style 標籤。"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 352.15,
          "end": 356.37,
          "en": "With that, we got our text input component set up and we can now use it.",
          "zh": "有了那個，我們的 TextInput 元件設定好了，而我們現在可以使用它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 356.38,
          "end": 358.63,
          "en": "So let's go back to the app Svelte file.",
          "zh": "所以讓我們回到 App.svelte 檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 358.63,
          "end": 361.33,
          "en": "And in there let's import this text import.",
          "zh": "而在裡面讓我們匯入這個 TextInput。"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 361.33,
          "end": 367.36,
          "en": "So import text input from dot slash UI, text input svelte.",
          "zh": "所以從 ./ui/TextInput.svelte 匯入 TextInput。"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 367.87,
          "end": 373.27,
          "en": "And now we can use this text input component instead of these div blocks.",
          "zh": "而現在我們可以使用這個 TextInput 元件，而不是這些 div 區塊。"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 373.27,
          "end": 379.78,
          "en": "So here instead of the title, we can use text input like this, which is of course way shorter though",
          "zh": "所以這裡不是 title，我們可以像這樣使用 TextInput，那當然短得多，不過"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 379.78,
          "end": 383.2,
          "en": "we of course need to pass some data to text input.",
          "zh": "我們當然需要把一些資料傳給 TextInput。"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 383.82,
          "end": 385.77,
          "en": "Which data do we need to pass?",
          "zh": "我們需要傳哪些資料？"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 385.8,
          "end": 391.11,
          "en": "Well, basically, all the data we're expecting here control type ID, label, rows and value.",
          "zh": "嗯，基本上，我們在這裡預期的所有資料，controlType、id、label、rows 和 value。"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 392.58,
          "end": 396.57,
          "en": "So back in apps world, let's maybe start with the ID.",
          "zh": "所以回到 App.svelte，讓我們也許從 id 開始。"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 396.9,
          "end": 397.86,
          "en": "The ID here.",
          "zh": "這裡的 id。"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 397.86,
          "end": 400.95,
          "en": "That was for the title, so let's give it an ID of title again.",
          "zh": "那是給 title 的，所以讓我們再次給它 id 為 title。"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 401.1,
          "end": 404.76,
          "en": "The label would be title, so that is what the user sees.",
          "zh": "label 會是 title，所以那是使用者看到的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 404.76,
          "end": 407.52,
          "en": "So we should also write it in a pleasant way.",
          "zh": "所以我們也應該以好看的方式寫它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 408.95,
          "end": 411.23,
          "en": "We also need to bind our value.",
          "zh": "我們也需要繫結我們的 value。"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 411.23,
          "end": 416.03,
          "en": "And again, bind value here unfortunately, doesn't doesn't work as before.",
          "zh": "而再次，這裡的 bind:value 不幸不像之前那樣有效。"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 416.03,
          "end": 423.44,
          "en": "So instead we have to do this manually bind the title to value and here it's on input and.",
          "zh": "所以相反我們必須手動做這個，把 title 繫結到 value，而這裡是 on:input，而"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 424.11,
          "end": 424.92,
          "en": "Dear.",
          "zh": "那裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 426.66,
          "end": 435.21,
          "en": "We get our event and then we want to set title equal to event target value.",
          "zh": "我們得到我們的事件，然後我們想把 title 設成等於 event.target.value。"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 435.21,
          "end": 437.34,
          "en": "And that is something you saw earlier in the course, right?",
          "zh": "而那是你在課程稍早看過的某樣東西，對吧？"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 437.34,
          "end": 444.84,
          "en": "This is also using this shorthand syntax where we use the inline notation where we have a very short",
          "zh": "這也使用這個簡寫語法，我們使用內嵌記法，我們有一個非常短的"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 444.84,
          "end": 445.5,
          "en": "assignment.",
          "zh": "指派。"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 445.5,
          "end": 448.47,
          "en": "You could alternatively also output this in a function.",
          "zh": "你也可以改為在一個函式裡輸出這個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 448.47,
          "end": 450.54,
          "en": "This is another alternative here.",
          "zh": "這是這裡另一個替代。"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 450.99,
          "end": 455.25,
          "en": "And what else do we need to set the rows and the control type?",
          "zh": "而我們還需要設定什麼，rows 和 controlType？"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 455.25,
          "end": 457.17,
          "en": "Well, in the If check down there.",
          "zh": "嗯，在下面那裡的 if 檢查裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 457.17,
          "end": 459.36,
          "en": "I'm checking if the control type is text area.",
          "zh": "我在檢查 controlType 是否是 textarea。"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 459.36,
          "end": 462.51,
          "en": "So if I don't set it to text area, we always get the input.",
          "zh": "所以如果我不把它設成 textarea，我們永遠得到 input。"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 462.51,
          "end": 465.27,
          "en": "And I also don't care about rows if I have an input.",
          "zh": "而如果我有一個 input，我也不在乎 rows。"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 465.27,
          "end": 470.13,
          "en": "So for the title, which should be a regular input, we don't really need to care about that.",
          "zh": "所以對 title，它應該是一般的 input，我們真的不需要在乎那個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 470.82,
          "end": 473.25,
          "en": "So with that this should be fine.",
          "zh": "所以有了那個，這應該沒問題。"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 473.61,
          "end": 476.58,
          "en": "We can now copy that and also replace the subtitle.",
          "zh": "我們現在可以複製那個，也取代 subtitle。"
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 476.61,
          "end": 479.58,
          "en": "Of course, the ID should then be replaced with subtitle.",
          "zh": "當然，id 那時應該被換成 subtitle。"
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 479.61,
          "end": 482.22,
          "en": "The label here will be subtitle.",
          "zh": "這裡的 label 會是 subtitle。"
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 482.22,
          "end": 485.13,
          "en": "The value will refer to the subtitle variable here.",
          "zh": "value 會指這裡的 subtitle 變數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 485.13,
          "end": 490.27,
          "en": "And I also want to set that subtitle variable when we have that input event.",
          "zh": "而我也想在我們有那個 input 事件時設定那個 subtitle 變數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 491.39,
          "end": 493.76,
          "en": "We can also replace the address here.",
          "zh": "我們也可以在這裡取代 address。"
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 493.79,
          "end": 495.49,
          "en": "The ID is then address.",
          "zh": "那時 id 是 address。"
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 495.5,
          "end": 497.18,
          "en": "The label is address.",
          "zh": "label 是 address。"
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 497.22,
          "end": 501.47,
          "en": "We're referring to the address variable and we want to set that address variable here.",
          "zh": "我們指 address 變數，而我們想在這裡設定那個 address 變數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 502.32,
          "end": 505.68,
          "en": "We also have the image that's also a regular input.",
          "zh": "我們也有圖片，那也是一般的 input。"
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 505.68,
          "end": 514.23,
          "en": "So we have image URL as an image URL, as a human readable label, image URL as a variable name, also",
          "zh": "所以我們有 imageUrl 作為 imageUrl，作為人類可讀的 label，imageUrl 作為變數名稱，也"
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 514.23,
          "end": 515.01,
          "en": "down here.",
          "zh": "在下面這裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 515.13,
          "end": 516.72,
          "en": "And then we have our email.",
          "zh": "然後我們有我們的 email。"
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 516.72,
          "end": 519.21,
          "en": "And now for the email, something is missing.",
          "zh": "而現在對 email，有某樣東西缺少。"
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 519.21,
          "end": 524.73,
          "en": "We do have the ID, email and the label email and the value email here also down there.",
          "zh": "我們確實有 id email、label email，以及這裡的 value email，下面那裡也是。"
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 524.76,
          "end": 527.64,
          "en": "But for the email I also want to set a different type.",
          "zh": "但對 email 我也想設定一個不同的 type。"
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 527.64,
          "end": 534.06,
          "en": "Of course here I always have type text, but actually that type should be settable dynamically.",
          "zh": "當然這裡我永遠有 type text，但實際上那個 type 應該可以動態設定。"
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 534.06,
          "end": 542.04,
          "en": "So let's export the type here as a prop as well in the text input component and bind this dynamically",
          "zh": "所以讓我們也在 TextInput 元件裡把 type 當 prop export，並動態繫結這個，"
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 542.04,
          "end": 545.46,
          "en": "so that we are flexible regarding how we want to set this.",
          "zh": "這樣我們在想怎麼設定這個方面是有彈性的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 545.79,
          "end": 547.89,
          "en": "So now back in the app component.",
          "zh": "所以現在回到 App 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 548.71,
          "end": 554.95,
          "en": "We can set the type here to email, but of course we should now also set the type on the other inputs",
          "zh": "我們可以在這裡把 type 設成 email，但我們現在當然也應該在其他輸入上設定 type，"
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 554.95,
          "end": 555.16,
          "en": "here.",
          "zh": "這裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 555.16,
          "end": 556.78,
          "en": "We should set it to text.",
          "zh": "我們應該把它設成 text。"
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 556.78,
          "end": 561.22,
          "en": "So let's add type text to all the other inputs here.",
          "zh": "所以讓我們在這裡所有其他輸入上加 type text。"
        },
        {
          "id": 139,
          "start": 562.88,
          "end": 565.22,
          "en": "Let me copy that entire input here again.",
          "zh": "讓我再次複製這裡整個輸入。"
        },
        {
          "id": 140,
          "start": 565.22,
          "end": 569.03,
          "en": "And let's also replace the text area there.",
          "zh": "而讓我們也取代那裡的 textarea。"
        },
        {
          "id": 141,
          "start": 569.06,
          "end": 571.25,
          "en": "We expect the description.",
          "zh": "我們預期 description。"
        },
        {
          "id": 142,
          "start": 571.25,
          "end": 574.76,
          "en": "So this sounds like a fitting ID description here.",
          "zh": "所以這聽起來像一個合適的 id，這裡是 description。"
        },
        {
          "id": 143,
          "start": 575.43,
          "end": 577.62,
          "en": "Referring to the description variable.",
          "zh": "指 description 變數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 144,
          "start": 577.62,
          "end": 579.99,
          "en": "And here we don't need the type.",
          "zh": "而這裡我們不需要 type。"
        },
        {
          "id": 145,
          "start": 579.99,
          "end": 585.66,
          "en": "But instead, since this should be a text area, we need to set control type which I'm checking down",
          "zh": "而是，既然這應該是 textarea，我們需要設定 controlType，我在"
        },
        {
          "id": 146,
          "start": 585.66,
          "end": 588.51,
          "en": "there in the if check equal to text area.",
          "zh": "下面那裡的 if 檢查裡檢查的，等於 textarea。"
        },
        {
          "id": 147,
          "start": 588.6,
          "end": 595.59,
          "en": "So let's set control type to text area here so that the text area gets rendered with all that out of",
          "zh": "所以讓我們在這裡把 controlType 設成 textarea，這樣 textarea 被渲染，有了那一切"
        },
        {
          "id": 148,
          "start": 595.59,
          "end": 595.86,
          "en": "the way.",
          "zh": "處理完。"
        },
        {
          "id": 149,
          "start": 595.86,
          "end": 598.34,
          "en": "If we save that, it looks way better.",
          "zh": "如果我們存那個，它看起來好得多。"
        },
        {
          "id": 150,
          "start": 598.35,
          "end": 602.7,
          "en": "Obviously a bit too large, but the inputs look better.",
          "zh": "顯然大了一點，但輸入看起來更好。"
        },
        {
          "id": 151,
          "start": 603.09,
          "end": 610.08,
          "en": "Now regarding the sizing, we can give that overall form that holds all of that a nice style and I'll",
          "zh": "現在關於尺寸，我們可以給持有這一切的整體表單一個不錯的樣式，而我會"
        },
        {
          "id": 152,
          "start": 610.08,
          "end": 619.77,
          "en": "just give that form a width of 30 rem max width of 90% for mobile devices and a margin of auto.",
          "zh": "只給那個表單 width 30rem、max-width 90%，給行動裝置，以及 margin auto。"
        },
        {
          "id": 153,
          "start": 619.77,
          "end": 622.59,
          "en": "So that it's nicely centered and that looks better.",
          "zh": "這樣它被好好置中，而那看起來更好。"
        },
        {
          "id": 154,
          "start": 622.59,
          "end": 623.25,
          "en": "I say.",
          "zh": "我說。"
        },
        {
          "id": 155,
          "start": 623.61,
          "end": 629.4,
          "en": "Now let's quickly see if it still works because that is definitely something that should be the case.",
          "zh": "現在讓我們很快看它是否仍然有效，因為那絕對是該有的情況。"
        },
        {
          "id": 156,
          "start": 629.4,
          "end": 634.38,
          "en": "So let's quickly enter all of that and it almost works, but it gets submitted.",
          "zh": "所以讓我們很快輸入所有那些，而它幾乎有效，但它被送出了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 157,
          "start": 634.38,
          "end": 640.78,
          "en": "But I think that's just that my ID automatically deleted prevent default again.",
          "zh": "但我想那只是我的 IDE 再次自動刪掉了 preventDefault。"
        },
        {
          "id": 158,
          "start": 640.81,
          "end": 641.83,
          "en": "Yes, it did.",
